window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1301,"title":"Chapter 1301 Don’t You Think It’s Strange?","paragraphs":["1301 Don’t You Think It’s Strange?","At this moment, He Wenyin and the others had also heard the ins and outs of the matter. Only then did they know that He Wenxian was the one wearing a fake. However, she arrogantly said that Miss Qiao was wearing a fake and even wanted to lend her necklace to her, pretending to be very kind.","Everyone did not say anything, but they had different thoughts in their hearts. They all knew He Wenyin. She had always been pure and naive. She would believe whatever others said. The things she said just now did not sound like her own thoughts. Perhaps someone often said those things in her ear, so she remembered them.","The person who was using He Wenyin was naturally He Wenxian.","He Wenxian pretended to be noble and kind in front of her sister, but she was secretly embarrassing Mrs. Gu. It turned out that the eldest daughter of the He family was so scheming!","!!","If Miss Qiao were not the chief designer, Gu Shan, and if she did not have Gu Zheng as her backer, what would the outcome be today?","Everyone thought about it carefully, and their eyes were filled with disappointment.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes slightly and looked at He Wenxian, whose face was filled with guilt and sincerity. She chuckled. “Since Miss He has apologized, then let’s forget about this matter.”","He Wenxian instantly heaved a sigh of relief, and the corners of her mouth had just curled into a smile when she heard Qiao Xi say casually, “Perhaps you’ve really forgotten, Miss He. If I don’t forgive you, it’ll make me seem unforgiving.","“Ah Zheng, the He family has always told the public that they’re close to you, but I don’t think Miss He takes you seriously. She can’t even remember who your wife is! Anyway, it’s about time. The auction is about to start. Let’s go to the front hall.”","Gu Zheng’s gaze instantly softened as he smiled and nodded. He held Qiao Xi’s hand and strode away.","Everyone had different expressions. Mrs. Gu’s words reminded everyone that regardless of whether He Wenxian had really forgotten or was pretending, she did not tell them that Qiao Xi was Mrs. Gu. Either the He family did not take Gu Zheng seriously at all, or it meant that He Wenxian had ulterior motives and deliberately wanted Mrs. Gu to make a fool of herself.","No matter what the reason was, the He family had already offended Gu Zheng. Was there a need for them to please a family that was already hated by Gu Zheng?","“Miss He.” Qiao Xi had just walked to the door when she suddenly stopped in her tracks and slowly turned around. “It shouldn’t be a problem for me to donate this necklace now, right?”","He Wenxian’s blood surged. Anger and shame rushed to her head at the same time. She was about to faint from anger, but in front of everyone, she could only squeeze out a smile. “Of course, it’s not a problem.”","This farce finally ended with He Wenxian’s apology. Mrs. Gu had also forgiven He Wenxian, but everyone knew very well that this was just the beginning. He Wenxian naturally would not let the matter rest. From the fact that Miss He deliberately made Mrs. Gu look bad, it could be seen that she was filled with hostility toward Mrs. Gu.","Originally, He Wenxian was a gentle goddess in everyone’s hearts, but now, her beautiful image seemed to have been tarnished.","After Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng left, Cheng Juan also walked out.","Gu Zheng’s voice was gentle. “Xi Xi, thank Mr. Cheng.”","Qiao Xi smiled. She should indeed thank Cheng Juan, but before she could speak, Gu Zheng stopped in his tracks and turned around slightly. “Mr. Cheng, I heard that you’re always busy. Many noble families ask you to appraise their jewelry, but you reject them all. Why did you come to the He family’s charity banquet to appraise the jewelry this time? Moreover, you carried a hammer with you. Could it be that you knew that someone would look for you to appraise the jewelry?”","Qiao Xi’s expression changed. It was over! It was over. Would she be discovered?","Gu Zheng glanced indifferently at Cheng Juan and smirked. “Xi Xi, don’t you think it’s strange?”","Qiao Xi panicked and subconsciously glanced at Cheng Juan. That kid had an indifferent expression as if everything had nothing to do with him. It seemed that she could explain it herself.","Actually, Cheng Juan was indeed an orphan who was once sponsored by the He family, but he had a special identity. If he did not want to tell others, Qiao Xi naturally would not know about it either.","After a long silence, Qiao Xi braced herself and said, “After all, this is a charity banquet. It’s not strange for someone to donate jewelry, so Mr. Cheng came over to take a look.”","Gu Zheng nodded thoughtfully as if he seemed to believe her words. Then, he asked with a trace of hostility, “Mr. Cheng’s rules aren’t ordinary. Xi Xi, weren’t you afraid that he’d accidentally smash the wrong necklace?”","Cheng Juan frowned.","Qiao Xi: “...”","“Mr. Cheng has never made a mistake in his career. He has been appraising jewelry for so many years. How could he smash the wrong thing? Ah Zheng, you’re really good at joking,” she explained awkwardly."]},{"number":1302,"title":"Chapter 1302 Where Have We Met?","paragraphs":["1302 Where Have We Met?","Gu Zheng looked at her meaningfully with a smile as if he had already seen through her.","“Mr. Cheng only picked up the necklace and took a brief look at it before deciding that He Wenxian’s necklace was a fake. He could also tell that there were fillings in the necklace. Actually, the craftsmanship of that necklace isn’t bad. It can be said to be a high-quality imitation. Appraisers can’t quickly figure it out with the naked eye. Xi Xi, you’re a designer of Liuli, so of course, you understand how difficult it is to appraise such jewelry. Sometimes, you might need some equipment to help you.","“The rubies on the two necklaces are indeed different, but it’s impossible for one to make a judgment in an extremely short period of time. Xi Xi, why do you think Mr. Cheng was so sure that He Wenxian’s necklace was a fake?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Cheng Juan had indeed done a sloppy job, and it was noticed by Gu Zheng!","Cheng Juan was just pretending to be a jewelry appraiser. He smashed her necklace after taking a look. He wanted to observe it carefully before smashing it!","However, Gu Zheng was testing Cheng Juan now. What was he trying to do? Could it be that he was jealous?","Cheng Juan raised his eyes and met Gu Zheng’s gaze. He could sense a strong warning from it. Was he warning him to stay away from Qiao Xi?","He glanced at Gu Zheng and let out a hearty laugh. “So, this is the famous President Gu! I’ve heard a lot about you. I heard that you’re Chairman He’s student. I don’t think you’re very respectful to your master!”","Gu Zheng did not even bat an eyelid. Without changing his expression, he said, “I heard that Mr. Cheng is an orphan sponsored by the He family. In that case, Chairman He can be considered your benefactor too. However, I don’t think you care about your benefactor’s reputation at all. You don’t look like you’re repaying your benefactor. You must be taking revenge.”","Qiao Xi was sandwiched between the two of them and smelled the strong smell of gunpowder.","‘Why are you two being so sarcastic?’","Cheng Juan was not annoyed. Instead, he raised his eyes to look at Qiao Xi and sneered. “Yes, I’m a person who repays kindness with ingratitude. They sponsored me, but I won’t let them have an easy time.”","Gu Zheng retracted the smile on his face and looked at Cheng Juan. The two of them seemed to understand what the other party meant.","Qiao Xi pondered. Back then, the He family had indeed sponsored some orphans. At that time, Cheng Juan should only have been five or six years old. What did the He family do after that?","Gu Zheng pondered for a moment and said in a gentler tone, “Mr. Cheng, do you still remember your friend from the orphanage?”","Cheng Juan’s expression turned cold as he said in a sharp voice, “President Gu, don’t you know where the orphans who were sponsored by the He family ended up?”","At this moment, Qiao Xi realized that there was something wrong with the contents of their conversation. But Cheng Juan did not say anything else, and Gu Zheng did not ask further.","The three of them arrived at the entrance of the front hall. Gu Zheng suddenly stopped in his tracks and asked, “Mr. Cheng, are you really an orphan?”","Cheng Juan glanced at him and did not answer his question. Instead, he continued walking forward. “President Gu, I’ll leave first. We’ll meet again if fate allows.”","He had just taken a few steps when he suddenly saw someone appear in the corner. Qiao Xi raised her eyes to take a look. It was He Wenyin.","He Wenyin had gone somewhere and sneaked in from the back door. When Cheng Juan saw her, he suddenly recalled something. He had previously done a jewelry appraisal for a little girl. It turned out that the little girl back then was the current He Wenyin.","He Wenyin walked over and looked around. When she suddenly saw Cheng Juan in front of her, she looked stunned and panicked.","Cheng Juan took a few steps forward with a teasing look in his eyes. “Miss, have we met somewhere before?”","He Wenyin’s expression changed as she glared at him unhappily. “Where would I have seen you?! This method of hitting on others is already outdated. Stop being so old-fashioned!”","Cheng Juan touched his nose in amusement. “Perhaps I was wrong. You’re a little similar to a young lady I’ve seen before. Anyway, there are many similar people in this world. It must be a coincidence.”","At this moment, a friend beside He Wenyin walked over and whispered in her ear, “Don’t offend this gentleman. He’s the jewelry appraiser, Cheng Juan.”","He Wenyin: “...”","Her expression was a little strange. She frowned at first, then revealed a flattering smile. “Hello, Mr. Cheng. The auction is about to start. Mr. Cheng, quickly take a seat.”","Before Cheng Juan could say anything, He Wenyin ran away.","Cheng Juan looked at her back view, and the corners of his mouth curled into a smile of interest. He did not expect He Weinian to nurture such an interesting little girl."]},{"number":1303,"title":"Chapter 1303 Cheng Juan’s Past","paragraphs":["1303 Cheng Juan’s Past","The He family’s charity banquet was the same as before. It was a public auction of the items donated by the guests. The highest bidder would win. In the end, the He family would donate all the donations received.","Gu Zheng held Qiao Xi’s hand and sat down. Seeing that she was silent for a long time, he turned his head and asked her, “Xi Xi, what are you thinking about?”","Qiao Xi came back to her senses and looked at He Wenyin with slightly cold eyes. “I was just thinking about He Wenyin’s past with Cheng Juan.”","She had known Cheng Juan for so many years, but she had never heard him mention the past. She only knew that he grew up in an orphanage. After that, someone sponsored him to attend university, which was how he achieved his current achievements.","!!","Cheng Juan had been diligent and studious since he was young. He wanted to repay the person who sponsored him when he grew up. Back then, his eyes were filled with hope as he told Qiao Xi excitedly, “Xi Xi, I’m leaving. I’ve found the benefactor who sponsored me. I’m going to look for him.”","Qiao Xi knew that he was grateful and wanted to repay his kindness back then, so she supported him. However, a year later, Cheng Juan was brought back by Qin An. At that time, Cheng Juan’s eyes no longer had any light as if he had become a different person. From then on, she rarely saw him smile.","Back then, Qiao Xi had even asked Qin An what had happened, but Qin An did not tell her. He only said that if Cheng Juan wanted to tell her, he would naturally tell her. If he did not want to tell her, she should let him slowly recover from his wounds. She did not want to force him to open his wounds.","Qiao Xi did not ask again. After that, Cheng Juan seemed to have walked out of his sorrow and worked hard to become a famous jewelry appraiser. He never mentioned that benefactor again.","It was not until the He family returned to Li City that Cheng Juan suddenly returned. After he returned to Li City, he went to look for Qin An and Qiao Xi. A trace of hatred had burst out of Cheng Juan’s eyes. He said that he would not let it slide so easily this time.","Qin An looked as if he had expected this. Qiao Xi did not understand it in the past, but now, she had guessed a portion of it. He Weinian was indeed Cheng Juan’s benefactor, but for some reason, Cheng Juan, who was once grateful, treated He Weinian as his enemy.","Qiao Xi abruptly raised her head. “You said that many of the children in the orphanage Cheng Juan was in all those years ago disappeared?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were cold, and his tone was calm. “Yes, the management of the orphanage was very lax 20 years ago. No one would pay attention to the disappearance of a group of orphans. The only people who would notice would probably be their companions who grew up with them, but...","“What if they all disappear too? No one will probably notice.","“The children in that orphanage were lonely and helpless. If they were lucky and met a good family, they could live a happy life after being adopted. When the children reached a certain age, the He family gave them a sum of money to leave the orphanage. In the eyes of the orphanage’s director, these children would go their separate ways after coming of age. Their future would be bright. It was just that the children later forgot about the orphanage and never visited.”","“But Cheng Juan is different.” Qiao Xi added, “From what you’re saying, the children who were sponsored by the He family have all disappeared without a trace. Only Cheng Juan was left behind. But how could living people disappear into thin air?”","There were more than ten children who grew up with Cheng Juan back then. Why did they all go missing and only Cheng Juan remained?","Gu Zheng’s gaze became sharp. “Those orphans don’t have any relatives. The only link they have is with the orphanage. The dean of the orphanage wouldn’t think that they had gone missing. He’d just think that they were busy looking for better lives. Hence, even if they went missing, no one would call the police. With the He family’s strength, it’s very easy to make them disappear completely.”","Qiao Xi’s scalp instantly went numb as she frowned and asked, “But why did the He family make them disappear? So many of them disappeared at the same time too. Even if their plan is perfect, it’s hard to guarantee that they won’t be discovered. Could it be...”","Gu Zheng’s thin lips parted slightly. “Because the He family has a reason to get rid of them. For example, those orphans discovered a secret that only Cheng Juan doesn’t know.”","What reason did they have to get rid of so many people?","Gu Zheng looked at the kind-looking He Weinian in front of the stage and snorted disdainfully. “Xi Xi, do you know the secret that the He family doesn’t want others to know?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Madam He and He Weinian’s loving appearance. The couple’s faces were filled with happy smiles. They stood on the stage together and spoke. When they got off the stage, He Weinian thoughtfully supported Madam He and carefully grabbed her wrist. His eyes were filled with love."]},{"number":1304,"title":"Chapter 1304 The He Family’s Old Case","paragraphs":["1304 The He Family’s Old Case","Qiao Xi looked at the couple in front of the stage and could not help but sigh in her heart. What a loving couple. Unfortunately, everything was just on the surface.","Seeing that Qiao Xi was silent, Gu Zheng asked again, “Xi Xi, do you know how many wives He Weinian has had?”","Qiao Xi hesitated for a moment and replied tentatively, “Madam He is a mistress?”","Among the noble families of high society, it was very common for mistresses to rise to power. Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng’s families both had such incidents, but the He family was different.","“Madam He is He Weinian’s second wife. Two years after He Weinian’s ex-wife died, Madam He married He Weinian and gave birth to He Tingchen and He Wenxian.","Qiao Xi calculated carefully. “He Tingchen is 25 years old this year. Madam He married He Weinian 26 years ago. In other words, He Weinian’s ex-wife died 28 years ago.”","Gu Zheng nodded and continued, “He Weinian’s love life is impeccable. He didn’t have an affair and only married his second wife after his first wife’s death. In everyone’s eyes, He Weinian has always been a gentle, respectful, and humble man. Hence, everyone naturally thinks that He Weinian came from a noble family and received higher education since he was young, but actually...”","Qiao Xi was instantly interested.","Gu Zheng said calmly, “Actually, he’s not from a noble family at all. He’s just from an ordinary family, but his ex-wife was the daughter of a noble family. He has tried his best to cover up this matter, but I still found some clues.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Madam He. “Looking at how loving He Weinian and Madam He are, I thought Madam He was the first wife. I didn’t expect He Weinian to be married a second time.”","“He Weinian’s ex-wife also gave birth to a son and a daughter, but during one trip, the three of them got into a car accident. The car fell off the cliff, and the three of them died on the spot. Later on, the police confirmed that it was just an accident. Xi Xi, if you want to know the details of this matter, go ask Mr. Liang.”","“Teacher?” Qiao Xi asked.","“Yes, Mr. Liang should know what happened back then. He Weinian’s wife and children died in a car accident. What’s even stranger is that a few years before that car accident, He Weinian’s in-laws accidentally fell while climbing a mountain. The two of them died on the spot. It was also an accident.","“He Weinian’s ex-wife was an only child. After his in-laws passed away, all their assets were inherited by his ex-wife. After that, his wife and children died in a car accident, so he ended up inheriting those assets.”","The more Qiao Xi thought about it, the more terrifying she found it. She clenched her fists. “In other words, the He family’s current status and money were all derived from He Weinian’s ex-wife?”","“That’s right.”","Qiao Xi frowned. “To be able to support such an enormous He family, the inheritance left behind by his ex-wife must be very generous. He Weinian is the greatest beneficiary from those two accidents, but no one ever suspected him?”","Gu Zheng shook his head. “No one will suspect anything because he and his ex-wife were very close. The two of them often attended banquets together. He Weinian doted on his ex-wife very much and was very meticulous. The couple was very loving. Moreover, his biological children also died in the car accident. Everyone thought that even if he wanted to harm his wife, he wouldn’t have killed his children.","“After the accident, He Weinian was heartbroken and immediately told the police that it could be murder. Otherwise, why would the car suddenly lose control? He asked the police to open a case for investigation and refused to believe that it was just an accident.","“In the eyes of outsiders, he had always been gentle and kind. After his wife and children died, he cried bitterly every day and fell sick for a few days. His hair turned white from worry, and he even fainted from crying at the funeral. After that, He Weinian still could not accept it, so he abandoned the company and helped the police investigate. After doing this for half a month, he finally confirmed that it was indeed a murder case.","“It was just that the suspect in this murder case wasn’t He Weinian but his cousin. His cousin had always been jealous that He Weinian married a beautiful and rich woman. They were a loving couple and had two children, so He Weinian seemed to be a winner in life while his cousin was useless. Out of jealousy, he caused the deaths of He Weinian’s wife and children. He wanted He Weinian to live in pain for the rest of his life.”","When Qiao Xi heard these words, she kept having the feeling that this story was a little far-fetched. Was it because He Weinian’s cousin was jealous of He Weinian that he caused the death of his wife and children?","A trace of mockery and coldness appeared on Gu Zheng’s face. “After that, He Weinian asked for the death penalty as the victim’s family member. He cried bitterly in court, causing everyone to be moved. Because of this, he offended his family and cut off all contact with his parents and relatives."]},{"number":1305,"title":"Chapter 1305 Shocking Secret","paragraphs":["1305 Shocking Secret","“What happened after that?” Qiao Xi stared fixedly at him.","“He Weinian’s cousin confessed to the crime and was executed. He Weinian naturally got the inheritance and even announced in public that he would donate his wife’s inheritance.”","Qiao Xi could not help but sneer. “Who is he kidding?! The He family has been dedicated to charity for so many years, but that money has never left the He family. It’s just a formality.”","“The murderer was found, so no one suspects He Weinian anymore. After all, he lost his loving wife and children. He even fainted from crying at the funeral. He cut off all ties with his relatives to seek justice for his wife. Most importantly, he donated his inheritance. On the surface, he indeed has no reason to kill his wife and children.”","“In that case, those orphans must have found out the truth. He Weinian was afraid that this matter would be leaked, so he had no choice but to get rid of everyone who might know the truth.”","Qiao Xi seemed to have held her breath in her heart. Every inch of skin on her body emitted a wisp of coldness. She finally understood why Cheng Juan hated He Weinian. Those dozen or so orphans...","With He Weinian’s character, it was impossible for him to leave any evidence behind. Hence, those orphans were probably killed. Cheng Juan had probably found out something, which was why he suddenly returned to Li City.","A trace of coldness suffused Qiao Xi’s entire body. “Then do Madam He and He Tingchen know what He Weinian did?”","Although there was no evidence, Qiao Xi was already sure that He Weinian had caused the deaths of his in-laws, wife, and children. If Madam He knew this, she probably wouldn’t have dared to marry him.","If Madam He really did not know about it, then He Weinian was really too scary. He had too many masks. Not only could he pretend to be kind, but he could also pretend to be innocent. Even his wife, who had been living with him for decades, could not see through him.","Gu Zheng said softly, “I’m not too sure if Madam He and the son of the He family know, but I think He Wenyin knows about this.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes instantly widened. In that case, He Wenyin was wholeheartedly going against the He family because she had long known the ugly side of the He family under their masks.","“Cheng Juan’s companions...” Qiao Xi’s nose suddenly soured.","“Fifteen.”","A cold voice sounded. Cheng Juan stood behind them. His tone was slightly cold, and his eyes were deep with a trace of sorrow and hatred. He took a deep breath. “Including me, there were a total of 16 of us. At that time, the dean of the orphanage brought the 16 of us everywhere to seek funding. At that time, the orphanage was too poor, and we didn’t even have any appropriate clothes to wear. I was the youngest among them, so there were many things I couldn’t remember. However, when I was four years old, many of my friends were picked up one after another. At that time, the dean said that they would have a better life. A philanthropist was willing to sponsor them to complete their studies. They would be able to go to school as long as they were at a suitable age.”","A trace of viciousness flashed past Cheng Juan’s eyes. “At that time, the dean thought that I wasn’t old enough, so he didn’t let me go. That philanthropist gathered 15 people together and took a photo. He even specially published it in the newspapers to publicize how kind and loving he was. He was willing to generously sponsor these poor orphans.”","Qiao Xi continued, “After that, you realized that those companions who left were taken away because they discovered He Weinian’s secret. What awaited them wasn’t a good life but...”","Cheng Juan gritted his teeth and suppressed the sorrow in his heart. “Yes, they never contacted the dean after they left the orphanage. They did occasionally send a few letters saying that they were doing well. But I haven’t seen them since.","“When I grew up and recalled what happened back then, I always felt that something was wrong. I never thought that this matter was related to that philanthropist. After that, I excitedly found He Weinian and discovered a shocking secret.”","A layer of grayness covered his eyes. The person he once treated as a god was the murderer who harmed more than ten of his companions. Of course, he could not accept it.","“You found out that the disappearance of those companions is related to He Weinian?” Qiao Xi asked.","“Yes, I’ve never stopped investigating all these years, but He Weinian is really too cunning. He doesn’t seem to have left many clues.”","Cheng Juan’s voice gradually became weak. He wanted to continue, but suddenly, a gentle voice came from behind. “Juan, it’s great that you’re here!”","Hearing this voice, a trace of hatred flashed past Cheng Juan’s eyes before disappearing. He turned around and smiled gently. “Mr. He.”"]},{"number":1306,"title":"Chapter 1306 Irreconcilable Hatred For Killing My Mother","paragraphs":["1306 Irreconcilable Hatred For Killing My Mother","“Why are you still calling me Mr. He? It sounds too distant. Call me Uncle He in the future. I heard what happened in the small banquet hall just now. Wenxian is a little temperamental. Don’t mind her.”","Qiao Xi sized up He Weinian. No matter when, his words and actions were always so appropriate, causing others to be unable to catch a trace of mistake.","Cheng Juan’s performance was perfect when facing his enemy. He chuckled. “Uncle He, you’re being too serious. I’m already very happy that you don’t blame me.”","“How could I blame you? You did the right thing in this matter! You should be professional. Don’t ruin your reputation for Wenxian. You’re the most outstanding student I’ve sponsored. I’m already very touched that you’re willing to stay by my side and work for the He family. How could I blame you for such a small matter? Follow me to the front and sit down.”","He Weinian smiled affectionately, then went forward to greet Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi. The surrounding people all looked over and discussed softly.","“What? The jewelry appraisal master is a student sponsored by He Weinian?”","“I heard that Cheng Juan used to be an orphan. Coincidentally, Chairman He sponsored the orphanage he was in. There were more than ten children in total. In the end, only Cheng Juan was willing to stay by Chairman He’s side and work for him.”","“I see! Mr. Cheng can be said to be grateful. Unfortunately, the other children in the orphanage are too heartless. They’re not even willing to stay by Chairman He’s side.”","Cheng Juan gritted his teeth and suppressed the anger in his heart. He turned around to look at Gu Zheng before leaving with He Weinian.","After everyone left, Qiao Xi leaned over to Gu Zheng’s ear and asked, “Do you think Cheng Juan is staying by He Weinian’s side to take revenge for his companions?”","“Xi Xi, what other motive do you think he has?” Gu Zheng asked.","Qiao Xi thought for a moment. “I can’t say. I just have a feeling that Cheng Juan seems to be hiding something. Perhaps he doesn’t have the strength to go against He Weinian yet, so he doesn’t want to say it. But I think he’ll say it one day.","“No matter what his motive is, Third Brother and I will do our best to help him.” Qiao Xi could understand Cheng Juan very well. He and his companions had relied on each other back then. They treated each other as their own biological brothers and sisters. Now that he was the only one who survived, his only mission was to take revenge.","“Xi Xi, you probably don’t know that Cheng Juan and He Weinian’s deceased son are the same age. His son was just born when the car accident happened.”","Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes and suddenly recalled something. Cheng Juan had gotten Qin An to help him change his age. Could it be that He Weinian’s son did not die and survived the car accident? Did he become the current Cheng Juan?","The car accident happened 28 years ago, which meant that Cheng Juan was 28 years old, but his information showed that he was 26 years old.","If Cheng Juan and He Weinian really had that kind of relationship, wouldn’t Cheng Juan have a grudge against He Weinian for killing his mother?","Qiao Xi felt that Cheng Juan must have found some clues, but there was no evidence. He could not alert the enemy and could only continue to hide his identity.","The venue suddenly fell silent. The auction was about to start. Qiao Xi took off the necklace and handed it to Song Shijing.","“Young Madam, are you really donating it?”","Qiao Xi nodded without the slightest hesitation, but her gaze passed through the crowd to look at He Weinian and Cheng Juan. She instructed softly, “Quickly donate it.”","Only valuable items could enter He Weinian’s treasure vault. This necklace had a tracking and listening device that could accurately find the exact location of the treasure vault.","He Weinian was full of smiles at this moment. Cheng Juan was sitting on his right, while He Wenxian, He Tingchen, and Madam He were sitting on his left. It was a harmonious scene.","“Juan, I saw you chatting with Ah Zheng for a long time just now. I didn’t expect you to hit it off with him so well. Do you know him?” He Weinian suddenly turned his head and asked with a trace of doubt in his eyes.","Cheng Juan replied calmly, “I’m not familiar with President Gu, but Qiao Xi and I are old acquaintances.”","He Weinian reacted and smiled. “Oh yes! Look at how bad my memory is getting. You’re a jewelry appraiser, and Qiao Xi is a designer. You must have worked with her before.”","Cheng Juan nodded, his tone carrying a trace of loneliness. “Yes, but I didn’t expect her to be married when I returned to the country this time.”","A trace of resentment flashed past He Wenxian’s eyes, but He Weinian smiled brightly. “Why do I feel that you want to get married too? Juan, you’re not young anymore. You’re 26 years old this year, right? Where do you plan to develop in the future?”","Cheng Juan replied gently, “Yes, I’m 26 years old. Qiao Xi wants me to go to her studio. I’m still considering it.”"]},{"number":1307,"title":"Chapter 1307 Which Parents Don’t Love Their Children?","paragraphs":["1307 Which Parents Don’t Love Their Children?","“I hope you can stay in the country.” He Weinian’s eyes were loving as he smiled gently. “Juan, it’s been so many years. Have you never thought of looking for your parents?”","Cheng Juan’s gaze changed. He knew that He Weinian was suspecting him. He had been developing overseas all these years, but he suddenly returned to Li City. It would naturally arouse He Weinian’s suspicion.","His voice was a little low and hoarse. “The dean told me that I was thrown at the entrance of the orphanage back then. When they picked me up, they saw that a note had been stuffed into my clothes. My name and date of birth were written on it. Since my parents had already decided to abandon me, there’s no point in me looking for them.”","A glint flashed past He Weinian’s eyes. He had previously investigated and found out that Cheng Juan was abandoned at the entrance of the orphanage 26 years ago. At that time, he was just born. There were records of him in the orphanage back then.","But what if Cheng Juan had changed his age like Tingchen and Wenxian?","No way! He had investigated it a long time ago. At that time, Cheng Juan was just an orphan with no one to rely on. He did not have the ability to change his age at all. He was the one who sponsored Cheng Juan to become a famous jewelry appraiser internationally.","He Weinian wanted to keep Cheng Juan by his side because he wanted everyone to know that he had sponsored this orphan in the past and nurtured him to become an internationally renowned jewelry appraiser. However, he was unwilling to trust Cheng Juan easily. He had to investigate this person clearly.","“You’re still young! Which parents in the world don’t love their children? If they weren’t facing difficulties, they wouldn’t have been able to bring themselves to abandon their children. I think you can consider looking for them so that you can understand the situation back then.”","As He Weinian spoke, he patted his shoulder. “Juan, why don’t I help you investigate? If they really wanted to abandon you back then, then you don’t have to see them. However, if they had their reasons for doing so, I can bring you to see their biological parents. What do you think?”","Cheng Juan’s heart was in turmoil. Even after so many years, He Weinian was still so hypocritical. It was nauseating!","He endured the uncomfortable feeling, and his eyes flickered. His voice trembled with surprise. “Thank you, Uncle He. If you need my help in the future, feel free to ask.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Cheng Juan deliberately stood up slightly. The token slid out of his pocket. He Weinian’s gaze was instantly attracted to the token. He knew that this was the token of the chief appraiser of Liuli and also a symbol of Cheng Juan’s status as an elder of the jewelry association.","Cheng Juan bent down to pick up the token and smiled in embarrassment.","“So, you’re back because of the jewelry association! I thought you came back for me!” He Weinian smiled brightly.","Cheng Juan smirked. “I came back for both, of course.”","Hearing this, He Weinian’s guard against Cheng Juan relaxed a little. If Liuli and the Jewelry Association had invited Cheng Juan at the same time, it was natural for him to decide to return to the country to develop his career. After all, it would be even more glorious to be able to become an elder of the Jewelry Association. Moreover, he was still so young. He had to think about his future.","He Weinian suspected Cheng Juan because Cheng Juan came to Li City not long after he returned to the country. He did not think that Cheng Juan would be so loyal to him and give up his development overseas in order to repay his kindness. However, if it was because of the Jewelry Association, he could understand. After all, Cheng Juan came back to the country for work. He only reached out to the He family as it was convenient.","At the thought of this, He Weinian was relieved. He was so wary of Cheng Juan because of what had happened back then...","However, almost 30 years had passed since that incident. Those people were all dead. All traces of them in this world had disappeared. No one would pay attention to those past events.","At this moment, the auction officially began.","The items donated by the He family were all very expensive. Just the value of the items donated by their family had already exceeded 200 million. At this moment, Scorching Heart, which was donated by Qiao Xi, appeared on stage.","He Weinian’s expression changed.","Cheng Juan looked at the sparkling necklace on the stage and said casually, “I really didn’t expect Qiao Xi to be willing to donate such a valuable necklace. I thought that she was just angry. After all, Scorching Heart is extremely valuable. I reckon not many people present can afford it.”","He Weinian turned his head and asked, “What do you mean?”"]},{"number":1308,"title":"Chapter 1308 A Murderous Devil","paragraphs":["1308 A Murderous Devil","“A few years ago, the auction price for this necklace was 150 million. This is because this necklace isn’t made from ordinary rubies. It’s extremely precious and rare. Moreover, its craftsmanship can be said to be top in the world. Now, the price of this necklace is estimated to be 300 million. All the guests present will participate in the bidding and obtain what they like, but I reckon they won’t be able to gather such a large sum of money in a short period of time.","“However, if this necklace can be brought to the auction house in the capital, the price might increase by another 100 million. It’s really a pity to auction it here. Moreover, among the guests present, the only one who can fork out 300 to 400 million to buy a necklace is probably Gu Zheng. However, this necklace was donated by Qiao Xi. If Qiao Xi donates it, it’ll be meaningless for Gu Zheng to bid for it again. Hence, I think it’s better to send this necklace to the capital to be auctioned. Wouldn’t it be much more worth it to get an extra 100 million?”","Cheng Juan spoke slowly, and He Weinian listened very seriously.","At this moment, Song Shijing asked softly, “Young Madam, how do you know that He Weinian would keep the necklace? If we auction it now, won’t our plan fail?”","Qiao Xi smiled confidently. “Originally, I couldn’t be sure, but... Cheng Juan is sitting beside him. He can choose not to listen to others, but he’ll definitely listen to the words of an internationally renowned jewelry appraiser.","“Moreover, Cheng Juan is telling the truth. This necklace is extremely valuable. If He Weinian doesn’t believe him, he can get someone to investigate. I chose to donate this necklace because I want to use He Weinian’s greed to make him keep the necklace for the time being and not use it for the auction.","“Whether he’ll auction it off after this, who knows? He’ll probably try his best to cover it up. For example, he’ll forge a fake and keep the real necklace by his side. Moreover, I heard that He Weinian likes to collect rare jewelry. This necklace is unique and has an extremely high collection value. I don’t believe that He Weinian won’t be tempted!”","Qiao Xi picked up the wine glass and took a sip. She chuckled and said, “Soon, He Weinian will stand up and say some hypocritical words so that the necklace won’t be a part of the auction.”","The next second, Scorching Heart was about to be auctioned. He Weinian walked up the stage, picked up the microphone, and said gently, “Everyone, before this necklace is auctioned, I want to announce that the market valuation for this necklace is 300 million.”","The entire venue was in an uproar. When they came to attend the auction, they had all come with a certain budget. This price was discussed with their families or the shareholders of the company. They did not have the ability to bid for anything above this price. This necklace was actually as high as 300 million, so they could not afford it.","He Weinian glanced at the expressions on everyone’s faces and announced again, “Since everyone has already done their best at the auction today, let’s find a suitable opportunity to auction this necklace.","“Don’t worry, everyone. I’ll announce the final price of this necklace online and donate everything. If you’re worried, I’ll inform you on the day of the necklace auction. Please come and supervise the auction.”","In the past, He Weinian’s image as a kind and benevolent person was deeply rooted in everyone’s hearts. No one would think that he would embezzle donations. Moreover, he said it so frankly, so no one would doubt his intentions.","Cheng Juan looked at He Weinian, who was talking confidently on stage. Even he was almost deceived by He Weinian’s appearance.","Even though he knew that He Weinian was pretending, he had to admit that He Weinian’s words and actions were too perfect. No one could find anything wrong with them.","After He Weinian finished speaking, the necklace was put away by the He family. They said that there would be a foundation established by the He family to temporarily safeguard it. They would take it out for auction when a suitable opportunity arose.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng. “As expected.”","Gu Zheng turned his head, and the two of them smiled at each other. “He’s my master. Of course, I know him.”","The entire venue erupted in applause. Everyone was praising He Weinian for being an outstanding philanthropist.","Cheng Juan clapped his hands symbolically, but his eyes were filled with hatred. He Weinian looked like a philanthropist on the surface, but he was actually a demon who killed without batting an eyelid. He pretended to be kind and benevolent in front of everyone. He held charity banquets every year, but in reality, it was to make it easier for him to earn money!","Everyone thought that he was a kind person, but he was an executioner. He stepped on the bones of many people to climb up. He even killed his wife and children. Cheng Juan wondered if his wife and children had ever come looking for him to take his life when he was dreaming."]},{"number":1309,"title":"Chapter 1309 He Wants To Seek Justice For The Dead","paragraphs":["1309 He Wants To Seek Justice For The Dead","On the surface, He Weinian had cried bitterly for his dead wife and children. He even almost fainted. However, he had secretly invited many people to exorcise the souls of his wife and children. He even conducted many rituals to keep ghosts away.","Cheng Juan was not a superstitious person. He did not believe that ghosts could take lives. The dead could not be revived. They could not tell the truth of what had happened back then, but he had always remained in this world. He wanted to seek justice for those who had died!","After the charity banquet ended, Cheng Juan bid farewell to He Weinian and left.","He Wenyin stood in a corner and stared at Cheng Juan’s departing figure. She had a feeling that this man was different from the rest. She could clearly see the flash of hatred in his eyes. He was so similar to her.","She looked away, her heart pounding.","After Cheng Juan left, the smile on Madam He’s face gradually vanished. She asked in a low voice, “Do you think Cheng Juan will believe you? Back then...”","“Don’t worry, I’ve already investigated him. Even if he continues to investigate, there won’t be any results.”","He Weinian said casually. Actually, he had long known that Cheng Juan was secretly investigating the 15 missing orphans. However, with his current status, it was very easy for him to forge evidence. He could give Cheng Juan a satisfactory answer and let him unravel the knot in his heart. This was not difficult for him.","That was why He Weinian kept probing Cheng Juan. After confirming that Cheng Juan did not suspect him, he could keep Cheng Juan by his side.","Hearing He Weinian’s words, Madam He’s expression softened a little. Then, she leaned over to He Weinian’s ear and said in a low voice, “Hubby, I haven’t been sleeping well recently. I dreamed of them...”","“What nonsense are you talking about? Don’t scare yourself!” He Weinian frowned. His gaze suddenly became sharp, and his expression was unprecedentedly serious.","Seeing that the guests were still present, he recovered his expression and said disdainfully, “They couldn’t defeat me when I was alive. What can they do now that they’re dead? You’re just too timid. All ghosts and gods are just your imagination.”","Madam He nodded and comforted herself softly. “Y-Yes, they’re all fake. What’s there for me to be afraid of? They’re already dead.”","“Alright, don’t be so paranoid. You’re the madam of the He family, so you have to pay attention to your image at all times,” He Weinian reprimanded unhappily, then instructed, “Remember, don’t let Tingchen and He Wenyin hear about these things. Tingchen is pure and kind. He might continue to investigate out of curiosity. As for He Wenyin...","“We can’t easily believe He Wenyin either. In short, don’t let them know.”","Madam He nodded hurriedly. “I’ll remember.","“Hubby, I heard from Wenxian that Qiao Xi isn’t simple! Can we teach her a lesson?”","He Weinian nodded thoughtfully, then a gentle smile appeared on his face. He held Madam He’s hand and walked toward the crowd.","In everyone’s opinion, the couple was loving, their children were filial, and their family was happy. They were simply a model family. However, they did not know that behind such a glamorous scene was the blood and bones of many people.","...","Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi sat in front of the computer, her eyes staring at the location of Scorching Heart. Ever since they left the banquet hall, the necklace had started moving. According to He Weinian, this necklace should have been sent to the He family’s foundation, but the current route was to the He family’s villa.","Gu Zheng chuckled, his eyes filled with disdain.","Qiao Xi leaned against the chair, slightly worried about Cheng Juan. After all, He Weinian was not a kind person. If Cheng Juan was exposed...","That night, Qiao Xi dreamed again. In her dream, she had long known Mo Yuan and remembered the seashell wind chime. However, the scene was different from before. A man appeared in front of her, but no matter what, she could not see the other party’s face clearly.","She saw the man give her a glass of water, and she took it without hesitation and drank it in one gulp. Not long after, her face revealed a shocked and sad expression as she whimpered in pain.","Qiao Xi had never been someone who was afraid of pain. She had been very strong since she was young, but one could sense from her expression in her dream that she must have felt heartbroken at that time. However, it did not seem to be physical pain but spiritual pain. It was obvious that she knew that man and even trusted him very much.","What was in that glass of water? Why was she in so much pain? However, she was clearly immune to poison. Even if she drank poisoned water, she would not have such a big reaction. Perhaps...","Perhaps it was not poison. The other party knew that she was immune to poison, so he drugged her with something else."]},{"number":1310,"title":"Chapter 1310 Dream Of Despair","paragraphs":["1310 Dream Of Despair","In her dream, Qiao Xi saw the man shouting outside. A group of nurses rushed in and pressed her down while taking her blood with a syringe.","Those people were like lunatics, wishing they could suck her blood dry. They did not care that she was getting weaker and weaker.","The man muttered, “Xi Xi, I’m sorry. I had no choice! I love you very much too, but only one of you can live. I have to make a choice. I’m really sorry. I’ve let you down...”","Qiao Xi’s heart seemed to have been dealt a heavy blow, and the pain was indescribable.","At this moment, her soul was floating in the air as she looked at the body that was being pressed onto the bed. In her dream, she looked to be 14 or 15 years old. She probably had not even started to date yet. The love this man was talking about was probably kinship.","However, she could not see that man’s face clearly. His voice was different from her brothers’. She did not remember knowing such a person at all.","Her shocked and sad expression still lingered in her mind. It was as if the young her could not believe that the man in front of her would harm her. Those sad and desperate eyes made her suffocate.","She was clearly such a strong girl. Who was the other party that could make her so sad?","Despair and pain instantly enveloped her heart. She could not breathe properly, and her body was pulled out of the dream. She suddenly sat up and gasped.","At this moment, her side was empty. The bedroom was dark, but a bright ray of moonlight shone in through the gap in the curtains. She picked up her phone and looked at it. It was only past 11 o’clock. She suddenly woke up not long after sleeping.","Qiao Xi’s heart thumped violently. She clutched her chest and could clearly sense the abnormality in her body. It was a fear that came from the depths of her heart. The fear was mixed with pain and despair.","Who was that man? Why did he do that to her? More importantly, why was she in pain?","Back then, when Qiao Rou pushed her into the water and she faced the threat of death, she did feel deep fear, but she did not feel pain or despair.","Qiao Xi thought that she would not casually rely on a man, nor would she be sad and in pain over a man. That was just a groundless dream. Why would it affect her so much?","However, was that really just a dream, or... did it really happen?","She had indeed lost a part of her memories that involved Gu Zheng. She had not found the reason or any clues yet. This time, she dreamed of another man. That man’s voice was filled with guilt. He said that he loved her, but he had no choice but to give up on her.","Were they relatives?","He did not look like someone from her father’s generation. He should be very young. Moreover, she trusted that man very much, but...","Qiao Xi fell into deep thought. Perhaps part of her loss of memory was related to this man, but she had grown up being bullied by Qiao Rou and Xu Mei. It was very difficult for her to trust someone. Why did she trust that man so much and even suffer because of his murder attempt?","Qiao Xi felt like her head was about to explode. She rubbed her temples before calling Qin An. “Third Brother, let me ask you something. Do you think I trust you very much? Do you think I’d be in shock, pain, and despair if you were to poison me one day?”","Qin An: “...”","He was already asleep when he was woken up by Qiao Xi’s call, but all he heard was her asking a strange question. He forcefully suppressed his anger as he shouted, “Little Six, if you’re sick, quickly go to the hospital for treatment!”","Qiao Xi ignored his roar and hung up. Third Brother thought that she was not that kind of person. Since that was the case, why was she in so much pain after finding out that that person had harmed her?","If there was nothing wrong with her brain, it was because that man was very important to her and treated her extremely well that she let down her guard and completely trusted that man. That was why she was in pain and despair after the betrayal.","Just as Qiao Xi was frowning and thinking, Gu Zheng pushed the door open and walked in. Seeing that she was not asleep, he turned on the lights. He was wearing white lounge clothes, and his hair fell gently. He looked at Qiao Xi with his clear eyes and noticed the sweat on her forehead. He pursed his lips and asked, “What’s wrong?”","Qiao Xi looked at him seriously and asked, “Gu Zheng, do you think I’m someone who would feel pain, despair, and even run away cowardly after being hurt?”","Gu Zheng: “...”","He walked to the bed and gently fixed her hair behind her ear. Her face and lips were slightly pale. Her eyes were suffused with a trace of doubt and sorrow. He seemed to have never seen Qiao Xi look slightly weak and helpless."]},{"number":1311,"title":"Chapter 1311 I Will Make Her Life Worse Than Death","paragraphs":["1311 I Will Make Her Life Worse Than Death","“No,” Gu Zheng said firmly. “No matter how important that person is to you, with your character, you won’t behave like that. Xi Xi, you’re not a weak person to begin with. Your childhood experiences have already polished you to be indestructible. You’ll only become braver the more you suffer. You won’t become a weak person who runs away.”","Hearing Gu Zheng’s words, Qiao Xi seemed to have come alive.","Gu Zheng smiled. “Tell me, what dream did you have?”","...","!!","The next morning, Gu Zheng was in the study, quietly thinking about Qiao Xi’s words last night. She dreamed of a man who drugged and harmed her. She was pressed down by a group of people and had her blood drawn.","A trace of coldness flashed past Gu Zheng’s eyes. That man did not poison her but used a special medicine that could temporarily make her lose her ability to move. The only people who knew that she was immune to poison were the trustworthy people beside her. In other words, Qiao Xi trusted that man very much.","He remembered that the Xia family had been scheming to get Xi Xi’s blood. Could it be that the Xia family was behind it?","“President.” Song Shijing knocked on the door and walked in. He said respectfully, “I’ve already investigated, but there are no clues. Such a man has never appeared in Young Madam’s information, and there’s no record of Young Madam’s blood being drawn in any hospital. If it wasn’t done in a formal organization, it’ll be very difficult to find out.","“However, I accidentally realized that many people have been investigating Young Madam. There’s even news that Young Madam’s blood can detoxify poisons. Moreover, it’s said that...”","Song Shijing suddenly paused and frowned as if he could not say anything else.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were cold as he ordered, “Speak.”","Song Shijing lowered his head and said nervously, “If they transfuse Young Madam’s blood into someone else, that person will have the ability to be immune to poison. Then, if that person’s blood is transfused into Young Madam’s body, Young Madam will produce blood that’s also immune to poison.","“That’s why she can afford to lose the blood in her body to others.”","Gu Zheng could not help but break the pen in his hand. His eyes were bloodshot. Just listening to Song Shijing made it difficult for him to suppress the anger in his heart.","“Who’s the rumormonger?”","Song Shijing gritted his teeth. “...The Xia family, Xia Lan.”","Xia Lan was the previous Xia Yunlou. Ever since her identity was exposed last time, the Yin family had ordered Xia Yunlou to change her name and disallowed her from continuing to use Xia Yunlou’s name. When the police came to investigate, Xia Cheng insisted that he did not know Xia Yunlou’s whereabouts or that Xia Lan was not the real Xia Yunlou. Xia Lan also knew nothing, so this matter was temporarily put aside.","These few days, Xia Lan had probably been hiding in the Xia family and did not dare to go out. Who knew that she would spread such news everywhere?","“According to my investigation, Xia Lan said that Young Madam’s blood can be purified every five years. Then, the person who injects her blood into their bloodstream will be immune to all poison. However, each time she’s about to go through the purification process, Young Madam falls sick.”","Gu Zheng suddenly recalled Qiao Xi’s dream last night. She dreamed that her blood was drained when she was 14 or 15 years old. If it were five years ago, the timing was a match.","“She’s courting death!” Gu Zheng exuded a violent killing intent. “I have yet to settle the score with her for what happened in New City Mall. Now that He Weinian’s matter is settled, it’s time for me to deal with Xia Lan.”","“President...” Song Shijing trembled in fear.","“Xia Lan wants to harm my Xi Xi, right?” Gu Zheng’s light brown eyes were covered in a layer of blood red, and he did not conceal the killing intent in his eyes at all. All these years, he had long since developed the ability to not show his emotions on his face, but he was unable to calm down when it came to Qiao Xi.","As soon as he finished speaking, Song Shijing reminded him hesitantly, “Calm down! President, murder is against the law.”","Gu Zheng looked up with a cold smile. The temperature around him plummeted. “Song Shijing, won’t it be too easy to grant such a person death?”","Song Shijing: “...”","“I’ll make her wish she was dead!”","His words scared Song Shijing.","Soon, Qiao Xi learned about the matter from Song Shijing. Since the other party thought that she would fall seriously ill every five years, she would cooperate with them.","When Gu Yao heard that Qiao Xi was sick, he hurriedly put down his work and brought his assistant and secretary to buy a bunch of things before going to Longwan Residential.","He pushed open the door with difficulty with the flowers and fruits. The butler hurriedly took them. “Second Young Master, why did you buy so many things?”","“Isn’t Qiao Xi sick? I’m here to see her.” With that, Gu Yao quickly rushed upstairs before the butler could react."]},{"number":1312,"title":"Chapter 1312 Humans Are Selfish","paragraphs":["1312 Humans Are Selfish","At this moment, Gu Yao was still very puzzled. How did a person like Qiao Xi, who could beat up a group of strong men, suddenly fall sick? Could it be that she had caught a cold during the change in season? However, a cold was not a serious illness. She was such a strong person, so she wouldn’t have needed to apply for leave!","Could she be injured? Had she lost a lot of blood?","Or was it a car accident? Did she break her leg or arm?","It was over! Could it be a terminal illness?!","!!","Countless thoughts appeared in Gu Yao’s mind. Qiao Xi’s dying appearance on the hospital bed had already appeared in front of him. His heart ached, and he quickened his pace.","If Qiao Xi was really disabled or had a terminal illness, he would accompany her with Gu Zheng. In the future...","Gu Yao suddenly pushed the door open. The worry and heartache on his face froze instantly, and the corners of his mouth twitched slightly.","Qiao Xi was indeed lying on the bed, but she was holding her phone in her hand and was focused on playing a game. When she saw someone open the door, she raised her eyes and glanced at them.","Gu Yao widened his eyes and looked at her carefully. Then, he asked in shock, “Your leg and arm aren’t broken?”","Qiao Xi: “???”","Couldn’t this brat wish her well?","Qiao Xi suddenly put down her phone and looked at him with a smile. “Gu Yao, I suddenly feel that this game is quite boring. Why don’t you play with me? I want to see if your legs and arms will be broken.”","Gu Yao nodded subconsciously, then his expression changed drastically. He suddenly took a few steps back and shouted in a panic, “Hey! Qiao Xi, don’t be rash! I heard that you were sick and came all the way here to see you. Why do you wanna hit me the moment we meet?!”","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “I’m not sick. I’m just pretending!”","“You’re pretending to be sick?” Gu Yao was stunned for a moment and instantly became nervous. “Why are you pretending to be sick? Did someone in the university bully you? Or did someone in the company bully you? Tell me and I’ll help you deal with them!”","Qiao Xi glanced at him, her heart warm. These were Gu Yao’s sincere thoughts.","She paused for a moment and suddenly asked, “Gu Yao, do you think I’m someone who would feel pain, despair, and even run away cowardly after being hurt?”","Gu Yao’s mind was filled with question marks, then he suddenly thought of Gu Moling. A look of surprise washed over him.","Thinking about Gu Moling’s current outcome, he knew that she was not that kind of person. If someone hurt her, with her character, she would definitely not let that person have an easy time—much less run away cowardly.","At this moment, Gu Yao also sensed that she was not in a good mood. He asked gently, “Qiao Xi, what’s wrong? Why are you asking this? Did you encounter some difficulties?”","Qiao Xi’s lips were tense. Gu Yao was pure and kind, just like a piece of white paper. She did not want to tell Gu Yao those dirty and terrifying things lest he be worried and afraid.","“No matter what happens, tell me. I’ll try my best to help you solve the problem, okay?” Gu Yao’s voice was unprecedentedly gentle as if the person in front of him was not his sister-in-law but a child younger than him.","Gu Yao was so worried that his body was trembling. Qiao Xi was such a strong person. How could she have such an expression? Could it be that she really had an incurable disease?","At this moment, Gu Yao was already so anxious that his forehead was covered in sweat. He paced back and forth in the room and looked at Qiao Xi anxiously. His eyes were clear, bright, and warm.","Qiao Xi was silent for a moment before she said helplessly, “I’m fine for now. It’s just that I had a dream.”","Then, Qiao Xi told Gu Yao about that dream. Gu Yao, who had always been carefree, instantly became serious when he heard that. He rarely revealed such an expression, which did not match his character and age.","Gu Yao knew that since Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng took this matter so seriously, it was very likely that this matter was true. Five years ago, someone had really taken Qiao Xi’s blood.","Suddenly, his face turned pale as he exclaimed, “F*ck!”","He immediately took a step back, and a trace of horror appeared in his eyes. He lowered his voice and said, “That’s not right! You’re immune to all poisons! Moreover, your blood can be regenerated. Doesn’t that mean you’re a blood bank that can cure all poisons? How can you tell others about this? If news of this gets out, you’ll be doomed!”","That was right. Such news could not be spread. After all, humans were selfish by nature. It was hard to guarantee that the people who knew about this would not harm Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi hesitated for a moment. “Others?”","“That’s right!” Gu Yao said anxiously. “If your blood can detoxify all poisons, you’re a walking target now. If this secret gets out, who knows how many demons will want you? If you tell the secret so easily, then...”"]},{"number":1313,"title":"Chapter 1313 The Cutest Person In The World","paragraphs":["1313 The Cutest Person In The World","“There’s only you and me in this room. And it’s not like you’re an outsider.” Qiao Xi smiled indifferently.","Gu Yao was stunned. “Yes! You’re my sister-in-law! How can I be considered an outsider?”","Qiao Xi couldn’t help but laugh. “Then what are you worried about? I’ve only told you and Gu Zheng about this. It’s impossible for me to tell outsiders.”","Gu Yao instantly felt that his status in Qiao Xi’s heart had changed. It turned out that he was as important as Gu Zheng. He was really too outstanding!","He immediately patted his chest and promised excitedly, “Qiao Xi, I swear on my life that I’ll absolutely not tell anyone!”","Qiao Xi naturally believed him, or else she wouldn’t have told him.","“But...” Gu Yao suddenly frowned. “Don’t you think something’s wrong?”","“What’s wrong?” Qiao Xi asked.","Gu Yao said, “You dreamed that your blood was extracted when you were 15 or 16 years old. According to the information Gu Zheng investigated and the Xia family’s words, the blood in your body is purified every five years, and the person who has your blood can be immune to all poisons. It’s been exactly five years now. Your blood can be purified now.","“If your blood was extracted five years ago, then the time is ripe now. Such rumors are suddenly spreading outside. The person who spread the rumors might be the person who took your blood back then, but you’ve seen all those people from the Xia family. It can’t be them!”","Qiao Xi understood all this. “That’s why I’m pretending to be sick.”","The Xia family said that before the blood in her body was completely purified, she would be very weak. If the outside world knew that Mrs. Gu had suddenly fallen sick and this news coincidentally matched the rumors, perhaps this could lure out the mastermind.","Gu Yao said worriedly, “Qiao Xi, I think your dream is real. It shouldn’t be long before your memories recover. It’s just that we don’t know who wants to take your blood yet, so we can’t guard against them.","“But I don’t understand. How would that person know such an important secret?”","Qiao Xi muttered as well, “I don’t understand either. How could others know my secret?”","“Ordinary people won’t spread this secret. Moreover, you’ve always been careful. You definitely wouldn’t have told outsiders. If it’s Gu Zheng and me, or someone else you trust, we definitely won’t spout nonsense. Otherwise, others might accidentally discover that your blood can treat poisons, so...”","Qiao Xi shook her head and replied with a smile, “I think I was the one who told him.”","Gu Yao’s face instantly turned pale, and his ears buzzed. He widened his eyes in shock.","If the other party was able to make Qiao Xi tell this secret herself, then that man must be as important to Qiao Xi as Gu Zheng was. That was why she was able to tell the other party everything. However, someone she trusted so much wanted to take her blood and make her lose her memory.","Five years later, that person returned and even wanted to take Qiao Xi’s blood again. He wanted to plunder Qiao Xi’s blood time and again to satisfy his greed and selfishness.","But... why would she ever trust such a person?","“You didn’t see that man’s face?” Gu Yao asked in a trembling voice.","“No. After all, I haven’t recovered my memories yet, and my dream was very blurry,” Qiao Xi replied. Actually, she was very curious as to who the other party was. She trusted him so much, yet he betrayed her mercilessly.","Or could it be that the other party was not just one person but a group of people or a family?","Gu Yao sized up Qiao Xi and asked nervously, “Qiao Xi, are you feeling unwell now?”","Qiao Xi shook her head. “According to the news spread by the Xia family, it might be about time. But I don’t feel weak. Everything is normal.”","Gu Yao heaved a sigh of relief and reminded her, “You have to be careful. Don’t get close to unfamiliar people now. You can’t be schemed against by those bastards. Gu Zheng and I won’t let anything happen to you.”","Qiao Xi was so touched that she was about to cry. Ah Yao was really kind and warm-hearted.","She tugged at Gu Yao’s sleeve, tears almost welling up in her eyes. “Gu Yao, you’re the most—”","“After all, your existence is to restrain Gu Zheng. If you’re not around, Gu Zheng will probably turn the entire Li City upside down. With you by his side, he’ll pretend to be gentler. He won’t have a cold face all day. Otherwise, if I stand by his side for more than ten minutes, I’ll be so afraid that I’ll freeze into an ice pop. Ever since he married you, he has been smiling. He looks gentle and refined like a noble young master. Hence, without you, I don’t dare to imagine what he’ll become.”","Qiao Xi: “...” She originally wanted to say that Gu Yao was the cutest person in the world, but now, she took back her words."]},{"number":1314,"title":"Chapter 1314 Overestimating Oneself","paragraphs":["1314 Overestimating Oneself","In the Xia family’s villa.","These few days, the Xia family had been gloomy. Xia Cheng was in a coma for a few days and had just woken up. The company had already fallen to the bottom. The investors had all announced that they would withdraw their investments. The company’s capital chain was broken, their products were delayed, and their employees had all gone on strike. Overnight, all Xia Mengyan’s contracts were canceled. She also had to compensate a huge sum of money for the breach of contract. Everyone in the Xia family seemed to have given up struggling.","Xia Mengyan lay on the sofa like a zombie.","“Heh! So this is the Xia family!”","Suddenly, a disdainful female voice came from the door.","Everyone from the Xia family immediately looked in the direction of the voice. Old Madam Xia was already unhappy. Seeing this, she shouted, “Who are you? This is the Xia family’s residence. Get out!”","A middle-aged woman stood outside the door, followed by more than ten bodyguards and a fat, greasy man.","The woman was dressed elegantly and elegantly. Her skin was also very delicate. She was wearing a high-end dress with an expensive fur coat. She had a shiny gemstone necklace and earrings on her. She also had a lace hat that looked like it was from Y Nation.","The woman sized up everyone. “You’re Qiao Xi’s family?”","Xia Cheng’s expression instantly darkened when he heard Qiao Xi’s name.","The personal assistant beside the woman said respectfully, “Madam, that’s Madam Xia Lan. A few days ago, she was still called Xia Yunlou. I heard that she’s Miss Qiao Xi’s biological mother, but there are also rumors that she’s a fake. They haven’t been confirmed yet.”","The woman snorted, her eyes filled with disdain. “She’s that impostor!”","The assistant nodded. “Yes.”","Xia Lan’s expression instantly changed drastically, and her voice was sharp. “What nonsense are you talking about?! Who are you? What are you doing in my house?”","The woman pointed at the chair beside her. The assistant immediately took a handkerchief and carefully wiped the chair beside him. The woman sat down elegantly and reprimanded, “Why are you shouting? You have no manners at all! Of course, I’m here today for an important matter.”","Then, the assistant helped the fat and greasy man sit beside the woman. He then leaned closer to the woman and said in a low voice, “Madam, the Xia family is already struggling at death’s door under Gu Zheng’s suppression. Of course, they’ll agree to your request.”","A trace of pride flashed past the woman’s eyes. She wore white lace gloves with both hands and smiled coldly. “Gu Zheng? I really didn’t expect the little bastard who could be trampled on by everyone to not only survive but make a name for himself. However, no matter how capable Gu Zheng is, he’s not our match. He’s like an ant trying to shake a tree. He overestimates himself!”","The assistant smiled and nodded.","The woman leaned against the chair and glanced at the Xia family with disdain. Finally, her gaze landed on Xia Lan. “Xia Lan, you’re really too useless!”","Xia Lan’s expression was extremely ugly.","“You can’t even control your own daughter. As her mother, you have all rights to control her affairs and marriage. However, in the end, not only were you unable to control Qiao Xi, but the Xia family even ended up in this state because of your incompetence!”","Xia Lan roared crazily, “Get lost! Get out!”","The surrounding bodyguards immediately gathered over, constantly vigilant against anyone hurting the madam. The woman said unhurriedly, “I’m here today to bring you good news. I can protect Xia Corporation. Moreover, Qiao Xi won’t be an obstacle to you anymore.”","Xia Cheng did not dare to easily believe the other party, but Xia Lan was so excited that she bared her fangs and brandished her claws. “What’s your plan? I’ll agree to anything as long as you can save the Xia family and make Qiao Xi completely disappear! That little b*tch isn’t my daughter. She makes me wish I was dead! I wish I could kill her!”","“Qiao Xi is your daughter.” The woman smiled lightly. “Xia Lan, I’ll give the Xia family two billion as a betrothal gift.”","Everyone widened their eyes.","“My son wants to marry Qiao Xi, and if you accept the betrothal gift, the Xia family is our in-laws. Xia Lan, Qiao Xi is your daughter. Although your relationship isn’t good, you’re related by blood, after all. As long as you agree to let her marry my son, everything will be easy.”","The Xia family looked at each other in silence for a few seconds. Xia Cheng said awkwardly, “But Gu Zheng...”","The woman saw greed in their eyes and chuckled. “I don’t take Gu Zheng seriously at all. Sooner or later, I’ll... get rid of this irksome bastard. When the time comes, Qiao Xi won’t have Gu Zheng as her backer anymore. If you ask her to marry my son, how can she refuse?","“By the way, I forgot to introduce myself. I think you know our family, Chairman Xia. My husband is...”"]},{"number":1315,"title":"Chapter 1315 2 Billion Yuan Betrothal Gift","paragraphs":["1315 2 Billion Yuan Betrothal Gift","“My husband is from the Brook family in Y Nation,” the woman said arrogantly.","The Brook family?","Xia Cheng’s hair stood on end. This woman in front of him was actually from the Brook family.","“You can call me Madam Tan here.” Madam Tan looked up slightly. “Director Xia, this is a good opportunity. I don’t have that much time to wait for you to consider.”","As long as Qiao Xi married that man, the Xia family would be able to obtain two billion yuan. Moreover, Gu Zheng would not take revenge on them. There would be no consequences? Xia Cheng was so excited that his breathing quickened.","Madam Tan looked at him arrogantly and said slowly, “My son fell sick when he was young and is different from ordinary people. Qiao Xi will definitely not like him. If she’s unwilling to marry him, then this two billion yuan betrothal gift...”","That was two billion!","Xia Cheng and Ai Sumei looked at each other, their eyes filled with greed and urgency.","Sumei was already close to going crazy. In just a few days, she went from the respected Old Madam Xia to a mistress and a shrew who was despised by everyone. The Xia family’s company was gone, and everything was gone. However, this two billion yuan could allow them to make a comeback!","Her voice was sharp as she shouted anxiously, “No! Qiao Xi has to agree. It’s her blessing to be able to marry Young Master Tan. She has to marry him even if she doesn’t want to!”","Xia Lan’s face was ferocious as she smiled crazily.","Qiao Xi caused her to lose her dignity and the Xia family to go bankrupt. She had to receive the punishment she deserved.","Actually, this was not considered a punishment and was also for Qiao Xi’s own good. The betrothal gift was two billion, and it was sufficient to prove that that fool was very rich. Moreover, Madam Tan said that she would get rid of Gu Zheng sooner or later. Instead of letting Qiao Xi be a widow, she might as well remarry as soon as possible.","Moreover, Qiao Xi was from the Xia family. What was wrong with sacrificing her marriage for the Xia family?","Madam Tan glanced coldly at everyone. “If Qiao Xi doesn’t agree...”","“She’ll agree! She has to agree!” Xia Lan took the list from Madam Tan’s hand excitedly and said excitedly, “Qiao Xi is from the Xia family. If I ask her to marry, she has to marry!”","Young Master Tan smiled wretchedly, revealing his yellow teeth. His face was fierce.","When Xia Mengyan saw this disgusting man, she could not help but feel a chill in her heart. If Qiao Xi really married this man, the rest of her life would be completely ruined! She knew that there was always a way out. Qiao Xi could not defeat her!","Madam Tan looked at the greedy Xia family and sneered in her heart.","...","At this moment, Qiao Xi was sitting in the studio and looking at the canvas in front of her thoughtfully. The person from Ling Pavilion stood beside her and said respectfully, “Eldest Miss, that’s what happened.”","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with confusion. “I don’t remember knowing Madam Tan!”","She did not know the other party, but the other party seemed to have a grudge against her.","Qiao Xi lazily raised her eyes. “She’s also from the Brook family?”","The shadow guard of Ling Pavilion nodded. “Yes.”","“I don’t know anyone in Y Nation. I’ve never met anyone from Brook’s family when I was on a mission before, much less Madam Tan.”","Qiao Xi carefully thought about the surname ‘Tan’ and frowned. “Didn’t she say that she’s from the Brook family? Why is she calling herself Madam Tan?”","“I’ve investigated this matter and found out that the Tan family and the Brook family are in a marriage alliance. They went to Y Nation to develop their careers together, so Madam Tan’s husband should be of mixed blood. Everyone in Y Nation calls him Mr. Brook.”","Qiao Xi nodded. She still had no impression of this person. She had indeed heard of the Brook family, but she had nothing to do with this family. Why did they come to Li City for no reason and even look for the Xia family to ask for her hand in marriage?","“Looks like Madam Tan isn’t too familiar with me either, but I just don’t understand why she insists that I marry her son.” Qiao Xi supported her chin and thought.","The secret guard of Ling Pavilion had a subtle expression. “Eldest Miss, you’re already married to President Gu, yet Madam Tan still wants you to marry her son. This is too unreasonable!”","Qiao Xi suddenly reacted. “You’ve just reminded me by saying that.”","The shadow guard looked puzzled.","“I’m already married to Gu Zheng. Someone of Madam Tan’s status must have investigated me in advance. She clearly knows that I’m already married, but she still found the Xia family to force me to marry her son. Why do I feel that she’s not targeting me?”","This was because she had never interacted with the Brook family, but the other party suddenly crossed such a long distance to marry her. Moreover, if Madam Tan wanted a married woman like her to marry into her family, she would definitely offend Gu Zheng. However, Madam Tan did not seem to care about Gu Zheng at all. In that case, was she doing this to deal with Gu Zheng?"]},{"number":1316,"title":"Chapter 1316 The Xia Family Wants To Divide The Property?","paragraphs":["1316 The Xia Family Wants To Divide The Property?","In the study of Longwan Residential.","Song Shijing reported respectfully, “President, that’s what happened.”","“The Brook family?” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow, his eyes revealing a trace of mockery. “I still don’t know when I offended them.”","“President, our business has never involved Y Nation. Thus, we’ve never collaborated with the Brook family. Since we’ve never met, how could there be a grudge?” Song Shijing was also puzzled.","“Now that the Brook family is becoming more and more mysterious, we can’t find out the other party’s true power. President, what do you think the other party wants to do?”","Gu Zheng shook his head silently, a trace of coldness flashing past his light brown eyes. The Brook family...","Although he did not know the other party, he had a feeling that the other party wanted to deal with him.","The next day, Qiao Xi received a call from Xia Cheng early in the morning.","Xia Cheng said that there were some matters related to Xia Yunqiu that she needed to handle. She could deny her relationship with Xia Lan, but Xia Yunqiu was her adoptive mother, after all. She should be present.","Moreover, although everyone suspected that she and Xia Lan were not related by blood, the Xia family had long been proficient in forging DNA tests. Even if they really wanted to do a DNA test, the Xia family would definitely tamper with it. Hence, Qiao Xi might as well not do it. In short, she was already sure that she had nothing to do with Xia Lan.","Xia Cheng said patiently, “Xi Xi, I know that you’re unhappy. I won’t force you to call Xia Lan your mother. You can deny her identity, but Yunqiu is your adoptive mother. She treated you like her biological daughter. Moreover, she left all her inheritance to you. Now that the Xia family is about to go bankrupt, we’re prepared to split the assets. Although Yunqiu is no longer alive, she should have a share of the assets.","“Yunqiu doesn’t have any children of her own. She only has you, her adopted daughter, so I’ll leave the assets that belong to her to you. I still have you in my heart.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. Xia Cheng was really good at acting. For the sake of tricking her into going to the Xia family’s residence, he was actually able to let bygones be bygones and patiently coax her.","If the shadow guard had not told her about the Xia family’s plans, she wouldn’t have known about the Xia family’s scheme. She would have been deceived by Xia Cheng. She would have thought that they had really turned over a new leaf and were prepared to return to Shengdu to live well.","The Xia family was planning on giving her a share of their assets? Even a fool would not believe it!","Qiao Xi replied slowly, “Director Xia, just tell me what it is.”","“Xi Xi, I’m sincere. It’s our fault that the Xia family has come to this point. Now that things have come to this, are you not even willing to come to the Xia family? You’ll just be coming for a reunion dinner and to share the assets. If you don’t want to come alone, you can bring a few friends over. Maybe you won’t be able to see them anymore in the future.”","It was indeed impossible to see them again because as long as Qiao Xi stepped foot into the Xia family, she would be forcefully taken away by the Brook family.","With the Brook family’s power, it was meaningless no matter who Qiao Xi brought along. Even if Gu Zheng was present, he would be unable to stop all of this.","Gu Zheng would not dare to offend such a powerful family like Brook. Moreover, it was Qiao Xi’s blessing to be able to marry into their family. What was there to refuse?","Qiao Xi’s voice was calm. “Since it’s like that, I’ll see you in the afternoon.”","At this moment in the Xia family’s villa, Madam Tan looked at Xia Cheng as he hung up the phone. She asked arrogantly, “Qiao Xi agreed?”","The Xia family had different gazes, but they were all filled with a trace of greed. Xia Mengyan clenched her fists tightly, her pale face filled with excitement.","She had investigated Young Master Tan before. She heard that when he was young, he fell sick and hurt his brain. Although he did not become a complete fool, his behavior was definitely different from ordinary people. Other than being rich, he was riddled with flaws. It was fine that he was ugly, but he also had a violent character. She heard that he had killed women before he became an adult. After he became an adult, he married a few wives but they all died in less than half a year. They died in a miserable manner too. In the end, their corpses were rashly cremated, and their relatives did not even have the chance to see them.","What kind of life would Qiao Xi have after marrying such a man?","As long as Qiao Xi married into the Brook family, the Xia family would be able to obtain two billion yuan. In the past, she was unable to defeat Qiao Xi, but so long as she succeeded this time, Qiao Xi would forever disappear from her sight and never have the chance to stop her again.","Qiao Xi could only blame herself. Who asked her to be so ostentatious and be targeted by the Brook family...","Xia Cheng’s old face was filled with pride and greed. “Madam Tan, Qiao Xi has already agreed. She’ll definitely come.”"]},{"number":1317,"title":"Chapter 1317 Fake Banquet","paragraphs":["1317 Fake Banquet","“Well done.” Madam Tan took out a check from her bag and placed it on the table. “This is my personal reward to the Xia family. Take it.”","Xia Cheng picked it up and saw that it was a check for 100 million. This sum of money was definitely nothing to the Brook family, but to the Xia family, who was already in a precarious situation, it could save their lives! With this sum of money, they would have a chance to come back. Sooner or later, they would let those who mocked them know the Xia family’s true strength.","As for Qiao Xi, she could only pray for the best once she went to Y Nation.","What happened in New City Mall was indeed Xia Mengyan’s scheme and a result of Xia Mengyan’s own selfish desires, but Qiao Xi did not consider the Xia family’s interests at all. She even joined forces with the Luo family to make the Xia family look bad. She exposed Xia Yunlou’s identity in public and forced her to change her name to Xia Lan.","The Xia family had already fallen into such a state. Xia Cheng only wanted Qiao Xi to get married. What was wrong with that? All these problems started because of Qiao Xi, so she should compensate the Xia family.","“Thank you, Madam Tan. Don’t worry, Xi Xi will be your daughter-in-law from now on.” Xia Cheng smiled extremely obsequiously, his old face filled with wrinkles.","Madam Tan smiled in satisfaction. “Your Xia family is quite capable. My son is different from ordinary people, so I’ve never refused anything he wants since he was young. Now that he has taken a liking to a woman, I have to satisfy her. I hope you can understand a mother’s heart.”","“Of course, I understand.” Xia Cheng hurriedly nodded and subconsciously looked at Young Master Tan, who was at the side. He smiled obsequiously. “Young Master Tan has a noble status. Young Master Tan is out of Xi Xi’s league. How could she refuse?”","“Well said! With my son’s identity, it’s absolutely more than enough to marry her. I hope this marriage won’t go wrong,” Madam Tan said as she looked affectionately at Young Master Tan beside her. “Lil’ Yu, Miss Qiao will be able to marry you soon. Although Qiao Xi’s identity isn’t noble enough, she’s very beautiful. You must be gentle with her this time and not kill her. It’s best if she gives birth to a child for you as soon as possible.”","...","In the afternoon.","Gu Yao asked nervously, “No way. Are you really going to the Xia family? You know that those bastards have ill intentions, yet you still want to go over? Are you crazy?”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. “Xia Cheng said that I can bring the others over.”","“Who are you bringing over?! That’s clearly a fake banquet! You might not be able to come back if you go. If anything happens to you, how will Gu Zheng survive?!”","As Gu Yao spoke, he was suddenly stunned for a moment and looked at Qiao Xi in surprise. “Right, Gu Zheng should know about the Xia family too, right? But he probably doesn’t know that you agreed to go to the Xia family. If he finds out, he definitely won’t agree to let you go.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched slightly. ‘This kid’s guess is quite accurate.’","She smiled and waved her hand. “Oh, it doesn’t matter.","“I’m indeed going to bring someone with me this time. This person is a professional reporter from a TV station. I’m doing this to protect myself!”","Only then did Gu Yao react. “What? You’re just bringing a reporter over?”","Qiao Xi stroked her hair weakly and said with a smile, “Yes! Moreover, it was Chairman Xia who said it himself. I can bring anyone I want. I’m only bringing one friend over. Is there a problem?”","This reporter was Eldest Brother’s friend from a TV station. To be able to enter Li City TV Station to be a reporter, he must be very professional. He should be able to record the situation at the scene and broadcast it.","Qiao Xi wanted everyone to see Madam Tan snatching a commoner to be her daughter-in-law on the spot. The Xia family would definitely cause a commotion for the sake of money. Since they dared to do this, they had to bear the consequences.","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. It was uncertain who would marry Young Master Tan in the end!","A moment later, a gentle-looking man in bodyguard clothes walked in. “Miss Qiao.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and sized up the man in front of her. The person her brother chose would be fine. She smiled. “Reporter Fang.”","Reporter Fang had already hidden the pinhole camera on his body. “Mr. Shen said that he wants me to follow you to the Xia family as a bodyguard to avoid unnecessary trouble. Anyway, I’m a reporter and have disguised myself as someone with other professions in the past. I’m already used to it. I believe I’ll definitely be able to cooperate with you to complete the mission.”"]},{"number":1318,"title":"Chapter 1318 A Weak Woman Who Killed An Ox With One Punch","paragraphs":["1318 A Weak Woman Who Killed An Ox With One Punch","Qiao Xi smiled gently. “Reporter Fang, you should know that if they didn’t have any intention of harming me, I wouldn’t have thought of making a counter-attack either. If I really fall into their hands, I’ll definitely end up miserable. So it’s reasonable for me to deal with them. What do you think?”","Gu Yao: “???” ‘You’re a weak woman? Someone who can kill an ox with one punch is saying that she’s weak?’","Half an hour later, Qiao Xi was done packing and had just gone out when she bumped into a tall man.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were deep. Seeing that she was stunned at the door, he slowly walked toward her.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to glance at him and said seriously, “Ah Zheng, no matter what, I have to go today!”","Gu Zheng pursed his lips tightly and stood in front of her. After a moment of silence, he chuckled. “You’re really fooling around. I’ve only been out for a short while, yet you’ve secretly agreed to go to the Xia family.”","Qiao Xi knew that Gu Zheng was worried about her and would definitely not agree to let her go to the Xia family. However, even if she did not go today, the Xia family would not let the matter rest. There would be other schemes.","“Don’t worry, I’ll be fine. Everything is under my control.”","The man lowered his eyes, his long eyelashes casting a shadow on his eyelids. His tall body was still blocking in front of her. “Xi Xi, I’ve always supported you in whatever you usually do, but I’ve said it before. I don’t want you to be in danger.”","He stretched out his hand, and his long fingers wrapped around Qiao Xi’s hand, unwilling to let go. Worry appeared in his usually cold eyes.","“I won’t be in danger. I’m bringing a reporter with me. Moreover, the shadow guards of Ling Pavilion will secretly protect me. They’ll surround the Xia family’s villa. If I’m in danger, the shadow guards will immediately appear to save me.","“The Xia family has already schemed against me multiple times. Even if I don’t go this time, they’ll find other reasons to see me. At that time, we might encounter an unpredictable situation. It’s much better for me to go now than to give them the chance to execute a sudden attack.”","Gu Zheng held her hand tightly and said in a low voice, “I’ll go with you.”","Qiao Xi immediately refused. “No, Gu Zheng. The effect will be different if you go. Moreover, I have something more important to hand to you.”","Gu Zheng looked up and met her eyes. He instantly understood. “The DNA test results of the Medical Association?”","“Yes.” Qiao Xi’s tone became heavy. “It’s impossible to get the Xia family to cooperate with us for a DNA test. Even if the Yin family appears, they won’t admit it, so we need to find someone to help us with this matter. He’ll definitely agree if you appear.”","At that time in New City Mall, through the Luo family’s head’s words, everyone suspected that Xia Yunlou was not her biological mother. However, there was no evidence, after all. The Xia family had forged too many things. If Qiao Xi did not figure it out this time, there would be endless trouble in the future.","Hence, Madam Tan’s appearance gave Qiao Xi a new idea. She had never been a soft-hearted person. She had always adhered to the principle of not offending others unless they offended her. This time, she was going to counter-attack!","...","In the Xia family’s villa.","A few servants from the Xia family were entering the house from the door. Xia Mengyan casually picked up a box and opened it to take a look. It was filled with precious items such as gold, silver, and jewelry.","Madam Tan looked at her arrogantly. “Miss Xia, thank you for the photo.”","Xia Mengyan’s expression changed. “Madam Tan, what photo? I don’t understand what you mean.”","“Miss Xia, you were the one who facilitated this marriage,” Madam Tan said calmly. “If you hadn’t given Qiao Xi’s photo to my assistant, my son wouldn’t have found such a wife. It’s just that you didn’t tell me in advance that Miss Qiao is already married and her husband is Gu Zheng.”","Actually, she came to Li City from Y Nation because her son liked Qiao Xi, but all of this started because of a photo.","Xia Mengyan’s pupils constricted as she hurriedly lowered her head.","Madam Tan said slowly, “Miss Xia, there’s no need to pretend in front of me. Of course, I investigated your background before I came.”","Xia Mengyan clenched her fists tightly and did not dare to look Madam Tan in the eye. She felt as if she couldn’t hide any of her secrets in front of Madam Tan. She did not expect Madam Tan to find out so quickly.","At that time, she accidentally found out about Young Master Tan’s scandal. She heard that he liked to abuse women, and several of his wives died at his hands. Not only did his family not stop him, but they even relied on their family’s status to help Young Master Tan search for beautiful women. No matter their status or identity, as long as the women were good-looking, they were qualified to marry him. Moreover, the betrothal gifts were always very generous."]},{"number":1319,"title":"Chapter 1319 He’s Ugly And Scary","paragraphs":["1319 He’s Ugly And Scary","Young Master Tan was cruel by nature. Without any women by his side, he would make a fuss and smash things. Xia Mengyan heard that he had recently gotten into women from the East, so she spent money to find connections and gave Qiao Xi’s photo and information to the people around Madam Tan.","She was just giving it a try. She did not expect Madam Tan to really bring Tan Yu to Li City and want Qiao Xi to go back to Y Nation with them.","Xia Mengyan smiled awkwardly. “Madam Tan, I sent the photo because I heard that Young Master Tan has always wanted to find a considerate person. My cousin is beautiful and knows how to paint. She’ll definitely make Young Master Tan happy. Moreover, Young Master Tan has a noble status and is suave. If the two of them can be together, it’ll be a beautiful marriage.","Madam Tan glanced at Xia Mengyan and could not help but smile.","Xia Mengyan continued, “Actually, I’ve always thought that Xi Xi and Gu Zheng weren’t compatible, so I thought that it would be great if she could marry Young Master Tan. I didn’t expect Young Master Tan to really like her. He’s out of her league!","“Which woman wouldn’t like a handsome, carefree, and noble man like Young Master Tan? I gave you Xi Xi’s photo back then because I hoped that Xi Xi could find her own happiness. After all, it’s her blessing to be able to marry Young Master Tan.”","Qiao Xi had just walked to the door when she heard Xia Mengyan’s words. She instantly could not help but roll her eyes.","‘Since you’ve said so, I’ll give you this blessing. Do you want it?’","Reporter Fang looked at her and placed one of the pinhole cameras at the door. He captured this scene clearly. He had been following behind Qiao Xi the entire time, and all his movements were very secretive.","When Xia Mengyan saw Qiao Xi, she hurriedly greeted her with a smile. “Xi Xi, you’re finally here. Grandpa and Aunt are both waiting. I’ll go tell them!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to glance at Madam Tan, then followed Xia Mengyan into the Xia family’s inner residence.","At this moment, not far from the Xia family’s villa.","Gu Yao looked at the image on the phone and shouted in anger, “F*ck! That toad-like man was actually found by Xia Mengyan! I’ve never seen such an ugly person. It’s fine if he’s ugly, but he shouldn’t come out to scare people. Moreover, I’ve investigated Young Master Tan and found out that he’s caused the death of many women. He’s clearly ugly, but he’s still so brutal. Xia Mengyan actually went against her conscience and praised him for being handsome and carefree? When did she go blind?”","Gu Zheng exuded a strong murderous aura.","Gu Yao was furious. “No! I’ll wait for Qiao Xi to come out today. I’m worried about leaving her here. Gu Zheng, where are you going?”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes. “To the Medical Association. Xi Xi asked me to get the paternity test report.”","“Yes, the paternity test report will definitely be fine. However, what if the Xia family comes up with an excuse and refuses to admit it?”","“That’s why we have to look for a certain someone.” Gu Zheng smirked. “There’s another person who can prove that Xia Lan and Xi Xi are not related by blood. It’s Xu Zhi, Xia Lan’s ex-husband.”","All along, everyone thought that Qiao Xi was Xu Zhi and Xia Lan’s child, but what if they never had a child at all? Perhaps Xia Lan had given birth to a daughter with someone else and could not stay by her side. She could only deceive Xu Zhi into losing the child.","20 years later, they found Qiao Xi. Xu Zhi naturally thought that Qiao Xi was his biological daughter, but what if it was all wrong from the beginning?","Gu Yao muttered, “I have to say that Xu Zhi is also a scumbag, but if he’s willing to prove Qiao Xi’s identity, he’s still a real man!”","Gu Zheng looked up at the Xia family’s villa. “Gu Yao.”","“What’s wrong?” Gu Yao looked up foolishly.","“I’ll need at least 40 minutes to go to the Xu family. I hope you can protect her while I’m gone.” Gu Zheng’s voice was gentle with a trace of helplessness.","Gu Yao instantly seemed to be on steroids. He straightened his back and patted his chest as he promised, “Don’t worry! Even if I have to risk my life, I’ll protect Qiao Xi! If anyone dares to touch her, I’ll chop that person up! I absolutely won’t let Qiao Xi be hurt at all!”","The assistant beside Gu Yao had a subtle expression. With Mrs. Gu’s ability, Second Young Master probably did not need to do anything. After all, Mrs. Gu could kill a cow with one punch. What could Second Young Master do?","In the villa.","Qiao Xi glanced at her phone. Gu Zheng was already on his way to the Xu family. She believed that Xu Zhi would come.","The servants in the Xia family’s villa were all very busy. Qiao Xi pretended to be curious and asked, “Aren’t you going back to Shengdu? Why are you still moving things back?”"]},{"number":1320,"title":"Chapter 1320 Becoming The Future Mrs. Brook","paragraphs":["1320 Becoming The Future Mrs. Brook","Xia Mengyan forcefully suppressed the excitement in her heart. As long as Madam Tan took Qiao Xi away today, Qiao Xi would be Tan Yu’s toy. She would be imprisoned in the Brook family’s cage forever and suffer all kinds of torture. Even Gu Zheng would not be able to save her.","Qiao Xi’s life was ruined, but she was still the high and mighty eldest daughter of the Xia family. She was a perfumer who was sought after by everyone. It would not be long before everyone forgot their past unhappiness. After all, as long as Qiao Xi was not around, no one would stand in her way.","Xia Mengyan softened her expression and tried her best to control the excitement in her heart. “Xi Xi, these are the betrothal gifts from the Tan family.”","“Betrothal gifts?” Qiao Xi was slightly surprised and casually asked, “Who’s getting married?”","Before Xia Mengyan could explain, Xia Cheng, Xia Lan, and the others received Xia Mengyan’s message and brought Tan Yu to the living room.","“Xi Xi, you’re finally here. Why are you standing there? Sit down! Someone, pour Second Miss some tea!”","Xia Cheng smiled affectionately. “Xi Xi, I know you’re unwilling to acknowledge the Xia family, but you’re a child of the Xia family, after all. I still hope you can come home more often to visit us. In the future, you’ll be a daughter of the Xia family, just like Mengyan. I won’t favor one over the other.”","Qiao Xi replied coldly, “Chairman Xia, I have nothing to do with the Xia family. If you called me over today just for this identity, then there’s nothing else to say. My time is very precious, so I’ll get going first.”","She turned around and was about to leave when she suddenly heard Xia Cheng smile coldly. “Xi Xi, don’t be in a rush to leave! Since you’ve said so, I won’t hide it anymore.”","After he finished speaking, Xia Cheng shot Ai Sumei a look. Ai Sumei instantly understood and hurriedly whispered a few words in Madam Tan’s ear. Then, everyone’s gazes landed on Qiao Xi as if they were looking at a lamb waiting to be slaughtered.","“Actually, I’ve already arranged a marriage for you. The other party has already delivered the betrothal gifts to your door. The other party is Young Master Tan from the Brook family in Y Nation. After you marry him, restrain your temper and serve Young Master Tan well.”","As soon as she finished speaking, a black shadow pounced toward Qiao Xi. Qiao Xi raised her eyes and saw a fat and greasy man. His triangular eyes revealed wretchedness and infatuation. Saliva even flowed out of the corners of his mouth as he rushed over with the intention of touching Qiao Xi’s face.","Qiao Xi took a step back and avoided his touch. She even glared at him with an icy-cold gaze. Tan Yu was terrified by her gaze and slightly afraid to go forward.","The entire venue was silent for a few seconds. Xia Cheng’s expression gradually darkened as if he felt that there was no need to continue pretending since Qiao Xi had already entered the Xia family’s residence.","“Xi Xi, why are you dodging? You’re Young Master Tan’s wife. What’s wrong with him touching you?”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were suffused with a trace of coldness as she asked word by word, “Chairman Xia, are you sure you want me to marry him?”","Xia Cheng knew Qiao Xi’s thoughts and immediately said firmly, “Of course, you have to marry him! Let me tell you, I’ve already accepted the betrothal gifts. The Brook family is very sincere and gave two billion. It’s enough to show how much Young Master Tan values you. I believe you’ll definitely be very happy if you marry him.”","“Betrothal gifts?” Qiao Xi’s voice carried a trace of ridicule.","At this moment, Madam Tan said with a smile, “Miss Qiao, our Lil’ Yu really likes you. According to Li City’s customs, we’ve already given the Xia family betrothal gifts. Moreover, the Xia family has already accepted the two billion yuan. From now on, you’re a member of our Brook family. Live well with Lil’ Yu in the future and I won’t treat you badly.","“Miss Qiao, this is my son, Tan Yu. We’ll bring you back to Y Nation today and hold a wedding there.”","Madam Tan added, “By the way, I also heard that your adoptive mother left you a generous inheritance. According to Li City’s rules, after you accept the betrothal gifts, you should also get a portion of the dowry. However, the Xia family probably can’t fork out any dowry now, so if you agree to marry into the Brook family with your adoptive mother’s inheritance, I’m willing to let you become the future Madam Brook. I’ll bring you to all kinds of banquets and let you see true high society.”","Qiao Xi sighed in her heart. Why were these people so shameless? From what Madam Tan said, was she marrying that ugly man or was she marrying someone out of her league?","“Heh!” Qiao Xi sneered. “Madam Tan, I really admire you. You can even say such things out loud! The companies and shares under my name add up to more than two billion yuan. This doesn’t even include the jewelry and properties my mother left me. Moreover, there’ll be an endless stream of dividends in the future. Don’t you think it’s too ridiculous for you to buy all my things with a betrothal gift of merely two billion yuan?”"]},{"number":1321,"title":"Chapter 1321 Are You Qualified To Interfere In My Marriage?","paragraphs":["1321 Are You Qualified To Interfere In My Marriage?","Anger appeared in Madam Tan’s eyes as she snorted. “Miss Qiao, I hope you can understand that we’re not discussing with you but informing you that my son is the noblest young master of the Brook family. Many women have fought tooth and nail to marry into our family. It’s your honor that my son has taken a liking to you. If it weren’t for the fact that he likes you, I wouldn’t have let a woman of your status marry into our family. You should thank me instead of talking to me in such a tone!","“I don’t care if you’re willing or not. This matter has already been decided. Take all your assets and return to Y Nation with us. Become my son’s wife obediently in the future. As long as you’re sincere to my son, he’ll treat you well too.”","With that, Madam Tan looked at her son affectionately. “Lil’ Yu, quickly bring Miss Qiao away.”","Tan Yu took a few steps forward and stammered, “Miss Qiao, I really like you. You’re... the most beautiful woman I’ve ever seen. I won’t bully you...”","Those fat hands were about to touch Qiao Xi’s face when the next second...","“Ah!!” A scream echoed throughout the living room. Tan Yu screamed in pain. His face was fierce, and his fat lips were trembling. “Let go of me! Let go!”","Qiao Xi glanced at the other party with disdain and directly grabbed his wrist before throwing him a few meters away. His fat body heavily fell onto the coffee table, and the fat on his body trembled as the teacups on the table fell to the floor.","A loud bang spread to every corner accompanied by the sound of a porcelain cup shattering. The air instantly froze. Everyone was stunned for a few seconds, and Madam Tan’s eyes instantly widened. “Qiao Xi! You dare hit my son?”","Xia Cheng panicked and hurriedly roared, “Qiao Xi! Are you crazy? That’s Young Master Tan! How could you beat up your husband?”","Qiao Xi took out a few tissues from the table and carefully wiped the hand that had just touched Tan Yu’s. She could not hide the disgust in her eyes.","“Madam Tan, don’t be angry. I’ll persuade her,” Xia Mengyan said obsequiously, then looked at Qiao Xi with a worried expression. “Xi Xi, think carefully. You’re going to marry a noble from Y Nation. Moreover, how many girls dream of marrying Young Master Tan? You can’t judge a book by its cover. You heard it just now. Young Master Tan said that he’ll treat you well.","“Young Master Tan is handsome, carefree, gentle, and considerate. It’s your blessing to marry him. How can you refuse his good intentions? Grandpa and Aunt both hope that you can be happy. Stop fooling around.”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Since Young Master Tan is so good, then you marry him.”","Xia Mengyan instantly choked, and cold sweat instantly seeped out of her forehead. Her voice trembled slightly. “I... I’m not as beautiful as you! Moreover, Young Master Tan likes you, not me. I’m not as lucky as you. I’m not qualified to marry Young Master Tan.”","At this moment, the servants had already helped Tan Yu up. Qiao Xi calmly walked to the sofa and sat down. She said with a smile, “So, Young Master Tan chose me because I’m too beautiful, and that’s why he came all the way to Li City to marry me?","“But I’m already married! How can I marry Young Master Tan?” Qiao Xi said slowly, “Only monogamous relationships are acknowledged in our country. Could it be that Young Master Tan likes me so much and is willing to be my kept lover?”","The entire venue instantly fell silent, and Ai Sumei’s expression was extremely ugly. She had heard these words from Yin Lianxin. At that time, Yin Lianxin said, “Xia Cheng and I are legally recognized as husband and wife. In modern society, only monogamy is acknowledged. Could it be that you’re willing to be a mistress?”","Qiao Xi! This little b*tch actually dared to say such things to Madam Tan and Young Master Tan. If she angered them, what would the Xia family do? Would she drag the Xia family down with her?","“Qiao Xi! Shut up!” Xia Cheng berated loudly.","Qiao Xi completely ignored him and continued slowly, “Madam Tan, I remember that Y Nation also only acknowledges monogamous relationships! You clearly know that I’m married, yet you still want me to marry Young Master Tan. Aren’t you forcing me to make a mistake? Or are you also keeping a secret lover out there?”","“Nonsense!” Xia Cheng shouted at the top of his voice, afraid that she would anger Madam Tan. “In our country, children have to listen to their parents. You and Gu Zheng got together behind your elders’ backs when you got married, so it’s called adultery. Of course, it doesn’t count. I don’t care if you’re willing or not. Your marriage with Gu Zheng is over. You can stay by Young Master Tan’s side in the future!”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing. “Chairman Xia, do you think you have the right to interfere in my marriage?”"]},{"number":1322,"title":"Chapter 1322 Your Fate Should Be Like This","paragraphs":["1322 Your Fate Should Be Like This","The surroundings instantly fell silent.","“Qiao Xi!”","An angry roar came from upstairs. Xia Lan rushed over angrily and shouted like a lunatic, “You and Gu Zheng are not compatible. That man is too scheming. Hasn’t he caused Mengyan enough trouble? You won’t have a good ending if you’re with him!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes suddenly turned cold as she sneered. “He harmed Xia Mengyan? Wasn’t it Xia Mengyan who schemed against me first? Madam Xia Yunlou... Oh, no, I should call you Madam Xia Lan. My husband helped me clear my name and took revenge on the people who bullied me. Is there anything wrong with that?","!!","“Would you think we’re suitable only if my husband doesn’t do anything and even helps Xia Mengyan bully me? I really don’t agree with your thoughts.”","Xia Lan realized that she had said something wrong, but she did not know how to retort. The anger that was suppressed in her heart surged as she ordered, “Qiao Xi! Let me tell you, we’ve already accepted Madam Tan’s betrothal gifts. You have to marry Young Master Tan even if you don’t want to!”","“Is that so?” Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with disdain.","Xia Lan’s tone was unquestionable. “Yes! I’m your mother. You have to marry whoever I ask you to marry! Since I gave birth to you, I have the right to interfere in your marriage. You can’t go against my wishes!”","“Madam Xia, are you admitting that I’m your daughter now? Didn’t you cut off all ties with me?” Qiao Xi looked at her coldly.","Xia Yunlou retorted in a sharp voice, “I just said those words in a moment of anger! I’m doing this for your own good. I want you to have a backer for the rest of your life. You’ll definitely be happy if you marry Young Master Tan. Why don’t you understand my painstaking efforts?!”","Xia Mengyan’s tone carried a hint of pleading. “Xi Xi, we’ve already accepted the betrothal gifts. If we go back on our word now, the Brook family will definitely destroy the Xia family. You and Gu Zheng will be divorced, but you’ll still have a noble status. You’ll be even more glorious than before. On the account of Aunt Yunqiu, help the Xia family.”","“Shut up! You’re not worthy of mentioning my mother. If she were here, she definitely wouldn’t push me into a fire pit!” Qiao Xi berated, then raised her eyes to look at Xia Lan. “Madam Xia, you should know how many women Young Master Tan has tortured to death. You keep saying that you’re my mother, but can you bear to let me marry such a man?”","Xia Lan lowered her head guiltily and retorted unwillingly, “T-That’s all a rumor. Even if such a thing really happened, it’s because those women were insensible and didn’t know how to serve their husband. You’re different. You’re so outstanding and know everything. You’ll definitely coax Young Master Tan. If you really die, it’s your fate. You can’t blame me.”","Xia Mengyan said again, “Xi Xi, don’t think too much. If those women hadn’t died, you wouldn’t have had the chance to marry Young Master Tan! Moreover, Young Master Tan likes you very much. He’s willing to come all the way to Li City for you and is even willing to give you two billion as a betrothal gift. You should feel honored. Now that things have come to this, quickly leave with Young Master Tan.”","Qiao Xi grunted coldly and slowly clenched her fists, gesturing in front of everyone.","“Director Xia, Madam Xia, I’m not from the Xia family to begin with. You have no right to marry me off. If the Xia family wants to sell their daughter for glory, they should sell Xia Mengyan, not me.”","“No! Mengyan can’t be the one to do it!” Xia Lan’s sharp voice sounded as she pointed at Qiao Xi crazily. “I painstakingly carried you for ten months to give birth to you. How are you not a member of the Xia family? You’ve already grown up, so it’s time for you to repay us. Is it so difficult to marry you?”","Qiao Xi slowly stood up, and her entire body emitted a chill. Xia Lan could not help but take a few steps back.","“Madam Xia, since you’ve said so, I’ll settle the score with you.”","At this moment, the internet had already exploded. This was because Shen Yu had started a live broadcast 20 minutes ago. As he was usually very busy, he almost did not do live broadcasts. Now that he suddenly started a live broadcast, the fans were extremely excited. They told each other about it and clicked on the live broadcast.","Everyone did not expect that the person in the live stream was not Shen Yu. Instead, they saw the Xia family. Everyone heard the conversation between Xia Mengyan and Madam Tan and learned that Xia Mengyan had deliberately given Qiao Xi’s photo and information to Madam Tan. That was why Madam Tan came all the way to Li City to propose a marriage between Qiao Xi and her son.","Then, something even more shocking happened...","At first, everyone thought that a scene from a show was being filmed. After someone revealed the identities of the Xia family and Qiao Xi in the live stream, everyone knew that the scene in front of them was real."]},{"number":1323,"title":"Chapter 1323 Xia Lan’s Crime","paragraphs":["1323 Xia Lan’s Crime","At this moment, everyone realized that she was really selling her daughter for glory. It was not a TV show that was being filmed.","[It’s really tragic to be Xia Yunlou’s daughter!]","[Previous poster, pay attention. She’s not the real Xia Yunlou. She’s an impostor. Her name is Xia Lan now!]","[I have a friend who’s studying in Y Nation. He said that Tan Yu played a few women to death, but because he has a noble status, his family has helped him settle it. Now, they still dare to come to Li City to snatch women. Isn’t this too much?!]","[The Xia family is even more detestable! Previously, they even wanted to cut ties with Miss Qiao. Now, for the sake of money, they want to send Miss Qiao to such a family. If they’re willing to sell her, why don’t they sell Xia Mengyan to them? Right, it was Xia Mengyan who gave Qiao Xi’s photo to Madam Tan, so they came looking for Qiao Xi. Xia Mengyan is really evil!]","At this moment, the Xia family’s villa was silent. When Qiao Xi said that she wanted to settle the score with the Xia family, it angered Xia Lan even more. She bared her fangs and brandished her claws as she roared, “I haven’t settled the score with you yet! You’re the one who harmed me and Mengyan in the incident at New City Mall...”","“Half a year ago, you came looking for me while claiming to be my mother. Although you said that you wanted to acknowledge me, you didn’t allow me to return to the Xu family. You also didn’t allow me to consider myself the eldest daughter of the Xu family. You wanted to announce to the public that I was an adopted daughter. After that, your son, Xu Anyi, tried to kill me. However, you said that I wasn’t dead, so I should just forgive my brother.","“After that, you brought me back to the Xu family. Your adopted daughter, Xu Anran, tried to burn me to death in the house. After I exposed Xu Anran’s crime, you said that I should forgive her since I didn’t die from that incident.","Qiao Xi spoke word by word with a calm tone, but everyone could not remain calm anymore. Only then did the servants at the scene know that Qiao Xi had suffered so much in the Xu family.","Xia Lan’s expression changed as she watched Qiao Xi expose those things. She did not feel guilty in the slightest and only felt ashamed and angry. “Y-You shut up...”","“You allowed Xu Anran and Xu Anyi to harm me. You even ordered me not to say anything. Otherwise, the Xu family would be the ones losing face. You said that as the daughter of the Xu family, I had to make a sacrifice for the Xu family. It’s only right that I suffer a little.","“After that, Xu Anran grew to like Gu Zheng, so you forced me to divorce Gu Zheng and asked me to give my husband to Xu Anran. If I didn’t listen, I’d be going against my mother’s orders.”","Xia Lan felt the gazes around her grow hotter and hotter. The Xia family might already know her crimes, but the servants did not. They looked at her with anger and disdain.","What right did a group of cheap servants have to look at her like this?","Xia Lan was burning with anger as she shouted crazily, “You still remember such small matters?! I’m your mother. Everything I do is for your own good. Moreover, Anran left the Xu family a long time ago. What else do you want?”","“I can let Xu Anran off, but let’s talk about what you’ve done to me for Xia Mengyan’s sake.” Qiao Xi sneered. “Xia Mengyan drugged the higher-ups of Lu Corporation to taint me. If I hadn’t been vigilant, the other party might have already succeeded. However, you still thought that it was my fault. You said I angered Xia Mengyan, so she attacked me on an impulse.”","Everyone present and the audience in the live broadcast were dumbfounded. Was this really Qiao Xi’s mother? These things were no longer as simple as being wronged. Xia Lan either wanted to kill Qiao Xi, taint her, or snatch her husband! After everything happened, Xia Lan would always find all kinds of excuses to defend others or herself.","“Madam Xia, for Xia Mengyan’s sake, you manipulated public opinion and made everyone think that I was a mistress. You ruined Xia Mengyan’s engagement and forced me to get a divorce to give up my position to Xia Mengyan. After that, you still refused to give up and tricked me into going back to the Xia family. You conspired with Chairman Xia to drug me and wanted me to die in the Xia family without anyone knowing. If Gu Zheng hadn’t arrived in time, I’m afraid I would’ve died in your hands.”","At this moment, Xia Mengyan’s face was pale. She hid behind Xia Lan and retorted weakly, “No, it’s not like that. Don’t say anymore...”","“I thought that the matter would end here, but you actually brought Xia Mengyan into the Qiao family’s villa and tried to steal the belongings left behind by my adoptive mother, Madam Xia Yunqiu. After I found out, you flew into a rage out of humiliation and slandered me for stealing Xia Mengyan’s necklace that cost one million yuan. You even called the police to arrest me. After I showed evidence to prove my innocence, you still defended yourself by saying that it was all because I was in Xia Mengyan’s way. In your opinion, I had to sacrifice myself to set off the noble eldest daughter of the Xia family.”","When Qiao Xi spoke up to here, she raised her eyes to glance at Xia Mengyan, who was shrinking her trembling body."]},{"number":1324,"title":"Chapter 1324 How Unlucky It Is To Be Xia Lan’s Daughter","paragraphs":["1324 How Unlucky It Is To Be Xia Lan’s Daughter","Qiao Xi continued to say word by word, “Madam Xia, you said that I’ve been wandering outside since I was young, while Xia Mengyan has been pampered since she was young. I don’t have the qualifications to compare myself to Xia Mengyan. It’s my fate that I was swapped when I was young, and I can’t blame anyone else for it.”","Xia Lan shouted in exasperation, “Am I wrong? It’s not my fault that you were swapped! What happened before is long in the past, and you didn’t suffer any losses. Why are you still unwilling to let this go? I worked hard to give birth to you after ten months of pregnancy. You have to be grateful. You...”","Qiao Xi interrupted her coldly. “Everyone has heard about the incident at New City Mall. Madam Xia and Xia Mengyan framed me for destroying the Luo family’s porcelain sculpture and even wanted to cut ties with me.”","As soon as she finished speaking, she looked at Xia Lan indifferently. “Madam Xia, you did all of this. I didn’t bicker with you in the past, but it’s time for me to settle the scores with you today.”","!!","Xia Lan seemed to have been skinned alive and was at a loss under everyone’s burning gazes.","Qiao Xi had always said that Xia Lan’s sins were not something a mother could commit.","She was Qiao Xi’s biological mother, yet she, her adopted daughter, and her niece repeatedly tried to harm Qiao Xi. Xia Lan wished for nothing more than to kill her daughter! But why did she do this?","At this moment, the live stream was filled with curses.","[Xia Lan’s daughter is really unlucky! Before Qiao Xi reunited with Xia Lan, Qiao Xi’s life was clearly very good. After she returned to the Xia family, she didn’t receive any preferential treatment at all. Instead, she had to constantly be on guard against villains. Did she have to become Xia Mengyan’s stepping stone just because she didn’t grow up in the Xia family?]","[I keep having the feeling that Xia Lan is not Qiao Xi’s biological mother. She’s so good to Xia Mengyan. Could it be that she’s Xia Mengyan’s biological mother?]","[Does the Xia family still have any humanity?! They’re actually selling Qiao Xi! Qiao Xi is a human, not an item!]","The living room of the villa was eerily silent.","Xia Lan’s expression was ferocious, and she almost stopped breathing. Her eyes were bloodshot as she glared fiercely at Qiao Xi.","“Chairman Xia.” Madam Tan was the first to break the silence. She sounded a little impatient. “I don’t have that much time to listen to you quarrel. You’ve already accepted the betrothal gifts. Can you get Miss Qiao to go back with me or not? Please give me a definite answer.”","When Xia Cheng heard this, he hurriedly advised, “Madam Tan, don’t worry. Xi Xi is from our Xia family. If we want her to marry, she has to marry.”","Madam Tan nodded in satisfaction, then glanced coldly at Qiao Xi and said disdainfully, “Chairman Xia, I don’t care what grudges you had before. She has to return to Y Nation today and consummate her marriage with my son. Otherwise, I’ll take back the two billion.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart.","Seeing this, Xia Cheng’s tone was cold and hard. “Xi Xi, you heard it too. We’ve accepted the betrothal gifts. This marriage has already been decided. Even if it’s for Yunqiu, you have to agree, right?”","At this moment, Xia Lan had also recovered from her anger. When she heard that Madam Tan wanted to take back the two billion, she instantly became nervous. “Qiao Xi, how can you just watch the Xia family go bankrupt? If you’re unwilling to marry Young Master Tan, the Xia family will be completely doomed!","“Be good and follow Madam Tan to Y Nation. Otherwise, don’t blame me for being heartless.”","Qiao Xi snorted coldly. “Madam Xia, why do I have to marry whoever you want me to marry? What right do you have to decide my marriage and fate?”","“Because I’m your mother!” Xia Lan shouted without hesitation, “You have to listen to whatever I tell you to do! You have led a wandering life since you were young. I was the one who brought you back. Even if you can’t become the daughter of the Xia family, I’ve already given you the identity of my daughter. You should be grateful to me, but what have you been doing instead? You go against me in every way and refuse to listen to me. If I had known that you were so difficult to deal with, I wouldn’t have looked for you!","“We asked you to return to the Xia family, so you should know how to repay our kindness. As long as you marry Young Master Tan, the Xia family can get two billion yuan to restore our glory. Even if you die today, you have to die in Young Master Tan’s bed!”","Qiao Xi’s gaze turned cold. “Then why isn’t Xia Mengyan the one marrying him?”","“Shut up!” Sumei berated loudly and glared at her with resentment. “You’re different from Mengyan. Mengyan grew up by our side since she was young. We can’t bear for her to marry far away, so she should stay by our side and enjoy life. You’ve been wandering outside since you were young. You’re already used to wandering everywhere. This is your fate! No one can change it!”"]},{"number":1325,"title":"Chapter 1325 Xi Xi Is Laughing At You For Being Stupid","paragraphs":["1325 Xi Xi Is Laughing At You For Being Stupid","“Xi Xi, we’ll remember your sacrifice for the Xia family. It’s your honor to sacrifice yourself for the family. Everyone will thank you,” Xia Mengyan advised hypocritically.","Earlier, Xia Lan was still nervous because of the crimes Qiao Xi listed, but now that she heard Ai Sumei’s words, she felt that everything was justified. Qiao Xi was her daughter, and the Xia family’s blood flowed in her body. She should contribute to the Xia family.","At this moment, the live stream had already exploded. Countless netizens squeezed in and watched helplessly as the Xia family made shocking comments.","[Oh my God! How can there be such shameless people in the world? They’re making Qiao Xi sacrifice herself, but what have they done for Qiao Xi? Xia Lan has never raised Qiao Xi at all. What right does she have to ask Qiao Xi to sacrifice herself?]","!!","[I feel disgusted just looking at Xia Mengyan’s face. How does she have the cheek to say those words? She keeps saying that it’s an honor to make a sacrifice for the family, but she’s not the one doing it. I think she’s quite compatible with Tan Yu. I personally want Xia Mengyan to die quickly. It would be best if she was tortured to death by Tan Yu!]","In just dozens of minutes, the Xia family’s scandal had already occupied the trending topics.","In the Xia family’s villa, Qiao Xi was still calmly leaning against the sofa. After a long silence, she sneered. “Where did you get the cheek to ask me to sacrifice myself?”","“What’s with your attitude? You should be grateful that we let you return to the Xia family. As my daughter, you should be more magnanimous. You can’t be so selfish!”","Qiao Xi grunted indifferently. “Is that so?! Does your daughter have to marry Young Master Tan?”","“That’s right! You’re my daughter, so you have to marry him! Marriage is a big matter. Your parents have the final say. I won’t acknowledge your marriage with Gu Zheng. Divorce him and marry Young Master Tan immediately. You have no right to resist!”","The audience in front of the screen clenched their fists. They wished they could rush to the Xia family’s house and beat this group of shameless people to death.","They originally thought that Qiao Xi could not take it anymore, but they saw the corners of her mouth curl up as she smiled indifferently. “Madam Xia, are you really going to let your biological daughter marry Young Master Tan?”","“Of course!” Xia Lan did not notice anything wrong and replied without hesitation.","Qiao Xi smiled even more wantonly as if she had seen something funny. “That’s good.”","That was good? What did she mean?","Xia Lan’s heart trembled as she suddenly noticed that something was wrong. Why was Qiao Xi so indifferent? She was about to marry Young Master Tan. Even if she did not agree, they would still tie Qiao Xi to Young Master Tan’s bed. Why was she not nervous at all?","Qiao Xi had only brought one bodyguard with her. Could it be that her bodyguard was skilled in martial arts?","No!","Xia Lan suddenly became nervous. “Why are you smiling?”","Qiao Xi leaned comfortably against the sofa and looked at Xia Lan with a smile.","The other members of the Xia family also noticed that something was wrong. Qiao Xi had fallen out with the Xia family since she entered. Why did she keep talking about the Xia family’s crimes?","With Qiao Xi’s character, she would not agree to marry Young Master Tan, but she asked Xia Lan the same question twice in a row. She asked if Xia Lan wanted her biological daughter to marry Young Master Tan.","When Qiao Xi heard Xia Lan’s answer, she smiled even more wantonly. Why was she smiling?","Even if someone suspected that Xia Lan was not Qiao Xi’s biological mother, they did not have any evidence! Xu Zhi was already sure that Qiao Xi was his daughter and Xia Lan was her mother. No matter how outsiders suspected it, this was an unquestionable fact.","“Madam Xia.” Qiao Xi suddenly broke the silence, but her next words caused the Xia family’s hearts to skip a beat. “Since that’s the case, you must let your biological daughter marry Tan Yu. You’ve accepted a betrothal gift of two billion yuan, so you have to keep your word. If you break the promise, I’m afraid the Xia family won’t be able to bear the anger of the Brook family.”","Xia Lan was uneasy, and sweat trickled down her forehead. She shouted in a panic, “What exactly do you mean? Why are you laughing?”","“Xi Xi is laughing at you for being stupid.” A cold voice came from outside the door. Everyone looked in the direction of the voice, and Xia Cheng and Xia Lan’s pupils suddenly constricted.","20 minutes ago, Gu Zheng arrived at the Xu family’s residence. Facing the trembling Xu Zhi, his eyes were cold and arrogant. He exuded a powerful aura. “President Xu, do you understand what I mean?”","Cold sweat broke out on Xu Zhi’s forehead as he stammered, “President Gu, Xi Xi... is our daughter, so you...”","Gu Zheng gently knocked on the table and interrupted Xu Zhi as if he was giving Xu Zhi another chance to reorganize his words. “President Xu, is there any point in lying to me now? You should know the consequences of offending me. Isn’t the Xia family a living example?”"]},{"number":1326,"title":"Chapter 1326 You Only Have One Chance. What Do You Choose?","paragraphs":["1326 You Only Have One Chance. What Do You Choose?","Xu Zhi was terrified and uneasy. His hands trembled as he picked up the cup.","Gu Zheng slowly looked up. Song Shijing immediately understood and reminded him, “President Xu, why don’t you read the news online first? Maybe you’ll change your mind.”","Xu Zhi hesitated for a few seconds and took Song Shijing’s phone in fear. He was stunned when he saw the explosive news and public opinion online.","“President Xu, you’re a smart person. You should know very well what will happen to the Xia family. We can make the Xia family suffer eternal damnation. However, our young madam wants to prove her identity. If you agree, it’ll be considered as our president owing you a favor. He definitely won’t make things difficult for you in the future.”","!!","“Uhh...”","“President Xu, what’s there to hesitate about?” Song Shijing’s voice turned cold as he placed the paternity test report in front of Xu Zhi. “Look carefully. This is the paternity test report of the Medical Association. You should know how authoritative the Medical Association is. As long as you testify, the matter will naturally be settled. The Xia family won’t be able to defend themselves.”","“But I...” Xu Zhi was still hesitant.","“I know that you still care about your relationship with your wife as you two have been together for more than 20 years. You can’t bear to see Xia Lan consigned to eternal damnation. But look at her. Is she still the same woman you have in your heart? Her name is Xia Lan now, not Xia Yunlou. Why do you have to cut off your escape route for her?”","Song Shijing continued to persuade him. “It’s every man for himself. President Xu, do you want to offend our president for Xia Lan, or do you want to live a safe life from now on? You only have one chance. It all depends on your choice.”","“If you insist on protecting Xia Lan, we won’t force you. You’ll just follow the Xia family to eternal damnation!”","Hearing Song Shijing’s words, Xu Zhi could not help but tremble. He stared at his phone and saw that the internet was filled with curses. Xia Lan was shouting and cursing like a shrew. Some even scolded him for being blind. How did he marry a woman like Xia Lan back then?","Was he really going to lose everything in the Xu family for such an unbearable woman?","Although he did not like Qiao Xi, he was a normal person and had some sympathy. When he heard about all the evil things Xia Lan had done to Qiao Xi, he could not be indifferent.","...","The Xia family.","After Xu Zhi finished speaking, everyone looked at the door. When the Xia family saw Xu Zhi, their expressions changed drastically.","He took a deep breath, and Gu Zheng’s words still echoed in his mind. He could not be consigned to eternal damnation with the Xia family. He had already kept this secret for Xia Lan for more than 20 years. They could be considered husband and wife, but he could not make mistakes again and again for Xia Lan.","When Xia Lan saw Xu Zhi, her body could not help but tremble. Her eyes were filled with horror. “Why are you here?”","Xu Zhi walked in front of her and questioned, “Yunlou, do you really want Xi Xi to go to Y Nation and marry into the Brook family?”","“Don’t call me Yunlou. I’m called Xia Lan now! I’m her mother. Is it wrong for me to marry her off? Xu Zhi! I have nothing to do with you anymore. Don’t even think about the two billion dollars! Don’t even think about it!”","Xu Zhi’s eyes were filled with disappointment. Xia Lan actually thought that he came to the Xia family to fight for the two billion yuan. He was not capable, but he would never betray his daughter for glory.","Xia Lan rushed over and pointed at Qiao Xi’s nose as she roared furiously. “Let me tell you, no matter who comes today, you have to marry Young Master Tan!”","Qiao Xi paid no attention to her.","Xu Zhi was already unable to restrain his anger. Just as the netizens had said, was he blind back then? Why did he marry such an unbearable woman? Why did he think that Xia Lan could replace Xia Yunqiu?","At this moment, he was already unable to suppress the flames of rage in his heart. He only felt something surge out from his heart. “Xia Lan, you’re not worthy to decide on Qiao Xi’s marriage!”","Xia Lan did not expect that Xu Zhi would actually stand up for Qiao Xi. Her face was ferocious, and her eyes were bloodshot like an angry beast. “I’m not worthy, but are you? We’re already divorced. Qiao Xi has nothing to do with you. We’ve already accepted the Brook family’s betrothal gifts. If we don’t marry Qiao Xi off, they won’t let us off. Qiao Xi is my daughter. Why can’t she suffer for me?”","Xu Zhi’s heart was filled with desolation. He looked at the woman in front of him and felt that she was extremely unfamiliar. “Xia Lan, you’re the one who accepted the betrothal gifts, so why does Xi Xi have to marry into their family? Why does she have to suffer for you? Look at all the things you’ve done to her.”","The netizens in the live broadcast were about to explode from anger.","[Is Xia Lan crazy?! She has never treated Qiao Xi well, yet she wants Qiao Xi to sacrifice herself for her. She’s just hoping to take all the benefits for herself. How can she be so shameless?! Everyone knows that marrying Tan Yu means death. She’s sending her daughter to her death!]"]},{"number":1327,"title":"Chapter 1327 I’ll Drag Qiao Xi To Death","paragraphs":["1327 I’ll Drag Qiao Xi To Death","When Xia Lan heard Xu Zhi’s words, she could not help but sneer. “I gave her life. Isn’t that enough? I’m her biological mother. How could I harm her? As long as she marries Young Master Tan, she’ll be a noble in Y Nation. She’ll be even more glorious than now. Isn’t this a good thing?”","Xu Zhi clenched his fists tightly. He looked at Xia Lan in disappointment and gritted his teeth. “Haven’t you heard of Young Master Tan’s evil deeds? If you want your daughter to marry him, you have to at least understand the other party’s character and background. You clearly know what kind of person he is, yet you still want Xi Xi to marry him. You’re clearly trying to kill her! Not only do you want to harm her, but you even want to exchange her life for money. Are you still human?”","The living room instantly fell silent. Xia Lan jumped up as if her tail had been stepped on. Her face was livid, and her ugly face was revealed. “So what? I painstakingly gave birth to her. She has lived for 20 years, which is enough. Can’t she return her life to me now? She’ll die a worthy death. After all, she’ll also enjoy the glory and wealth of the Brook family when she’s still alive. She should be satisfied!”","Xu Zhi looked at the crazy woman in front of him. It was hard to imagine that he had spent 20 years with this woman.","!!","“You came uninvited. I’ve already shown you enough respect by not chasing you out. You have no right to interfere in today’s matter!” Xia Lan said disdainfully.","“I gave birth to Qiao Xi, so she should realize her value. As my daughter, she has to be prepared to sacrifice herself at all times to fulfill my wish as a mother. So what if she dies? This is her life. She can’t blame me!”","Xu Zhi looked at Xia Lan in horror as if he had seen a ghost.","He suddenly recalled that when Xi Xi returned to the Xu family, Xia Lan had wholeheartedly protected Xu Anran and indulged her in committing crimes. Xi Xi must have felt the same as him—shock, anger, and even despair.","How did Xia Lan become like this? He vaguely remembered that she was not like this in the past. Otherwise, why would he marry her?","Xia Lan gained confidence, and the gaze she shot at Xu Zhi was filled with disdain. “Don’t think that you can stop my decision just because you’re my ex-husband. No matter what, Qiao Xi has to marry Young Master Tan. If you ruin this marriage, I’ll drag Qiao Xi down with me!”","Xu Zhi suddenly felt weak all over. He said with difficulty, “Xia Lan, have you really decided to marry your biological daughter to Young Master Tan?”","Initially, he wanted to persuade Xia Lan because they had been husband and wife for more than 20 years. However, it seemed that she was hopeless now. She could not blame him.","Xu Zhi completely gave up.","When Xia Lan heard Xu Zhi’s words, her eyes instantly widened. Why did he ask the same question as Qiao Xi? What was wrong with letting her biological daughter marry Young Master Tan?","“Xu Zhi, what are you doing? This is the Xia family’s territory. It’s absolutely impossible for you to snatch her away!” Xia Lan warned.","“I gave Qiao Xi life, so she has to listen to my orders. I’m her mother, so she should repay me. What right does she have to refuse? She—”","“Because she’s not your daughter at all!” Xu Zhi shouted at the top of his voice and interrupted Xia Lan’s words. He trembled in anger, and his expression was extremely gloomy. He almost squeezed out a sentence from his throat. “Xia Lan! Qiao Xi isn’t your biological daughter at all. What right do you have to force her to marry someone else?","“She doesn’t have the Xia family’s blood in her, nor was she raised by the Xia family. Why should she be coerced by you?”","Xu Zhi roared, and the living room suddenly fell silent. Even the sound of breathing stopped. The expressions on everyone’s faces instantly stiffened. After calming down for a few seconds, they looked at Xu Zhi in surprise.","Xia Lan’s face was pale. The corners of her eyes twitched slightly, and she gritted her teeth. Then, she rushed in front of Xu Zhi as if she had gone mad. She hit and cursed, “Xu Zhi! You bastard! What nonsense are you talking about? Shut up!”","Xu Zhi grabbed her wrist and looked at her coldly. “You didn’t hear me clearly, right? Then I’ll say it again. Qiao Xi isn’t your daughter or mine. She has nothing to do with us. We’ve never had children all the years we were married. Anran and Anyi were both adopted. Don’t you know that?”","They didn’t have children?","Xia Lan was instantly stunned. Her body went soft as she fell onto the chair beside her. She retorted with a trembling voice, “No, no! Qiao Xi is my daughter!”","She had clearly given birth to a daughter, but Xu Zhi said that they did not have a child. Who did she have a child with, then?","No! No! Xu Zhi must be talking nonsense. Qiao Xi had to be their daughter. Otherwise, how could she marry into the Brook family?"]},{"number":1328,"title":"Chapter 1328 A Million Bucks To Shut Up","paragraphs":["1328 A Million Bucks To Shut Up","Xia Cheng walked forward and glared at him. “Xu Zhi, you and Lan’er are already divorced. You have no right to interfere in our Xia family’s matters. Xi Xi is your and Lan’er’s child. This is the truth.","“Moreover, when Lan’er gave birth back then, the hospital recorded it very clearly. She did give birth to a girl. Now that you’re slandering Lan’er’s innocence in public, what are your intentions?”","Xia Cheng spoke righteously, and everyone could not help but look at Xu Zhi.","Xu Zhi smiled bitterly and shook his head. “I’m not slandering her. Xia Lan does have a daughter, but she’s not our child. Chairman Xia, are you still acting in front of me now?”","!!","Xia Cheng’s old face instantly stiffened as if he had thought of something. Everyone also sensed that something was wrong.","[Xu Zhi said that he and Xia Lan don’t have children, but he said that Xia Lan has a daughter. In that case, Xia Lan must have cheated and given birth to a daughter with someone else, right?]","[I have to say that Xu Zhi is considered loyal. For the sake of Xia Lan’s reputation, he endured it for so many years without saying anything. If Xia Lan hadn’t insisted on courting death and forcing Miss Qiao to marry Young Master Tan, Xu Zhi probably wouldn’t have revealed Xia Lan’s affair in public.]","“Ah!!! That’s not true! You’re just a piece of trash who relied on the Xia family to rise to power. What right do you have—”","Xu Zhi’s eyes were filled with disappointment as he interrupted her, “We’ve been married for more than 20 years. I’ve already done my best for you. I originally wanted to bring this secret to the grave and didn’t want it to affect your reputation. Now that you’re the one who wants to ruin yourself, I’ll show everyone something interesting.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Xu Zhi took out a document. It contained Xia Lan’s records for the past 20 years. There were intimate photos of her with other men, her chat history, and so on.","Xu Zhi’s voice was trembling. “Look carefully. Isn’t this you? You dare to do it but don’t dare to own up to it, huh?”","Qiao Xi bent down and picked up the documents scattered on the floor. The reporter behind her immediately leaned forward and aimed his camera at the documents.","The information Xu Zhi provided was very detailed. The time, location, and names were all very precise. There were also traces. When Xia Lan was pregnant, he had always been overseas discussing business. It was enough to prove that Xia Lan had an affair.","The Xia family did not stop Qiao Xi from getting the information. Actually, they all knew about Xia Lan’s affair, so they were not surprised.","Xia Cheng’s expression did not change as he said indifferently, “That’s all in the past. Why are you still talking about it? So what if Qiao Xi isn’t Lan’er’s biological daughter? Xu Zhi, this is the Xia family. Do you think you can interfere in the Xia family’s family matters? I don’t care whose daughter she is. She has to marry Young Master Tan today!”","Xu Zhi sneered. “Chairman Xia, you already knew that Xi Xi isn’t a child of the Xia family?”","Xia Lan recovered from her shock and looked at Xia Cheng in disbelief. “Father, this...”","“Lan’er, Qiao Xi is indeed not your daughter,” Xia Cheng said indifferently. “Since Xu Zhi has already said it, then there’s no need to hide it.”","Xia Lan’s entire body went soft, and her heart was extremely complicated. At first, she was shocked and angry, but then she was actually delighted. It turned out that Qiao Xi, whose temperament and appearance were very similar to Xia Yunqiu, was not her daughter! Exactly! How could she have given birth to a little b*tch?!","This was really good news!","Xia Lan instantly felt much better. A smile appeared on her face, but...","The next second, Xia Ji was unhappy. “Dad, how can you spout nonsense? If Qiao Xi isn’t Lan’er’s daughter, then how can she marry into the Brook family...”","Madam Tan suddenly looked up with a cold smile.","Xia Cheng smiled coldly. “The Brook family wants Qiao Xi. What does it matter if she’s Lan’er’s daughter or not? Since she’s in my Xia family’s territory, I have the final say.”","“The betrothal gifts have been accepted, and Madam Tan and Young Master Tan have also rushed over from afar. Do you think Xu Zhi can snatch someone from us?”","The atmosphere instantly darkened. Xu Zhi was stunned by Xia Cheng’s shameless words.","“You... You already know that Qiao Xi isn’t Xia Lan’s daughter, yet you actually... You actually want to force her to get married. You...”","“Xu Zhi, I told you a long time ago that you have to turn a blind eye sometimes. Don’t be so serious. If I give you the two billion, will you disagree?” Xia Cheng smiled proudly. “As long as you promise me to leave immediately and not spout nonsense, I can give you a million yuan to keep your mouth shut. What do you think?”","A million yuan hush money? How could he say that?"]},{"number":1329,"title":"Chapter 1329 Isn’t Xia Lan’s Biological Daughter At The Scene?","paragraphs":["1329 Isn’t Xia Lan’s Biological Daughter At The Scene?","Xu Zhi had never been so angry before. He was so angry that he could not say a word. Qiao Xi, who was at the side, suddenly chuckled.","Her eyes were clear, and her exquisite face was filled with smiles. She said slowly, “Chairman Xia, all of you already know that I’m not Xia Lan’s daughter and I have nothing to do with the Xia family, yet you still have the cheek to force me to marry Young Master Tan?","“You want to sell me to Young Master Tan after accepting a betrothal gift of two billion yuan. Is this human trafficking? I really didn’t expect the Xia family to be doing such a business behind my back!”","The entire venue was silent. The servants also looked disdainful.","Chairman Xia had already admitted that Miss Qiao was not related to the Xia family by blood. He even accepted the betrothal gift from the Brook family and forced Miss Qiao to marry him. Was this any different from human trafficking? Moreover, ordinary human traffickers could not get two billion yuan!","Xia Cheng glanced at Qiao Xi with disdain and smiled especially horrifyingly. “Xi Xi, it doesn’t matter what you say. In short, you have to marry him today. Even if you go out and say that the Xia family accepted a betrothal gift of two billion yuan, who will believe you? Do you have evidence?","“You’ll be leaving Li City soon. You’ll disappear from this land forever. You might not even be able to come back in your lifetime. What chance do you have to tell others?”","This proud and disdainful expression made the netizens in the live broadcast furious. They wished they could crawl over and slap Xia Cheng twice.","The actions of the Xia family could no longer be described with words. Facing such shameless people, logic could not be used to reason with them. It seemed that violence was the only way to solve the problem.","Xia Cheng stood up and looked down at Qiao Xi. “I admit that you’re not a child of the Xia family, but this is my territory. No outsiders will know about this. They’ll only know that Xia Lan’s daughter married into a family from Y Nation. Is there anything wrong with that?","“Xi Xi, you’re the second daughter of the Xia family now. It’s your duty to sacrifice for the family. Lan’er doesn’t have a biological daughter, so she can only—”","“Chairman Xia, isn’t Xia Lan’s biological daughter right in front of you?”","Suddenly, a cold voice sounded. The man’s figure was tall, and his entire body was filled with a sense of oppression. His footsteps were steady as if he was stepping on everyone’s hearts. He walked to Qiao Xi’s side and sat beside her, holding her slightly cold hand.","Xia Cheng was dumbfounded, and his body could not help but tremble.","Gu Zheng? Why was he here?","For the sake of stopping Gu Zheng from arriving, he had already sent someone to intercept him. Moreover, the Brook family had also sent someone over. They did not expect to get rid of Gu Zheng, but they could at least delay him for a period of time. Once Qiao Xi boarded the plane, it would be too late.","The moment Gu Zheng appeared, the entire venue instantly fell silent.","Madam Tan sized up the tall man in front of her, and a trace of coldness flashed past her eyes.","Everyone carefully pondered over Gu Zheng’s words. If Qiao Xi was not Xia Lan’s biological daughter, who else could it be?","They glanced around. There were only two women in their 20s at the scene, Qiao Xi and Xia Mengyan.","Xia Cheng had already admitted that it was not Qiao Xi, so there was only one possibility—","Everyone looked at Xia Mengyan. Seeing this, Xia Lan instantly reacted. Her face was pale as she hurriedly struggled to stand up from the chair. Her sharp voice sounded. “Nonsense!”","Xia Cheng’s face was livid. “President Gu, please don’t spout nonsense in public. Lan’er’s biological daughter passed away a long time ago.”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “Is that so? Chairman Xia, are you saying that Madam Xia’s biological daughter isn’t present?”","“Yes! If Lan’er had her own biological daughter, there’s no need for Xi Xi to marry into the Brook family!” Xia Cheng said self-righteously as if Qiao Xi should sacrifice herself for the Xia family.","Song Shijing clenched his fists. This old man was so arrogant. He was forcing someone who had nothing to do with the Xia family to get married and even accepted a sky-high betrothal gift. Why did he still think it was a glorious matter?","“I hope you’ll remember your words, Chairman Xia.” Gu Zheng smiled. Song Shijing immediately handed him a document.","Gu Zheng flipped through the documents leisurely with a subtle smile on his face. However, everyone could tell that he was not smiling but mocking the other party with killing intent.","The coldness that filled the bodies of the Xia family members almost suffocated them. Their bodies stiffened as they stood rooted to the ground.","“Chairman Xia, take a look at this paternity test.”","Reporter Fang immediately went forward and carefully aimed the camera at the paternity test report. It clearly said: ‘Xia Ji and Xia Mengyan are confirmed to be father and daughter.’"]},{"number":1330,"title":"Chapter 1330 Throwing The Evidence In His Face","paragraphs":["1330 Throwing The Evidence In His Face","It was not strange that Xia Ji was Xia Mengyan’s father, but the second report made everyone dumbfounded.","Xia Lan and Xia Mengyan were confirmed to be mother and daughter.","The two paternity test reports were stamped with the seals of several appraisers. Most importantly, the tests came from the most authoritative organization—the Medical Association.","Everyone looked at Xia Ji and Xia Lan in shock.","Xia Ji’s face was pale. His mind buzzed as if something had exploded in his ears.","Xia Cheng, who had always been calm, also changed his expression. Xia Lan shouted agitatedly, “No! This isn’t true. This is slander!”","Xia Mengyan was stunned on the spot. Her body was as cold as a corpse, and her heart seemed to have been dealt a heavy blow. She could not help but tremble as tears welled up in her eyes.","Xia Lan seemed to have gone mad as she rushed over to tear up the reports. “This is fake! Gu Zheng is so rich. It’s very easy for him to fake a paternity test report! He must’ve faked it!”","Qiao Xi glanced at Xia Lan with disdain. She had long known that Xia Lan would say such things. As long as Gu Zheng took out evidence, Xia Lan would say that Gu Zheng was relying on his wealth and power to forge evidence, so the evidence he brought out was invalid.","Gu Zheng chuckled. “Looks like you’re very experienced, Madam Xia! You actually know that the report is fake without even looking.”","Xia Lan was already in a state of collapse and did not understand what Gu Zheng meant. She thought that he had admitted that the paternity test report was fake, but the rest of the Xia family understood. Gu Zheng knew that Xia Lan had forged Qiao Xi’s paternity test back then and pretended to be Qiao Xi’s mother. Hence, Gu Zheng would not let the person who forged the paternity test report for her off, much less the Xia family.","Xia Cheng forced himself to calm down. “President Gu, Lan’er did something stupid in a moment of confusion back then, but it was all for Xi Xi! She knew that Xi Xi doesn’t have parents, so she wanted to give her a warm home. You have to understand a mother’s heart.”","The servants could not help but reveal disdainful expressions. Xia Cheng probably did not believe it himself, but he still said indifferently, “Lan’er did forge a paternity test to prove that Qiao Xi was her daughter. Since our Xia family could easily do it, I believe you could also forge a paternity test, right?”","Everyone gasped. How did Xia Cheng have the cheek to say that?","“In that case, if I can’t produce any other evidence, you won’t admit it.” Gu Zheng’s tone was indifferent.","Xia Cheng’s expression suddenly changed as he had a bad feeling.","Then, Song Shijing took a few steps forward. “Chairman Xia, our president means that it’s better for you to admit it yourself than for us to throw the evidence in your face. However, it doesn’t matter if you don’t accept it.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Song Shijing handed the documents to Xia Cheng. “This is the time Madam Xia Lan was pregnant and gave birth. Back then, after Madam Xia Lan gave birth, her daughter went missing while Mr. Xia Ji suddenly had another daughter.”","Xia Ji immediately defended himself. “My wife and Lan’er got pregnant at the same time. It’s just that they didn’t say anything at that time.”","Song Shijing glanced at him and smiled disdainfully. “After Madam Xia got pregnant, she suddenly disappeared for a period of time. Then, news of her pregnancy spread. She gave birth to another child, but this time, it was a fake pregnancy. Her goal was to confuse others about Xia Mengyan’s time of birth. Didn’t Madam Xia do all that just to cover up this big secret?”","Xia Ji flew into a rage. “Nonsense! This is all a guess. How can it be considered evidence?”","Song Shijing said, “It’s indeed a guess, but Mr. Xia, my guess is based on the clues. Won’t your actions arouse suspicion?”","Xia Ji broke down and shouted, “Are you crazy?! Lan’er and I are biological siblings. How could we have a child together? If you continue to spout nonsense, I’ll call the police!”","At this moment, when Ai Sumei saw that her son was being bullied, she did not care about her image anymore. She sat on the floor and wailed like a shrew in the market. “Oh my! My poor child! He’s actually being slandered like this! Can the president of Gu Corporation ruin the reputations of others like this? Aren’t you forcing my stepson and Lan’er to their deaths? The siblings are indeed close, but it’s definitely not what you say...”","Xia Mengyan, who was at the side, also cried and said, “Xi Xi, I don’t mind how you treat me, but you can’t slander my father and aunt! The Xia family is already in such a difficult situation. Are you really going to force us to their deaths?”"]},{"number":1331,"title":"Chapter 1331 Worldview Ruined","paragraphs":["1331 Worldview Ruined","Song Shijing went forward and said loudly in front of everyone, “Xia Lan has been pretending to be Xia Yunlou for many years. She’s not Chairman Xia’s daughter at all, so she’s not Xia Ji’s younger sister. Chairman Xia, do you really think I’m just guessing and don’t have any evidence?”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s lips curled up slightly as a trace of impatience flashed past his eyes.","Song Shijing understood instantly and said coldly, “Our president has already given you a chance to admit it. Since you don’t want to do it, don’t blame us for being heartless. President Xu, take it out.”","The color on Xia Lan’s face instantly vanished!","!!","Xu Zhi took a deep breath, took out a USB drive from his pocket with trembling hands, and handed it to Song Shijing.","When Xia Lan saw the USB drive, she instantly exploded. “Xu Zhi!”","“Madam Xia Lan, Mr. Xia Ji, I really want to save you some dignity, but you don’t seem to need it.” With that, Song Shijing inserted the USB drive into his laptop.","Xia Cheng rushed over crazily and was instantly subdued by Song Shijing with one hand. Not to mention a 60-year-old man, even if everyone in the Xia family attacked him together, they would not be Song Shijing’s match.","Xia Cheng was so angry that his face turned red. He shouted at the servants in exasperation, “Someone! Quickly snatch that USB drive back!”","There was silence. No one paid attention to Xia Cheng.","Xia Lan’s and Xia Ji’s eyes were filled with horror. Xia Lan’s eyes were bloodshot as she looked at Xu Zhi sadly and angrily. “We’ve been husband and wife for more than 20 years. Even if we’re divorced, you can’t just choose to forget our past relationship like this! Why are you doing this to me?”","Xu Zhi’s eyes were filled with disappointment, so he simply looked away.","Song Shijing turned on the computer and played the video on the USB drive.","“Turn it off! Turn it off!”","Everyone’s gazes were gathered on the computer screen. The surveillance footage showed Xia Lan and Xia Ji lying on the bed and hugging each other. Everyone in the Xia family could tell from the environment of the bedroom that the two of them were in Xia Ji’s bedroom.","Xu Zhi looked at Xia Lan with a sad gaze. “After we got married, you always came up with excuses to go back to your mother’s side of the family. I never doubted you, and no one would think that there was anything wrong. No one would find it strange that you’re on good terms with your brother, but I didn’t expect you to give birth to a daughter for Xia Ji behind my back!","“I discovered your secret a long time ago, but on the account that the Xia family has helped the Xu family for so many years and you’ve been married to me for more than 20 years, I never exposed you or told anyone else this secret.","“In the past, I thought that husband and wife were one. If you lost your dignity, it would mean that I lost mine. That’s why I kept enduring it. However, I realized that you’ve become even worse!”","Xia Lan roared crazily, “Impossible! That’s Xia Ji’s bedroom. How could there be a surveillance camera? Who recorded the video? Was it that b*tch, Su Nian?!”","“Xia Lan!!” Xu Zhi berated angrily. He was no stranger to the name Su Nian. She was Xia Ji’s wife. Outsiders might have never heard of Madam Xia’s identity and name, but Xu Zhi was the son-in-law of the Xia family, after all. He had seen Su Nian a few times at family banquets.","Xu Zhi’s voice was trembling. “Who are you calling a b*tch? Su Nian is Xia Ji’s wife, the legitimate Madam Xia. You’re the third party who interfered in someone else’s marriage. Now that you and Xia Ji’s scandal can’t be hidden anymore, you’re just reaping what you sowed. Who do you think is more like a b*tch?”","Xia Lan instantly lost all her strength and fell to the floor, crying.","The audience in the live stream was shocked when they saw the scene in front of them.","[Oh my God! My worldview is really ruined! Xia Lan and Xia Ji had an affair and even gave birth to a daughter. Why is the Xia family so disgusting?]","[F*ck! So Xia Mengyan is Xia Ji and Xia Lan’s daughter! I was wondering why Xia Lan was so good to Xia Mengyan. Xu Zhi and Madam Xia are really pitiful! They had to endure being cuckolded!]","[Just now, Xia Cheng even said that Xia Lan didn’t have a biological daughter, so he could only let Qiao Xi marry him. Now, he’s been slapped in the face crazily. Xia Mengyan has been the only child of the Xia family since she was born. She has the love and resources of the Xia family. If someone has to sacrifice for the Xia family, it’ll definitely be Xia Mengyan! Why should Qiao Xi sacrifice for the Xia family?]","[Xia Mengyan is the most disgusting b*tch! I’ll vomit just by looking at her!]","At this moment, Xia Lan was already helped up by the Xia family. She was trembling, and her eyes were filled with despair.","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “Chairman Xia, what other reasons do you have now?”","They could say that the paternity test was fake, but the video of Xia Ji and Xia Lan having an affair on the bed was real. The Xia family’s guilty and crazy expressions were also real. It was obvious that Xia Mengyan was Xia Ji and Xia Lan’s biological daughter."]},{"number":1332,"title":"Chapter 1332 She Should Be The One Marrying Young Master Tan","paragraphs":["1332 She Should Be The One Marrying Young Master Tan","Xia Cheng gritted his teeth, and the muscles on his face trembled slightly. He opened his mouth but could not say a word.","Gu Zheng said slowly, “Now that it has been proven that Miss Xia is Madam Xia Lan’s biological daughter, the person who should marry into the Brook family should be Miss Xia.”","These casual words seemed to have punched the hearts of the Xia family heavily. Their faces were contorted and pale. Xia Mengyan was trembling, her eyes filled with horror.","Everyone remembered what Xia Lan had said just now. She wanted her biological daughter to marry into the Brook family, but the biological daughter Xia Lan was talking about was Qiao Xi. Now that the video and information were exposed and Xia Lan’s biological daughter had become Xia Mengyan, the person who should marry Young Master Tan was Xia Mengyan!","Xia Mengyan’s forehead was covered in a cold sweat, and her face was as pale as paper. The blood in her body seemed to have frozen. She subconsciously pulled the corner of Xia Lan’s shirt, and her fingers turned slightly pale.","Xia Lan abruptly widened her eyes and roared like a lunatic, “No! Mengyan can’t marry! This has nothing to do with Mengyan. This marriage belongs to Qiao Xi! The person Young Master Tan likes is also Qiao Xi!”","Gu Zheng revealed a cold smile. “Miss Xia, what do you think?”","Xia Mengyan’s heart was instantly invaded by fear. Tears trickled down her face. She was sad, aggrieved, and unwilling.","She liked Gu Zheng, but Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with Qiao Xi. He even wanted to push her into a fire pit for Qiao Xi and have her marry a ruthless man like Tan Yu.","Xia Mengyan, who had always thought of herself as a socialite, no longer cared about her image. She knew the consequences of marrying Tan Yu. She would be tortured to death by Tan Yu like other girls.","She shook her head crazily. Her hair was messy, and her tears had ruined her exquisite makeup.","“No! I don’t want to! Grandpa, Dad, I don’t want to marry him!”","Hearing Xia Mengyan’s cries, Song Shiyu could not help but snort. He imitated Xia Mengyan’s tone and said slyly, “Miss Xia, think carefully. You’re marrying a noble from Y Nation. Just how many girls dream of marrying Young Master Tan? You can’t judge a book by its cover.”","As Song Shiyu spoke, he looked at Xia Mengyan provocatively. What he said was what Xia Mengyan had just said.","“Young Master Tan is handsome, carefree, gentle, and considerate. It’s your blessing to marry him. How can you refuse his good intentions? Our president and Young Madam both want you to be happy. Stop fooling around.”","Qiao Xi widened her eyes. Like boss, like subordinate. She did not expect Song Shiyu to be so sarcastic.","Xia Mengyan trembled in the cold and looked at Song Shiyu in disbelief. These were indeed what she had just said, but Song Shiyu and Gu Zheng were not at the scene when she said those words. How could they have heard her?","Before she could figure it out, Xia Lan staggered in front of Xia Mengyan. “What nonsense are you talking about? Our Mengyan can’t marry Young Master Tan. She has to stay by my side.”","“Why not? She’s your biological daughter!” Song Shiyu’s expression was a little aggrieved. He looked exactly like Xia Mengyan. “Isn’t Young Master Tan worthy of Miss Xia? Didn’t Miss Xia say that Young Master Tan is handsome and carefree? Since she admires Young Master Tan so much, isn’t it right for her to marry him?","“Moreover, I remember that it was Miss Xia who contacted Madam Tan and gave Qiao Xi’s photo to Young Master Tan. If it weren’t for Miss Xia, how would Young Master Tan know Young Madam? Miss Xia kept saying that Young would be happy if she married Young Master Tan, but now when we’re asking her to marry him, she’s crying and refusing to. Why is that?","“I understand now. Miss Xia, you probably know that Young Master Tan has caused the death of many women. If you marry him, you’ll be tortured to death by him. But you still asked our young madam to marry him. Actually, you didn’t do it for Young Madam’s own good at all. You just wanted to send her to hell! You’re really too vicious!”","Song Shiyu’s reprimands made the Xia family look uglier and uglier. They gradually panicked.","Only Xia Cheng’s expression was calm. He took a deep breath. “President Gu, I know Mengyan is a little selfish.”","A little selfish? Song Shiyu was shocked by Xia Cheng’s shamelessness. The audience in the live stream was also stunned.","[How is this considered a little selfish? I’m a very cultured person. I never scold people and only scold non-humans! Xia Mengyan, you idiot! Why don’t you just die?!]","[Xia Mengyan is very selfish! She clearly knew about Tan Yu’s evil deeds, but she still contacted Madam Tan and gave her Qiao Xi’s photo. That’s why Madam Tan came to Li City to look for Qiao Xi. If Qiao Xi hadn’t been vigilant, she might have been forcefully brought to Y Nation a long time ago.]"]},{"number":1333,"title":"Chapter 1333 Businessmen Prioritize Benefits","paragraphs":["1333 Businessmen Prioritize Benefits","Hearing Xia Cheng’s words, Qiao Xi was still expressionless as if she was used to the Xia family’s shameless words and they could no longer arouse her emotions.","She knew that Xia Cheng would not admit his mistake easily, but she was not a soft-hearted person. Since Xia Mengyan dared to scheme against her, she would give her a taste of her own medicine and let Xia Mengyan marry Young Master Tan!","Xia Cheng could not guess what Qiao Xi was thinking. He did not realize that everything that was happening in the Xia family was being broadcasted live. The audience could clearly see the Xia family’s ugly nature.","At this moment, Xia Cheng was still confident that everything was under control. “President Gu, I want to talk to you alone.”","Song Shijing and Song Shiyu looked at each other with disdain.","Everyone’s gazes landed on Gu Zheng, who replied casually, “Chairman Xia, let’s talk here.”","A trace of embarrassment flashed past Xia Cheng’s eyes, but he quickly recovered. He glanced at Qiao Xi with disdain, then cleared his throat and said, “President Gu, I’ll shamelessly ask you for a favor today.”","With that, Xia Cheng smiled obsequiously and said self-righteously, “Since those things have been exposed, there’s nothing to hide. Xi Xi is indeed not a member of the Xia family. We do want to use her in exchange for the two billion yuan betrothal gift. This two billion yuan can help our Xia family tide over the difficulties. I think if you were me, you would have made the same choice. President Gu, you’re also a businessman. You should understand our actions.”","Song Shiyu sighed in his heart. Fortunately, he had not eaten before coming. Otherwise, he would have vomited on the spot. Did this old man know what he was saying? It was fine for him to want to get two billion yuan through a marriage alliance, but what right did he have to marry off someone who had nothing to do with the Xia family to the Brook family?","The Xia family wasn’t forming a marriage alliance, they were engaging in human trafficking. Now, he actually said that businessmen valued benefits above all else. Would the president understand him?","Xia Cheng did not feel guilty at all. He even felt that there was nothing wrong with his actions. He thought that businessmen had to prioritize benefits. Human character and morals were not important.","Qiao Xi leaned against the sofa as she let out a cold snort. She was already flattering Xia Cheng by merely saying that he was shameless.","Xia Cheng glanced at Qiao Xi. He was slightly puzzled. Why was Qiao Xi so indifferent? It was even to the extent that she looked at him with disdain.","He calmed the uneasiness in his heart and raised his eyes to look at Gu Zheng. “President Gu, you’re naturally very capable to be able to make Gu Corporation so big. You must know that sometimes, in order to achieve your goal, you have to sacrifice some people. This is also part of fate. With Qiao Xi’s sacrifice, we can get two billion yuan and also the protection of the Brook family. This is a very good deal. It’s Qiao Xi’s honor to be able to fetch a bethrotal gift of two billion yuan. President Gu, you’re also a businessman, so you should know what to do.","“President Gu, you’re such an outstanding man. You can find any woman you want. Even if you’re divorced, countless women will fight to marry you. This opportunity is really too rare.","“As long as you nod your head and agree, I can give you half of the two billion yuan I get by sacrificing Qiao Xi. I hope you can help the Xia family in the future. What do you think?”","As soon as he finished speaking, Song Shijing and Song Shiyu were instantly infuriated and clenched their fists unconsciously.","This old man was going to buy Young Madam and even give half of the stolen money to the president? How did he have such a disgusting thought?","In their opinion, Xia Cheng wanting to split the proceeds with the president was undoubtedly an insult to the president. With the president’s love for Young Madam, he would never sell her even if he died.","However, Xia Cheng did not think so. He felt that benefits were the most important. Gu Zheng would not refuse this condition. After all, most men would choose to give up their wives for a billion. Hence, not only did Xia Cheng want to sell Qiao Xi, but he even wanted to make her suffer till the very last moment. He wanted her to see her husband abandon her with her own eyes.","When Xia Mengyan heard Xia Cheng’s words, she suddenly looked up. Her eyes were filled with anticipation. If Gu Zheng agreed...","“Heh.”","Under everyone’s burning gazes, Gu Zheng, who had been silent all this while, suddenly chuckled. He slowly looked up, his deep eyes glowing. However, his tone was terrifyingly cold. “Chairman Xia.”","Xia Cheng looked proud as if he had already confirmed Gu Zheng’s choice."]},{"number":1334,"title":"Chapter 1334 Insulting Him With A Billion Yuan","paragraphs":["1334 Insulting Him With A Billion Yuan","Xia Mengyan held her breath and looked at Gu Zheng expectantly.","That was a billion yuan! As long as Gu Zheng agreed, they would immediately move the betrothal gift of a billion yuan to Longwan Residential. Gu Zheng was so young, handsome, and outstanding. He could have many women by his side. Qiao Xi was very beautiful, but she was not the only beautiful woman.","He was already hesitating, which meant that Qiao Xi’s status in his heart wasn’t that important. Under the temptation of a billion, most people would be unable to restrain themselves.","Everyone in the Xia family looked at Gu Zheng with anticipation. Gu Zheng said slowly, “Chairman Xia, are you insulting me?”","!!","The smugness on Xia Cheng’s face froze instantly. Could it be that Gu Zheng thought that a billion was too little?","Before Xia Cheng could speak, Gu Zheng sneered. He was already extraordinarily handsome, and when he smiled, he exuded the charm of a mature man with a trace of roguishness.","However, in the eyes of the Xia family, such a smile was like a death warrant. It made one shudder.","Xia Cheng’s heart trembled. He had a bad feeling.","The next second, Gu Zheng said calmly, “Chairman Xia, do you think I’d sell my wife for a billion yuan? Just because you can do such a thing doesn’t mean that the others are as greedy as you. As for the collaboration, I’m not the same kind of person as you. I’m not willing to collude with you.”","The living room instantly fell silent.","Song Shiyu’s eyes were filled with admiration. As expected of the president. He did not even use dirty words when scolding others. One sentence from him could make Xia Cheng feel ashamed. The president had not only scolded Xia Cheng but also Madam Tan. She and Xia Cheng were the same kinds of people!","Xia Cheng’s face was livid as he suppressed his anger. “President Gu, are you disagreeing?”","Gu Zheng did not even bother to look at Xia Cheng. He frowned. His voice was calm, but it was filled with strong killing intent. “What? Chairman Xia, are you threatening me?”","“I’ve made myself very clear. Chairman Xia, you accepted the two billion yuan betrothal gift, so you naturally can’t go back on your word. Hence, Xia Mengyan has to marry Young Master Tan today!”","Silence, dead silence!","Xia Cheng’s expression was as dark as ink. He gritted his teeth and said, “President Gu, Mengyan is from the Xia family. You can’t interfere in our Xia family’s marriage.”","“Oh! So this is the big shot of Li City! The president of Gu Corporation, Gu Zheng?” Madam Tan walked forward elegantly and greeted him with a smile.","She had a voluptuous figure and was wearing Y Nation’s style clothes. Her face was exquisite, and she looked like a charming middle-aged woman. Although her tone was gentle, Qiao Xi could still sense the disdain in her eyes.","As expected, her expression changed the next second. “President Gu, it’s not your place to interfere in the marriage of our Brook family. My son has taken a liking to Miss Qiao, so she has to leave with us today. I hope you can think it through. Offending the Brook family won’t do you any good.”","Song Shiyu snorted. “You’re really interesting. It’s true that we can’t interfere in the Brooke family’s marriage, but you want our young madam to marry into your family. Of course, we can’t agree. Not to mention that our young madam and the president are already married. Even if the young madam isn’t married, you can’t snatch someone away just like this. The Brooke family is bullying others, so why can’t we say anything?”","Madam Tan sneered. “Who do you think you are? The Brook family is a noble family in Y Nation, and I’m the noble Madam Brook. Are you worthy of criticizing me?","“President Gu, I’ll give you a chance. As long as you hand Qiao Xi over and let me bring her back to Y Nation, I can let bygones be bygones. If you insist on protecting Qiao Xi, then don’t blame me for being heartless!”","Gu Zheng sneered, but his smile did not reach his eyes.","“Why are you smiling? Let me tell you, our Brook family—”","“Madam Tan.” Qiao Xi suddenly interrupted the other party. “I remember that the marriage contract between the Xia and Brook families clearly states that the person who’ll marry Young Master Tan Yu is Madam Xia Lan’s daughter. Since the marriage contract has already been issued, wouldn’t it be breaking the rules if the person who marries Young Master Tan isn’t Xia Lan’s daughter? Our country values rules the most. If this matter blows up, the conflict won’t just be between two families. Perhaps it’ll be between two countries, or perhaps the scandal of the Brook family won’t be able to stay hidden anymore. In that case, your son might really be in trouble.","“The Brook family is indeed a noble family in Y Nation, but you came to Li City to snatch me away. Moreover, Gu Zheng’s identity is extraordinary. If the matter blows up, you’ll be in the wrong.”"]},{"number":1335,"title":"Chapter 1335 Give Me A Satisfactory Answer","paragraphs":["1335 Give Me A Satisfactory Answer","“However, it’s understandable if Miss Xia Mengyan marries him. After all, you’ve already signed the betrothal contract and the Xia family has accepted the betrothal gifts. Everything about that arrangement is reasonable.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi glanced at Xia Mengyan with a smile.","Xia Mengyan was so scared that her scalp went numb. She hid behind Xia Lan in horror, her back drenched in sweat.","Song Shiyu quickly continued, “Young Madam is right! Madam Tan, if this matter blows up, the Brook family will be the ones losing their reputation. Since you’ve given the betrothal gifts, if the Xia family goes back on their word and refuses to marry their daughter to Young Master Tan, won’t they be looking down on you?”","Song Shiyu said slyly, “Our young madam is already married, so she definitely can’t marry Young Master Tan. Since Young Madam can’t marry into your family, you can only choose Xia Mengyan. After all, she’s Madam Xia Lan’s daughter, and she’s unmarried. No one is more suitable than her. If she’s unwilling to marry, it’ll be equivalent to the Xia family looking down on you and Young Master Tan. If news of this gets out, what will others say about the Brook family?”","When Madam Tan heard these words, her eyes were filled with anger.","Qiao Xi echoed, “That’s right! You spent two billion but didn’t even get to proceed with the marriage. When you return to Y Nation, you’ll definitely be laughed at!”","“Madam Tan, you came all the way to Li City and took out a betrothal gift of two billion yuan. The Brook family must know that you’re here to offer betrothal gifts. If you spend two billion yuan but don’t bring a woman back, what will the family say?”","“They might say that you’re a noble madam but was played by a small family. You’ll end up embarrassing your family after losing such a large sum of money...”","Madam Tan was instantly furious.","Gu Zheng!","It was all because of this man. If he hadn’t appeared, she could have forcefully taken Qiao Xi away and no one would’ve noticed. However, not only was she unable to take Qiao Xi away now, but she also had to listen to the ridicule of this group of people.","However, Qiao Xi’s words made sense. If she spent two billion yuan but failed to get her son a wife, then...","Madam Tan hesitated for a moment before finally looking up at Xia Cheng with a malicious expression. “Chairman Xia, you’ve already accepted the two billion yuan betrothal gift. No matter what, someone has to marry my son and return to Y Nation with us. If the Xia family doesn’t want to be enemies with the Brook family, hand that person over!”","Madam Tan gritted her teeth tightly. At this point, she could only take a step back. She would let Qiao Xi off this time, but sooner or later, Qiao Xi would have to pay the price for this! Since she was married to Gu Zheng, she had to bear the danger that followed.","The Brook family could not have a falling out with Gu Zheng, so she had no reason to be enemies with him. However, it was harmless to trip him up.","How painful would it be for Gu Zheng if he saw his beloved wife become her son’s plaything one day?","Unfortunately, the plan this time did not succeed, but it did not matter. Qiao Xi was lucky this time, but she would not be so lucky every time. Qiao Xi would fall into her hands sooner or later.","Everyone in the Xia family was silent, but it was obvious that Madam Tan no longer had the patience. She frowned unhappily. “Chairman Xia, I’ll give you five minutes. You have to give me a satisfactory answer. Otherwise, don’t blame me for being nasty.”","Xia Cheng’s expression darkened as he looked at Xia Mengyan in confusion.","Xia Mengyan’s body went soft, and her face was as pale as paper. Madam Tan had already made it very clear that she was forcing her to marry Tan Yu. If the Xia family did not agree, the Brook family would do their best to suppress the Xia family. At that time...","Why? The person who was supposed to get married in the beginning was clearly Qiao Xi. Why was it her now?","“Mengyan, go to Y Nation with Young Master Tan obediently. I’ll visit you after some time. If the Xia family survives this crisis, I’ll bring you back.”","Xia Mengyan’s eyes were filled with horror. Back then, when she sent Madam Tan the photo, she did not expect things to turn out like this. She just happened to hear about Young Master Tan’s evil deeds. She hoped that Qiao Xi would marry him and be tortured to death by Young Master Tan, but if she married him, she would have no chance of survival.","Her tears fell like pearls. Her vision was already blurred by her tears. She suddenly pounced in front of Xia Cheng and pulled his arm, crying. “Grandpa! No! I can’t marry him! I’m your granddaughter! How can you...”","Xia Ji panicked, and Xia Lan was so scared that tears streamed down her face.","Sumei grabbed Xia Cheng’s other arm and begged, “Ah Cheng, you can’t let Mengyan marry him! Mengyan grew up by your side. How can you bear to push her into a fire pit? She’s so obedient and filial. Are you going to sell her for two billion? It would be fine if she can be happy, but she’ll be tortured to death!”"]},{"number":1336,"title":"Chapter 1336 You Brought This Upon Yourself","paragraphs":["1336 You Brought This Upon Yourself","Xia Lan rushed over and cried. “Dad! Mengyan can’t marry into their family. Let’s discuss it with Madam Tan. There must be a way!”","As she spoke, Xia Lan turned around and looked fiercely at Qiao Xi. Her eyes were bloodshot, and she wished for nothing more than to tear Qiao Xi into pieces. “Qiao Xi! It’s all your fault! Why can’t you marry Young Master Tan? If you could just obediently marry him, this wouldn’t be happening to Mengyan right now! It’s all your fault! You jinx! B*tch! Why aren’t you dead?”","Xia Lan rushed over crazily. Just as her sharp nails were about to touch Qiao Xi, she was kicked a few meters away by Song Shiyu.","“Ah!!” Xia Lan fell heavily to the floor. She felt that all the bones in her body were about to fall apart, and she did not have the strength to stand up.","What happened in the Xia family caused an uproar online. There were even people explaining what had happened to the netizens who had just entered the live stream.","[That’s not right! The Xia family is so arrogant when they speak to Madam Tan. They’re even making so many comments that expose their lack of principles and values. Don’t they know that someone has started a live broadcast?]","[The bodyguard beside Qiao Xi is the one doing the live broadcast. We definitely can’t let the Xia family know! If they find out, there won’t be a live broadcast for us to watch anymore!]","The moment that was said, the live stream instantly fell silent for a few seconds as if they understood something.","Madam Tan looked at Mengyan, who was kneeling on the floor and crying. She shot the bodyguards beside her an impatient look.","Xia Cheng advised softly, “Mengyan, be good and follow Madam Tan to Y Nation today. I promise you that I’ll definitely go to Y Nation to look for you.”","“Ah Cheng!”","“Dad!”","Sumei and Xia Ji shouted.","Xia Cheng glared at them. “Shut up! We’ve already accepted the two billion yuan betrothal gift. We can’t go back on our word now! With the two billion yuan, we can make a comeback. Otherwise, our family will starve. As long as the Xia family regains power, we’ll be able to bring Mengyan back sooner or later.”","Xia Mengyan looked up in despair and said, “Grandpa! I’m the internationally renowned perfumer, Sally! All these years, I’ve brought more than two billion yuan to the Xia family. You...”","Unexpectedly, Grandpa sold her for two billion!","Xia Cheng hurriedly instructed the bodyguards to restrain Xia Ji and Xia Lan. He made the final decision. “Madam Tan, we’ve already signed the contract. You can take her away, but only a portion of the two billion was brought here. Please don’t go back on your word and give the rest to the Xia family as soon as possible.”","“Mengyan, follow Young Master Tan.”","Young Master Tan smiled foolishly and moved his fat body toward Xia Mengyan. “Although this lady isn’t as beautiful as Miss Qiao, she still looks good...”","“Ah!!! I don’t want to!” Xia Mengyan was shocked and moved back crazily.","Qiao Xi was still leaning against the sofa. She glanced at Xia Mengyan and withdrew her gaze.","Gu Zheng rubbed Qiao Xi’s hair affectionately and said softly, “You brought this upon yourself. Xi Xi doesn’t want to see this dirty scene, so let’s go.”","Xia Mengyan struggled to get up and staggered back. She looked at Old Madam Xia pleadingly and screamed, “Grandma! Save me!”","Sumei gritted her teeth and was in a dilemma.","That was two billion! Although her heart ached for her granddaughter, two billion would bring huge benefits to the Xia family. They could still live in a luxury villa and enjoy their beautiful lives as the upper class.","Many people would make the same choice as them. Ai Sumei did not want this to happen either, but someone had to sacrifice for the Xia family. If they refused, not only would they not be able to get the two billion yuan, but they would also offend the Brook family. If that happened, would the Xia family still be able to survive?","Sumei turned her face away mercilessly and did not look at Xia Mengyan. She said helplessly, “Mengyan, I can’t do anything about it! Be good and marry Young Master Tan. After the Xia family survives this crisis, I’ll go to Y Nation to look for you. Your grandfather has put in so much effort to nurture you and the Xia family has given you so many resources. Now that it’s time for you to repay him, you can’t bear to see the Xia family go bankrupt, right?!”","Xia Mengyan cried in despair. Her gentle mask instantly shattered as she roared with a ferocious expression, “No! Ah!!!”","When had the high and mighty eldest daughter of the Xia family ever lost her composure like this? She had always been so arrogant. She had never thought that she would end up like this one day.","She looked up slightly and was heartbroken. “I’m the eldest daughter of the Xia family. Now, you’re selling me for... two billion? You love me, but in the face of money and benefits, I can be sacrificed. Grandma, how could you...”"]},{"number":1337,"title":"Chapter 1337 Raising An Ingrate","paragraphs":["1337 Raising An Ingrate","Before Xia Mengyan could finish, Song Shiyu interrupted her coldly. “Miss Xia, that’s not what you said when you forced Young Madam to marry into the Xia family. You said that it’s an honor to sacrifice for the Xia family. Why are you unwilling now that it’s your turn to marry?","“Our young madam is not a member of the Xia family. She has never received any kindness from the Xia family since she was young, but you, the eldest daughter of the Xia family, have been living in luxury since you were young. You’re doted on and supported by the Xia family. It’s only right for you to sacrifice for the Xia family, right?!","“Moreover, Madam Tan was invited by you. Since you can ask outsiders to sacrifice for the Xia family, why aren’t you willing to sacrifice for the Xia family? Chairman Xia, the granddaughter you spent so much effort to raise is too selfish. The Xia family is about to go bankrupt, but she’s unwilling to sacrifice for the Xia family.","“I heard that Miss Xia grew up by Chairman Xia’s side. In order to nurture Miss Xia, the Xia family spent a lot of time and money, but what happened in the end? They raised an ingrate!”","Hearing Song Shiyu’s words, Xia Cheng’s face darkened. His tone was no longer as gentle as before. “Mengyan! At this point, you have to marry him even if you don’t want to!”","Then, Xia Cheng bent down slightly and said in a low voice, “Mengyan, don’t worry. I’ll take revenge for you. It won’t be long before Qiao Xi goes to accompany you. At that time, she’ll definitely suffer ten times more than you!”","Xia Mengyan burst into tears and cried without caring about her image. She did not want to marry Young Master Tan. She would die! Why did she have to marry him? There must be another way!","Right, she could still seek the help of netizens. Although her reputation was not too good after the incident at New City Mall, she still had a portion of her fans. If she posted this matter online, she would definitely obtain the sympathy of the netizens. Once the matter blew up, Madam Tan would not be able to take her away by force.","Seeing that Xia Mengyan was silent, Xia Cheng thought that she had already accepted her fate and heaved a sigh of relief.","He turned around and could not help but meet Gu Zheng’s eyes. He had clearly planned it out and sent someone to intercept Gu Zheng so that Madam Tan could forcefully take Qiao Xi away. At that time, even if Gu Zheng came, it would be too late.","Even if Gu Zheng had a lot of power in Li City, he could not snatch her from the Brook family. After all, if he went to Y Nation, he might not even be able to come back. Did he have to lose his life for a woman?","He originally thought that this plan would be foolproof, but he did not expect it to end up like this. He had obtained the two billion yuan betrothal gift, but he had lost Mengyan.","Xia Cheng gritted his teeth hatefully. Qiao Xi caused the Xia family to suffer such a loss in silence. Did she think that everything would end just like this? He would absolutely not let the matter rest. When the Xia family regained their power, he had to make Qiao Xi pay the price!","“Chairman Xia, could it be that you’re thinking of making me pay the price when the Xia family regains their power?” Qiao Xi suddenly spoke and chuckled.","The corners of Xia Cheng’s mouth twitched slightly, but he was only absent-minded for a moment before quickly returning to normal. He asked calmly, “So what?”","“Qiao Xi, you’re Gu Zheng’s wife now, so I’m naturally unable to touch you. Gu Zheng likes and dotes on you now, but how can you be sure that he won’t have a change of heart? Even if he has always taken care of you, he can’t be by your side at all times. There’ll always be times when he overlooks things.","“You caused our Xia family to be in pieces. How can we take this lying down?”","Xia Cheng stared fiercely at her. Even if Gu Zheng was present, he did not care in the slightest. Gu Zheng liked her, so he did not hesitate to offend the Brook family to keep her by his side. However, ten years later, when she was old and weak, there would be younger women by Gu Zheng’s side. After all, with Gu Zheng’s net worth and appearance, it was impossible for him to only like Qiao Xi forever.","When Gu Zheng despised her, wouldn’t it be easy for the Xia family to deal with a woman?","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up slightly. “Chairman Xia, you’re quite bold! You actually dare to say such things in front of Gu Zheng. Could it be that you’re not afraid that Gu Zheng will deal with all of you now? Or do you already have a foolproof plan to protect the Xia family?","“Do you think that with the two billion yuan, the Xia family can regain their power? Oh, is it because Xia Mengyan will be marrying into the Brook family, so the Xia family will have the protection of the Brook family? If Gu Zheng wants to deal with you, he’ll first have to get through them, right?”","Xia Cheng was calm. “So what if I am? Is there a problem with that?”"]},{"number":1338,"title":"Chapter 1338 Public Enemy","paragraphs":["1338 Public Enemy","“There’s no problem at all.” The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled into a mocking smile. “If it weren’t for that incident, you could indeed be fearless. Even if you can’t deal with me now, you’ll be able to seize the opportunity one day. However...”","Xia Cheng suddenly gasped, and his heart twitched.","But what? Why did Qiao Xi’s eyes still carry a disdainful smile when she said this? She was just a woman. Why didn’t she have the slightest fear when she heard that someone wanted to take revenge on her?","Qiao Xi blinked and looked at him in surprise. “Chairman Xia, don’t you know what I’m talking about? That’s really too sad.”","!!","What was it?","Due to that incident, he could no longer take revenge on Qiao Xi? What exactly happened that Qiao Xi could be so indifferent?","Xia Cheng frowned. He really did not understand what was going on, but he was inexplicably nervous.","He was indeed unable to attack Qiao Xi now, but he didn’t believe that he wouldn’t have the chance in the future. What right did Qiao Xi have to be so sure that they wouldn’t have the chance to attack?","Qiao Xi looked at Xia Cheng with a smile, then said slowly, “Chairman Xia, I’m sorry to have started a live broadcast without your permission.","“From the moment I entered until now, everything that has happened in the Xia family has been broadcasted live by this reporter beside me. Xia Mengyan scheming to marry me to Young Master Tan, Xia Lan being Xia Mengyan’s biological mother, and the disgusting deal between the Brook family and the Xia family has all been broadcasted!","“Now, everyone knows the Xia family’s ugly side. They know that you’re engaged in human trafficking for money. Who would do business with such a dirty family?”","As Qiao Xi spoke word by word, Xia Cheng’s body became colder and colder. His body gradually stiffened as if he would lose his breath in the next second.","Live broadcast?","Qiao Xi said that the person beside her was doing a live broadcast? No wonder she was so calm from the moment she entered. It turned out that she had already made plans. Even if Gu Zheng did not come, she could still announce all of this to the world.","Even though Xia Cheng was experienced, he could not calm down. The muscles on his face trembled, and his eyes almost popped out. A trace of despair appeared in his eyes.","He originally thought that no one would know that this had happened in the Xia family, so he discussed it with Gu Zheng without any worries and calmly admitted the Xia family’s scandal. Unexpectedly...","“What? Chairman Xia, do you have nothing to say?” Qiao Xi smiled casually. “I’m not a fool. I clearly knew that you had ill intentions, so why would I come to the Xia family unprepared? Chairman Xia, why did you underestimate me so much?”","Xia Cheng’s ears buzzed. He could no longer listen to Qiao Xi. He only knew that she had started a live broadcast. If this was true, it would be impossible for the Xia family to regain their power. The Xia family’s products would be boycotted by everyone, and the Xia family would definitely go bankrupt.","“Qiao Xi!” Xia Cheng spat out this name. This angry roar almost exhausted all his strength.","“I’m not deaf. Please keep your voice down, Chairman Xia.” Qiao Xi looked at him with a smile. “Chairman Xia, you should quickly think of a way to solve the Xia family’s mess!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Xia Cheng’s assistant rushed in with a messy stack of documents.","In this half an hour, the Xia family had become a public enemy. The entire internet was boycotting the Xia family.","This live broadcast was broadcasted on Shen Yu’s account. He had tens of millions of fans, so the effect was naturally extraordinary.","“Chairman Xia, bad news! The company really can’t take it anymore! Miss Xia has also been banned by the entire internet. We originally still had a chance to make a comeback, but now, we don’t have a chance at all!","“Moreover, Xia Corporation has been sued by other companies. Not only do we need to compensate for the breach of contract, but someone has also reported you for human trafficking. I think the police will come to arrest you soon.”","Xia Cheng’s mind instantly exploded, and his chest hurt.","Xia Mengyan, who was hiding in the corner, also took out her phone while trembling. When she saw the curses online, she felt that she could not breathe. Her heart seemed to be clenched tightly by a hand, and she was trembling in pain.","The netizens all said that she was shameless and a b*tch! They wanted her to die. It would be best if she was tortured to death by Tan Yu!","Xia Mengyan’s body turned cold. It was clearly close to summer, but she felt that the weather was cold. She could only cry silently.","“Chairman Xia! Miss Qiao is suing you too!”","Qiao Xi was suing the Xia family for human trafficking. Xia Cheng had personally admitted his crime in the live broadcast, so Qiao Xi would definitely win this lawsuit. Not long after, Xia Cheng would be arrested and sent to jail. He would not have the chance to make a comeback at all."]},{"number":1339,"title":"Chapter 1339 This Is Called Reaping What You Sow","paragraphs":["1339 This Is Called Reaping What You Sow","Xia Cheng’s chest was filled with the smell of blood. “Xi Xi! Xi Xi!”","The Xia family’s living room was silent for a few seconds before it instantly exploded. Only then did Ai Sumei understand what had happened. Even though the Xia family had obtained two billion yuan, it was still impossible for them to regain their power. All of them would be accused of crimes.","Sumei’s face was pale. She had spent a lot of effort seducing Xia Cheng and becoming a rich madam. She thought that she would live so carefreely forever, but she did not expect to face jail in her later years.","No! No!","!!","She suddenly realized her outcome and instantly aged a little. She could not help but cry bitterly. Then, she thought of something and hurriedly shouted at Xia Mengyan, “Mengyan, you schemed against her. It’s all your fault. Quickly apologize to Qiao Xi and ask for her forgiveness.”","If Xia Mengyan had not sent Madam Tan a photo, how could this have happened? The instigator of all this was Xia Mengyan!","Sumei staggered in front of Xia Mengyan and grabbed her arm tightly. She gritted her teeth and said, “You harmed everyone. Hurry up and apologize to Qiao Xi! Your grandfather and I are old, so we absolutely can’t go to jail. Mengyan, you can’t bear to see us suffer in jail, right? Quickly apologize!”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled into a playful smile as she watched Ai Sumei’s crazy actions indifferently. It seemed that the Xia family knew that if they sold her for two billion yuan, they would be despised by the world, but they still insisted on doing it.","They originally thought that this matter would not spread. Even if they did shameless things, it would not be a big deal. In any case, no one would learn about their actions. However, they never expected that after the truth was revealed, everyone’s reputation would plummet. Xia Corporation would be sued, and everyone would be accused.","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes. They clearly knew that they were doing something wrong, yet they still did such a thing. They were not worthy of pity after falling into such a state.","Xia Mengyan was still in a state of collapse. She had completely lost her mind and even felt that this was just a dream. Before long, she would wake up from the nightmare. She stood on the spot with empty eyes. The next second, she was pushed to the floor by Ai Sumei and forced to kneel and apologize.","Sumei was already close to going crazy. She thought about how she had been swallowing her anger and scheming all these years. In the end, not only did she not win against Yin Lianxin, but she even had to go to jail. She had schemed for her entire life, but she actually ended up like this!","She did not want to go to jail! As long as Qiao Xi withdrew the lawsuit, she could continue to stay in the villa as the old madam of the Xia family. It did not matter if the company could not be run. As long as they still had two billion yuan in their hands, it would naturally not be a problem for them to comfortably retire.","Xia Mengyan slowly looked up at her unfamiliar family and closed her eyes in despair.","Her relatives who once doted on her so much first forced her to marry Young Master Tan. Now, they were forcing her to kneel and apologize to Qiao Xi. Why was this? Why were they so heartless?","In just half an hour, everyone was forcing her. Even Xia Lan was unwilling to stand up for her.","She had already cried until she lost all her strength. At this moment, she could only kneel on the floor weakly. Ai Sumei grabbed her hair and forced her to kowtow to Qiao Xi.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","Xia Mengyan’s head slammed heavily onto the floor, and her forehead turned red. However, Ai Sumei did not pity her in the slightest. Instead, she looked at Qiao Xi with anticipation and said agitatedly, “Miss... Miss Qiao, she already knows her mistake. She even kowtowed to you and apologized. Please forgive us and quickly withdraw the lawsuit!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were cold as she turned her head to look at Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with gentleness. His warm palm landed in front of her eyes, blocking this unbearable scene. He took the opportunity to pull her into his arms. A gentle voice came from his chest. “You must be tired. Let’s go.”","She nodded obediently and followed him out of the door. She had just taken a few steps when she heard Ai Sumei’s broken roar behind her. Then, she beat and scolded Xia Mengyan crazily. Xia Mengyan’s sharp cries echoed throughout the villa.","“This is called reaping what you sow.” Song Shiyu looked disdainful without a trace of sympathy.","Madam Tan’s gloomy gaze landed on Qiao Xi’s back. She really did not expect that this young woman would actually easily destroy the Xia family and even use some small methods to make them fight.","She had underestimated Qiao Xi this time. She had miscalculated. However, she would absolutely not let Qiao Xi off just like that. Sooner or later, she would send Qiao Xi to her son’s bed!","Suddenly, Madam Tan’s assistant rushed over with an anxious expression. “Madam, there’s a call from home.”"]},{"number":1340,"title":"Chapter 1340 Don’t Be Too Happy","paragraphs":["1340 Don’t Be Too Happy","Madam Tan took a few steps forward, and the assistant hurriedly handed the phone to her. She hesitated for a few seconds, but in the end, she took the phone with a gloomy expression and put it to her ear.","Qiao Xi, who had walked to the door, turned around slightly and saw Madam Tan’s face getting darker and darker. However, Madam Tan immediately suppressed her anger and said obsequiously, “You’re thinking too much. This is just a small matter. I’ll handle it well. I won’t tarnish the Brook family’s reputation.”","The other party seemed to be very dissatisfied. Madam Tan had to coax them in a low voice. After hanging up, anger instantly surged to the top of her head as she slammed the phone on the floor.","The surrounding people were so scared that their bodies trembled. They all lowered their heads and did not dare to make a sound.","Qiao Xi was not in a rush to leave. Instead, she turned around and glanced at Madam Tan with a smile.","Madam Tan’s eyes were cold. “Miss Qiao, don’t be happy too soon. There’s still time. Until the last moment, we’ll never know who the final winner is.”","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. “I think it’s safe to say that I’ll be the final winner.”","“Heh! Alright! We’ll see!” With that, Madam Tan glanced coldly at Gu Zheng before leaving angrily with the bodyguards. Xia Mengyan, who was about to break down and roar, was taken away as well.","Qiao Xi looked coldly at the Xia family. Xia Cheng and Ai Sumei were sitting on the floor in a sorry state. Xia Ji and Xia Lan were leaning against each other, but their eyes were empty and their faces were dispirited.","She frowned and asked, “Where’s Madam Su Nian?”","Then, she fell into deep thought. Since Su Nian had already provided the video, she would definitely not return to the Xia family. After all, the Xia family would not let Su Nian off easily.","Xia Cheng looked fiercely at Qiao Xi’s and Gu Zheng’s backs, his heart filled with anger and unwillingness. Could it be that the Xia family was completely doomed?","He really did not understand. Although the Xia family was not strong, they were still a noble family in Shengdu. He had been in high society for so many years. How did he end up like this overnight?","What puzzled him even more was that he and the Brook family had joined forces to deal with Gu Zheng. Even if Gu Zheng had already made arrangements, how could he have expected the Brook family to be present? How did he quickly escape the interception of the two families?","There was only one possibility—the Yin family was involved!","Xia Cheng felt a dull pain in his chest and suddenly spat out a mouthful of blood. It was the Yin family...","Yin Lianxin had stepped down from managing the family a few years ago. She only drank tea and planted flowers now. She lived a comfortable life in retirement, so the only person who could help Gu Zheng was Yin Yunyi!","Xia Cheng’s heart ached even more. He even felt that it was very laughable. It turned out that the person who caused the downfall of the Xia family was actually his biological son. His son had helped Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi destroy his life’s hard work.","On the other hand, Qiao Xi had just walked out of the Xia family when she saw Gu Yao and Yin Jingting at the door.","Gu Yao quickly walked forward and asked anxiously, “Is everything settled? Before you came out, Madam Tan was angry and brought Xia Mengyan into the car. She even glared at me fiercely, scaring me so much that my heart thumped. She looks like a tigress. Her assistant seemed to want to say something, but he didn’t say anything after seeing Young Master Yin.”","Qiao Xi could not help but look at Yin Jingting.","Yin Jingting was silent for a few seconds before asking softly, “Xi Xi, do you know Madam Tan?”","“We just met today,” Qiao Xi replied.","Yin Jingting said thoughtfully, “Looks like Xia Mengyan shot herself in the foot. Actually, the Brook family has a very good reputation in Y Nation. Every noble cherishes their reputation very much. They don’t want their reputations to be ruined. I reckon Madam Tan will be punished by the family when she returns to the country. This is probably where her ill intentions toward you came from. However, you’d better be careful. I don’t think she’ll let the matter rest.”","Was that all?","Qiao Xi pursed her lips, and Yin Jingting continued, “Young Master Tan has a great reputation. Previously, Madam Tan had also tried to snatch women by force. However, this is the first time she came to Li City from Y Nation to snatch someone. Perhaps it’s just because Young Master Tan really likes you.”","“Just because Tan Yu likes me?” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows, and dense disgust appeared in her eyes. It was really unlucky to be liked by such a man.","Yin Jingting replied, “I’m not sure yet, but it’s not a good thing that you’ve offended the Brook family. You should be more vigilant.”","Qiao Xi nodded and frowned slightly. The Brook family had nothing to do with Gu Zheng and her. It was the first time they met. They probably did not have any grudges against each other, so was it really just because Young Master Tan liked her?"]},{"number":1341,"title":"Chapter 1341 The Secret Of A Large Family","paragraphs":["1341 The Secret Of A Large Family","Qiao Xi fell into deep thought. Although Madam Tan had a bad temper, she was not a brainless person. Could it be that for the sake of satisfying her son’s desires, she was willing to spend two billion to get a woman for her son?","...","Longwan Residential.","After Gu Yao and Yin Jingting left, Qiao Xi looked up at Gu Zheng. “What are you thinking about? Why aren’t you saying anything?”","The man looked up slightly, and a cold glint flashed across his eyes. “Are you thinking of the Brook family?”","“Brother Jingting said that the Brook family has a good reputation in Y Nation. I’ve also investigated this family. That seems to be the case, but why would a family that values their reputation so much tolerate Tan Yu snatching women and torturing them to death?","“Moreover, it’s not a secret that Tan Yu has killed women. Why is the Brook family protecting this idiot? How can their reputation in Y Nation be good if they’re allowing Tan Yu to commit murder like this?”","Gu Zheng nodded and looked at her with his light brown eyes, listening to her.","“Don’t you think that the Brook family is very similar to He Weinian? They have a good reputation, but they’ve done many bad things behind the scenes. Tan Yu is only fearless because of his family’s power.","“A large family like theirs has such shameful secrets, so it’s naturally not easy to investigate. Perhaps their family’s reputation is really good, but there are exceptions like Tan Yu and Madam Tan. However, it’s also possible that they’re hiding some secrets. When Madam Tan suddenly came to Li City...”","As Gu Zheng spoke, the corners of his mouth curled into a mocking smile. “It’s probably because something happened that made her feel afraid, so she had no choice but to come.”","Afraid? What could make Madam Tan afraid?","After the two of them finished speaking, Gu Zheng went upstairs to take a shower. Qiao Xi continued thinking for a moment in the living room, but she still had no clue.","...","Three days later, in Y Nation.","Tan Yu’s fat body leaned against the sofa, and the muscles on his face trembled slightly. He said hatefully, “B*tch! She caused me to be punished by the head of the family!”","Madam Tan sat elegantly on the chaise longue and glanced at Tan Yu indifferently. “I told you a long time ago that you’re the young master of the Brook family. Even if you’re not the young master of the direct line of descent, you still have a noble status. Don’t always say those dirty words to make others think that you’re very uneducated.”","Madam Tan’s tone was gentle. Be it her actions or words, she was so elegant. Those who did not know better would think that she was an elegant and beautiful noblewoman, but those who knew her knew how vicious and unbearable she was.","The next second, the corners of her mouth revealed a vicious smile. “I underestimated Qiao Xi, so I was tricked by her. However, she won’t be so lucky in the future. She used a live broadcast to force us to leave Li City and caused us to be punished. Her methods are indeed brilliant, but unfortunately, they’re almost used up.","“She’s just a 20-year-old girl. She’s just a little scheming. She’s merely relying on her status as Gu Zheng’s wife, yet she actually dares to be so arrogant and mock me in public. I want her to know the consequences of offending me.”","Madam Tan spoke calmly as if she was talking about a small matter, then she sighed helplessly. “Unfortunately, Qiao Xi wasn’t able to marry you. It’ll be a good thing if she’s able to become a member of the Brook family. Perhaps those two people will be afraid of the Brook family’s power and won’t attack her.”","When Tan Yu heard this, his eyes widened. “Who are those two people?”","Madam Tan smiled lightly. “They’re not big shots. Of course, their power is inferior to our family’s, but they’re also the heirs of noble families in Y Nation. I really don’t know how Miss Qiao offended this group of people. A socialite even looked for me and asked me to think of a way to bring Qiao Xi back to Y Nation. She said it’s best if she marries you.”","Actually, Madam Tan knew her son very well. That socialite raised such thoughts because she wanted to push Qiao Xi into a fire pit. Hence, that socialite definitely had a grudge against Qiao Xi.","Of course, she was willing to give that socialite some face. Coincidentally, Xia Mengyan sent Qiao Xi’s photo over. Her son liked Qiao Xi, so Madam Tan went to Li City.","“A 20-year-old girl has silently offended so many people. Looks like she’ll end up very miserable even without me doing anything.”","Madam Tan smiled sinisterly with a trace of disdain. “But since she knows that noble socialite, perhaps Qiao Xi’s identity can’t be underestimated!”"]},{"number":1342,"title":"Chapter 1342 Never Meet Again","paragraphs":["1342 Never Meet Again","“I think Miss Kang wants to deal with Qiao Xi because Qiao Xi’s appearance threatens her status or benefits. To be able to threaten a noble socialite, it’s naturally impossible for Qiao Xi to be just an ordinary person.”","Tan Yu was confused, but Madam Tan did not explain further.","Madam Tan lowered her eyes, and her gaze suddenly turned cold. “I don’t care if Qiao Xi is dead or alive or who she has grudges against, but if Gu Zheng dares to come back, I’ll absolutely not let him off!”","On the other hand, Qiao Xi had finished her work and returned to Longwan Residential. She lay comfortably on the rocking chair in the backyard.","!!","Luo Qing jumped down from the wall, landing lightly beside her. “Xi Xi, you’ve been very independent since you were young. You rarely tell us about your private matters, so I’m not too sure if you left five or six years ago.”","Qiao Xi had long known that this would be the outcome, and she wasn’t surprised at all. She casually waved her hand and said, “Second Brother, is such a small matter worth you making a trip over? I just had a dream. Even though it’s very realistic, there’s no need to take it so seriously. I just really want to know who the man in my dream is.”","Luo Qing lowered his eyes and looked at Qiao Xi, who was lying on the rocking chair. Her skin was porcelain-white, and her eyes were sleepy. She was like a lazy kitten, cute and charming. His gaze was gentle like water as he said softly, “Since you can’t find out, don’t look for trouble.”","His long and slightly cold fingers landed on her cheek and gently stroked it. Luo Qing bent down slightly, his breaths clear. “Xi Xi, I didn’t manage to find the man in your dream, but there’s someone you should still remember.”","“Who is it?” Qiao Xi raised her eyes slightly, her eyes sparkling.","Luo Qing was slightly hesitant. “The person Qiao Zhenguo met when he sent you to the countryside.”","Qiao Xi’s expression changed. She knew who the person Luo Qing was talking about was.","“At that time, you knew him too. He was also abandoned by his family and sent to the countryside. You and he—”","“It’s all in the past.” Qiao Xi’s expression was slightly unnatural as she interrupted Luo Qing. The lazy kitten from before was instantly on guard. Qiao Xi’s face darkened as she said, “Don’t mention him.”","“Xi Xi.” Luo Qing said anxiously, “Grandpa brought him up the mountain with him, but I didn’t expect him to do such a thing. You almost gave up studying medicine because of this. I know you’ve never forgotten him!”","Qiao Xi frowned and said in an unhappy tone, “I already said not to mention him! At that time, he deceived me into joining the Huo family for the sake of using me. After that, he wanted to deceive Grandpa’s medical skills. After his final goal was exposed, he almost caused Grandpa’s death. Why should I remember such a heartless ingrate?”","A trace of sorrow appeared between Luo Qing’s brows. He probably wanted to comfort Qiao Xi, so he tried his best to make his tone gentle. “Xi Xi, I’ve investigated him and found some clues.”","Qiao Xi already hated that man to the core and did not want to hear any news about him.","After a moment of silence, Luo Qing said with cold eyes, “After you left the Huo family, he looked for you everywhere. When he couldn’t find you, he left behind a letter.”","Qiao Xi silently rolled her eyes and felt extremely disdainful in her heart.","“Back then, Grandpa didn’t blame him. He just said that he wouldn’t see him again. I thought that we wouldn’t meet again, so I didn’t settle the score with him. However... the people from Ling Pavilion found out that after he left Li City, he went to Y Nation.”","When Qiao Xi heard the mention of Y Nation, her eyes instantly widened as she abruptly looked at Luo Qing.","“Now, he has already become a pivotal figure in the Brook family. His surname is still Huo, and he hasn’t changed his name to Brook or Tan. However, he’s managed to obtain the respect of the Brook family.”","Qiao Xi’s body stiffened as if she was unable to accept this fact.","Luo Qing’s tone was cold. “If he’s not from the Brook family, it’s almost impossible for him to sit in this position in just a few years.”","Qiao Xi’s breathing trembled slightly as she said with difficulty, “In that case, is he from the Brook family?”","Luo Qing nodded, but Qiao Xi suddenly smiled. Originally, she had always thought that she had no grudge against Madam Tan. Now, it seemed that she had accumulated grudges with the Brook family for a long time.","She and that man should never meet again, but who knew that the Brook family would insist on provoking her? Could it be that they would meet again soon?","“Xi Xi.” Luo Qing asked tentatively, “Is the man in your dream him?”"]},{"number":1343,"title":"Chapter 1343 A Trouble Lasts For A Thousand Years","paragraphs":["1343 A Trouble Lasts For A Thousand Years","Qiao Xi shook her head without the slightest hesitation. “Impossible! I hated him to the bone a long time ago, so how could I have told him my secret? Moreover, I remember that the man in my dream wanted to take my blood for a girl who was about to die from illness.","“But that man only has that disgusting two-faced b*tch by his side. That two-faced b*tch is very healthy and will live for a thousand years. That scumbag and b*tch definitely won’t die so early!”","Luo Qing: “...”","Xi Xi was also very cute when she scolded others!","!!","His eyes were only gentle for a moment before they suddenly turned cold. That man probably wouldn’t know Xi Xi’s secret, so who was the man in Xi Xi’s dream?","Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “The Brook family...”","It seemed that she did have a grudge against the Brook family. Back then, she had beaten that man up fiercely and swore never to see him again. If they met again, they would definitely be enemies!","Qiao Xi looked as if she had come to a sudden understanding. “I was wondering why Madam Tan came all the way to Li City just to offer the betrothal gifts. It turns out that she really has a grudge against me!”","“Heh!” Qiao Xi smiled coldly. “Coming all the way to Li City and spending two billion in betrothal gifts. She’s really rich!”","The emotions in Luo Qing’s cold eyes were very calm, but the emotions in his heart were surging. Would that man really spend two billion to target Qiao Xi? Would he even force Qiao Xi to marry Tan Yu?","Although Xi Xi had a grudge against that man, he did not believe that man would treat Xi Xi like this.","The coldness in Luo Qing’s eyes gradually melted. He bent down slightly with a gentle expression and reached out to stroke her soft hair with his warm hand. “The Brook family has lost their reputation and won’t be making a move for the time being. Even if they come, I’ll protect you.”","Qiao Xi nodded. She was not afraid of the Brook family, but she was curious about what that man would do to her next.","...","In Y Nation, the Brook family.","A maid went forward and asked respectfully, “Madam, how should we settle the young miss from Li City?”","Madam Tan was stunned for a few seconds before remembering that they had brought Xia Mengyan back. She was just a substitute, so she naturally did not take Xia Mengyan seriously. She waved her hand casually. “Wash her up and send her to Young Master’s courtyard.”","Xia Mengyan was just an abandoned child who caused her to lose her dignity in public. She cried all the way here. Madam Tan felt annoyed just looking at Xia Mengyan.","The maid received the order and walked out.","On the other hand, Tan Yu still did not realize the hidden calamity and was still unwilling to give up. “Qiao Xi is so good-looking! Her looks and figure are simply top-notch! Now, we’ve exchanged two billion for such a piece of trash. We’ve suffered a huge loss!”","Xia Mengyan was wearing a thin white dress. She sat on the carpet with her head lowered. She was trembling. Actually, she also wanted to stand up, but when she was showering, the maid gave her a pill. She lost all her strength and could only be at the mercy of others.","Tan Yu was just as the rumors said. He was a demon. He liked to abuse women. Xia Mengyan’s fair and delicate skin was covered in injuries. From the day she arrived in Y Nation, she had been tortured crazily by Tan Yu as if he was venting his anger.","Back then, when Xia Mengyan sent Madam Tan the photo, she did not expect that these torture methods would be used on her. She could not help but cry, but she did not dare to make a sound.","Tan Yu frowned, and his fat face was filled with displeasure. “Shut up! If you cry again, I’ll beat you to death! If it weren’t for Qiao Xi being unwilling to marry me, do you think I would have married you? Why don’t you look in the mirror and see if you’re worth two billion?”","Madam Tan walked in elegantly and glanced indifferently at Xia Mengyan, who was on the floor. She advised softly, “Son, don’t be angry. The head of the family has just punished us. We can’t attack for the time being. Anyway, Qiao Xi is in Li City. She can’t run away. There’s no rush.","“Sooner or later, I’ll send her to your side.”","Madam Tan smiled confidently, sweeping away the depression in Tan Yu’s heart.","Yes! Qiao Xi was in Li City now. They would attack after the limelight was over. At that time, Qiao Xi would still be his woman! He was the young master of the Brook family, so he could have any woman he wanted.","Unfortunately, he had been thinking about it for so long but only got Xia Mengyan in the end. His gaze landed on Xia Mengyan, and it gradually became wretched and lustful.","Xia Mengyan shook her head in horror as tears streamed down her face. “No! No...”","“It’s your blessing to be able to obtain my love. Why are you crying? If you want to blame someone, blame Qiao Xi! If she obediently came back with me, you wouldn’t have taken her place. But I’ll get her sooner or later. At that time, I’ll let her have a taste of my methods. Hahaha...”"]},{"number":1344,"title":"Chapter 1344 Came For A Woman","paragraphs":["1344 Came For A Woman","“Young Master!”","Just as Tan Yu was fantasizing about how to torture Qiao Xi, a servant hurriedly barged in and said in a panic, “Young Master, bad news! M-Mr. Huo is here!”","Tan Yu’s body instantly stiffened, and his eyes were filled with panic. Madam Tan, who was at the side, also frowned.","After a few seconds of silence, Tan Yu suddenly stood up and frowned indignantly. “So what if he’s here? What does it have to do with him that I dote on women? I’m from the Brook family—”","!!","“Young Master Tan.”","Before Tan Yu could finish, a dignified and low voice came from the door. Then, a tall, gentle-looking, and handsome man walked in.","He looked to be in his 20s and exuded a gentle aura. There was even a faint smile on his lips. Such a gentleman should be unguarded.","However, in the next second, his eyes suddenly turned cold, and the smile on his face made one shudder.","Tan Yu’s fat body trembled. He mustered his courage. “W-Why are you here?”","Mr. Huo’s eyes flickered as he sat elegantly on the chair in front of Tan Yu. He ordered, “Young Master Tan, I’m sorry to inform you that from now on, you can’t leave Brook Castle for two months.”","He looked up slightly. Even though he was sitting, his aura was still several times stronger than Tan Yu’s. “If you don’t listen to my advice, don’t blame me for being heartless.”","Tan Yu was so scared that his body trembled as he fell onto the chair behind him.","Madam Tan’s heart trembled, but she still retorted calmly, “Mr. Huo, you’re just an outsider, while Lil’ Yu is the young master of the Brook family. What right do you have to threaten him?”","When Mr. Huo heard this, he sneered. “Madam Tan, you and Young Master Tan tarnished the reputation of the Brook family this time and almost broke the law. It was the head of the family who protected you. Otherwise, do you think you could have returned to Y Nation so easily?","“What right do you think you have to talk to me like this? Just based on your title as Madam Brook?”","Madam Tan’s face turned pale, and her lips trembled slightly.","A trace of coldness flashed past Mr. Huo’s eyes. “Madam Tan, you used two billion yuan to snatch a commoner’s daughter and made the Brook family so embarrassed. You did so many stupid things. In the end, the head of the family is only punishing you and Young Master Tan by grounding you for two months and suspending your positions in the company. On the account of your past relationship, the head of the family is already soft-hearted enough not to expel you from the family, but you seem to be very unconvinced.”","A trace of horror appeared on Madam Tan’s usually elegant face. She explained loudly, “You must have exaggerated something in front of the head of the family, and that’s why the head of the family is punishing us like this! We’re from the Brook family, but you’re just an outsider. Why should we listen to you?”","“My surname isn’t Tan or Brook, but I’m already in charge of nearly half of the Brook family’s power. I don’t have to say anything in front of the head of the family. Even if the head of the family doesn’t say anything, I have the right and ability to punish you.”","Mr. Huo glanced at the two of them coldly as if they were a pile of trash. He chuckled and stood up to walk to the door.","Looking at his tall back view, Madam Tan was still unconvinced. “Aren’t you only concerned about the company? Lil’ Yu committed so many crimes in the past, but you’ve never punished him. We only went to Li City to snatch someone this time. Although we caused the Brook family to lose their dignity, you’ve never minded such things.”","All these years, there had been many incidents of Tan Yu snatching women by force. He caused the death of those women, and the Brook family always suppressed those news. This man had never minded either. Now, they were actually grounded and suspended because of such a small matter?","Madam Tan knew very well that the head of the family admired Mr. Huo very much. Now that the head of the family was old, Mr. Huo must have asked the head of the family to strip her of her position by making use of the incident this time. He just wanted full control over the Brook!","Mr. Huo stopped in his tracks and turned around slightly with a gentle smile. “Heh! Madam Tan, you’re quite smart. You actually guessed correctly.”","Madam Tan looked at his smile, and fear swept through her body. She had never wanted to be enemies with Mr. Huo, but she did not understand how her trip to Li City had angered him.","He had never paid attention to such small matters. Why did he come over personally to warn them today?","Madam Tan racked her brains to think. Suddenly, a figure appeared in her mind. She asked tentatively, “Y-You’re doing this for that woman?”","Mr. Huo’s expression changed slightly."]},{"number":1345,"title":"Chapter 1345 You’re Only Half Right","paragraphs":["1345 You’re Only Half Right","At this moment, Xia Mengyan, who was sitting on the floor, suddenly looked up. A trace of hope lit up in her eyes. The noble and elegant man in front of her had grounded Madam Tan and Tan Yu for a woman.","The Brook family was powerful, but Mr. Huo’s status was extraordinary. He could represent the head of the family to punish Madam Tan and Young Master Tan. Not only that, but he was also handsome. To Xia Mengyan, who was in despair, Mr. Huo was like a ray of light. He was her only hope.","Who was the woman Madam Tan was talking about? Could it be that Mr. Huo was here for her? After all, she was the woman who was snatched back by Tan Yu and was even tortured by him for a few days.","At first, Madam Tan thought that it was Xia Mengyan. After all, Xia Mengyan was the eldest daughter of the Xia family. It was reasonable for her to know the young master of the Huo family.","Back then, Mr. Huo came to the Brook family as a doctor and treated the head of the family’s chronic illness. He slowly obtained the trust of the head of the family. The head of the family had investigated him, but he did not care about his past. He still handed the family’s matters to him to manage.","Could it be that the woman in Mr. Huo’s heart was Xia Mengyan?","Madam Tan looked at the injuries on Xia Mengyan’s body and almost fainted.","Xia Mengyan was weak all over, so she moved toward the door with difficulty. She was crying while wearing a pure white lace dress. She looked pitiful.","“S-Sir, please take me away! Tan Yu is a bastard. He... He’ll torture me to death! Sir...”","Xia Mengyan naively thought that Mr. Huo must know that the person Tan Yu snatched back was her, so he specially came to save her. Her eyes were filled with hope.","Mr. Huo glanced at the woman lying on the floor, then at Madam Tan. His gaze was playful.","Madam Tan only felt her body turn cold. She stood up stiffly and untied the rope around Xia Mengyan’s feet while trembling. She explained in a panic, “Mr. Huo, I’m sorry. I didn’t know that Miss Xia and you...”","She really could not believe why Mr. Huo would like a woman like Xia Mengyan. Xia Mengyan had sent her Qiao Xi’s photo because she wanted Qiao Xi’s blood on the hands of another.","In the past few years, Mr. Huo had looked down on so many women who were interested in him. She thought that he had extremely high standards, but she did not expect him to like Xia Mengyan.","“Madam Tan, I just praised you for being smart, but it turns out you’re only half right.”","Mr. Huo’s tone was indifferent as he glanced at Xia Mengyan in disgust. “I’m sorry, but I don’t know this woman at all. The woman in my heart is—”","It was not Xia Mengyan?","Madam Tan was stunned for a few seconds before she suddenly thought of another possibility.","Mr. Huo said word by word, “Madam Tan, this is just a small warning. If you dare to hurt Qiao Xi again in the future, you’ll have to bear the consequences!”","He was actually here for Qiao Xi!","Madam Tan suppressed her anger. No matter how capable Mr. Huo was, he was just an outsider. What right did he have to interfere in their family matters? He even dared to threaten her?","“Huo Yuzhou! For a woman, you actually—”","Before she could finish, Huo Yuzhou grabbed Madam Tan’s neck. His long fingers instantly tightened. Madam Tan’s face turned red as she struggled helplessly.","Huo Yuzhou let go of her in disdain. Madam Tan fell to the floor weakly and coughed uncontrollably. She could feel the crazy killing intent in Huo Yuzhou’s eyes just now.","He really wanted to kill her!","“Madam Tan, although you’re the madam of the Brook family, you can’t defeat me. On the account of the patriarch, I can let you off this time, but if I find out that you attacked Qiao Xi again, I’ll let you know what it means to wish you were dead!”","Huo Yuzhou’s casual words scared Madam Tan so much that her red face instantly turned pale.","Xia Mengyan, who had originally ignited hope, fell into despair again. She looked at the man in front of her with teary eyes. She never expected that this man actually came for Qiao Xi.","At this moment, Madam Tan had long lost her arrogance. She said while trembling, “Mr. Huo, then Miss Xia...”","If Huo Yuzhou was here for Qiao Xi, then she would not dare to keep Xia Mengyan by her side. She might as well give her to Huo Yuzhou as a gift to please him.","Xia Mengyan wiped her tears and looked at the man pitifully. As long as he said a word, she would be saved.","After a few seconds of silence, the man chuckled and asked indifferently, “Madam Tan, do you think I have bad taste? I’ll leave such goods to Young Master Tan to enjoy.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he left mercilessly without even looking at Xia Mengyan.","Xia Mengyan lay on the floor in despair, her eyes gradually losing light..."]},{"number":1346,"title":"Chapter 1346 Don’t Call Her Mrs. Gu","paragraphs":["1346 Don’t Call Her Mrs. Gu","The next day, at Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi looked at the gorgeous jewelry box on the table and could not help but tsk. “Where did Gu Zheng squander his money this time? He bought such expensive jewelry? My room is almost brimming with jewelry, so why is he still buying such things?!”","Song Shiyu’s expression was subtle. “Well...”","Qiao Xi took out a diamond necklace from the jewelry box and felt that her eyes were dazed by the light of the diamond. She frowned. “I’m asking you a question!”","!!","Song Shiyu opened his mouth, not knowing where to start.","Song Shijing came forward to explain, “Young Madam, the president didn’t buy this piece of jewelry. It’s an apology gift from the Brook family.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and was slightly surprised. “Didn’t the Brook family send someone over to apologize and deliver the gifts long ago? Why are they giving more gifts?”","“The person who came to deliver the gift said that this is an apology gift from the head of the Brook family to Young Madam. He even specially reminded Young Madam that he chose it for you himself. He hopes you’ll like it.” Song Shijing thought that the other party’s words were a little strange.","Song Shiyu pursed his lips. “I heard that the head of the Brook family is an old man. Would he personally choose a gift for Young Madam? He must have instructed his subordinates to buy it, but the subordinates have good taste.”","Song Shijing thought that it made sense. “The Brook family is indeed very powerful. They’re a top noble family in Y Nation, so even if Madam Tan offended Young Madam, the head of the family wouldn’t personally choose a gift for Young Madam. A subordinate of his must have chosen it. They’re just saying that to express their sincerity in apologizing.”","Qiao Xi put down the necklace and suddenly curled the corners of her mouth. Just because they said it was the head of the Brook family did not mean that it was the head of the family, right?","There were two people in charge of the Brook family now. Almost half of the power was in that man’s hands.","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly, and she was silent for a short while. “Since the Brook family has already apologized, we have no reason to accept such expensive jewelry. Immediately get someone to send it back.”","Song Shiyu nodded hurriedly. “I think so too! Even if the head of the Brook family is an old man, he’s still a man! They’ve already apologized, yet they still gave you such a valuable gift. It’s obvious that they have ill intentions! If outsiders find out, they’ll think that you’re related to that old man! How shameless of him!”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. That man was indeed very shameless!","At this moment, she felt that Madam Tan’s sudden attack was not because of that man. Madam Tan seemed to be targeting Gu Zheng. What grudge did she have against Gu Zheng?","Qiao Xi suddenly felt slightly tired. She had yet to figure out who the man in her dream was when the Brook family came looking for her. There seemed to be too many unsolved mysteries.","“Return everything the Brook family sends over in the future!” Qiao Xi instructed coldly.","Song Shiyu and Song Shijing nodded. Suddenly, their phones rang. They said quickly, “Young Madam, the president is flying to Y Nation for a meeting tonight. Are you going too?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. Y Nation? Was Gu Zheng really going to a meeting?","...","At this moment, in Y Nation.","“Sir, the gift that was sent to Li City has been returned,” the assistant said respectfully, his heart trembling.","“Mhm.” Huo Yuzhou was reviewing documents. He paused for a moment and quickly returned to normal.","After a moment of silence, the assistant added, “However, Mrs. Gu accepted the apology gift from the Brooke family. She... only returned the piece of jewelry you personally chose.”","Bang!","The glass cup on the table fell to the floor, and the shards scattered all over the floor. The veins on his arms were about to pop out.","Huo Yuzhou’s tone was cold. “I remember telling you not to call her Mrs. Gu.”","“M-Miss Qiao returned your gift and even instructed everyone to return everything the Brook family sends in the future,” the assistant said while trembling. A layer of cold sweat broke out on his back.","Huo Yuzhou’s eyes were still cold, but the corners of his mouth curled into a smile. “Looks like she knows that I gave it to her.”","“Also...” The assistant continued, “Gu Zheng is coming to Y Nation for a meeting. He’s flying tonight and will be here tomorrow morning. I heard that Miss Qiao will be coming too.”","Huo Yuzhou’s eyes flickered. “Will she come too? It’s been so long since we last met. What should I give her?”","The next day, in Y Nation.","Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi got off the plane and looked at the crowd of people who came to pick them up. They chuckled and said, “Xi Xi, I already said that I came to Y Nation for work.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. Was it really work?","The Brook family was in Y Nation, and Gu Zheng happened to come here for a meeting. Was it really such a coincidence? She kept having the feeling that something was wrong with this meeting. It seemed to have been specially arranged."]},{"number":1347,"title":"Chapter 1347 Learn From One’s Misfortune","paragraphs":["1347 Learn From One’s Misfortune","Qiao Xi looked at the group of people in front of her who were here to pick her up and was stunned for a moment. Then, she followed Gu Zheng through the special passage.","Gu Zheng smiled warmly and said in a clear voice, “Xi Xi, what are you doing in Y Nation?”","Qiao Xi instantly choked. Gu Zheng said slowly, “Liuli doesn’t seem to have any activities or projects that require you to personally come to Y Nation recently. Moreover, you’ve never collaborated with Y Nation. What matters require the presence of the chief designer?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","She said self-righteously, “Ah Zheng, of course, I’m here to accompany you! It’s not safe for a man like you to be outside. Is there a problem with me accompanying you?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with gentleness as he smiled like a fox.","Qiao Xi gulped and looked away. She did not know what grudge Gu Zheng had against the Brook family for the time being, nor did she know the motive behind the Brook family’s actions. She came this time to unravel these mysteries.","“President Gu.” The person who picked him up asked respectfully, “Are you going to the hotel now?”","“Xi Xi, do you want to rest?” Gu Zheng turned his head gently to ask the person beside him.","Qiao Xi nodded, and Gu Zheng instructed, “Song Shiyu, prepare the documents for the meeting in the afternoon.”","Song Shiyu: “...”","He looked at Song Shijing in a complicated manner, his eyes filled with helplessness. The president was not here for a meeting at all, nor did he have to attend any meetings. What materials did he have to prepare?","When everyone arrived at the hotel, they had a simple meal. Gu Zheng and Song Shijing left the hotel, saying that they were going to Gu Corporation’s Y Nation branch company for a meeting.","Qiao Xi stayed in the suite alone and was about to catch up on sleep when there was a sudden knock on the door. She stood up and walked to the door. The person outside was still knocking rhythmically.","The person’s tone was respectful and gentle. “Miss Qiao, I’m sorry to disturb you. Our master has something to give you.”","She frowned, her face filled with confusion. Who was their master?","She only seemed to know Lu Zhi in Y Nation, but if Lu Zhi was looking for her, he would have called in advance and not rashly come. Just as Qiao Xi was about to refuse, she suddenly thought of someone.","She did know someone in Y Nation. That man had a long-standing grudge against her!","The other party seemed to know that she was in the suite and said respectfully again, “Miss Qiao, Sir knows you well. He knows that you’re unwilling to see him. He said that you love and hate him deeply. He believes you still have him in your heart, and that’s why you’re unwilling to forgive him.”","Qiao Xi grunted coldly. Look at what he was saying. Did that man mean to say that if she did not open the door, it was because she still had him in her heart?","That man had always been able to easily manipulate people’s hearts. After hesitating for a moment, Qiao Xi felt that she could not be too polite to him, so she directly pressed the button for room service in the hotel. Not long after, staff and security guards arrived at the door of the suite.","Qiao Xi heard footsteps outside the door. She said, “I don’t know the person outside. I don’t know why he’s knocking on my door. Please take him away.”","When the person saw the staff and security guards outside the door, he said unhurriedly, “Miss Qiao, it’s okay if you don’t open the door. Our master has already expected this. He has sent you many emails and letters over the years, but you didn’t reply to any of them. Is it because you don’t dare to interact with him anymore?”","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly. This person’s temper was really the same as Huo Yuzhou’s. He was about to be chased away, but he did not panic in the slightest and was still provoking her.","After he finished speaking and saw that Qiao Xi still had no reaction, the person could only leave first. After a moment, Qiao Xi opened the door and saw a bouquet of pink tulips at the door with some white lilies around them.","The flower language of tulips was eternal love, while lilies signified a happy return. Huo Yuzhou’s meaning was already very obvious.","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and glanced coldly at the bouquet of flowers before closing the door heavily. It was this man who used her to learn medicine and almost burned down the library.","Did he think that a bouquet of flowers, jewelry, and some ambiguous words could make her fall for him? She was no longer the innocent young lady she used to be. After suffering a loss from this man, she learned her lesson. Naturally, she would not believe his clumsy flattery.","...","In the study of the Brook family.","“Sir, Miss Qiao didn’t open the door or accept your gift,” the assistant reported respectfully.","Huo Yuzhou’s fingers were long and well-defined. He was tapping the table lightly. His expression did not change when he heard this, and he only nodded.","“That bouquet of flowers was left at the door. Later on, the hotel staff thought that they had sent it to the wrong place, so they brought it to the front desk.”"]},{"number":1348,"title":"Chapter 1348 Between Gu Zheng And Me, Who’s Better?","paragraphs":["1348 Between Gu Zheng And Me, Who’s Better?","Huo Yuzhou lowered his eyes and said indifferently, “If she doesn’t accept it, this gift will lose its meaning. Whoever likes it can take it. It doesn’t matter.”","“Sir, will you still send it tomorrow?”","Huo Yuzhou shook his head.","The assistant then began to report the contents of today’s meeting. Suddenly, he thought of something and paused for a moment. “I’ve investigated Gu Zheng and realized that he didn’t come to Y Nation for a meeting. After he left the hotel, the people we sent lost track of him. They said that he seemed to have disappeared into thin air.”","!!","“Gu Zheng’s strength can’t be underestimated, so he naturally won’t be easily followed.” With that, Huo Yuzhou raised his cold eyebrows slightly and asked seriously, “Who do you think is better between me and Gu Zheng?”","The assistant: “...”","He hesitated for a few seconds, then immediately replied, “Of course, you’re more outstanding. You got to your current position in just a few years. The Brook family’s power is also top-notch in Y Nation. Mr. Gu is still a little inferior to you.”","Huo Yuzhou’s finger landed on the medical book beside him. On it, the words ‘Divine Physician’ were written. The corners of his mouth revealed a trace of mockery. “Since I’m better, why did she marry Gu Zheng? I clearly knew her earlier and was by her side when she was at her weakest and most helpless.","“Before the divine physician appeared, the two of us relied on each other in that dilapidated village. We went to the top of the mountain to watch the sun rise and lay on the grass to look at the stars.","“We shared biscuits and even hugged each other to warm each other up every night. When the Qiao family wanted to bully her, I was the one who stood up for her. We had so many beautiful memories. All these years, I’ve been thinking about her, but why did she choose Gu Zheng, who appeared halfway?","The assistant: “...”","Huo Yuzhou smiled self-deprecatingly. “Why am I telling you this? You don’t know anything at all. How can you understand my feelings?”","The assistant looked at Mr. Huo in surprise and did not dare to say anything.","A trace of sorrow flashed past the man’s eyes. He smiled bitterly and shook his head. “Could it be that after betraying her once, I won’t have another chance?”","The assistant: “...”","Huo Yuzhou frowned. “You’re like a block of wood. It’s useless to talk to you. Don’t stand here and be an eyesore. Get out.”","The assistant was relieved. “Sir... If there’s nothing else, I’ll go out first.”","With that, he fled. After leaving, he could not help but purse his lips.","‘You didn’t just betray Miss Qiao. You stole her medical book and almost caused her grandfather’s death. Do you think she’ll forgive you?’","After the assistant left, the study was filled with silence. A trace of sorrow shrouded Huo Yuzhou’s eyes as he turned on his computer. The emails he had sent were all like rocks sinking into the sea. It was enough to prove how determined Qiao Xi was.","At this moment, the phone suddenly rang. A woman’s careful voice came from the other end. “Mr. Huo...”","Huo Yuzhou was clearly unhappy to have his thoughts interrupted. His tone was cold. “What is it?”","“Miss Guan refuses to eat or take her medicine. She’s clamoring to see you. The doctor said that if she continues to cause trouble, her body won’t be able to take it. He hopes you can go take a look.”","The person who spoke was a young nurse. She had been taking care of Miss Guan all these years. She thought that Mr. Huo would definitely come to see Miss Guan. After all, all these years, the noble and elegant Mr. Huo had never been close to women. He was focused on the family’s matters. The only young woman he interacted with was Miss Guan.","She heard that Miss Guan was already married to Mr. Huo, but the wedding had not been officially held yet. Mr. Huo had bought a villa for Miss Guan and even specially hired many people to take care of her. Now that Miss Guan wanted to see Mr. Huo, of course, he would not refuse.","However, she did not expect that the man on the other end of the phone would snort coldly. The nurse instantly became nervous. Immediately after, she heard Mr. Huo’s impatient voice. “I’m not a doctor. What’s the point of me going? If she doesn’t want to eat, then just let her be.”","“Mr. Huo...” Before the nurse could finish, the man hung up mercilessly.","The doctors and nurses in the room looked at each other and lowered their heads at the same time. No one dared to look at the ferocious Miss Guan.","Mr. Huo was too heartless!","At this moment, Miss Guan’s expression was malicious. Her fingers gripped the white bedsheet tightly as she broke down and shouted, “Why? Why isn’t he coming to see me? Did that b*tch come to Y Nation? As long as that b*tch appears, he won’t care about me anymore. Boo-hoo...”"]},{"number":1349,"title":"Chapter 1349 It’s Not Too Much To Want One of Young Master Tan’s Hands, Right?","paragraphs":["1349 It’s Not Too Much To Want One of Young Master Tan’s Hands, Right?","After Huo Yuzhou hung up the phone, his pupils suddenly constricted when he looked at the computer again. The emails sent to Qiao Xi had all become ‘read’.","Five minutes ago, Qiao Xi returned to her room. She really did not understand why Huo Yuzhou thought that she would accept his gifts and flowers. Back then, he set fire to the library and stole her grandfather’s medical book. He even almost caused her grandfather’s death. No normal person would forgive him.","It was a little boring to be alone in the room, so Qiao Xi sat on the bed with her laptop and casually browsed some things. She suddenly recalled the man’s words outside the door just now. Huo Yuzhou seemed to have sent her a lot of emails.","Qiao Xi suddenly became interested and entered her inbox. She saw that the man had sent about 50 emails over the years, so Qiao Xi started reading from the beginning.","!!","...","At this moment, in the Brook family’s residence, Madam Tan and Tan Yu’s villa was eerily quiet. The servants and bodyguards seemed to have disappeared. The huge villa was empty.","Madam Tan looked at the tall man in front of her, her heart filled with fear.","Gu Zheng’s light brown eyes were calm as he glanced at Song Shijing indifferently. Song Shijing understood instantly and went forward to tear off the tape on Madam Tan’s mouth.","A few days ago, in the Xia family’s villa in Li City, Madam Tan had seen Gu Zheng. This man was as powerful and handsome as the rumors said.","However, Madam Tan, who had always been arrogant, felt that Gu Zheng was just a paper tiger. She had already run to Li City to snatch Qiao Xi, but Gu Zheng did not even dare to do anything to her and even let them return to Y Nation. Since he did not even dare to make a move in Li City, what could he do in Y Nation?","However, Madam Tan did not expect that when she woke up from her afternoon nap in the bedroom, she and her son were both tied up. There was also tape on their mouths, so they could only whimper helplessly.","Madam Tan had never seen such a scene before. At first, she thought that it was a kidnapping, but this was her villa. There were dozens of bodyguards guarding outside. Who could silently barge into the villa and kidnap them?","Just as Madam Tan was feeling puzzled, Gu Zheng and his assistant walked in. He clearly did not say a word, but for some reason, he could still make her shudder.","As soon as the tape was torn off, Madam Tan shouted in horror, “Daniel!”","“Madam Tan, don’t waste your effort,” Song Shijing said with a smile, but to Madam Tan, that smile was as scary as a ghost. “I’m sorry, but your butler, Daniel, won’t appear. No one will disturb our president until he’s done.”","Madam Tan’s heart thumped violently. The usually elegant noble madam had never been in such a sorry state.","Gu Zheng sat opposite Madam Tan. His tall body was as perfect as a sculpture. His dark and deep eyes were fixed on Madam Tan, and his body exuded a cold killing intent.","He looked at Madam Tan quietly. After a moment of silence, the corners of his mouth suddenly curled up into a disdainful smile. “Madam Tan, we meet again.”","Madam Tan’s heart was in her throat, and her face instantly turned pale!","He... Why did he break into her villa? Where were all the bodyguards and servants outside?","“Madam Tan, you must be very curious about where your people have gone.” Gu Zheng had only glanced at her and already guessed her thoughts. He said casually, “Song Shijing made it very clear just now that no one will disturb you until you answer my question, so you don’t have to call for help.”","Madam Tan took a deep breath and forced herself to calm down. She was the madam of the Brook family. Although she was not valued by the head of the family, she could not lose her dignity in front of outsiders. Her voice trembled slightly. “You... You want to take revenge for Qiao Xi?”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “Madam Tan, you’re not stupid.”","Madam Tan felt that she was about to break down. Yesterday, Huo Yuzhou had already come to punish her. For Qiao Xi’s sake, he grounded the mother and son. He even suspended her position in the company. Now, Gu Zheng suddenly barged into her villa to take revenge for Qiao Xi.","For a woman, were they going to go against the madam of the Brook family? Moreover, Qiao Xi was unharmed. She had already paid such a huge price. What else did Gu Zheng want?","Madam Tan trembled nervously. “President Gu, what exactly are you doing?”","“What do you think?” Gu Zheng suddenly looked up, and a cold glint flashed past his eyes. He casually looked at Tan Yu and said the coldest words in the calmest tone, “Everyone knows that I dote on Mrs. Gu, but Young Master Tan coveted her and even wanted to touch her face. It’s not too much for me to ask for one of Young Master Tan’s hands, right?”"]},{"number":1350,"title":"Chapter 1350 Treating Human Lives Like Weed","paragraphs":["1350 Treating Human Lives Like Weed","Gu Zheng’s tone sounded gentle, but the words he said made one feel fear.","Madam Tan looked at the demonic man in front of her. Her teeth could not help but chatter. What did he say he wanted to do?","Tan Yu was the young master of the Brook family. Although he was sick and his brain was damaged, and the head of the family did not like him very much, he still had his identity. Since he was young, he got whatever he wanted. He only wanted a woman now. Moreover, he had yet to succeed, yet Gu Zheng wanted one of his hands?","Before Madam Tan could say anything, Tan Yu laughed arrogantly. “You want my hand? I’m the young master of the Brook family. If you dare to hurt me, you’ll have to bear the anger of the Brook family. I’m sitting here. If you have the ability, come and take my hand!”","A strong sense of fear swept through Madam Tan’s body. “Lil’ Yu, don’t...”","Before he could finish, Gu Zheng sneered. “Since Young Master Tan has said so, I’ll oblige.”","Madam Tan’s heart trembled. She struggled with all her might and wanted to stop him, but Song Shijing rushed in front of Tan Yu like a shadow.","Tan Yu sat on the chair, his eyes filled with disdain. As the young master of the Brook family, he had never known what it was like to be afraid. Moreover, this was the Brook family of Y Nation. If Gu Zheng really cut off his hand, he would not be able to leave Y Nation alive. Could it be that Gu Zheng would lose his life for a woman?","“Ah—!!!”","The proud and arrogant expression on Tan Yu’s face instantly stiffened. He heard the sound of bones breaking, then a sharp pain swept through his entire body. He widened his eyes and watched as his fat wrist was twisted in a strange posture.","Gu Zheng’s expression did not change as a faint smile appeared on his face. “I really didn’t expect Young Master Tan to be so generous, but it’s not convenient for me to take your hand away for the time being. Young Master Tan, keep this hand for now. I’ll come back to take it when I have time.”","Tan Yu broke out in a cold sweat from the pain. He held his broken hand and screamed.","Gu Zheng really wanted his hand? He even said that he would come back to get it when he had time?","“Gu Zheng! Don’t go too far!” When Madam Tan saw her son’s miserable appearance, her blood instantly surged. Her eyes were bloodshot as she twisted her body and roared at Gu Zheng, “If you want revenge, come look for me! Why did you hurt my son? His IQ is only at the age of ten. He’s still a child. Do you have the cheek to make things difficult for him?”","“He’s a child?”","Gu Zheng asked, and his eyes suddenly turned cold. The smile on the corners of his mouth instantly vanished. His deep eyes were extremely dark and filled with coldness. “Can children torture and kill women? Can children treat human lives as weeds? Madam Tan, you indulged your child in committing crimes. I can help you discipline him so that he won’t make such big mistakes again.”","Madam Tan’s eyes almost popped out as her heart ached. “You—”","“I want Young Master Tan’s hand. This is just a small lesson. If you’re dissatisfied with this and choose to anger me, it might not be as simple as just a hand.”","Madam Tan instantly swallowed the words in her mouth. Her face was livid, and she could only glare fiercely at Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng slowly stood up and looked down at the man who was screaming in pain. A cold snort escaped his nose before he walked out of the room.","Song Shijing looked at the two of them, whose foreheads were covered in a cold sweat. He said coldly, “Madam Tan, you’ve seen our president’s methods. I hope you can discipline Young Master Tan well. Before the president leaves Y Nation, he’ll find time to take Young Master Tan’s hand.”","After the two of them walked out of the room, Tan Yu finally realized what was going on and shouted in pain, “Ah!!! My hand hurts! I can’t let them off!”","Madam Tan lowered her head. Her body was cold, and the clothes on her back seemed to be drenched in sweat.","Rumor had it that Gu Zheng was cruel and ruthless, but she did not believe it because the first time she saw Gu Zheng, he clearly looked very gentle. At that time, she thought that the rumors were fake, but now, she finally believed them.","The Brook family had been developing in Y Nation for a hundred years, but in just a few years, Huo Yuzhou had controlled almost half of their power. If she did not put up a fight, how could the mother and son have a place in the family in the future?","It was already very difficult to deal with Huo Yuzhou, but now, there was Gu Zheng. He was even more heartless and crueler than Huo Yuzhou. Without saying anything, he broke Lil’ Yu’s hand!","Madam Tan was burning with anger, but she knew very well that she was not Gu Zheng’s match for the time being. Hearing Tan Yu’s curses, she berated him without caring about her image, “You won’t let him off? Do you have the ability?”"]},{"number":1351,"title":"Chapter 1351 Gu Zheng’s Weakness","paragraphs":["1351 Gu Zheng’s Weakness","“Gu Zheng was able to quietly enter the villa, break your hand, and leave the villa safely. You’re not his match at all. If you anger him, he’ll come back and cut off your hand now!”","Madam Tan broke down and berated. Sometimes, she hated her son very much. He was stupid, ugly, and useless. She was the noble Madam Brook. Why did she give birth to such an embarrassing son?","Tan Yu shrunk his neck in fear and shut up.","Madam Tan took a deep breath and suppressed the anger in her heart. She lowered her head and sized up her clothes. After confirming that there were no problems, she quietly waited for the servants to enter.","!!","A servant hurriedly ran over and untied the two of them. Madam Tan ordered coldly, “Young Master is injured. Quickly call the doctor!”","Madam Tan frowned tightly, and her emotions gradually calmed down. Gu Zheng was indeed very strong, but as long as he was a person, he would definitely have a weakness. Gu Zheng’s weakness was Qiao Xi, and Qiao Xi had too many secrets. Qiao Xi seemed to have many enemies as well. There was no need for her to personally make a move as there were many people who deliberately wanted Qiao Xi’s life.","Gu Zheng did not have three heads and six arms. Could it be that he could protect Qiao Xi at all times?","On the other hand, Gu Zheng walked out of the villa and quickly got into the car. His expression was gloomy as he said casually, “Song Shijing, go get Tan Yu’s hand back. It’s useless to leave it with him.”","Song Shijing said, “You... Didn’t you just say...”","“I didn’t say that I wouldn’t go back on my word,” Gu Zheng said indifferently with a trace of a roguish smile. “I’m not a good person to begin with. It’s not strange for me to go back on my word.”","Song Shijing: “...”","“I understand. I’ll go get his hand now.”","Actually, the president did not want to arouse Young Madam’s suspicion, so he did not take Tan Yu’s hand. However, Tan Yu’s arrogant tone and greedy, wretched eyes just now told them that if the president did not chop off his hand, he would probably still covet Young Madam.","If they did not teach Tan Yu a lesson, he would not learn his lesson!","Tan Yu’s hands were stained with the blood of many women. Under the protection of the Brook family, he was not punished at all. They were now going to cut off one of Tan Yu’s hands, which could be considered as eliminating evil for the people. He probably would not dare to commit crimes easily in the future.","At this moment, in the hotel, Qiao Xi was going through those emails.","Actually, the fire that Huo Yuzhou set off did not really burn. As the library was rescued in time, most of the medical books were saved. Only a few were burned. Moreover, Grandpa had already repaired them. Grandpa also had a copy of the medical book that Huo Yuzhou stole.","Qiao Xi hated him because she was used and betrayed. Back then, she went to the Huo family as Huo Yuzhou’s ‘close friend’ and lived under the same roof as him. Later on, when she found out that she was being used, she completely cut off all ties with the Huo family.","She knew that Huo Yuzhou was looking for her everywhere and wanted to apologize to her in person, but she did not want to contact Huo Yuzhou, so she disappeared for a period of time. Hence, Huo Yuzhou could only keep emailing her.","There was another important reason for her to completely cut off all contact with Huo Yuzhou. Huo Yuzhou suddenly brought back a girl from the orphanage called Guan Hui.","After so many years, Qiao Xi seemed to have already forgotten Guan Hui’s appearance. She only remembered that Guan Hui was always sick. However, from the first time Qiao Xi took Guan Hui’s pulse, she knew that Guan Hui was healthy and had no problems. Her illness was just an act.","Everyone in the Huo family knew that Qiao Xi was the descendant of the divine physician, so as long as Guan Hui was sick, Qiao Xi had no choice but to treat her. When Guan Hui lay on the bed with a pale face and was on the verge of death, Huo Yuzhou would blame her for not treating Guan Hui seriously.","To Qiao Xi, every moment in the Huo family was like torture. Back then, it was the Huo family who begged her to go to them. They said that they wanted to thank her for taking care of Huo Yuzhou and that she was Huo Yuzhou’s savior. However, when she really went to their house, the other party did not cherish her anymore. It was also at that time that her grandfather wanted to take Huo Yuzhou as his apprentice. Qiao Xi was afraid that her grandfather would be dissatisfied with Huo Yuzhou because of her, so she kept enduring it and did not tell her grandfather. She thought that as long as she did not stay with the Huo family in the future, she would not have so many troubles.","However, she did not expect that she would lure a wolf into her house. Not only did Huo Yuzhou steal her grandfather’s medical skills, but he also almost ruined her grandfather’s life’s work.","She wondered what were the contents of Huo Yuzhou’s emails.","Did he apologize? Beg for forgiveness?","Qiao Xi opened the first email he sent. It was sent six years ago. At that time, it had only been half a month since that incident, and she was still very sad. After all, she was only 14 years old. It was indeed difficult to accept that someone she trusted so much had used her and betrayed her."]},{"number":1352,"title":"Chapter 1352 Don’t Dirty Mrs. Gu’s Eyes","paragraphs":["1352 Don’t Dirty Mrs. Gu’s Eyes","Qiao Xi took a closer look and saw that there were only a few simple words in the email: [I’m sorry.]","She clicked on the next email. It also said that he was sorry. Every April or May, Huo Yuzhou would send her an email, but without exception, the content was the same. It was only two years ago that he suddenly stopped sending emails. Instead, it was Guan Hui who sent her some emails. They were filled with hypocritical greetings, saying that they all missed her very much and that if Qiao Xi was free, they could meet up.","Qiao Xi propped her chin and thought for a moment. She had never told Guan Hui her email and contact details, but she suddenly sent these emails. Huo Yuzhou must have told her.","At first, Guan Hui did not have any ill intentions in her emails. She was just telling Qiao Xi how good Huo Yuzhou was to her. She had a low status, but she felt very happy to be able to become Huo Yuzhou’s woman. Moreover, she and Huo Yuzhou were going to get married soon. She hoped that Qiao Xi could attend the wedding.","!!","After reading that particular email, Qiao Xi felt uncomfortable all over. She was just about to close her computer when she suddenly saw the last email.","[Xi Xi, since things have come to this, I won’t hide it from you anymore.","[Back then, Yuzhou went to that village and went through a difficult time with you. He took care of you in every way. You saved him by chance and he invited you to the Huo family. Actually, all of that was for me.]","[I have a strange illness, and only the divine physician can treat it. Yuzhou heard that the divine physician was near that village, so he went there to gather information. He happened to know that the divine physician was about to take you in as his apprentice, so he approached you bit by bit.","[You’re a wild girl who was abandoned by the Qiao family. How could an outstanding and arrogant man like Yuzhou like you? Moreover, Yuzhou burned the library back then because of me.","[Xi Xi, you’ve always trusted Yuzhou very much. Even when you were wronged, you didn’t dare to tell the divine physician. You even personally introduced Yuzhou to the divine physician. You probably didn’t expect such an outcome, right?!]","Qiao Xi clenched her fists and picked up her phone to take a photo of the email. She originally thought that Huo Yuzhou and Guan Hui had completely disappeared from her world. Unexpectedly, not only did they appear again, but they even came to disgust her!","She was furious and sent the contents of the email to her brothers and teacher.","Back then, when Huo Yuzhou set fire to the library, the Huo family immediately came to apologize when they found out about it. Grandpa was kind-hearted and could not bear to make things difficult for them, so he forgave Huo Yuzhou. However, he also requested to cut off all contact with the Huo family and never see them again. Even so, Qiao Xi would not forgive them. Now that Guan Hui had sent this email, it proved that Huo Yuzhou had set the fire for her.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. Guan Hui’s actions were exactly what she wanted. Not long after she closed her computer, she received Shen Yu’s message.","At the same time, the people from Ling Pavilion also sent a message. Tan Yu’s hand had been cut off.","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. Tan Yu’s hand was chopped off. Who did it?","After thinking for a few seconds, Qiao Xi instantly came to a sudden understanding. She knew it. How could Gu Zheng have come to Y Nation for a meeting so coincidentally? He probably could not take this lying down and wanted to teach Tan Yu a lesson. The meeting was just an excuse.","Just as she was deep in thought, the man’s gentle voice suddenly sounded behind her. “What are you thinking, Mrs. Gu? Didn’t you hear me come back?”","Gu Zheng bent down and glanced at the contents of her phone. He said slowly, “Mrs. Gu, you seem to be very concerned about Tan Yu, but it’s better not to dirty your eyes with such trash.”","Qiao Xi was shocked by the sudden voice and hurriedly got up. After taking a few seconds to react, she asked, “Tan Yu’s hand was cut off by someone. Did you hear about it?”","“No,” Gu Zheng replied without changing his expression.","Qiao Xi sized him up and said with a smile, “Really? I thought you were the one who did it, but it turns out you didn’t know about it!”","“It wasn’t me.” Gu Zheng’s voice was calm. Even though he was suspected, his eyes were still calm.","Gu Zheng stood up and casually placed his jacket on the chair before sitting on the edge of the bed. His burning gaze landed on Qiao Xi’s face, then he lowered his eyes to look at the closed laptop. His long eyelashes left a shadow on his eyelids, making it impossible to see his expression clearly. His voice was also a little hoarse. “I don’t care about Tan Yu. I just want to know about you, Mrs. Gu.”","Qiao Xi was slightly puzzled when she heard his words, but the instant she raised her eyes, she suddenly understood something. Her heart skipped a beat as she gulped nervously. “Um... When did you come in?”","Could it be that Gu Zheng had already entered when she was looking at the emails just now?"]},{"number":1353,"title":"Chapter 1353 Giving You A Present","paragraphs":["1353 Giving You A Present","Qiao Xi’s heart thumped violently. If Gu Zheng saw those emails, he would definitely investigate her relationship with Huo Yuzhou. Perhaps he already knew about Huo Yuzhou before he went to the Brook family to cut off Tan Yu’s hand.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were as dark as a pool of water against the light, but there was a faint smile on his lips. “I came in when you were looking at your emails.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","She suddenly felt like she had been caught in the act. She said agitatedly, “It’s not... It’s not what you think. Let me explain.”","“Alright, explain.” Gu Zheng’s tone was calm and emotionless.","Qiao Xi looked at his calm face and became more and more flustered. She suddenly recalled what Song Shiyu had said. The calmer Gu Zheng looked and the more he smiled, the more terrifying he was. It meant that he was very angry.","It seemed that Gu Zheng already knew about her past with Huo Yuzhou and had guessed that the Brook family’s sudden attack was because of her.","After a moment of silence, Qiao Xi suddenly felt aggrieved. “I haven’t contacted Huo Yuzhou for a long time. He’s a lunatic! He clearly already controls half of the Brook family’s power and leads a good life now, but he just had to provoke me!","“He actually spent two billion to get me to marry that sadist, Tan Yu. Don’t you think this person is crazy?!”","Gu Zheng: “...”","He hesitated for a moment before following Qiao Xi’s train of thought. It turned out that she had always thought that the marriage was Huo Yuzhou’s idea. The corners of his mouth could not help but curl up as he nodded. “Yes, he’s crazy.”","“He even sent someone to harass me just now. That person said that Huo Yuzhou sent me many emails. I was curious about what that pervert sent me, so I clicked on the emails and took a look,” Qiao Xi said angrily.","Gu Zheng stroked her hair affectionately. “Since he’s so annoying, Xi Xi, don’t contact him in the future, much less meet him.”","Qiao Xi hurriedly nodded. “I don’t want to contact a lunatic! He’s abnormal!”","Song Shijing and Song Shiyu were standing at the door. They heard their conversation and could not help but look at each other.","They remembered that Madam Tan was making things difficult for Young Madam because of the president. Tan Yu was coveting Young Madam because of Xia Mengyan’s photo. This had nothing to do with Mr. Huo!","Gu Zheng reached out and pulled the obedient Mrs. Gu into his arms. His entire body exuded warmth, but his eyes were filled with coldness and killing intent.","That man actually dared to covet his Xi Xi!","“Xi Xi, the company is holding an auction tonight. Do you want to go with me?” Gu Zheng asked.","Qiao Xi was instantly interested and nodded happily.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with gentleness, but his tone was a little thought-provoking. “You’ve never been interested in auctions, and those things don’t catch your eye. Why don’t I give you a gift this time?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","The corners of her mouth twitched slightly. Why did she feel that Gu Zheng was implying something? It made her feel a chill run down her spine.","At eight in the evening, the auction was about to start. Qiao Xi changed into a gown and waited in the lounge with Gu Zheng.","After a while, a woman in her 30s who was dressed exquisitely walked over. The other party was the director of Gu Corporation’s branch company. She smiled warmly. “Hello, President Gu and Mrs. Gu.”","Gu Zheng nodded, then looked at Qiao Xi who was beside him and said softly, “I can’t accompany you tonight. If you’re bored, let her bring you around.”","Qiao Xi replied and did not ask what he wanted to do, but she felt that Gu Zheng must have come to Y Nation for something important this time. Since he did not want to say it for the time being, Qiao Xi would not ask. In any case, she would find out sooner or later.","After Gu Zheng left, the beautiful director said respectfully, “Mrs. Gu, you can call me Director Luo. If there’s anything you need, feel free to tell me. President Gu was afraid that you’d be disturbed by others, so he specially instructed me to accompany you.”","“Who would disturb me?” Qiao Xi was slightly puzzled.","Director Luo smiled gently. “I’m not too sure about that either. Perhaps it’s because you don’t come to Y Nation often, so President Gu is afraid that something special will happen.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and understood in her heart. She had long guessed Gu Zheng’s intentions. Director Luo looked like a beautiful director on the surface, but she was actually not an ordinary person.","From the moment Director Luo entered, Qiao Xi noticed that her footsteps were very light, and her palms were a little rough. It was obvious that she was a martial artist. Presumably, Director Luo was Gu Zheng’s shadow guard. For the sake of hiding her identity, she was given the position of director. Although Director Luo’s acting skills were not bad, her disguise still could not escape Qiao Xi’s eyes."]},{"number":1354,"title":"Chapter 1354 Special Finale","paragraphs":["1354 Special Finale","Seeing that Qiao Xi had not said anything, Director Luo knew that she was suspicious, so he confessed in a low voice, “Young Madam, the president is just concerned about you. After all, this isn’t Li City. There are unknown risks here. He’ll be more at ease with me protecting you.”","“Gu Zheng has enemies here?” Qiao Xi asked.","Director Luo was silent for a moment before he explained, “You can’t say that we’re enemies. It’s mainly because the various forces in Y Nation are chaotic, and there are too many benefits involved. We’re in the territory of the Brook family. Now that the Brook family is getting stronger and stronger, many nobles don’t dare to provoke them, so we have to be on guard.”","Qiao Xi had long known that this was the Brooke family’s territory. In that case, did no one know about Gu Zheng breaking into the Brooke family’s villa yesterday and beating Tan Yu up?","!!","“Young Madam, the president asked you to see if there’s anything you like.” As she spoke, Director Luo handed her a beautifully crafted booklet.","Qiao Xi casually glanced at it and was slightly uninterested. The items at the auction were nothing special, but when she flipped to the last page, her eyes suddenly lit up. In the photo was a beautifully crafted violin. It was not that this thing was precious but Qiao Xi felt that it looked a little familiar.","Seeing that she was staring at the violin, Director Luo was a little puzzled. “This violin is indeed exquisite, but it’s not worth collecting. There’s nothing special about it.”","She observed it carefully and really did not know why the president would put this thing at the end.","“I don’t know much about musical instruments. Perhaps this violin has some special meaning. If you like it, I’ll go ask around.” With that, Director Luo quickly left.","Qiao Xi stared fixedly at the photo. Actually, this violin was indeed nothing special, but it was personally made by Fourth Brother.","Back then, Fourth Brother was obsessed with music, and the musical instruments he made were almost perfect. It was worthy to be auctioned, but it shouldn’t be the finale.","The auction held by Gu Corporation was naturally extraordinary. The people who attended were all successful people with a net worth of tens of billions. The things that could catch their eye were works of calligraphy. They would not be interested in such an ordinary-looking violin at all, so why did Gu Zheng put it at the end?","Soon, Director Luo returned. She explained, “Young Madam, this violin was sent by the Brook family. They only had one condition, which was that this violin has to be the finale. They even said that someone will definitely buy it.”","“I heard that this violin was made by Xue Liang a few years ago. The materials are high quality, and the workmanship is exquisite. However, he also made a few identical violins at the same time. Logically speaking, the price of this violin shouldn’t be very high. I didn’t expect the starting price to be two million yuan. It’s even placed as the finale. I wonder what the Brook family is thinking. How can they be sure that someone will definitely buy it?”","Qiao Xi also agreed with Director Luo’s words. Actually, among all of Fourth Brother’s works, this violin was considered a very ordinary piece. The market valuation was only about 200,000 yuan, but now, the price had actually directly increased by nearly ten times. The Brook family even said that someone would definitely buy it. Did they think that everyone else was stupid?","“Young Madam, I heard something else.” Director Luo had just happened to hear it, so she told Qiao Xi. “I heard that someone played this violin many years ago, so it has a special meaning.”","Qiao Xi’s gaze froze as she frowned. “Where did you hear that?”","“That’s what everyone is saying, and I happened to hear it. Moreover, they said that the person who played this violin back then was Huo—”","Before Director Luo could finish, there was a commotion not far away.","“Mr. Huo is also here for the auction! He has always been reclusive and rarely attends such events. Why is he here today? Mrs. Huo, do you know the reason?”","Qiao Xi looked in the direction of the voice. Guan Hui was wearing a light blue princess dress that was long at the front and short at the back. Her eyes were filled with a happy smile as she was surrounded by everyone.","Everyone had heard that Mr. Huo Yuzhou, the head of the Brook family and the president of the Huo Corporation, would be attending this auction, but they did not see him. Hence, they came to please the future Mrs. Huo, Guan Hui.","Guan Hui said gently, “Yuzhou will be here, but he still has some business to discuss, so he hasn’t appeared. I’ve never asked about his work, so I’m not too sure either.”","“Mrs. Huo, I heard that you’re here for something,” someone asked curiously."]},{"number":1355,"title":"Chapter 1355 Birds Of The Same Feather","paragraphs":["1355 Birds Of The Same Feather","Guan Hui hesitated for a few seconds. “Yes, there’s a violin at this auction. I’ve played it before and have always liked it, so I want to bid for that violin.”","When Director Luo heard her words, she was enlightened. “In that case, Miss Guan is the person who played this violin!”","Everyone surrounded Guan Hui and praised her. “Madam Huo, you even know how to play the violin! I heard that the violin was personally made by Xue Liang. The workmanship is exquisite, and the tone is very good. Only such a top violin is worthy of you, Mrs. Huo!”","Guan Hui smiled shyly. “I didn’t expect to see this violin here after so many years.”","In the resting area on the other side, Qiao Xi raised her eyes slightly to glance at Guan Hui. “She played this violin before?”","When Huo Yuzhou lived on the mountain previously, he had a good relationship with Qiao Xi’s third and fourth brothers. It was reasonable for him to have touched this violin, but who did Guan Hui think she was? Was she worthy of touching that violin?","Moreover, wasn’t this violin sent by the Brook family? Since Huo Yuzhou had already sent it over, why did he want to buy it back?","Qiao Xi casually asked, “Director Luo, do you know why the Brook family is under the control of someone with the surname Huo?”","Director Luo lowered her voice and said, “I heard that... Mr. Huo is the illegitimate child of the Brook family. Although his status isn’t good, he’s swift and decisive. He’s extremely capable. On the other hand, the direct descendants of the Brook family are all very useless, so the moment he returned to the Brook family, he was supported by most people.","“The rumored ‘Mrs. Huo’ was brought back by Mr. Huo. All these years, she’s the only woman who’s been by Mr. Huo’s side, so she has always announced to the public that she’s Mrs. Huo. It’s just that the two of them have never gotten married.","“After all, Gu Corporation’s branch company is in Y Nation, so we have to interact with the Brook family. I’ve seen Mrs. Huo a few times. She looks gentle on the surface, but she’s actually petty. I really don’t know why Mr. Huo likes someone like her.”","Qiao Xi nodded and chuckled. “Birds of the same feather.”","Director Luo was slightly surprised. Actually, Mr. Huo’s reputation was not bad. She did not expect Qiao Xi to evaluate Mr. Huo like this.","After a moment of silence, Director Luo suddenly covered her mouth and laughed. “Speaking of which, you and the president are very compatible! One is a handsome man and the other is a beautiful woman. You’re also both so outstanding. The auction is about to start. I’ll accompany you to take a look.”","Director Luo’s tone was very sincere, and Qiao Xi smiled at her. Just as the two of them were about to stand up and leave, Guan Hui’s shocked voice suddenly came from behind.","“Xi Xi? You’re here in Y Nation too? Xi Xi, what are you doing here?”","Qiao Xi was suddenly slightly irritable. She really did not want to see Guan Hui. If she had known earlier, she would have left in advance.","At the same time, in the luxurious lounge.","Gu Zheng sat lazily on the gorgeous sofa. His expression was calm, but if one took a closer look, one would notice the disdain in his eyes.","Huo Yuzhou was flipping through the medical book in his hand and said calmly, “President Gu, you’re really carefree. In order to attend an auction, you actually came all the way from Li City to Y Nation.”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow and said coldly, “Mr. Huo, are you here today for Tan Yu?”","Huo Yuzhou frowned. The news that Tan Yu’s hand was cut off had already spread to the Brook family. Madam Tan was like a lunatic, insisting that Gu Zheng did it. It was just that Gu Zheng was not captured in the surveillance footage, and there was no evidence to prove that Gu Zheng had been to the villa.","Everyone thought that she was slandering Gu Zheng. After all, Tan Yu had killed too many people and there were many people who wanted to take revenge on him. It was already merciful enough that only one of his hands was cut off and his life wasn’t taken.","Moreover, Tan Yu was a fool. The head of the family did not care at all. Even if there was evidence that Gu Zheng was the one who did it, the head of the family would not go against Gu Zheng for Tan Yu.","Huo Yuzhou did not even raise his head and said coldly, “He’s just an abandoned child. I don’t care at all.”","Gu Zheng opened his arms slightly and leaned against the armrest of the sofa. The light from the window shone in, illuminating his handsome facial features. His facial features were well-defined like the most perfect sculpture. After a long time, he slowly said, “If it’s not for him, why are you looking for me, Mr. Huo?”","Huo Yuzhou suddenly stopped in his tracks. He slowly looked up, and his cold gaze landed on Gu Zheng. “President Gu, there are rumors that although you’re cold and heartless, you don’t stir up trouble. Now, it seems that the rumors can’t be trusted.”","Gu Zheng’s expression did not change as he raised an eyebrow. “What do you mean?”"]},{"number":1356,"title":"Chapter 1356 I’ve Never Been A Gentleman","paragraphs":["1356 I’ve Never Been A Gentleman","Huo Yuzhou clenched his fists, and his well-defined fingers turned slightly pale. His usually gentle voice also carried a trace of sharpness. “Why did you tell Xi Xi that I instructed Tan Yu to do those things? I care about Xi Xi so much, so why would I force her to marry Tan Yu? I thought you were a gentleman, but I didn’t expect you to be so despicable. You actually used such a method to make Xi Xi misunderstand me!”","Gu Zheng revealed a subtle smile. He did not expect Huo Yuzhou to know about this so quickly. It seemed that he did have some power in Y Nation.","Even though he had been exposed, Gu Zheng’s expression was still calm. He did not panic or feel awkward at all. Instead, he replied casually, “Mr. Huo, you’ve misunderstood. I’ve never been a gentleman.”","“President Gu, aren’t you afraid that Xi Xi will find out?” Huo Yuzhou’s gaze suddenly turned cold.","Gu Zheng raised his eyes to glance at him and let out a cold snort. “So what? Xi Xi and I are husband and wife, so we naturally know each other and believe in each other. This small matter is insignificant.”","Huo Yuzhou gritted his teeth and said in a low voice, “Gu Zheng, you and Xi Xi met ten years ago. At that time, you were her senior, Mo Yuan, but she had never seen you before. She married you because you were her senior. The two of you didn’t have any feelings for each other before this!","“But I’m different. I was already by Xi Xi’s side ten years ago. We met in the village, and I watched the sunrise and sunset with her. After that, the divine physician wanted to take me in as his apprentice, and I almost became her senior!”","Gu Zheng was not angry, but there was a smile in his eyes when he looked at Huo Yuzhou. This opponent was really not bad. He actually found out that he was Mo Yuan so quickly. He had to admit that Huo Yuzhou was much stronger than Lu Yan.","He had heard that Huo Yuzhou was cold, heartless, and decisive. However, when it had to do with Xi Xi, he found it difficult to control his emotions.","After a moment of silence, Gu Zheng sneered. “Mr. Huo, although you and Xi Xi have known each other for a long time, you don’t know her well. Actually, Xi Xi misunderstood Tan Yu’s matter herself. I just didn’t correct her. It’s clearly such a flawed matter, but Xi Xi thinks that you did it. Do you know the reason?”","Huo Yuzhou’s expression darkened.","“Because in her heart, you’re a despicable person. She doesn’t believe you, so she thinks that you would do such a thing. Since she already thinks so, why should I correct her?”","Huo Yuzhou’s body stiffened as disbelief flashed past his eyes.","In her heart, he was a despicable person. She did not believe him, and that was why she thought that?","The huge lounge was silent as if time had stopped. Gu Zheng looked at his watch but did not suggest leaving.","Just as the atmosphere froze, hurried footsteps suddenly came from outside the door. Huo Yuzhou’s assistant’s anxious voice came from outside. “Sir, bad news. Miss Guan and another woman are arguing. Do you want to...”","Huo Yuzhou replied coldly, “If she wants to cause trouble, let her. If something happens, she shouldn’t expect me to clean up her mess.”","The assistant instantly choked. After being by Mr. Huo’s side for so many years, he knew very well that Mr. Huo had always been cold and heartless. He only had his mind on Miss Qiao.","He was silent for a few seconds before saying uneasily, “But... the person quarreling with Miss Guan is... Miss Qiao.”","Swoosh!","Huo Yuzhou suddenly stood up, and the medical book fell to the floor. The yellow pages were a little damaged.","Gu Zheng also stood up slowly, but his eyes were extremely sharp. “Mr. Huo, control your woman. Don’t let her disturb Xi Xi. If Xi Xi suffers, I won’t let her off.”","With that, Gu Zheng pushed the door open and left. His footsteps were a little hurried. The assistant at the door looked at the scene in the lounge and could not help but tremble in fear. Mr. Huo stood by the window and did not move for a long time.","After a long time, the assistant asked tentatively, “Sir?”","Huo Yuzhou’s voice was a little sorrowful. “Am I really a despicable person in her eyes?”","The assistant: “...” ‘What do you think? Can you stop asking me such questions?’","Huo Yuzhou said, “It’s useless to ask you. Go warn Guan Hui. If she’s obedient, she won’t have to worry about food and clothes. However, if she’s tired of living and insists on provoking Xi Xi, I’ll send her to her death!”","The assistant’s heart trembled. He did not expect Mr. Huo to say such things. No matter what, Miss Guan had been by Mr. Huo’s side for so many years. Even if she had not contributed anything, she worked hard. Moreover, in the eyes of outsiders, Miss Guan was already his fiancee, but he actually said that if she was tired of living, he would send her to her death."]},{"number":1357,"title":"Chapter 1357 No Discrimination In Love","paragraphs":["1357 No Discrimination In Love","Huo Yuzhou walked out of the lounge with his assistant following behind him with his head lowered.","On the way, Huo Yuzhou’s expression was cold as he frowned.","He had miscalculated. If he had known that Xi Xi would come to the auction today, he would not have let Guan Hui out. Now that she had angered Xi Xi, would Xi Xi blame him?","Gu Zheng and Huo Yuzhou arrived at the scene one after another. At this moment, the scene was very noisy.","!!","Ten minutes ago.","When Qiao Xi heard Guan Hui’s voice, her face was filled with impatience. Before she could speak, Guan Hui walked straight in front of Qiao Xi and said with an arrogant and slightly hypocritical posture, “Xi Xi, why didn’t you contact me when you came to Y Nation? I thought I was mistaken just now! Did you specially rush over because you knew that Yuzhou and I were here?”","Director Luo frowned. “Mrs. Huo, we—”","Guan Hui smiled and shook her head. “Xi Xi, it was our fault back then, and we failed to take your feelings into consideration, but love can’t be controlled. I don’t know what past you have with Yuzhou, but he hasn’t mentioned it all these years. I can understand that you feel aggrieved, but we’ve been friends for many years, after all. Why should you cut off all contact with us because of this?”","Director Luo was shocked: “!!!”","Everyone present was dumbfounded. Did Mrs. Huo mean that this woman in front of them was once Mr. Huo’s friend and had once pursued him? After that, because Mr. Huo chose Madam Huo, they stopped seeing each other?","Could it be that there was an inexplicable love triangle between them?","Qiao Xi’s porcelain-white face was filled with annoyance. She frowned and turned to leave. Unexpectedly, Guan Hui actually grabbed her wrist. Her eyes were filled with provocation, but her tone was very gentle. “Xi Xi, it’s time to let go of the past. Yuzhou is very busy with work, so you probably won’t be able to see him today. If you want to see him, I won’t stop you. However, it’s best if the two of you don’t meet alone.”","Seeing this scene, Director Luo also understood Guan Hui’s meaning. She was afraid that Young Madam and Mr. Huo would renew their relationship, so she deliberately came forward to show off and warn them.","Everyone present naturally understood, and the gazes they shot at Qiao Xi were full of disdain as they sized her up.","Those who could participate in this auction were all reputable nobles of Y Nation. They could only enter with invitations, and they had never seen Qiao Xi before. It was even to the extent that they had never heard of Mr. Huo having such a friend.","Could it be that this woman sneaked in to see Mr. Huo?","Guan Hui also realized this and immediately asked in confusion, “Right, Xi Xi, do you have an invitation? Don’t tell me you secretly ran in?”","“I don’t have an invitation,” Qiao Xi replied truthfully.","This was an auction held by Gu Corporation’s branch company. She was Gu Zheng’s wife and the female boss of Gu Corporation. Naturally, she did not need an invitation.","However, these words took on a different meaning in Guan Hui’s ears.","Guan Hui smiled proudly, then looked arrogantly at Qiao Xi before saying in a sincere tone, “Xi Xi, how could you do such a thing? If you really wanted to come in, you could have called me in advance. I could have brought you in. Why did you secretly come here?","“I don’t know how you broke in, but you’re unfamiliar with Y Nation. If you’re discovered, you’ll very likely be sent to the police station. Moreover, the people attending the auction are all reputable local nobles. Most of them are married. As a young lady, you have to pay attention to your image. You have to love yourself before others can respect you. Don’t be so rash in the future. If you encounter trouble, you can look for me.”","The meaning of Guan Hui’s words was very obvious. Either Qiao Xi had avoided the security guards and barged in, or she had relied on her relationship with a certain man to enter. Director Luo was instantly infuriated when she heard this and hurriedly explained, “Mrs. Huo, this is—”","Before she could finish, she saw Qiao Xi wave her hand and look at Guan Hui with a smile. “Does how I got in have anything to do with you, Mrs. Huo? Also, how are you so sure that I’m in contact with a married man?","“What do you mean by bringing up my past with Huo Yuzhou in public, Mrs. Huo? Do you want to suppress me, or do you want to declare your sovereignty and warn me?”","When Guan Hui heard Qiao Xi’s arrogant tone, her eyes instantly turned red as she said aggrievedly, “Xi Xi, you’ve misunderstood me. What happened back then... is in the past, so don’t mention it anymore. I said all of this for your own good. After all, we’re friends. I don’t want you to go astray.","“My status is indeed low. I’m an orphan who was abandoned. I’m not worthy of Yuzhou, but love doesn’t differentiate between noble and low statuses. I should have the right to pursue my own happiness.”"]},{"number":1358,"title":"Chapter 1358 You’re Just A Lovestruck Fool","paragraphs":["1358 You’re Just A Lovestruck Fool","“Back then, when you found out that I was in a relationship with Yuzhou, you suddenly disappeared. Yuzhou has been blaming himself and looking for you everywhere. He thought that he didn’t make himself clear and made you misunderstand.","“Actually, in Yuzhou’s heart, he treated you as his younger sister and doted on you. But you wanted us to break up, and I was really sad during that period of time. After all, why couldn’t a pair of lovers be together? Xi Xi, I know you didn’t do it on purpose, but you’re a woman too. You should understand my feelings. It wasn’t easy for Yuzhou and me to get to where we are today. I hope you... don’t...”","Guan Hui suddenly choked. She lowered her head as if she had suffered a great grievance.","When everyone heard this, they instantly understood. Mr. Huo had always treated Miss Qiao as his younger sister and doted on her very much. After Mr. Huo and Mrs. Huo got together, Miss Qiao suddenly disappeared. She wanted to use this to force Mr. Huo and Mrs. Huo to break up. Wasn’t she a scheming b*tch?","Guan Hui raised her eyes and glanced at everyone before smiling sinisterly. She wanted Qiao Xi to be condemned by everyone and let everyone know that Qiao Xi had snatched someone else’s boyfriend.","Moreover, she was right. Back then, Qiao Xi suddenly disappeared. Yuzhou was heartbroken and depressed for a period of time.","There were so many women in the world, so why did Huo Yuzhou like Qiao Xi? Why couldn’t he pay more attention to her? She loved Huo Yuzhou so much and could do anything for him, but he still didn’t even look at her.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth suddenly curled up when she heard these words.","It was happening again! Back then, Guan Hui had also played the same trick. She pretended to be weak in front of everyone as if she was the most aggrieved person in the world.","Guan Hui’s mother was originally a servant of the Huo family. After her mother died, her only wish was for the Huo family to take care of Guan Hui. After she was brought back to the Huo family, she had been living a careful life. She knew that her status was low and she was not worthy of Huo Yuzhou, so she always pretended to be pitiful and played tricks in hopes of getting Huo Yuzhou’s favor. However, the victims of these tricks were often Qiao Xi.","For example, Guan Hui had deliberately broken Qiao Xi’s favorite cup. Qiao Xi said a few words to her, but she cried and said that her life was bitter and her background was not good. She even said that even if she had to sell her blood, she had to compensate Qiao Xi for the cup. When Huo Yuzhou heard these words, he began to overflow with sympathy and criticized Qiao Xi for being so overbearing.","Qiao Xi recalled what had happened back then and could not help but smile. Her eyes were cold, and her tone was calm. “Mrs. Huo, you said that I like Huo Yuzhou and even tried to separate the two of you?”","Guan Hui looked aggrieved and choked. “Xi Xi, I know you don’t want to admit it, but if it weren’t for you, we wouldn’t—”","“Please, I was only 14 years old six years ago. I was still an underaged girl. All I was thinking about was how to increase my knowledge. How could I be in the mood to date? You weren’t educated at a young age, and your mind was filled with love. Just because you were like that, do you think others were too? At that time, I went off to university. Why would you say that I suddenly disappeared?”","Qiao Xi crossed her arms and sneered. “My time is very precious. Back then, I was learning how to paint, design, and play musical instruments. How could I have the time to watch you two date?! Don’t take yourself too seriously!”","Director Luo immediately echoed, “That’s right! Mrs. Huo, I heard that you and Young Madam are the same age! So, you got together with Mr. Huo when you were 14 years old. Weren’t you still in school then? Love is indeed precious, but you can’t abandon your studies for love, right?”","“Pfft...!” Someone could not help but laugh. Guan Hui’s face instantly turned red.","She took a few steps forward and said in a low voice in Qiao Xi’s ear, “Qiao Xi, you probably don’t know this yet, but after you left, the Huo family quickly forgot about you. In the end, I moved to your room. Your jewelry and clothes all belong to me now. Everyone dotes on me very much.","“I know you hate me, the daughter of a servant who stole your things, but it’s been so long. It’s time for you to let go. Yuzhou only treats you as his younger sister and has no romantic feelings for you. You—”","“Guan Hui.” Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes and interrupted her. “Why does it seem that you’re very proud of occupying my jewelry and room?","“Those pieces of jewelry and clothes are all things I don’t want. You only managed to get your hands on them because they’re trash I don’t want. The Huo family is so rich, but they’re not even willing to buy you new clothes and jewelry. It seems that Huo Yuzhou doesn’t treat you that well!”"]},{"number":1359,"title":"Chapter 1359 What Right Does She Have To Be So Arrogant?","paragraphs":["1359 What Right Does She Have To Be So Arrogant?","“You like Huo Yuzhou, so you think that all women will like him too? But you don’t know what would have happened to him if Grandpa hadn’t let him off on account of our past relationship. He would’ve had to bear legal responsibility for arson and compensate for all the losses. My grandfather’s medical books are all priceless. He won’t be able to afford to compensate the Huo family even if he sells himself!”","Qiao Xi’s tone was icy-cold and indifferent as she looked at Guan Hui as if she was looking at an idiot.","Guan Hui instantly choked, her eyes filled with disbelief. After a moment of silence, she gradually calmed down.","Did Qiao Xi really not like Yuzhou? Not only was Yuzhou handsome, but he was also so capable. How could Qiao Xi not like him? She must be afraid of losing her dignity, so she did not want to admit it.","“Xi Xi, I understand your feelings.” Guan Hui advised earnestly, “You still blame Yuzhou and me in your heart, but I really don’t have any ill intentions when I say these words. I just don’t want you to be with a married man in order to take revenge on Yuzhou and me.”","When the people who were trying to please Guan Hui saw this scene, they immediately stood up and echoed, “Back then, it was because of you that Mrs. Huo and Mr. Huo almost broke up. Now that you’ve seduced a married man, who can’t tell what you’re thinking?”","“You were exposed by Mrs. Huo, so you’re now biting back!”","At this moment, Huo Yuzhou happened to rush over. When he heard these words, his expression instantly changed. He was just about to step forward and stand up for Qiao Xi when a figure quickly appeared by Qiao Xi’s side.","The man’s tall figure stood in front of Qiao Xi, his voice cold and low. “Mrs. Huo, do you want to know how Xi Xi got in?”","The resting area instantly fell silent as everyone looked at this extraordinarily handsome man.","Guan Hui looked up and saw that the man’s light brown eyes were deep. His handsome features were filled with a cold aura, and there was a trace of anger in his eyes. Behind the man was Huo Yuzhou.","Guan Hui’s mind exploded as she lowered her head nervously.","“Mr. Huo!” Everyone shouted in surprise when they saw Huo Yuzhou. They thought that Huo Yuzhou was here to stand up for Guan Hui.","“Mrs. Huo, look who’s here!”","Everyone’s shouts scared Guan Hui so much that her entire body trembled. She knew that Huo Yuzhou did not like others calling her ‘Mrs. Huo’. She was afraid that Huo Yuzhou would be angry.","“Wait, this... This is the president of Gu Corporation?”","“President Gu and Mr. Huo are both here!”","Everyone was surprised and delighted. Qiao Xi, who was hiding behind everyone, raised her eyebrows.","Suddenly, someone said loudly, “Mr. Huo, this woman doesn’t have an invitation and even bullied Mrs. Huo. Mrs. Huo is crying from grievances. Quickly chase this woman out!”","Huo Yuzhou looked past everyone at Qiao Xi. After so many years, her appearance had not changed much. She was still so stunning, but her gaze made him feel unfamiliar.","Qiao Xi looked at him coldly without dodging in the slightest, and she sneered in her heart.","Did Huo Yuzhou want to berate her in public? Would he accuse her of bullying Guan Hui?","Guan Hui was so nervous that she broke out in a cold sweat. “Yuzhou, don’t misunderstand. We were just joking. Xi Xi...”","Qiao Xi was even more impatient. It had already been so many years, yet it was still the same trick. Guan Hui would pretend to be pitiful and say, ‘Xi Xi didn’t bully me. It’s all my fault. Brother Yuzhou, don’t blame her.’ Then, she would cry and say that her life was bitter and her status was low.","Once Huo Yuzhou heard Guan Hui’s words, he would think that she was bullying Guan Hui because she had no one to rely on. Guan Hui was afraid of offending her, so she did not dare to say anything even though she was wronged.","Qiao Xi had long guessed Guan Hui’s plan, so she nodded without hesitation. “Yes, I did say a few words to her, but it was Mrs. Huo who provoked me first. She questioned why I was able to enter and whether I seduced a married man. Of course, I couldn’t swallow my anger. Mr. Huo, you can’t control your woman, so I’ll help you teach her a lesson.”","Everyone: “???”","What right did this woman have to be so arrogant?","Huo Yuzhou was the head of the Huo family and the head of the Brook family. This woman actually dared to offend him like this. Was she tired of living?","Everyone said indignantly, “Mr. Huo, Mrs. Huo was doing it for this woman’s own good, but she reprimanded Mrs. Huo in public. She doesn’t take you seriously at all!”","“This is Gu Corporation’s banquet. It isn’t a place for her to behave atrociously. If she offends President Gu and Mr. Huo, let’s see how she can still be arrogant.”","“Mrs. Huo lowered herself to greet her. Not only is she ungrateful, but she also said nasty words to hurt others. She really doesn’t know what’s good for her!”","Everyone criticized Qiao Xi, but they did not notice that Huo Yuzhou’s expression was getting darker and darker."]},{"number":1360,"title":"Chapter 1360 Mr. Huo Is Just A Stranger","paragraphs":["1360 Mr. Huo Is Just A Stranger","Guan Hui revealed a proud smile. After all, her current identity was Mrs. Huo. Even if Yuzhou’s heart ached for Qiao Xi, he would not berate her in public.","“Yuzhou, it’s all a misunderstanding. I...” Guan Hui said obsequiously.","“You lowered yourself to greet Xi Xi? Don’t you know your identity?” Huo Yuzhou looked at her coldly, and the words he said made one’s heart turn cold.","Guan Hui’s eyes were filled with disbelief. “Y-Yuzhou...”","Huo Yuzhou’s tone was a little sharp. “Guan Hui, you said that Xi Xi seduced a married man?”","Everyone was instantly stunned. What was going on? Mr. Huo looked very angry. Moreover, why was he questioning Mrs. Huo? Wasn’t he here to stand up for her?","Just as everyone’s minds were filled with question marks, Gu Zheng suddenly sneered, his eyes filled with cold killing intent. “Mrs. Huo, you haven’t answered my question just now.”","Guan Hui’s gaze was hesitant as she looked at Gu Zheng.","Even though she had liked Huo Yuzhou for many years, she could not help but be tempted when she saw the man in front of her. Gu Zheng’s appearance and ability were both more outstanding than Huo Yuzhou’s. When she found out about the rumors about him, she admired this man even more. There was probably no one in the world who was more charming than Gu Zheng.","But what was his question just now?","‘Mrs. Huo, do you want to know how Xi Xi got in?’","Hearing how Gu Zheng addressed Qiao Xi, Guan Hui could not help but become nervous. Could it be that Gu Zheng knew Qiao Xi as well?","Guan Hui hurriedly looked at Huo Yuzhou, her eyes pleading, but Huo Yuzhou ignored her. She said in a panic, “Y-Yuzhou.”","Her heart thumped violently. She suddenly realized that things seemed to be out of control.","“Apologize to her!” Huo Yuzhou ordered.","These words were clearly directed at Guan Hui. Those who were trying to please Guan Hui were stunned. The person who was bullied was Mrs. Huo. Why did Mr. Huo want Mrs. Huo to apologize to that woman?","Guan Hui’s eyes turned red as tears trickled down her cheeks. Her voice trembled as she said, “Yuzhou, I...”","“Mrs. Huo, didn’t you hear him? Mr. Huo wants you to apologize!” Qiao Xi’s tone carried a trace of ridicule.","Guan Hui’s face turned red, and her lips trembled slightly. She realized that something was wrong and could only look up at Huo Yuzhou pitifully, hoping that he could help.","Gu Zheng, who was at the side, had already lost his patience. He turned around to look at Qiao Xi and gently held her hand. Then, he smiled and said, “Let me introduce you. This is my wife, Qiao Xi. The mistress of Gu Corporation naturally doesn’t need an invitation to attend the auction. Mrs. Gu did come with a married man, but that married man is me—her husband.”","When Guan Hui heard the words ‘Mrs. Gu’, her eyes instantly widened as she looked at Qiao Xi in shock.","Qiao Xi... was actually married to Gu Zheng?","“I really don’t understand why Mrs. Huo concluded that I seduced a married man the moment she opened her mouth. I have such a powerful husband, so why would I seduce other men? Mr. Huo, why do you think Mrs. Huo thinks so? Even when we met in the past, I’ve never seduced a married man!","“Ah! Could it be that the man she’s talking about is you?!” Qiao Xi smiled disdainfully. “Mr. Huo, you can be considered married now, right? But we haven’t seen each other for six years. To me, you’re just a stranger. I’m not even familiar with you, so how could I have seduced you?”","As she spoke, Qiao Xi turned to look at Guan Hui and sneered. “Mrs. Huo, just because you like a man doesn’t mean that others will like him too. Don’t you think you’re very laughable for declaring your sovereignty as soon as you arrived?”","“Qiao Xi!” Guan Hui was angered to the point her entire body trembled as she glared fiercely at her.","How could she say that? She did not believe that Qiao Xi had never liked Yuzhou!","Just now, there was a group of people surrounding Guan Hui. At this moment, there was no one around her. They had already analyzed the situation. Miss Qiao was Gu Zheng’s wife. She did not like Mr. Huo at all. It was Mrs. Huo who was thinking too much and suspected that others had ideas about her husband.","Moreover, Miss Qiao also said that she was 14 years old when she separated from Mr. Huo. At that time, she was focused on her studies and was not in the mood to think about love at all. Even if she had a good impression of Mr. Huo at that time, there was nothing left of their relationship now that six years had passed. Now that Miss Qiao was already married to Gu Zheng and had a beautiful marriage, she had no intention of continuing her relationship with Mr. Huo. All of this was orchestrated by Mrs. Huo!"]},{"number":1361,"title":"Chapter 1361 Humble Pleas","paragraphs":["1361 Humble Pleas","Everyone looked at each other and understood what they were thinking.","Looking at Guan Hui’s unwilling and angry expression, Qiao Xi smiled in satisfaction, then turned to look at Gu Zheng. “Ah Zheng, I don’t want to see her.”","Gu Zheng replied gently, then instructed, “Song Shijing, please get Mrs. Huo to leave.”","“Yes, President!” Song Shijing hurried to Guan Hui. “Madam Huo, our young madam doesn’t want to see you. She hopes you can leave immediately and never appear in front of her again.”","!!","“Yuzhou!” Guan Hui blushed awkwardly and looked at Huo Yuzhou anxiously.","If she was really chased out, how could she establish herself in Y Nation in the future?","Guan Hui panicked. “Y-Yuzhou, I’m your woman. If they chase me out, you’ll lose your dignity too! Xi Xi, I misunderstood you. I already know my mistake. I hope you can forgive me on the account of our past relationship.”","At this moment, Guan Hui lowered her head as sweat dripped down her face. She had spent a lot of effort to attend the banquet with Yuzhou and made everyone think that she was the legitimate Mrs. Huo. If she was really chased out, everything she wanted would disappear.","All these years, she had always known what Huo Yuzhou was thinking. He only liked Qiao Xi and had never liked another woman. He kept her by his side for the sake of making Qiao Xi jealous. For the sake of provoking Qiao Xi into returning to his side, he did not even stop her even if she spread rumors that she was Mrs. Huo.","Guan Hui begged humbly, “Yuzhou, I’m yours...”","Qiao Xi was suddenly in the mood for a prank. “Mr. Huo, if you beg me, I’ll forgive Mrs. Huo and not chase her out.”","Guan Hui’s eyes lit up as she stared at Huo Yuzhou.","Huo Yuzhou raised his eyes slightly, but his deep eyes were filled with coldness. Guan Hui’s expression instantly stiffened. Why should she be embarrassed in front of Qiao Xi? What right did Qiao Xi have to always be high and mighty while she had to beg for the love and sympathy of others?","She could not be chased away. Absolutely not!","“Yuzhou...” Guan Hui’s voice trembled.","Huo Yuzhou’s gaze was slightly cold. Everyone thought that Mr. Huo would plead for leniency. After all, Mrs. Huo was his fiancee. If she lost her reputation, it would affect Mr. Huo too.","Guan Hui also thought that Huo Yuzhou would not refuse. As long as he could make her stay with just one sentence, he had no reason to refuse! Moreover, she was Mrs. Huo. Huo Yuzhou could not be so heartless in front of everyone!","After a moment of silence, Huo Yuzhou’s expression was cold as he said word by word, “She’s not my wife. Whether she stays or leaves is up to you.”","The surroundings instantly fell silent, and everyone stopped breathing.","‘Whether she stays or leaves is up to you?’","Guan Hui looked up abruptly, her eyes filled with disbelief.","“Yuzhou!”","Shame, anger, and unwillingness mixed together, making Guan Hui break down.","Huo Yuzhou frowned. Obviously, he no longer had the patience to continue arguing with this woman. He slowly raised his eyes and looked at Qiao Xi, who was not far away. His lips moved. “Xi Xi.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were slightly disdainful. “Mr. Huo, we’re not familiar with each other. Please call me ‘Mrs. Gu’ in the future and don’t talk to me, lest someone says that I seduced a married man.”","Everyone’s gazes landed on Guan Hui. Her face was ashen, and her teeth were chattering. She said with difficulty, “Yuzhou, I... I beg you. I can’t be chased out. You... Let me stay.”","At this moment, the bodyguards had already come forward and wanted to pull Guan Hui away. Huo Yuzhou’s expression was slightly complicated as he looked at Qiao Xi. “You know what Lil Hui’s character is like. Why bicker with her?”","Qiao Xi chuckled. She suddenly recalled something. Guan Hui said that Huo Yuzhou burned the library for her. Since Guan Hui wanted to show off so badly, she really could not just let it end like this.","“That’s right! This isn’t the first time she’s provoked me. Logically speaking, I should be used to it. No matter what, she’s Mr. Huo’s woman. It won’t be good if we really chase her out.”","Qiao Xi smiled a little wantonly and gestured for the bodyguards to let go. Guan Hui’s entire body went soft, and she almost fell to the floor. She looked at Huo Yuzhou with red eyes.","“Ah Zheng, let’s go.” Qiao Xi did not even bother to look at them. She held Gu Zheng’s hand, and the two of them turned to leave.","Huo Yuzhou, who was standing on the spot, stared at Qiao Xi’s and Gu Zheng’s interlocked hands with a burning gaze. The man’s wide palm wrapped Qiao Xi’s weak and fair little hand. The man lowered his eyes and smiled dotingly at his wife. The two of them looked so compatible."]},{"number":1362,"title":"Chapter 1362 I’ll Give You A Chance","paragraphs":["1362 I’ll Give You A Chance","At this moment, Guan Hui felt that she was about to suffocate. Everyone’s gazes were like venomous snakes that were about to devour her.","Huo Yuzhou left with a gloomy expression, while Guan Hui followed behind him. Her face was pale, and a cold sweat broke out on her forehead.","Guan Hui had been by Huo Yuzhou’s side for more than seven years. She knew him very well. Although he did not say anything, she could tell from the expression on his face that he was very angry at this moment.","Her entire body was weak, and she was trembling violently. She stammered, “Y-Yuzhou, I... I know my mistake. P-Please let me off.”","Huo Yuzhou stopped in his tracks and lowered his eyes slightly. There was no emotion in his cold eyes. “Lil Hui, I remember telling you not to provoke her. Why didn’t you listen?”","Guan Hui trembled as tears streamed down her face. “I... I won’t dare to do it anymore.”","Without saying a word, Huo Yuzhou grabbed her wrist and brought her into the luxurious lounge. At this moment, Guan Hui’s face was pale, and her terrified eyes were filled with tears. “Yuzhou, I was really wrong. Please forgive me this time!”","Looking at Guan Hui’s tearful face, the corners of Huo Yuzhou’s mouth suddenly curled up into a cold smile. His voice was low and cold. “Lil Hui, I could indulge you in the past, but why did you say that you were Mrs. Huo in front of her? Don’t you know your identity? Do you think you’re worthy of being my wife?”","“I... I was just muddle-headed. Everyone was saying that I was Mrs. Huo, so I didn’t retort. I didn’t know that Xi Xi was also present, nor did I know that she married Gu Zheng!”","The last sentence successfully ignited the anger in Huo Yuzhou’s heart. The coldness around him grew stronger and stronger, and the temperature in the entire room seemed to have dropped a little.","At this moment, Guan Hui had already fallen to the floor. Huo Yuzhou looked down at her and bent down slightly. His well-defined fingers raised her chin, forcing her to raise her head.","“Guan Hui, I thought that you would’ve learned to be more obedient after being by my side for so many years. It seems that I’ve overestimated you. I can give you a chance this time. But if you dare to make a similar mistake in the future, don’t blame me for being heartless.","“You have to remember who gave you a carefree life and who pulled you out of the quagmire. If you don’t listen to me, then everything you did in the Huo family back then...”","“I’ll be good! Yuzhou, I’ll definitely listen to you! Forgive me. I won’t provoke Xi Xi anymore! I’ll do whatever you ask me to do!”","When Guan Hui heard Huo Yuzhou’s words, her eyes were filled with horror. She instantly cried bitterly. “I’ll apologize to Xi Xi. I’ll say that you’ve always liked her and you’ve never liked me. The position of Mrs. Huo will never be mine!”","Huo Yuzhou chuckled and looked at Guan Hui with cold eyes for a long time. Then, he bent down slightly and gently stroked her cheek with his index finger. He wiped a tear away from her eyes and said in a much gentler voice, “Lil Hui, she’s not the Xi Xi from before. She’s Gu Zheng’s wife now. If you provoke her, Gu Zheng won’t let you off even if I don’t do anything. I won’t fall out with Gu Zheng for you. If Gu Zheng wants your life, I won’t stop him.","“As long as you beg Xi Xi for forgiveness and promise not to provoke her in the future, you’ll have a chance of survival.”","Guan Hui was scared out of her wits. “I... I understand. I’ll apologize!”","“Very good.” Huo Yuzhou stood up and walked to the window to sit down. He took out a cigarette from the box on the table and lit it with his long fingers. As he blew out smoke, he turned his head and asked, “Do you like anything from the auction?”","When Guan Hui heard this, most of the sorrow and fear in her heart dissipated. Was Yuzhou going to give her a gift?","The violin instantly appeared in her mind. She said carefully, “Just that violin...”","“You don’t like the other things?” Huo Yuzhou smiled. “Looks like ordinary things won’t catch your eye anymore. I understand.”","Seeing that he was smiling and was no longer unhappy, Guan Hui heaved a sigh of relief and felt a trace of sweetness.","Did that mean that he would give her the violin? It had to be known that Qiao Xi had once played that violin. If he was willing to give the violin to her, did that mean...","“Why are you still sitting there?” Seeing that she did not move for a long time, Huo Yuzhou could not help but frown and scold coldly, “Get out. I don’t want to see you!”"]},{"number":1363,"title":"Chapter 1363 I’m Unlucky To Know Him","paragraphs":["1363 I’m Unlucky To Know Him","Guan Hui was not surprised that Huo Yuzhou was chasing her away so impatiently. She seemed to be used to it. She bit her lip and slowly got up from the floor to walk out of the lounge.","At this moment, there was a group of people standing outside. Seeing that Guan Hui’s eyes were filled with sympathy and a trace of disdain, Huo Yuzhou’s assistant broke the silence first. “Miss Guan, the sir said that he knows what you want. He wants you to go to the auction house first. He’ll go in a while.”","Guan Hui heaved a sigh of relief and straightened her back. Even if she could not compare to Qiao Xi’s status in Yuzhou’s heart, she was still the only woman by Yuzhou’s side. She would always be by Yuzhou’s side.","Back then, she spent a lot of effort to stay with the Huo family and schemed against Qiao Xi. It was not easy for her to get Qiao Xi out of the Huo family. Everything she had now was not easy to come by. She had to become the legitimate Mrs. Huo and make everyone who had once mocked her regret it.","When everyone heard Huo Yuzhou’s assistant’s words, their expressions were a little subtle. In that case, Mr. Huo still liked Miss Guan. Even if she was not Mrs. Huo now, she would be sooner or later.","A few socialites immediately smiled obsequiously. “Miss Guan, don’t you want that violin? Looks like you can get your wish this time.”","“That violin is the finale. It looks like it must have a special meaning. Mr. Huo wants to bid for it and give it to you, Miss Guan. It’s enough to prove that he cares about you. In that case, we won’t compete with Mr. Huo.”","Another woman said obsequiously, “Since you want the violin, I believe Mr. Huo will get it no matter how much money he spends. How can we be Mr. Huo’s match?! We’re not qualified to compete with him in wealth!”","Hearing everyone’s compliments, Guan Hui gradually looked proud.","At this moment, Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi had already arrived at the auction house. The seats were all luxurious sofas. Gu Zheng’s and Qiao Xi’s seats were in the center. Not only were they luxurious, but they also came with a good view.","Qiao Xi turned her head to look at the man beside her. “Don’t you have anything to ask?”","“Xi Xi, what do you think I’ll ask?” Gu Zheng’s eyes were bright like stars as he looked at her gently. Qiao Xi only took a glance before her heart thumped.","Gu Zheng raised his hand, and his long and fair fingers landed on her cheek. He stroked it gently. His tone was calm but carried a trace of coldness. “Let me ask you about your past with Huo Yuzhou. Did you know Huo Yuzhou before me?”","Qiao Xi instantly choked. She kept having the feeling that Gu Zheng knew everything. Did he investigate it himself, or did he hear it from somewhere?","She pondered for a moment and immediately reacted. She could not help but frown. “Did Huo Yuzhou tell you? What else did he say?”","Gu Zheng had a warm smile on his face. In front of Qiao Xi, he would maintain his gentle and elegant image no matter what.","Qiao Xi was angry. Huo Yuzhou was really too evil. She and Huo Yuzhou had known each other for a long time, but that was all because of Huo Yuzhou’s schemes. After what had happened, their previous relationship had long disappeared. Why did he say those strange things in front of Gu Zheng?","Gu Zheng said casually, “I’m not angry, and I won’t care about his words.”","Qiao Xi said indignantly, “Back then, he used me to get close to Grandpa and stole his medical book. He even almost burned the library. So what if I knew him before you?","“It’s my bad luck to know a despicable person like him!”","Gu Zheng’s cold face was filled with smiles, and his eyes became even gentler.","These words were not said by him. Xi Xi had said them herself. Moreover, Huo Yuzhou had indeed bragged in front of him that he had known Xi Xi for a long time and tried to ruin their relationship as husband and wife. Unfortunately, Huo Yuzhou had made a mistake. Xi Xi no longer trusted him.","Gu Zheng’s clear eyes were like a deep pool as he quietly looked at the woman beside him. Her every move was so charming. For the first time, he felt flustered. He was afraid that someone would snatch Xi Xi away and wished for nothing more than to hide Xi Xi from others.","However, he was not worried now because Xi Xi only had eyes for him. She would not like Huo Yuzhou.","The auction was about to start. Qiao Xi casually picked up the booklet on the table and flipped through it. She suddenly recalled that Gu Zheng had said that he wanted to give her a gift.","Ever since the two of them got married, Gu Zheng had given her many gifts. Jewelry and clothes had already filled the cloakroom. Although the things in this auction book were very expensive, they were not special. They were similar to the things in her cloakroom.","What did Gu Zheng want to give her? Could it be this violin?"]},{"number":1364,"title":"Chapter 1364 Mysterious Gift","paragraphs":["1364 Mysterious Gift","Qiao Xi suddenly raised her eyes and asked, “Ah Zheng, what gift are you going to give me?”","“Guess.” Gu Zheng’s tone carried a trace of amusement.","Qiao Xi supported her chin and pondered for a few seconds. “There’s nothing special about the items at this auction. Only the violin, which is the finale, is a little different. However, I don’t understand why the violin is so precious.”","Gu Zheng looked at her with a smile and did not answer.","Qiao Xi continued, “Actually, this violin was made by Fourth Brother. It has always been with Grandpa. I used to play it when I was free.","“When I was in the lounge today, I heard from Guan Hui that she wants this violin. Huo Yuzhou will probably bid for it and give it to her. After all, Huo Yuzhou is the head of the Brook family. He can’t bid for a 200,000 yuan violin to give to the future Mrs. Huo, so he specially instructed us to make the violin the finale to show off his noble identity and status.”","When she thought about this, Qiao Xi suddenly widened her eyes and asked in surprise, “Ah Zheng, could it be that the gift you want to give me is also this violin?”","Gu Zheng looked at her meaningfully and was about to speak when Qiao Xi pulled him back. “Gu Zheng, actually, I don’t really like this violin. I just played it a few times when I was bored. If I really liked it, Fourth Brother would have given me a similar violin a long time ago. You don’t have to spend money to buy this for me.”","“Xi Xi.” The smile on Gu Zheng’s face grew wider. “Do you think I’ll give you such an ordinary gift? Since it’s a gift I’m giving you, it’ll naturally have to satisfy you.”","Gu Zheng had long known that this violin belonged to Xue Liang. Since it belonged to Xue Liang, Xi Xi did not think it was all that interesting. Although he did not lack money, there was no need for him to spend it on this.","Qiao Xi came back to her senses and had a curious expression. “Then what exactly are you giving me?”","“You’ll know when the time comes,” Gu Zheng said mysteriously. Qiao Xi would definitely like this gift.","The more mysterious Gu Zheng was, the more curious Qiao Xi was. Apart from that violin, there was really nothing special about the items at the auction. Could it be that the gift Gu Zheng wanted to give was not from the auction?","On the other hand, Huo Yuzhou and Guan Hui had also taken their seats. As soon as they entered, Huo Yuzhou saw Qiao Xi sitting in the middle. His gaze would land on her from time to time.","“Yuzhou...” Guan Hui’s voice carried a trace of grievance, but her eyes were filled with resentment. Her man was looking at another woman. How could she take this lying down? However, she was afraid of making Huo Yuzhou angry, so she could only find a reason to interrupt his burning gaze.","“What do you think of that porcelain ornament? Why don’t we take it and put it in the living room?”","Huo Yuzhou retracted his gaze and instantly exposed Guan Hui’s thoughts. He frowned unhappily. “Don’t forget my warning. Watch your identity.”","Guan Hui’s body trembled as she lowered her eyes in fear. Hatred surged in her heart.","She had deliberately chased Qiao Xi away and been by Huo Yuzhou’s side for so many years. Even a dog should have grown feelings for her. She did not understand why Huo Yuzhou only had Qiao Xi in his heart and did not care about her feelings at all.","Bang!","The gavel fell, and the porcelain ornament was auctioned off.","Qiao Xi was not interested. These things were not interesting, but it was an auction held by Gu Corporation, after all. Song Shijing casually raised his placard a few times and bid for three things before stopping.","Guan Hui had taken a liking to a few pieces of jewelry. She looked at the man beside her, her eyes filled with pleading. She hoped that Huo Yuzhou could bid for them and give them to her, but Huo Yuzhou ignored her.","Soon, it was the last item. Everyone knew that the finale item was a violin. At first, they did not understand why an ordinary violin would be the finale item. However, later on, they heard that Mrs. Huo had been thinking about this violin for many years. This violin must be extraordinary.","As soon as the violin was placed on stage, Guan Hui’s eyes lit up. She looked at the man anxiously. “Yuzhou...”","Huo Yuzhou did not respond to Guan Hui. Instead, he ordered his assistant, “500,000.”","Guan Hui was instantly overwhelmed by pleasant surprise, and the resentment in her heart dissipated. She felt that Huo Yuzhou probably asked her to apologize to Qiao Xi because he did not want to offend Gu Zheng. After all, it had already been six years. Even if Huo Yuzhou had some feelings for Qiao Xi, they would have vanished with the passage of time.","She had been by Huo Yuzhou’s side for so many years. Huo Yuzhou still cared about her. Otherwise, he would not be bidding for this violin to give to her. Moreover, before this, Guan Hui had already asked around. Huo Yuzhou didn’t intend to attend the auction at first. He only specially rushed over when he found out that this violin would be getting auctioned."]},{"number":1365,"title":"Chapter 1365 Her Prank","paragraphs":["1365 Her Prank","At this moment, Qiao Xi also elegantly raised her placard, and the atmosphere instantly became subtle.","Everyone present knew that Guan Hui and Mrs. Gu had a conflict just now. Miss Guan had just bid for it, and Mrs. followed. She was clearly doing it on purpose!","It was just a violin. If it was auctioned outside, it would at most cost 500,000 yuan. The price Huo Yuzhou offered just now was probably because he thought that once this price was raised, no one would compete anymore. Unexpectedly, Mrs. Gu appeared out of nowhere.","Who would win this violin in the end? Everyone’s gazes shifted between the two parties.","When Guan Hui saw Qiao Xi raise the placard, her entire face darkened. She wheedled unwillingly. “Yuzhou...”","“Continue,” Huo Yuzhou said, and Guan Hui gained the confidence to immediately raise her placard. Qiao Xi followed closely behind and increased the price.","Huo Yuzhou frowned. Even if Qiao Xi wanted this violin, he had to be the one giving it to her. What right did the man beside her have to pay for it?","At the thought of this, he instructed Guan Hui to raise the price without hesitation. Soon, the price soared to five million.","Qiao Xi could not help but sneer. “Five million? Heh! Mr. Huo, you’re really willing to spend money!”","Actually, she did not want this violin. She had just heard from Guan Hui that she had once played this violin, so Qiao Xi deliberately raised the price to tease Guan Hui.","Guan Hui should know very well who this violin originally belonged to. Guan Hui just wanted to show her status in Huo Yuzhou’s heart, so she said in public that she had once played this violin.","At that time, Huo Yuzhou’s fire caused her grandfather to lose a few priceless medical books. This time, she only made Huo Yuzhou lose a few million yuan. She had done her best.","Qiao Xi did not intend to continue competing for this violin and had no intention of raising the price. Huo Yuzhou’s gaze landed on her, and the feeling in his heart was slightly complicated.","Could it be that Xi Xi did not like this violin? If she did not like it, it would be meaningless for him to bid for it.","Just as the auctioneer was about to hit the gavel, a cold voice spread throughout the entire hall. “Six million!”","“Ah Zheng!” Qiao Xi frowned.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were clear as he smiled gently. “What’s wrong?”","Qiao Xi deliberately raised the price for the sake of pulling a prank. She did not really want this violin. She originally thought that the matter would end here, but she did not expect Gu Zheng to continue raising the price. She said helplessly, “I already said that I don’t want this violin. Moreover, this violin is worth 500,000 yuan at most. Why waste money on it?”","“I didn’t say I wanted to buy it.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Gu Zheng raised his glass and took a sip of red wine. His thin lips were dyed red as he chuckled. “I did raise the price, but that doesn’t mean I have to buy it.”","Not long after, the price of this violin soared to ten million. Everyone was shocked. Even if these two big shots did not lack money, they could not squander it like this!","After Gu Zheng offered ten million, Huo Yuzhou’s assistant looked troubled. “Sir, the auction price for this violin is only 500,000 yuan. It’s already increased to ten million. Why don’t we forget about it?”","Huo Yuzhou ignored him and looked at Guan Hui. The smile in his eyes was cold. “Do you think we should increase the price?”","Guan Hui suddenly became nervous. “Y-Yuzhou, I think that... although this violin isn’t worth this price, we haven’t bid for anything in this auction. If others realize this, they’ll inevitably gossip. Moreover, ten million is nothing to you. Let’s continue raising the price.","“W-What do you think?” Guan Hui asked uneasily, but her eyes were filled with anticipation. She hoped that Huo Yuzhou could continue bidding. She did not care if the violin was worth the price or not. As long as Huo Yuzhou bid for it and gave it to her, everyone would know that she was the woman Huo Yuzhou cared about. No one would laugh at her anymore.","The assistant had been with Huo Yuzhou for many years. Of course, he could tell what Guan Hui was thinking. In the end, she was still too stupid to think about what she could not get.","The smile on Huo Yuzhou’s face grew wider and wider, but the smile did not reach his eyes. It looked hypocritical and scary.","“Since Lil Hui said to continue, then continue to increase the bid!” Huo Yuzhou gave the order, and the assistant could only raise his placard as instructed.","When Guan Hui saw this scene, she was so excited that her breathing almost stopped. She knew that Yuzhou had her in his heart. He knew that she liked this violin, so he would bid for it and give it to her no matter what.","Many years ago, she had seen Qiao Xi play this violin. The sound was beautiful. At that time, Qiao Xi was so dazzling as she stood under the sunlight. From then on, she fell in love with this violin. Now that this violin was finally going to be hers, the man beside her would also belong to her."]},{"number":1366,"title":"Chapter 1366 Can’t Even Bear To Spend This Bit Of Money","paragraphs":["1366 Can’t Even Bear To Spend This Bit Of Money","Guan Hui’s eyes were filled with pride and vanity. After so many years, she could finally hold her head high in front of Qiao Xi. She wanted to snatch what Qiao Xi valued. Not to mention ten million, she was even willing to give up 100 million!","The next second, Gu Zheng said casually, “20 million.”","Everyone was instantly dumbfounded. Was this man so crazy? He directly increased the bid by ten million?","Huo Yuzhou was not to be outdone. “30 million.”","Everyone’s eyes were about to pop out as they held their breaths. To be honest, this violin was indeed very exquisite, but no matter how beautiful it was, it was just a violin. This violin should cost 500,000 yuan at most. Who knew that the two richest and most powerful men in the venue would fight like this?","Gu Zheng wanted to give it to Mrs. Gu, while Mr. Huo wanted to give it to Miss Guan. They both wanted to use this violin to make a beauty smile. This was understandable, but everyone did not expect the price to increase to 30 million.","With Gu Zheng’s strength, he would probably continue to raise the price. It seemed that these two would not give up so easily. They might see the most unbelievable price in history today.","Everyone held their breaths and focused their gazes on Gu Zheng. Time passed minute by minute, but Gu Zheng had no intention of raising the price.","The auctioneer also hesitated for a few seconds. Seeing that Gu Zheng did not raise the price, he started shouting, “30 million going once, 30 million going twice.” However, Gu Zheng still did not react.","Everyone widened their eyes and looked at him in disbelief. President Gu was giving up so easily?","Actually, it made sense. 30 million to buy a violin was too much of a loss. Even if he was rich, he could not be so willful!","When Huo Yuzhou saw this scene, his eyes were filled with mockery. It was only 30 million, yet Gu Zheng had already given up. It seemed that he was not sincere about Xi Xi. He was not even willing to spend this bit of money.","Bang!","The gavel fell, and the auctioneer announced loudly, “30 million sold. Congratulations, Mr. Huo, on bidding for this violin!”","Only then did everyone realize that the auction had ended. They all applauded and echoed. The fact that Huo Yuzhou could spend 30 million to buy this violin meant that he was telling everyone that he did not lack money. His status in the Brook family was unshakable. Otherwise, why would he spend 30 million to buy a violin without even blinking?","Gu Zheng glanced at Huo Yuzhou, then lowered his eyes and said to the person beside him in amusement, “I told you that I wouldn’t buy it. I was just raising the price.”","Qiao Xi: “...” 30 million just for a violin!","“If Huo Yuzhou had given up in advance, would you have really bought it?” Qiao Xi widened her eyes and looked at him.","“It’s just tens of millions. It doesn’t matter if I spend that sum of money. At the very least, it can make Mr. Huo unhappy. Moreover, I know my limits. This violin already belongs to Mr. Huo,” Gu Zheng said casually.","He really did not care about this bit of money. Moreover, 30 million was his estimate. Huo Yuzhou did not bid for this violin to give Guan Hui but to give Xi Xi. Otherwise, Huo Yuzhou would not have offered such a high price.","Although Huo Yuzhou was powerful in the Brook family, it was something he had obtained through many years of cautiousness. He had to carefully consider whether everything he did was worth it or not. This time, he had already thought of the minimum price in his heart. It was about 30 million.","Huo Yuzhou would not make a losing deal. He wanted to give the violin to Xi Xi in front of everyone. If Xi Xi accepted the violin, it would mean that she had forgiven Huo Yuzhou. The grudge between the two parties would be written off. If Xi Xi did not accept it, he would not lose his dignity. After all, he had forked out 30 million to promote himself. Everyone would sigh at his power.","Hence, Huo Yuzhou’s bottom line was 30 million. Once this price was exceeded, he would cut his losses in time.","Gu Zheng had seen through his thoughts, so he gave up on bidding when Huo Yuzhou raised the price of 30 million.","At this moment, the auction had already ended. Guan Hui stood up excitedly. Soon, many socialites and noblewomen surrounded her. “Oh, Miss Guan, Mr. Huo dotes on you too much!”","“That’s 30 million! He didn’t even blink!”","“Mr. Huo is capable, so he naturally won’t care about this small amount of money. As long as Miss Guan is happy, Mr. Huo’s 30 million yuan won’t be wasted!”","Everyone praised her, coaxing Guan Hui until she was shy and forgot about her previous unhappiness.","Guan Hui replied shyly, “I said that I wouldn’t let him bid for it, but he still wanted to bid for it. It’s indeed a waste to spend 30 million on a violin.”"]},{"number":1367,"title":"Chapter 1367 What Did She Have To Show Off?","paragraphs":["1367 What Did She Have To Show Off?","“Miss Guan, what other nobleman is as passionate as Mr. Huo? You’re the only woman by his side all these years. It’s nothing for him to spend 30 million yuan on you!”","Hearing everyone’s words, Guan Hui instantly beamed.","This was the highlight of her life. She really wanted to show off in front of Qiao Xi. She wanted Qiao Xi to know how much Huo Yuzhou doted on her. She wanted Qiao Xi to see the violin she liked fall into her hands with her own eyes.","She wanted to snatch everything from Qiao Xi—her jewelry and Huo Yuzhou, who doted on Qiao Xi. She had succeeded back then, so today was naturally no exception.","“Xi Xi, you want this violin?”","Guan Hui suddenly said with a victorious smile, “I remember that you used to have a violin. I’ve always liked it, but you... You didn’t even let me touch it. You said that you were afraid that I wouldn’t be able to afford it if I broke it. I didn’t expect to have my own violin now.”","At this moment, Qiao Xi’s phone vibrated. It was a message from Xue Liang and Liang Pingchuan. She lowered her head and saw that the two of them had also followed her to Y Nation. It seemed that this was the gift Gu Zheng was talking about.","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing when she heard Guan Hui’s words. She did not want to have anything to do with Guan Hui and Huo Yuzhou, nor did she want to mention the past. However, Guan Hui seemed to be crazy and just had to provoke her.","When Guan Hui saw that Qiao Xi did not react for a long time, her eyes were filled with resentment. She had already snatched Qiao Xi’s violin, but Qiao Xi still looked indifferent.","Shouldn’t Qiao Xi fly into a rage?","She really hated Qiao Xi’s calm appearance. Even when she left the Huo family back then, she did not cry from sadness. It was because of her indifferent appearance that Yuzhou could not forget her.","Guan Hui felt depressed as if a huge rock was pressing against her heart. She gritted her teeth hatefully and tried her best to look gentle.","“Xi Xi, if you like this violin, I can lend it to you. After all, we’re friends. I can agree to such a small matter.” The corners of Guan Hui’s mouth curled up, and she looked like a petty person who had achieved success.","Qiao Xi picked up her phone and replied to Xue Liang. It was as if she did not hear Guan Hui’s words.","Guan Hui saw Qiao Xi’s cold gaze as she sat elegantly on the sofa. She was clearly wearing a simple long dress, but she had a noble aura that made others unable to take their eyes off her. Compared to Qiao Xi, she was like a laughable clown.","Anger and unwillingness instantly surged in her heart. Guan Hui had long forgotten Huo Yuzhou’s warning and smiled hypocritically. “Xi Xi, don’t be polite with me. I’ll send someone to deliver the violin to you later.”","Qiao Xi raised her head slightly, and her eyes were icy-cold.","Guan Hui met her gaze and suddenly became nervous.","Everyone present looked at each other, really not understanding their relationship. From what Miss Guan said, the two of them should be good friends, but Mrs. Gu did not really want to talk to Miss Guan.","Even though the two of them had a conflict, Miss Guan had already expressed her goodwill in front of everyone. Why did Mrs. Gu still have a cold expression? In comparison, Miss Guan was more magnanimous.","“Mr. Huo is here!” someone shouted from the crowd, and everyone looked up.","“Looks like Mr. Huo is going to give the violin to Miss Guan in public!”","Guan Hui smiled shyly and took this opportunity to show off in front of Qiao Xi. “Xi Xi, Yuzhou is here. If you really like that violin, I’ll discuss lending it to you with Yuzhou. He won’t refuse.","“I can lend it to you, but I can’t sell it to you. After all, Yuzhou bought it for me. Let’s forget about the past. Don’t take it to heart, alright?”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. Guan Hui’s thoughts were all written on her face.","She wanted to show off? What was there for her to show off?","When everyone heard Guan Hui’s words, they all guessed in their hearts that Mrs. Gu must have liked Mr. Huo back then. However, Mr. Huo chose Miss Guan and even brought her to Y Nation, so Mrs. Gu had always had a knot in her heart. However, she was already married to Gu Zheng now. What could she not get over?","Qiao Xi knew that Guan Hui was deliberately saying this to make everyone misunderstand. After all, Guan Hui did not dare to tell the truth in public. Once everyone knew what had happened in the past, they would know that Huo Yuzhou was a two-faced despicable person.","Qiao Xi sneered. “Miss Guan, when did I say I wanted this violin? Moreover, this violin was bought by Huo Yuzhou. What right do you have to decide who to lend it to?”"]},{"number":1368,"title":"Chapter 1368 Feelings Can’t Be Forced","paragraphs":["1368 Feelings Can’t Be Forced","What right did Guan Hui have to decide what to do with the violin that Huo Yuzhou had bid for?","Qiao Xi’s words instantly caused Guan Hui to choke. Her lips moved as she said with an aggrieved expression, “Xi Xi, it’s been so many years. Why are you still so hostile toward me? I’ve always wanted to beg for your forgiveness. I only thought of lending it to you because I know you like this violin. I really don’t have any ill intentions, but you always doubt my intentions.","“Back then, Yuzhou brought me away, and I know you hate me for it, but feelings can’t be forced. I’m not worthy of Yuzhou, and you look down on my identity, so you can’t accept me being by Yuzhou’s side. I understand that.”","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi with different expressions. What did everyone not understand after Miss Guan said this? Miss Guan knew that Mrs. Gu hated her, so she had been trying her best to please her. However, Mrs. Gu did not appreciate her kindness and even acted arrogantly, making Miss Guan sad.","Even if Mrs. Gu really liked Mr. Huo, that was all in the past. Now that Mrs. Gu was already married to Gu Zheng and Mr. Huo was about to marry Miss Guan, it was really not right for her to keep this grudge!","Moreover, Mr. Huo bought this violin for Miss Guan. Of course, she had the right to decide what to do with it. Mrs. Gu’s words sounded like she was jealous of her.","At this moment, someone comforted her in a low voice. “Miss Guan, don’t be sad. This violin was given to you by Mr. Huo. Of course, you have the right to decide who to lend this violin to. However, if she’s unwilling to accept it, don’t force her.”","“Xi Xi, I... I really have good intentions. I just want you to forgive me. Can’t we be friends like before? Why must you be so unforgiving?”","As soon as she finished speaking, footsteps sounded. Everyone made way for the man. Huo Yuzhou walked over, appearing straight and tall.","“Yuzhou...” Guan Hui hurriedly went forward to welcome him.","Everyone’s gazes landed on the two of them, but Huo Yuzhou did not stop at all. He walked past Guan Hui and continued forward.","The smile on Guan Hui’s face froze instantly. She looked at the stunned crowd and explained awkwardly, “I’m sorry, but Yuzhou must have something important to attend to. Please don’t take offense...”","However, before Guan Hui could finish speaking, everyone looked in the direction of Huo Yuzhou’s figure and saw him stop in front of Qiao Xi.","“Xi Xi.”","That gentle voice made Guan Hui’s ears buzz, and her face turned pale.","Qiao Xi was lowering her head to reply to Xue Liang’s message when a shadow suddenly blocked the light. She raised her eyes to look at the man in front of her, and the joy in her heart instantly dissipated as she frowned unhappily.","She turned around and wanted to leave Huo Yuzhou’s side, but this man was too shameless. Wherever she went, Huo Yuzhou would stand in her way to stop her from leaving.","Qiao Xi: “...”","She took a few steps back to distance herself from him. Her voice was cold. “Mr. Huo, please move aside!”","Huo Yuzhou looked at her stunning face and was dazed for a moment. Then, his voice was gentle. “Xi Xi, there’s been a misunderstanding between us. Can I talk to you?”","Qiao Xi instantly clenched her fists and kept telling herself that she was a weak woman and could not hit someone in front of so many people. She had to calm down.","She suppressed the urge to hit him and snorted. “Mr. Huo...”","However, before she could finish, Huo Yuzhou handed her a piece of paper. Qiao Xi looked down and saw that it was a receipt for 30 million yuan. It was signed with his name. Huo Yuzhou’s handwriting was strong and unique.","When Qiao Xi saw the numbers on it, she instantly reacted and could not help but sneer.","Huo Yuzhou lowered his eyes and stared at her with his deep eyes. His tone was filled with patience and affection. “Xi Xi, I owed you too much in the past. Take this violin as an apology. I hope you can accept it.”","Everyone’s pupils trembled as they watched this scene in disbelief.","What? The violin was for Mrs. Gu?","Mr. Huo spent 30 million on this violin. Wasn’t it for Miss Guan? Why did he give it to Mrs. Gu in the blink of an eye?","These casual words caused the entire hall to fall into dead silence. The air seemed to have frozen.","The eyes of those socialites and noblewomen who were flattering Guan Hui earlier were filled with shock as their gazes shifted between Qiao Xi and Guan Hui.","Guan Hui felt dizzy and her body went numb. It was as if she was going to faint the next second.","Huo Yuzhou bought this zither for Qiao Xi? It was not for her?"]},{"number":1369,"title":"Chapter 1369 Ambiguous Relationship","paragraphs":["1369 Ambiguous Relationship","Guan Hui gritted her teeth as her body trembled uncontrollably.","Huo Yuzhou clearly knew that this violin was made by Xue Liang. If Qiao Xi liked the violin, Xue Liang could give her one in minutes. It would even be better than this violin. Why would he spend such a large sum of money and spend so much effort to give it to Qiao Xi? Even if he did that, Qiao Xi would not be touched.","She was different from Qiao Xi. She only had eyes for him. As long as he was willing to give her 10% of his heart, she would be loyal to him. However, what had he done?","Everyone present thought that he would give the violin to her, but he actually gave it to Qiao Xi in public. He did not consider her feelings at all!","The love in Guan Hui’s heart instantly transformed into hatred. She hated Huo Yuzhou and Qiao Xi even more. If it were not for Qiao Xi, she would not have been so embarrassed.","Qiao Xi was already Gu Zheng’s wife, but Huo Yuzhou was brazenly giving Qiao Xi such a precious gift. Wasn’t he afraid of others gossiping? Wasn’t he afraid of angering Gu Zheng by having an ambiguous relationship with his wife?","At this moment, the gazes everyone shot at Qiao Xi and Huo Yuzhou carried a trace of strangeness. They took a few steps back successively and stared fixedly at the three people in the middle, afraid that they would miss the show.","At this moment, everyone remembered that Gu Zheng had also bid for the violin just now. This violin was for women. It was obvious that Gu Zheng wanted to bid for it for Mrs. Gu, but Huo Yuzhou knew this and was unwilling to give in. He did not even hesitate to raise the price to 30 million.","They were clearly going to give it to a woman. Why waste so much money?","Everyone thought for a moment and understood Huo Yuzhou’s meaning. He wanted to personally bid for this violin to give to Mrs. Gu. He did not want Gu Zheng to give it to her.","From the looks of it, Mrs. Gu and Huo Yuzhou’s relationship was very ambiguous. After all, they had an unknown past. Although Mrs. Gu was married now, she was still connected to Huo Yuzhou. She was wandering between two noble men. It had to be said that Mrs. Gu was indeed capable.","“Xi Xi, don’t refuse me.” Huo Yuzhou stared at her with a burning gaze, and his tone carried a trace of toughness.","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and looked at Huo Yuzhou’s name on the receipt. She sneered. “Mr. Huo, is it appropriate to give such a valuable gift to a married woman in front of your fiancee?","“Are you going to make the headlines with me tomorrow and make everyone think that I’m a fickle-minded woman? You’re not apologizing but trying to harm me!”","Huo Yuzhou knew that she would say this. His eyes were calm, but his voice carried an imperceptible trace of mockery. “Of course, I won’t harm you. I just want to return what I owe you. Even if you’re already married, can’t an old friend give you a gift? President Gu is in charge of the huge Gu Corporation, so he shouldn’t be so petty.”","Qiao Xi almost couldn’t help but roll her eyes. What was this? He wanted to give her a gift for no reason. If she didn’t accept it, it meant that Gu Zheng was petty?","Huo Yuzhou had always been cold and heartless, but he could be said to be extremely gentle and patient with Qiao Xi. His voice was gentle and carried a trace of indescribable charm. “Xi Xi, it was my fault back then. After so many years, you should let go. I owe you this violin. Accept it, alright?”","Qiao Xi was no stranger to this gentle murmur. In the past, Huo Yuzhou had always coaxed her like this.","‘Lil Hui doesn’t have any relatives anymore. She’s already so pitiful. Xi Xi, let her have her way.’","‘Xi Xi, just give this necklace to Lil Hui. I’ll buy you something better. You won’t mind, right?’","‘I’m sorry, Xi Xi. I didn’t mean to set the library on fire. Please forgive me.’","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with coldness. Were those words that were used to coax a child now being used to coax her?","Seeing that she was silent for a long time, Huo Yuzhou remained patient and said in a low and gentle voice, “Xi Xi, I’ve been looking for you all these years and sent you many emails, but you’ve never replied to me. You’ve punished me for long enough. Forgive me now, okay?”","The hall was silent. Everyone’s jaws dropped as they looked at Gu Zheng, who was not far away. Seeing that his wife was being coveted, he did not seem to have any intention of going forward.","Everyone could tell that Mr. Huo and Mrs. Gu were in an ambiguous relationship. Could it be that Gu Zheng was not worried? Mr. Huo was cold to everyone except Mrs. Gu. Could it be that they had a deep-rooted relationship in the past?","Everyone was guessing, but their guesses were all ruined the next second."]},{"number":1370,"title":"Chapter 1370 Mr. Huo’s Feelings Are Worth Nothing!","paragraphs":["1370 Mr. Huo’s Feelings Are Worth Nothing!","“Mr. Huo, you want Little Six to forgive you just because of a violin? Did you so easily forget what you’ve done?” A cold voice sounded, and everyone looked in the direction of the voice.","When Huo Yuzhou heard this voice, his eyes flickered, and the corners of his mouth curled into a meaningful smile. “Xi Xi, they’re here too! In that case, this means that you’re still unwilling to forgive me.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he slowly turned around and said in a calm tone, “Mr. Liang and Mr. Xue, welcome. Sorry for not going out to welcome you.”","In Y Nation, everyone might not know Liang Pingchuan, but they would know Xue Liang. All these years, Xue Liang had become famous overseas and held many art exhibitions. He was also known as the youngest capable painter. His works appeared all over the world, and many noble families in Y Nation had collections of his work.","After two seconds of silence, someone exclaimed, “It’s Xue Liang!”","Not far away, Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. Since Xue Liang was here, he naturally did not have to do anything.","Xue Liang went straight to Qiao Xi’s side and protected her behind him. He looked at Huo Yuzhou with a cold gaze. “Mr. Huo, I remember that I warned you and Guan Hui not to disturb Xi Xi’s life again. Otherwise, you’ll have to bear the consequences.”","Huo Yuzhou used to have a good relationship with Qiao Xi’s brothers. They once said that they would always be good friends and protect Xi Xi. After that, everything changed.","Now that they met again, Huo Yuzhou’s attitude was still gentle. “Mr. Xue, I don’t have any ill intentions. Giving Xi Xi a violin is just a token of my appreciation.”","“Keep your kind intentions for yourself. I made this violin myself. If Xi Xi likes it, I can give her many of such violins. She doesn’t have to accept gifts from an outsider for no reason. Moreover, we’ve already said that we won’t see each other again. Don’t tell me you think you can reconcile with Xi Xi by giving her a gift?”","After Xue Liang finished speaking, he glanced at Gu Zheng, who was not far away, and sneered. “In my opinion, your kind feelings and intentions are worthless! You want to bribe our Xi Xi with just a violin? Previously, President Gu made Little Six angry and gave her an island! Heh... I didn’t think it through. Your ability naturally can’t compare to President Gu’s. You probably can’t afford an island.","“Now that Xi Xi already has President Gu by her side and her husband really dotes on her, do you think you have a chance? You can’t even be considered Xi Xi’s friend. What right do you have to give her a gift?”","A trace of frustration surged in Huo Yuzhou’s heart. Before he came to see Xi Xi, he was clearly mentally prepared to be ridiculed. However, after hearing Xue Liang’s words, he could not suppress the emotions in his heart.","He and Xue Liang had known each other for so many years. They had once agreed to be friends for the rest of their lives, but Xue Liang was also speaking up for Gu Zheng now. What was so good about that man? Why was everyone standing on his side?","Even though Huo Yuzhou no longer cared about Xue Liang’s opinion, he still could not accept these words.","He forced himself to calm down, and his tone was still gentle. “Mr. Xue, what happened back then is in the past. Why take it to heart? I’ve let Xi Xi down, and I’m trying my best to make it up to her. I hope you can give me a chance.”","Everyone was confused. What exactly was the thing that happened back then?","Xue Liang looked up at him coldly. After a moment of silence, he chuckled. “A chance? Haven’t we already given you a chance? If I hadn’t let you off on account of Grandpa, do you think you would be where you are today?","“Ever since you did those things, our relationship has already been severed. Isn’t it laughable for you to say that you want to make up for it now?”","Huo Yuzhou’s gaze darkened as he pursed his lips.","Xue Liang said coldly, “I thought that we wouldn’t see each other again and that we would be fine. It’s up to you to give Xi Xi a gift, but you want Xi Xi to forgive you just because of a violin? You’re really delusional!”","Huo Yuzhou’s expression darkened, but he still maintained his composure.","Xue Liang looked at Guan Hui in disgust. “Mr. Huo, it was because of this woman that Xi Xi was sad back then. Are you still going to make things difficult for Xi Xi for her? What’s your motive for insisting that Xi Xi accept this gift?”","Huo Yuzhou frowned and asked gently, “What do you mean, Mr. Xue?”","“Don’t you understand what I mean? Back then, didn’t you set the fire for this woman? Grandpa forgave you on account of our past relationship, but if you set the fire for this woman, why shouldn’t we pursue the matter?”"]},{"number":1371,"title":"Chapter 1371 The Unknown Arson Case","paragraphs":["1371 The Unknown Arson Case","Hearing Xue Liang’s words, Huo Yuzhou could not help but fall into deep thought.","Xue Liang raised an eyebrow, his eyes filled with ridicule. “Why? Don’t you believe me, Mr. Huo?”","Huo Yuzhou’s cold gaze landed on Guan Hui. Who did she think she was? Did he set the fire for her? What did this woman say in front of Xi Xi to make Xi Xi so hostile to him?","Actually, he also understood what Xue Liang meant. They could forgive him for setting the fire, but they had to hold Guan Hui responsible. However, he could not hand Guan Hui over just like that. She was still valuable to him.","“What exactly do you want, Mr. Xue?” Huo Yuzhou’s tone turned cold, and his expression darkened.","In the deadlock, Xue Liang took a tablet from his assistant, logged into an email account, and handed it to Huo Yuzhou. He smiled meaningfully. “Mr. Huo, you’ve been sending emails to this account for so many years. You should be very familiar with it, right?”","Huo Yuzhou gasped as his burning gaze landed on the screen.","“Mr. Huo, you previously sent an email once a month, then once every six months. After that, you stopped sending any more emails. This is Little Six’s private account. Only a few close people know about it, but take a closer look. There’s another person’s email address here.”","Huo Yuzhou did not even need to look to understand what Xue Liang meant. Anger surged in his heart.","Guan Hui!","Sensing Huo Yuzhou’s sharp gaze, Guan Hui’s face turned pale as she lowered her head guiltily.","Xue Liang said sarcastically, “Mr. Xue, we don’t care how Guan Hui found out about this email address. Even if you gave it to her, it has nothing to do with us anymore. But the main point is that Miss Guan Hui said in her email...”","Then, Xue Liang clicked on the last email. The contents appeared in front of Huo Yuzhou.","[Back then, Yuzhou went to that village and went through a difficult time with you. He took care of you in every way. You saved him by chance and he invited you to the Huo family. Actually, all of that was for me.","[You’re a wild girl who was abandoned by the Qiao family. How could an outstanding and arrogant man like Yuzhou like you? Moreover, Yuzhou burned the library back then because of me.","[Xi Xi, you’ve always trusted Yuzhou very much. Even when you were wronged, you didn’t dare to tell the divine physician. You even personally introduced Yuzhou to the divine physician. You probably didn’t expect such an outcome, right?!]","Xue Liang’s expression turned colder and colder. At the thought of Guan Hui bullying his sister like this, he wished he could shoot Guan Hui. He read these words in front of everyone and sneered. “Mr. Huo, look at what your Miss Guan said!","“We all know that you approached Xi Xi with ill intentions and used her to satisfy your selfish desires, but I want to know if you set that fire because of Guan Hui back then.","“Back then, Grandpa forgave you on account of our past relationship, but he didn’t say that he would forgive Guan Hui. If this is true, then...”","Guan Hui broke out in a cold sweat. Her lips were pale and trembling slightly. “You! What are you doing?”","At this moment, the surrounding people finally understood what was going on. Mr. Huo had used Mrs. Gu and set fire to Mrs. Gu’s grandfather’s library. No wonder Mrs. Gu was unwilling to pay attention to Mr. Huo and Miss Guan. No one in her shoes would forgive him easily.","Thinking about Miss Guan’s words carefully, she deliberately made everyone think that they were in a love triangle just to hide that unknown arson case back then.","Xue Liang smiled coldly. “The loss of the library was huge. We can let Mr. Huo off, but we must hold Miss Guan responsible.","“Please come to the police station with us, Miss Guan. Let’s settle this score carefully. Are you going to compensate us or go to jail?”","“No! No...” Guan Hui was so scared that her face turned pale. She could not afford the loss of the library, and she did not want to go to jail.","Xue Liang took a few steps forward, his eyes cold. “Miss Guan, don’t be in a rush to retort. You sent that email yourself.”","“I...” Sweat broke out on Guan Hui’s forehead as her entire body trembled.","At that time, she had sent that email to Qiao Xi because she wanted to show off in front of Qiao Xi that Huo Yuzhou doted on her and would do anything for her. She wanted Qiao Xi to know that she was not Qiao Xi’s shadow. She was the woman Huo Yuzhou cared about.","If she did not admit it now, she would definitely be mocked by everyone and looked down on by Qiao Xi. If she admitted it, she would have to face jail time.","Guan Hui looked at the man beside her for help. “Y-Yuzhou...”"]},{"number":1372,"title":"Chapter 1372 Two Choices","paragraphs":["1372 Two Choices","Xue Liang lowered his eyes and looked at the violin beside him. “Mr. Huo, what’s your decision?”","Huo Yuzhou’s calm face was gradually covered in a layer of black fog. He could not help but clench his fists. He subconsciously looked at Qiao Xi. She still had a calm expression as if all of this had nothing to do with her.","She was the same as before. She did not even bother to look at people she did not care about.","Ever since that incident, she had treated him like a stranger. Everything in the past had vanished. The person who had once followed him and called him ‘Brother Yuzhou’ had completely disappeared.","He had thought of countless ways to win Qiao Xi back, but every time they met, she would only nod coldly and not say anything else. It was as if those few years were just a dream.","After so many years, she was still so cold. This matter was clearly related to her, but she could still watch coldly.","Huo Yuzhou suddenly felt his chest tighten. The smell of blood surged out of his throat as he said with difficulty, “What should I be deciding?”","Xue Liang pretended to be surprised and said in a mocking tone, “If you’re willing to hand Guan Hui over today, Xi Xi will accept this violin. Our past grudges will be written off. If you insist on keeping Guan Hui, then Xi Xi will absolutely not accept this violin. Please don’t disturb Xi Xi in the future as well. Otherwise, don’t blame us for being merciless.”","Huo Yuzhou’s heart skipped a beat as he frowned.","Qiao Xi, who had been watching coldly from the side, slowly raised her eyes. Her cold gaze landed on Huo Yuzhou, and the corners of her mouth curled into a playful smile.","Everyone was waiting for his response, but Guan Hui’s face was pale as she trembled.","The nobles of Y Nation all knew that Huo Yuzhou doted on her, but she knew very well who Huo Yuzhou liked. If he really handed her over, then she...","Fear and unwillingness instantly engulfed Guan Hui’s heart. She knew that the fire was not set for her because she was not in Huo Yuzhou’s heart at all. It was even more impossible for him to give up on Qiao Xi and the divine physician for her.","Huo Yuzhou’s breathing trembled. Xue Liang’s words were like a blow to his head, making him feel dizzy. It was not that he could not bear to part with Guan Hui but these words reminded him of what had happened back then.","At that time, after he set the fire, the divine physician had given him two choices. As long as he was willing to tell him the reason for the fire, everything would be over. He could still stay on the mountain and continue to be the apprentice of the divine physician. However, if he did not say anything, they would never see each other again.","In the end, he did not say the reason. He was chased down the mountain and lost a benevolent master. He also lost his old friends and the girl he liked.","Huo Yuzhou originally thought that he was born with an indifferent personality and would not care about friendship or love. He could use anyone to achieve his goal. From the moment he met Qiao Xi, it had been a carefully planned scheme. He thought that that trace of reluctance was just a small bit of affection that had developed over time. It would not be long before he completely forgot about it.","But...","“Mr. Huo, have you thought it through?” Xue Liang said impatiently.","Huo Yuzhou hesitated for a few seconds and took a deep breath. He used his impressive self-control to calm down. Soon, his conflicted eyes returned to normal. He was still the calm and composed Mr. Huo.","His eyes were cold, and his voice was gentle. “Mr. Xue, I think you’ve misunderstood. What happened back then had nothing to do with Lil Hui. I was just rash.","“If Xi Xi... doesn’t want to accept this violin, then I won’t force her.”","Hearing his answer, Xue Liang was not surprised in the slightest. He just looked at him coldly. “In that case, please remember my words today and don’t disturb Xi Xi anymore. Don’t forget that I have something on you.”","With that, Xue Liang turned to look at Guan Hui with even more disdain. “Miss Guan, let me give you a piece of advice. Don’t provoke Xi Xi. Don’t think that just because Huo Yuzhou is protecting you that we can’t do anything. Why don’t you ask Huo Yuzhou if he can protect you if we really attack?”","Guan Hui’s body went weak. She held onto the chair beside her to steady herself, but she also heaved a sigh of relief.","Fortunately... Fortunately, Yuzhou chose her. If she fell into Xue Liang’s hands, her outcome would definitely be very miserable.","Her gaze carried a trace of pride as she looked at Qiao Xi. Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi didn’t even bother to look at her before turning around and leaving with a calm expression.","Xue Liang looked coldly at Huo Yuzhou, and the man was also looking at him. When their gazes met, sparks seemed to appear in the air."]},{"number":1373,"title":"Chapter 1373 The Knot In The Heart That Can’t Be Undone","paragraphs":["1373 The Knot In The Heart That Can’t Be Undone","Huo Yuzhou lowered his eyes and looked away, still smiling warmly. After everyone left, he slowly raised his head. His aura was strong, and he was calm as if nothing had happened just now. His tone was even more unquestionable. “Let’s go!”","Guan Hui was standing on the spot in a daze. She was shocked by his voice and hurriedly followed him.","On the other hand, Qiao Xi walked out of the banquet hall and came in front of the silent man. She smiled. “Ah Zheng, is this the gift you were talking about?”","Gu Zheng smiled gently, his eyes filled with affection. “Xi Xi, do you like it?”","“I’m indeed very happy that Fourth Brother and Teacher are here in Y Nation. It’s more meaningful than jewelry. However, Fourth Brother is usually so busy. How does he have time to come here?”","“Mr. Xue is holding an art exhibition in Y Nation,” Gu Zheng said softly. He took a few steps forward and held Qiao Xi’s hand with a warm smile. “Mr. Xue happened to have something to say to Huo Yuzhou, so he came.”","Gu Zheng naturally had ulterior motives for inviting Xue Liang over. Huo Yuzhou relied on the fact that he knew Xi Xi first and always showed off in front of him. He did not want to debate with Huo Yuzhou and lose his bearing, so he let Xue Liang deal with Huo Yuzhou.","Huo Yuzhou could only blame himself for doing too many evil things and being hated by others. He could not be blamed for this, but Xi Xi could not know about this.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with smiles. He was really happy to have gotten rid of his love rival!","Xue Liang followed over. Qiao Xi stopped in her tracks and frowned. “Fourth Brother, you asked Huo Yuzhou this question in public because you wanted him to tell you the reason, right? However, you already gave him a chance six years ago and he chose to hide it at that time. How could he go back on his word now?”","Xue Liang’s eyes were a little complicated. He asked Huo Yuzhou in public because he wanted him to say why he did that back then.","Back then, they had been studying medicine together. Grandpa thought highly of Huo Yuzhou and taught him everything he had learned in his life. Huo Yuzhou was also obsessed with medicine and forgot to eat and sleep.","He was about the same age as Huo Yuzhou, and their personalities were very similar, so the two of them got along very well. They always chatted, made all kinds of musical instruments, and played them carefreely.","At that time, if someone had asked him who his best friend was, he would definitely have said Huo Yuzhou’s name without hesitation. However, no one expected Huo Yuzhou to steal Grandpa’s medical book and even set fire to the library.","In the end, Huo Yuzhou cruelly told them that he got close to Xi Xi and Grandpa only to use them. Even becoming friends with him was a step in the plan, and all of them blindly believed him.","After so many years, Xue Liang still could not accept this fact. The time they spent together was clearly real. He could also tell that Huo Yuzhou was happy from the bottom of his heart. How did it all become fake?","After being deceived by Huo Yuzhou, Xue Liang gave up studying medicine and music in a fit of anger and started learning oil painting instead. All these years, he had been unable to undo the knot in his heart, so he asked Huo Yuzhou again. However, Huo Yuzhou’s answer was the same as before.","Xue Liang replied with a bitter smile, “I... I was just muddle-headed. Little Six, I’m fine. You don’t have to worry about me. I just wanted to see if he had thought it through after so many years. I didn’t expect him to be so stubborn. In that case, we’ll abide by our original agreement and never see each other again!”","His expression was a little lonely. The corners of his lips twitched as he forced a smile. “Xi Xi, I rushed all the way here. Shouldn’t you treat me to a big meal?! Go look for Teacher and catch up with him first. I’ll talk to President Gu alone.”","As soon as Xue Liang finished speaking, he immediately turned around and walked toward the lounge. He did not dare to meet Qiao Xi’s gaze and subconsciously quickened his pace.","At this moment, outside the banquet hall.","The assistant opened the car door, and Huo Yuzhou got in. Guan Hui followed closely behind. Just as she was about to get in, the man’s cold voice suddenly sounded. “Lil Hui, I’ve been reminding you to know your identity, but you don’t seem to understand.”","Guan Hui’s face was pale. She lowered her head and did not dare to make a sound.","Huo Yuzhou’s tone was still gentle, but the smile on his lips made one shudder. He leaned against the car seat and placed his long legs on the side, casually blocking Guan Hui from getting into the car.","“Lil Hui, shouldn’t you explain how you found out about Xi Xi’s email address?","“It doesn’t matter if you spout nonsense or if Xi Xi finds out about it, but you actually let Xue Liang know. Xue Liang isn’t someone you can provoke!”","Guan Hui stood in front of the car door and trembled. Fortunately, her assistant reached out to support her so that she would not fall by the roadside."]},{"number":1374,"title":"Chapter 1374 They Don’t Have The Guts","paragraphs":["1374 They Don’t Have The Guts","Huo Yuzhou looked away coldly. “Lil Hui, if you want to live well, don’t provoke them. Do you hear me?”","Guan Hui nodded stiffly. Her back was already drenched in sweat.","She knew that Huo Yuzhou and Xue Liang were good friends, but they had already cut off all ties. Moreover, so much time had passed, yet he still cared so much about Xue Liang?","Huo Yuzhou moved his long legs away and tapped his well-defined fingers on the seat. “I have to deal with the Brook family’s matters now. I don’t have time to deal with you, but you have to remember not to go too far. Otherwise, even if I don’t deal with you, someone will.”","Besides fear, a trace of unwillingness surged in Guan Hui’s heart. Why was it that even after so long, Huo Yuzhou still could not let go of Qiao Xi and Xue Liang? They had already threatened him in public. However, not only was he not angry, but he was even protecting them!","She clenched her fists tightly and lowered her head as she replied gloomily, “I’ll remember.”","Huo Yuzhou smiled in satisfaction and gestured for her to get into the car. He closed his eyes tiredly.","The car slowly stopped in front of the luxurious villa. Huo Yuzhou got out of the car and instructed the chauffeur to send Guan Hui to her residence before leaving without looking back.","Back then, he had deliberately approached Qiao Xi and given her a trace of warmth when she was at her weakest. Originally, when the divine physician brought his apprentices to the village, he only wanted to take Qiao Xi away. It was he who curried favor with Xue Liang and Qiao Xi and pretended to be sad. That was why the two of them begged the divine physician to bring him away.","However, the divine physician still had concerns, so he arranged for him to stay at the foot of the mountain. He never went up the mountain for a few years. He was respectful and polite to the divine physician and focused on studying medicine. Seeing that he was talented in medicine and was humble, the divine physician agreed to take him in as his apprentice.","He had been pretending for so many years and could finally get what he wanted. He went up the mountain under everyone’s expectations. Unfortunately, good times did not last long before that incident happened...","Huo Yuzhou recalled everything that had happened back then, and his eyes were filled with mockery. Why did Xue Liang still ask him that question today? He had clearly given the answer six years ago. Since he had already made his choice back then, he would not change it now.","How could a smart person like Xue Liang not understand?","...","At this moment, in the banquet hall, the auction had ended and everyone had already left.","Xue Liang took the opportunity to talk to Gu Zheng alone and fled Qiao Xi’s line of sight in a panic.","The two of them sat in the lounge. Gu Zheng did not say a word and just looked at him with a faint smile. His deep eyes had long seen through everything.","Xue Liang was inexplicably flustered. He took a deep breath and forced himself to calm down. “I heard that Young Master Tan of the Brook family had his hand cut off. President Gu, do you know anything about it?”","“Tan Yu?” Gu Zheng was calm.","Xue Liang leaned against the sofa and suddenly curled his lips. “You did it?”","“Yes,” Gu Zheng admitted frankly. “He deserves it. Now, the Brook family has already become lively over this matter.”","“No matter what, Tan Yu is the young master of the Brook family. If his hand is suddenly cut off, it’ll be embarrassing for the family. I heard that Tan Yu wanted to marry Xi Xi, so I guessed that it was you. Since I could think of it, the Brook family can naturally guess that it was you too. Aren’t you afraid that they’ll take revenge on you for doing such a thing on their territory?” Xue Liang asked.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were deep and emotionless. After a moment of silence, he suddenly chuckled. “I’m afraid they don’t have the guts.”","A trace of surprise flashed past Xue Liang’s eyes. The Brook family was considered a top noble family in Y Nation. They had power and influence. How could Gu Zheng say such arrogant words in their territory?","After a moment of silence, Xue Liang slowly said, “I’ve investigated the Brook family. The original head of the family suddenly disappeared. This is only a temporary replacement. However, after tasting the benefits of power, who’d be willing to give up the position?","“Huo... Huo Yuzhou took this opportunity to eradicate his dissidents and occupied almost half of the Brook family’s power. Now, although the Brook family looks chaotic on the surface, their strength can’t be underestimated. It’s best if you don’t have anything to do with him. What happened to Xi Xi can’t happen again.”","Xue Liang’s tone suddenly turned cold. “I’m sure that Huo Yuzhou won’t target Xi Xi. The reason Madam Tan went to Li City to propose marriage was probably because of you, right?”","Gu Zheng’s expression remained unchanged. He was not embarrassed about being exposed."]},{"number":1375,"title":"Chapter 1375 Little Six Learned From Gu Zheng","paragraphs":["1375 Little Six Learned From Gu Zheng","Xue Liang narrowed his eyes and smirked. “You deliberately made Xi Xi misunderstand that Huo Yuzhou was the instigator of this matter. Since she’s willing to believe you, I won’t expose you. However, this matter started because of you. If you don’t get rid of this problem, there’ll be endless trouble in the future.”","Gu Zheng looked up and met Xue Liang’s gaze. His light brown eyes were like deep pools, and his expression was vague. After a long time, he said, “Mr. Xue, you have a point. I know what to do.”","Xue Liang retracted his gaze in satisfaction. “Gu Zheng, we entrusted Little Six to you. You have to remember your promise back then. No matter what, you have to protect Xi Xi and not let her be hurt.","Gu Zheng nodded, but he suddenly sneered. “Mr. Xue, don’t tell me you’re just reminding me to protect Xi Xi? Why do I feel that you’re here to stand up for Mr. Huo?”","‘I’m sure Huo Yuzhou won’t target Xi Xi.’","‘You deliberately made Xi Xi misunderstand that the instigator of this matter is Huo Yuzhou.’","Although Xue Liang had already calmed down before he spoke, Gu Zheng could still hear a trace of displeasure from his words. Was he angry with Huo Yuzhou?","The corners of Xue Liang’s mouth twitched slightly as he frowned. “What nonsense are you talking about?”","“It’s nothing. I just said it casually. Mr. Xue, don’t take offense.” Gu Zheng looked at him with a faint smile, his eyes filled with ridicule.","Xue Liang glared at him coldly and said seriously, “I cut off all ties with Huo Yuzhou six years ago. How could I stand up for him? Whether he lives or dies has nothing to do with me. I just don’t want this matter to implicate Xi Xi.”","Sunlight shone in through the window. Gu Zheng leaned against the window with his eyes lowered. His long and thick eyelashes left a shadow on his eyelids. His well-defined fingers gently supported his chin, and he could not hide the smile on his face.","Xue Liang: “...” ‘Damn! Why is this man like a fox?!’","Little Six had learned bad things from Gu Zheng. The two of them kept stabbing him in the heart!","In front of Gu Zheng, Xue Liang felt like he was sitting on pins and needles. In the end, he left the lounge as if he was escaping. Gu Zheng, who was by the window, still had a smile on his face, but his eyes gradually turned cold.","Song Shijing walked over from afar and said respectfully, “President, Mr. Xue must know about it already, so he came to remind you.”","Although Xue Liang did not say it explicitly, it was obvious that he already knew about the grudge between the president and the Brook family. Song Shijing could not help but be worried. They were not afraid of the Brook family, but they were worried about Young Madam...","“Should we tell Young Madam about this?” Song Shijing asked tentatively.","Gu Zheng shook his head, his deep eyes suddenly looking out of the window. He said casually, “I have nothing to do with the Brook family, so there’s naturally no need for me to let her know.”","Song Shijing nodded and did not say anything else.","On the other hand, Qiao Xi pulled Liang Pingchuan along to a corner and asked in a low voice, “Teacher, don’t you think that Fourth Brother hasn’t untied the knot in his heart?”","Liang Pingchuan found it hard to explain. “Among your brothers, your fourth brother values relationships the most. Your eldest and second brothers are emotionless machines. Other than being kind to us, they’re equally heartless to everyone. Your eldest brother is a Best Actor. He’s addicted to acting and only knows how to pretend to be gentle. Your second brother doesn’t want strangers to approach him. He’s like an iceberg. As for Xue Liang, he looks heartless on the surface, but he’s actually the weakest in his heart. He treated Huo Yuzhou as his lifelong friend, so he’s always taken his betrayal to heart.","“His character can’t be changed. As long as he’s loyal to someone, he’ll never be able to forget that person. If he’s hurt by that person, he’ll never be able to let it go.”","As Liang Pingchuan spoke, his face was filled with heartache. “Actually, he didn’t like to learn medicine at all. It was because Huo Yuzhou liked it that he learned from your grandfather. You and Huo Yuzhou both liked music, so he learned how to make musical instruments. After Huo Yuzhou left, he completely gave up on learning medicine and music and became obsessed with making poisons. He didn’t say anything on the surface as if he didn’t care anymore. In fact, he hasn’t forgotten about it for all these years.”","Qiao Xi’s heart suddenly ached.","Liang Pingchuan chuckled as if he wanted to break the sad atmosphere. “Actually, I didn’t want to bring Xue Liang with me this time, but this matter can’t be hidden from him. I thought that since he wanted to come, I should just let him. There are some things that have to be resolved. As long as he gives up, the knot in his heart might be resolved.”"]},{"number":1376,"title":"Chapter 1376 New Clue","paragraphs":["1376 New Clue","“Sigh! I didn’t expect that when this kid saw Huo Yuzhou, he couldn’t help but ask that question. Huo Yuzhou still hasn’t changed and refuses to say the reason. If he still can’t let go...”","Liang Pingchuan did not finish his sentence, but Qiao Xi could also understand that it was still difficult for Fourth Brother to accept it after so many years. Even after seeing Huo Yuzhou this time, the answer he received was the same as before. If Fourth Brother still could not let go and still had a trace of hope for Huo Yuzhou, thinking that he would admit his mistake and change, then Fourth Brother would be too stupid.","“Why is Huo Yuzhou in the Brook family?” Liang Pingchuan suddenly asked.","“The Brook family are nobles in Y Nation and has existed for more than a hundred years. I heard that the original head of the family suddenly disappeared, so he temporarily chose someone to replace him. Once this person ascends to a high position, it’s naturally impossible for him to come down.","“The internal affairs of a century-old noble family are really chaotic. Some people still refuse to give up and look for the original head of the family, while others want to assassinate that head of the family. It’s a good opportunity for Huo Yuzhou to come out and take power at this time, but it’s not without danger. I heard that he’s very valued by the current head of the family, so he managed to establish himself in the Brook family as an outsider.”","Hearing Liang Pingchuan’s words, Qiao Xi frowned and said softly, “Teacher, it’s better not to tell Fourth Brother about Huo Yuzhou. He’ll inevitably be affected.”","Liang Pingchuan looked at her and hesitated.","Little Six probably did not know yet. Xue Liang had already investigated everything related to the Brook family!","Liang Pingchuan had watched the few of them grow up and knew them very well. Xue Liang did not seem to care, but he came this time to give Huo Yuzhou a chance to turn over a new leaf. However...","He pondered for a moment and sighed. “Your fourth brother knows that the Brook family is making things difficult for you. He also knows that Huo Yuzhou is in the Brook family. That’s why he insisted on coming over.”","Actually, he just wanted to know if Huo Yuzhou had really changed. After all, how could he force Xi Xi to marry Tan Yu like that?","Qiao Xi returned to the hotel and looked at the report handed over by Ling Pavilion about what had been happening the past few days. Tan Yu and Madam Tan, who were originally clamoring to take revenge on Gu Zheng, suddenly stopped moving. They actually stayed at home obediently.","“Eldest Miss, we’ve investigated. Before Madam Tan went to Li City, she contacted an earl,” the shadow guard of Ling Pavilion reported.","“An earl?” Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. “Madam Tan knows such a person?”","A few hundred years ago, the people of C Nation also lived here. Hence, the culture and language of Y Nation were similar to that of C Nation. Some families’ surnames also continued the tradition of C Nation. For example, the surname of the Brook family was also Tan. As for the title of nobility, it was naturally not groundless. To be called an earl, one must have a noble status or have contributed to the country.","Qiao Xi suddenly raised her eyebrows. “Have you investigated this earl’s background?”","“Mr. Huo from the Brook family isn’t on good terms with this earl, but the Brook family has three factions. Madam Tan is from the weakest one. As for the earl...","“During the battle with the Brook family, the earl secretly supported Madam Tan, but he didn’t interact with her on the surface. However, the earl’s younger sister often met her.”","“Oh? There’s such a relationship?!” Qiao Xi smiled with interest.","“Miss Kang is from a noble family in Y Nation, so many people are trying to curry favor with her. However, I heard that her health isn’t good and she’s plagued by an old illness. She can only stay in seclusion and doesn’t attend banquets much. Even so, Miss Kang went out to see Madam Tan four times last month. Other than that, she hasn’t gone out again. It’s enough to show that she’s close to Madam Tan.”","Miss Kang? This surname sounded a little familiar.","Qiao Xi frowned. “Mhm, are there any other clues?”","“Um...” The shadow guard hesitated for a few seconds and added, “The Brook family’s internal relations are chaotic. Although Madam Tan is not as powerful as before, she’s still the madam of the direct line of descent. Moreover, the direct line of descent looks down on Mr. Huo Yuzhou, so Fourth Young Master asked me to tell you that Mr. Huo... couldn’t have instructed Madam Tan to work for him.”","Qiao Xi chuckled.","It was indeed as her teacher had said. Fourth Brother looked vicious on the surface and was obsessed with making poisons, but he was infinitely loyal. He came to Y Nation this time because he did not believe that Huo Yuzhou would attack her, so he personally came to take a look at the situation and even got the people from Ling Pavilion to secretly investigate this matter.","Fourth Brother was afraid that she would misunderstand Huo Yuzhou! However, now that their relationship was in a deadlock, it did not matter if she misunderstood him or not!"]},{"number":1377,"title":"Chapter 1377 The Man In Her Dream Appeared Again!","paragraphs":["1377 The Man In Her Dream Appeared Again!","Qiao Xi nodded and waved her hand to signal the shadow guard to leave.","At this moment, she already knew the internal makeup of the Brook family. Huo Yuzhou and Madam Tan were enemies, while Earl Kang and Miss Kang were on Madam Tan’s side.","Madam Tan was a woman, after all. It was not appropriate for her to meet the earl often, so she could only meet Miss Kang. Miss Kang would become the middleman between both parties.","All of this sounded very reasonable, but Qiao Xi realized a main point. Miss Kang rarely interacted with outsiders but met Madam Tan often. After that, Madam Tan brought Tan Yu to Li City. This might be a coincidence, but it was also possible that this matter was related to Miss Kang.","Qiao Xi shook her head and felt that she was thinking too much. She did not know Miss Kang at all, much less that earl. Why were they targeting her?","After a day of torture, Qiao Xi felt a little tired, so she leaned against the sofa and fell asleep. She fell into a dream again, and it was exactly the same as before.","The room was white. She was lying on the bed with a pale face. There was a circle of people around her, holding her hands and feet tightly. The other two people were holding syringes that were inserted into her fragile blood vessels.","A few minutes later, a man walked in from the door. His voice was gentle as he spoke softly to the doctor. He took a few steps forward and looked at Qiao Xi with a sad and complicated gaze.","The man stood by the bed and quietly watched the doctor take her blood. He watched as she lost consciousness. Before he left, he said, “Give her a blood transfusion immediately. Don’t let her life be in danger.”","Hah! He was actually worried that she would die. How hypocritical!","Qiao Xi woke up from her dream and cursed that hypocritical man in her heart. He was inferior to Huo Yuzhou. At least, Huo Yuzhou did what he did and never found excuses for himself.","She stood up and moved her limbs. She realized that her surroundings were dark. Unknowingly, it was already nine in the evening. She had actually slept for so long. She stood up and was about to go to the bedroom when her expression suddenly changed.","Wait! She seemed to have seen the face of the man in her dream this time!","Even though she was dreaming, Qiao Xi still remembered the scene of that man standing by the bed and looking at her. That face was so unfamiliar, and this man did not exist in Qiao Xi’s memory at all.","At this moment, Qiao Xi was extremely sure that she had once lost a portion of her memory, and the reason for that was probably related to this man.","Qiao Xi stood on the spot and was stunned for a moment before standing up to go to the study. She casually found a pen and paper and drew the man’s face. However, she only saw the man’s side profile. Moreover, he was standing at an angle, so the portrait was incomplete.","It was really too difficult to find someone with just an incomplete painting.","Qiao Xi put down the brush and stared fixedly at the man in the painting. He had gentle eyebrows, a high nose bridge, and a well-defined face. He was also very young. She took this painting to Gu Zheng’s study.","The man was busy with work with a serious expression. Song Shijing’s face was also tense. “President, if...”","“Alright, go handle it.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Song Shijing realized that Qiao Xi had pushed the door open and entered. He was stunned for a moment, then said respectfully, “President, I’ll go out first.”","Gu Zheng nodded and turned his head to look at Qiao Xi. She walked forward and asked softly, “What’s wrong?”","Song Shijing stopped in his tracks. This time, there was a lot of trouble. The Brook family had already sent someone to investigate the president’s identity. Moreover, the Brook family was a local noble family in Y Nation, after all. They were powerful all over the country. There were many members of the Brook family in Gu Corporation’s branch in Y Nation. If they did not find those people, there would be endless trouble.","However, Gu Zheng looked up slowly and smiled dotingly. “It’s nothing. It’s just a project that was delayed for a long time and couldn’t be completed, so I asked Song Shijing to handle it.”","Song Shijing choked: “...”","The president was really good at lying.","However, he had to admit that the president was really a good husband. He was unwilling to trouble Young Madam at all.","After Song Shijing left, a trace of coldness flashed past Gu Zheng’s eyes. However, when he looked up at Qiao Xi again, the coldness in his eyes disappeared instantly and was replaced by a gentle smile. “Aren’t you tired? Why aren’t you resting?”","Qiao Xi sized up her surroundings. There was not a single document on the table, and the computer was not turned on. Was Gu Zheng dealing with work?","She was silent for a moment, then handed the painting in her hand to Gu Zheng. “Do you know this man?”"]},{"number":1378,"title":"Chapter 1378 The Necklace Is Pretty, But You’re Better Looking","paragraphs":["1378 The Necklace Is Pretty, But You’re Better Looking","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes. The sketch in Qiao Xi’s hand was very simple. The lines were very casual, but the man’s facial features were very clear. His eyes were gentle, and there was a scar on his forehead.","He looked at it quietly for a while and said softly, “No.”","Qiao Xi had an expression as if she had expected this and frowned. “I don’t have any impression of this man, but I dreamed of him. He’s the man who drugged me in my dream and took my blood.”","Gu Zheng’s gaze landed on the painting again, and his gaze gradually became sharp. The man’s face was exquisite, and his eyes were filled with sorrow, but Gu Zheng felt that his gaze was not sincere.","!!","“Let Song Shijing investigate it.”","Qiao Xi hurriedly waved her hand. “Let’s not alert the enemy yet. I don’t know if this man really exists or if I imagined it. Even if he really exists, we can’t brazenly investigate.”","If this man had really taken her blood, the other party would definitely be on guard. Their brazen investigation would inevitably arouse the other party’s suspicion.","Qiao Xi folded the paper twice and put it away, her eyes narrowing slightly. “The person who knows this secret must be someone I trust very much. I really want to know why he’s worthy of my trust.”","Looking at the person on the paper, Qiao Xi was truly unable to understand why she trusted a man who looked very hypocritical.","...","The next morning in the study.","“President, we’re ready. We can leave now,” Song Shijing said.","Gu Zheng stood up and put on his jacket. He straightened his clothes in front of the mirror. “Are you done dealing with the Brook family?”","“It’s settled. They won’t attack for the time being.”","Gu Zheng nodded and suddenly thought of something. He asked in a low voice, “How about the matter I asked you to investigate yesterday?”","“No clues yet,” Song Shijing replied.","This answer was within Gu Zheng’s expectations. If it were so easy to find out, there would not have been no news of him for so many years.","At this moment, Qiao Xi pushed the door open and walked in. Gu Zheng saw the jade necklace on her neck and praised with a smile, “How beautiful.”","They were returning to Li City today, so Qiao Xi was in a very good mood. She specially wore a cloud-colored satin cheongsam. As the weather was still a little cold, she wore a white rabbit fur shawl over her shoulders. Her dark hair was tied into a simple bun, and she wore a jade hairpin. A green tassel hung below it, which matched the emerald necklace on her neck.","Her skin was snow-white, and she did not need heavy makeup. Just a little makeup was enough. At this moment, she was standing at the door with her slim figure. Her clear eyes were filled with smiles, and a trace of red appeared on her fair cheeks. She looked a little silly and cute.","Gu Zheng had never seen Qiao Xi like this. She had always liked fashionable clothes. He did not expect her to be so stunning in a cheongsam. She was like a fairy from heaven.","Qiao Xi walked in front of him in her high heels and spun around. She smiled shyly. “Does the necklace Mom left me look good?”","“The necklace is pretty, but you’re better looking.” Gu Zheng was not someone who would say sweet words. What he said was sincere. The jewelry left behind by Xia Yunqiu was all especially precious, but Qiao Xi did not wear them often. After all, this jade piece was too precious and had to be matched with the right clothes. Although this cheongsam was plain, it surprisingly matched.","“What’s going on outside?” Qiao Xi looked out of the window at the noisy villa not far away and asked curiously.","Song Shijing glanced outside and replied, “I heard that someone is moving in.”","They were in a high-end villa area in Y Nation. There were not many residents around. This villa was bought by Gu Zheng before he came, and no one lived in the villa next to it. However, Qiao Xi had observed the villa when she came here. Although no one lived there, the courtyard of the villa was very clean. It was obvious that someone cleaned it regularly, but the owner had not returned.","“I asked around this morning. It turns out that the daughter of the owner of that villa is seriously ill. He bought this villa to let his daughter recuperate. After all, there are few people here and it’s very quiet. No one will disturb her,” Song Shijing explained.","Qiao Xi nodded. The scenery here was not bad, and the air was very fresh. It was indeed suitable for recuperation. Moreover, she and Gu Zheng would be leaving soon. There would be no one else around then, so it would be even quieter.","After another ten minutes, Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng went downstairs and were about to get into the car to leave. Coincidentally, the man from the villa looked over. The other party was stunned for a moment. When he came back to his senses, Qiao Xi had already gotten into the car.","The man stood on the spot for a while before his eyes suddenly widened. He looked panicked and excited. He shouted something and pulled the person beside him over."]},{"number":1379,"title":"Chapter 1379 The Mystery Of The Dream Is About To Be Unveiled","paragraphs":["1379 The Mystery Of The Dream Is About To Be Unveiled","At this moment, the chauffeur had already started the car and did not notice the situation behind. By the time the man rushed over, the car had already driven away.","Qiao Xi seemed to have noticed something and subconsciously turned her head to see the man’s face through the car window.","Her pupils constricted!","The blood in Qiao Xi’s entire body instantly froze, and she could not help but widen her eyes. His face was exactly the same as the man in her dream!","!!","That man was even more mature than in her dream, but Qiao Xi was very sure that they were the same person. After a few years, he was naturally more mature.","Song Shijing asked tentatively, “Young Madam, do you want to stop the car?”","Qiao Xi turned around and looked at the man who was anxiously running over from outside the window. She replied coldly, “There’s no need.”","The car quickly drove away, and Qiao Xi clearly saw the scar on the man’s forehead.","The location of the scar was exactly the same. It seemed that her dream was indeed real. This man was the one who took her blood.","Gu Zheng’s gaze turned cold. Clearly, he had also seen that man.","“Who are they?” Qiao Xi asked.","Song Shijing hesitated for a moment and replied respectfully, “Young Madam, please wait a moment. I’ll investigate now.”","There were only two families in the vicinity, so it should not be difficult to investigate this family. Song Shijing called and got the news. His expression was a little strange. “Young Madam, they’re... nobles from Y Nation.”","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled as she had an inexplicable feeling.","“It’s the earl of Y Nation. A few years ago, the head of the family passed the title to his son. It’s that young man just now. His surname is Kang.”","Earl? Kang?","Qiao Xi suddenly recalled the news from the shadow guards’ investigation. Before Madam Tan went to Li City, she had met Earl Kang. Moreover, this earl had a weak and sickly younger sister.","If they were just Madam Tan’s supporters, Qiao Xi would not care. However, this man was exactly the same as the man in her dream. He ordered others to take her blood, but he still had to say with a sad expression, ‘I’m sorry, Xi Xi. I have no choice. Rest well. I’ll come and see you again.’","Qiao Xi’s expression was slightly cold. “Investigate and see if he’s been to Li City.”","“I need to contact Song Shiyu. We’ll inform Young Madam immediately.”","“Alright.” The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled into a gloomy smile.","As soon as the plane landed, Song Shiyu called. “President, Young Madam, we’ve already investigated Mr. Kang. His name is Kang Jichuan. He was born in Y Nation and lost his mother when he was young. His father is deeply in love with his wife and has never remarried. Kang Jichuan has a younger sister who has been weak and sick since she was young. She rarely interacts with the outside world and has to be hospitalized from time to time. Hence, very few people have seen Miss Kang.","“I heard that Mr. Kang has a gentle temper and is a vegetarian. He often goes into seclusion to pray for his deceased mother and seriously ill sister.”","“Seclusion?” Qiao Xi was slightly surprised.","Song Shiyu said, “Yes, according to the information, Mr. Kang has been doing it since four to five years ago. The culture of Y Nation and C Nation is similar, so it’s normal for him to go into seclusion to pray for blessings. I heard that he takes a few days off every month to go into seclusion.”","Qiao Xi immediately realized the coincidental timing. The scene from that dream was about four to five years ago.","After hanging up, Qiao Xi immediately contacted the people from Ling Pavilion and instructed them to keep an eye on Kang Jichuan.","Qiao Xi knew that the mystery of the dream was about to be solved. Kang Jichuan was the man in her dream. He took her blood to save a woman. Coincidentally, Kang Jichuan had a weak and sickly younger sister. In other words, it was very likely that that woman was his younger sister.","Before Madam Tan came to Li City, she had met Mr. Kang and Miss Kang. When Kang Jichuan saw her just now, he was very excited and chased after the car.","When Qiao Xi thought about this, she suddenly sneered.","Went into seclusion to pray for blessings? How laughable!","What Qiao Xi did not tell Gu Zheng was that at the end of the dream, her entire body was surrounded by cold seawater. A suffocating feeling swept through her entire body. Her entire body was weak, and she could only close her eyes helplessly.","Perhaps that man had taken her blood but was afraid that if the matter was exposed, there would be trouble, so he simply tried to kill her. However, after doing such a cruel thing, he could not endure the guilt and torture in his heart, so he went into seclusion every month to pray for blessings.","It might not be appropriate to say that he was in seclusion to pray for blessings. It should be atonement. He hoped that the dead could forgive him so that he could avoid the condemnation in his heart.","Just as Qiao Xi was deep in thought, her phone vibrated. It was a voice message from Xue Liang.","“Little Six, I have something to tell you.”"]},{"number":1380,"title":"Chapter 1380 Dusty Memories Are Awakened","paragraphs":["1380 Dusty Memories Are Awakened","If Xue Liang had an urgent matter, he could have called directly instead of sending a voice message. He was suddenly so serious as if what he wanted to say was a little difficult to say.","As expected, the next piece of news was told to Fourth Brother by Huo Yuzhou, who was now telling her.","“Huo... Huo Yuzhou said that he found out that Madam Tan went to Li City because of someone with the surname Kang. Madam Tan said that Miss Kang wants to deal with you. She even said that this is just the beginning. Miss Kang won’t let you off.","“He... He also sent someone to find out. He knew that you wouldn’t believe him, so he informed me. I haven’t found any clues yet, but I was afraid that the Kang family would attack again, so I wanted to remind you.”","After the voice message ended, Qiao Xi’s expression was slightly subtle. She did not expect Fourth Brother to contact Huo Yuzhou so quickly. However, Huo Yuzhou’s words sounded true. After all, she had found some clues that pointed to Kang Jichuan and Miss Kang.","Why was that man targeting her now that years had passed? Was he afraid that she would testify against their crimes, or was it because Miss Kang was seriously ill and needed her blood again? But no matter what the reason was, if she married Tan Yu and went to Y Nation, they could easily play with her in the Kang family’s territory.","Qiao Xi did not reply. She picked up her phone and prepared to go upstairs. She had just stood up when she felt her vision go dark. Countless images surged into her mind crazily. Her ears buzzed, and her mind was extremely chaotic as if it was about to split open.","The scene in her dream was quickly squeezed into her mind, appearing in her mind over and over again. Gu Zheng, Kang Jichuan, and an unfamiliar girl were in the scene.","Qiao Xi grunted slightly in pain. She closed her eyes and pressed her hands on her temples.","Had those dusty memories been awakened because she saw Kang Jichuan?","She whimpered in pain and endured the discomfort as she walked forward. However, in the next second, a tall and hot body hugged her from behind. His warm palm landed on her forehead as he stroked it gently. His voice that was like a clear spring echoed in her ears. “Xi Xi, what’s wrong?”","Knowing that the person hugging her was Gu Zheng, Qiao Xi relaxed and fell weakly into Gu Zheng’s embrace.","She closed her eyes tightly. It was as if a movie was playing in her mind. Images appeared in front of her frame by frame. Kang Jichuan’s gentle and hypocritical face kept appearing in her mind.","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and looked at Qiao Xi who was frowning in pain. His slightly cold fingers gently stroked her cheek, and his eyes were filled with worry and helplessness. He knew that Qiao Xi was recovering her memories. This process would definitely be very painful, but this was something she had to experience. If he could endure all of this in Qiao Xi’s place, he would agree without the slightest hesitation.","He carried Qiao Xi upstairs and gently placed her on the bed. He took off her shoes, took off her shawl, and covered her with the blanket. Then, he lay on his side beside Qiao Xi and pulled her into his arms. His hot palm gently stroked her forehead.","At this moment, Qiao Xi’s mind finally recovered its calm. She seemed to have had a very long dream. In front of her was an endless sea. Waves slapped the shore, and her rapid and messy breathing filled her ears.","She was trying her best to run forward to escape the people chasing after her. She had already reached a point where she could not retreat. Under the siege of everyone, she had no choice but to jump into the dark blue sea.","However, the other party did not want to let her off just like that. With the sound of a gunshot, she clearly heard a bullet piercing through flesh. The dark blue seawater was also dyed red by blood, but she did not feel any pain.","Actually, Qiao Xi had this dream a long time ago. At that time, she did not care and thought that she was only dreaming of being chased after because she was too tired. It was only when she dreamed of Mo Yuan from ten years ago that she realized that something was wrong.","She had really lost a part of her memory, and it was a very important matter.","Immediately after, Qiao Xi fell into another dream in a daze. She saw her 15-year-old self with a gentle and elegant man standing beside her. It was Kang Jichuan. He lowered his eyes to look at her gently. “Xi Xi, have you been well all these years?”","In her dream, she raised her fair face and smiled sweetly. “I’ve been doing very well! Grandpa and Brother treat me very well.”","Actually, Qiao Xi’s childhood was not good. Her days in the Qiao family were abysmal. She was abused by Xu Mei, bullied by Qiao Rou, and was humiliated constantly. If someone else had asked her this question, she might not want to answer. However, she smiled and replied, ‘Very well.’ This meant that she cared a lot about the man in front of her and did not want him to worry."]},{"number":1381,"title":"Chapter 1381 She’s Not The One I Love The Most","paragraphs":["1381 She’s Not The One I Love The Most","Qiao Xi really did not understand who Kang Jichuan was to actually make her care so much. Moreover, Kang Jichuan knew the secret of her blood.","She looked at her dream and tried her best to think about it. During that period of time, her grandfather was in trouble. Her eldest brother brought her overseas, and she stayed there for a period of time. That was probably when she got to know Kang Jichuan.","Although she was young, she had experienced so much in the Qiao family. She would not easily believe someone. Even if that man had a gentle appearance, he could not make her open her heart to him and even tell him that huge secret in just half a year.","After a long silence, Kang Jichuan, who was in his dream, suddenly said, “I’ve never seen my mother. Now that she has passed away, I won’t have another chance. You said that she’s very gentle and beautiful, right?”","Qiao Xi’s heart suddenly trembled when she heard Kang Jichuan’s words.","His mother had already passed away?","From what he said, the mother he was talking about was Xia Yunqiu?","In her dream, she lowered her eyes and replied gloomily, “Yes.”","Kang Jichuan’s eyes were filled with sorrow and regret. After calming down for a long time, he took a deep breath. “Father said... that if she was still alive, she would definitely come back to see us. I always thought that she had lied to us, but I didn’t expect her to...”","Qiao Xi suddenly gasped, and her body suddenly stiffened. An indescribable shock swept through her entire body. Even in her dream, she felt a chill run down her spine as she shuddered.","Then, Kang Jichuan’s words confirmed her guess...","“Xi Xi, since you’re already back, come home with me. When my father comes back, I’ll help you with the procedures. You’re my biological sister, so our family should live together.”","At that time, Qiao Xi did not see through the emotions in Kang Jichuan’s eyes, but now, Qiao Xi could see that there was love and guilt in Kang Jichuan’s eyes. However, they were less sincere and a little more complicated.","He was her biological brother. He was so gentle and kind, so he made Qiao Xi lower her guard. She believed this man because the love in his eyes was real, and so was his worry. However, the person he loved the most was not her, so he would sacrifice her life to save another person.","Even though Qiao Xi knew Kang Jichuan’s identity, she was unable to understand why she would tell him the secret of her blood. Kang Jichuan was very gentle to her, but her grandfather and brother treated her even better and gave her endless love. She was no longer that child who lacked love. Even if her biological brother appeared, she shouldn’t have told him all her secrets.","The scene in the dream changed again. The surroundings were desolate, and a cold wind blew. The branches beside the road were bare, and a layer of snow fell. Kang Jichuan held an umbrella and walked toward her, covering her from the snowflakes.","His smile was gentle as he gently brushed the snow off her head. “Xi Xi, I’ll come and pick you up from school in the future.”","She vaguely remembered that her grandfather was in trouble at that time. Her brothers were worried that they would implicate her, so they sent her overseas to study. During that period of time, they were not by her side. Kang Jichuan appeared at this time.","Snowflakes danced in the air. The man was holding a black umbrella. He was tall and slender. His eyes were gentle, making one easily give in to him.","Coincidentally, her classmates came out, and a group of little girls asked her if she was her boyfriend. Kang Jichuan laughed and said, “I’m her brother.”","Ever since that day, Kang Jichuan would come to pick her up from school every day. Coupled with his handsome appearance, he almost became a beautiful sight at the entrance of the university.","At that time, she was just a 14 or 15-year-old girl. Under such gentle attacks, she would naturally choose to believe the man in front of her.","Qiao Xi looked at the man in her dream and sneered in her heart.","At this moment, Kang Jichuan’s eyes were clearly filled with love and gentleness, but in the end, it was this man who ordered people to chase after her and eliminate her. Was he pretending too well, or was he just a contradiction?","While Qiao Xi was dreaming uneasily, Song Shijing rushed into the study. “President, I have news!","“Kang Jichuan’s father, Kang Ru, got married a long time ago, but the family has never acknowledged his wife. The two of them have never held a wedding either. According to the news, Kang Ru’s wife passed away many years ago, leaving behind a son and a daughter. Based on age, Kang Jichuan is the son of Kang Ru and his wife, but the daughter in the family shouldn’t be their biological daughter.”"]},{"number":1382,"title":"Chapter 1382 They’re Kind","paragraphs":["1382 They’re Kind","“After his wife passed away, Kang Ru never remarried. No matter how Old Madam Kang tried, he didn’t compromise. Later on, as he got older, Kang Jichuan, the only son in the family, inherited the title. Thus, Old Madam Kang stopped forcing him.”","A complicated look appeared in Gu Zheng’s eyes. “In that case, Madam Kang is...”","“Xia Yunqiu.” Song Shijing lowered his eyes.","Gu Zheng sneered. “As expected.”","“Also...” Song Shijing paused. “Kang Jichuan is a vegetarian, but it’s not strange as everyone has their own beliefs. But I heard that he even invites exorcists to his house to perform rituals. He’d look for a quiet place to pray every month as well.”","Gu Zheng’s lips curled into a cold smile, and a trace of playfulness appeared in his eyes.","“Kang Jichuan told the public that he prays for his deceased mother and sickly sister. However, I’ve asked around. He didn’t look for exorcists to pray for blessings but... to exorcise the souls of the dead.”","“The souls of the dead?” Gu Zheng abruptly looked up.","“Yes.” Song Shijing was very sure. “Kang Jichuan instructed them to exorcise the souls of the dead, but they don’t know who they are. Maybe it’s his mother, but I keep having the feeling that something’s wrong. After all, Kang Jichuan’s mother left when he was very young. He doesn’t have a deep relationship with his mother, so he wouldn’t invite people to exorcise souls every year. Moreover...”","In C Nation’s culture, souls who died of natural causes did not need to be exorcised. The souls that Kang Jichuan wishes to exorcise must be people who left with resentment and unwillingness. However, who around Kang Jichuan was unwilling to die?","Song Shijing said thoughtfully, “I keep having the feeling that Kang Jichuan killed someone. He goes into seclusion every year to pray for blessings and perform rituals because of his guilty conscience. However, he has a good reputation. He’s gentle and respectful. He doesn’t look like someone who can harm others.”","“What’s Kang Ru’s reputation like?” Gu Zheng asked.","“The Kang family is a noble in Y Nation, and Kang Ru is a noble earl. Outsiders naturally don’t dare to discuss him rashly. I heard that Kang Ru and Kang Jichuan are famous for their gentle tempers and kind hearts.”","Kind-hearted?","Hah!","This reminded Gu Zheng of He Weinian. He was also a kind-hearted person in the eyes of outsiders, but he did all kinds of evil behind everyone’s backs.","Whether the Kang family was wearing a hypocritical mask or if it was really as Song Shijing had said, it remained to be seen.","Song Shijing added, “Not only that, but Kang Ru is also a romantic. He doted on his wife very much. Even after his wife passed away for so many years, he never remarried. Many socialites know that he’s romantic and has a noble status. They all wanted to marry him, but he refused all of them.","“Kang Ru isn’t outstanding in business, and Kang Jichuan is also ordinary. However, the Kang family’s identity is obvious. A hundred-year-old noble family like theirs is powerful. Even without any assets, they can still live very comfortably.","“The father and son have good reputations not because of their ability and talent, but because they’re gentle, refined, and kind-hearted. They’re sought after by some women.","“Kang Jichuan and Kang Ru are very similar. He’s respectful, humble, and doesn’t have any bad habits. He can be considered a clean man among the noble young masters of Y Nation.”","At this point, Song Shijing suddenly paused. “There’s not much news about the daughter of the Kang family. Her name is Kang Qingzhi. She has been sick since she was young and can’t go out. Even at banquets held by the Kang family, she rarely attends. However, Old Madam Kang dotes on her granddaughter very much. The servants at home have a good impression of her too. They all say that she’s gentle and kind-hearted like her brother.”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. In the eyes of outsiders, everyone in the Kang family was kind. However, this was not the case in Xi Xi’s dream.","“I heard that Miss Kang’s illness suddenly became serious when she was 16 years old. Everyone said that she didn’t have long to live. The doctor said that she could live for another month at most, so he got the Kang family to bring her home to prepare for her funeral. However, not long after, she suddenly recovered. Although she’s still weak and sick, at least she can take care of herself and go out alone.”","Gu Zheng suddenly clenched his fists. It was indeed so.","Xi Xi’s blood was drawn when she was 15 years old, and her blood could revive one. Kang Qingzhi was clearly about to die, but she suddenly survived. Everything seemed to make sense now."]},{"number":1383,"title":"Chapter 1383 One Can Never Know One’s Heart","paragraphs":["1383 One Can Never Know One’s Heart","Song Shijing found it strange. “If Madam Xia Yunqiu is Kang Ru’s wife, why didn’t the Yin family mention it? In that case, Young Madam... should be Madam Xia’s biological daughter, which means she might be Kang Ru’s daughter.”","Song Shijing’s heart trembled. He suddenly remembered that when they left the villa in Y Nation, Kang Jichuan and Kang Ru seemed to have seen Young Madam. They chased after the car, but Young Madam ignored them.","Did Kang Ru and Kang Jichuan already recognize Young Madam?","Gu Zheng leaned against the chair, his eyes narrowing as he called out in a low voice, “Kang Jichuan is even more hypocritical than He Weinian.”","He had clearly already taken Xi Xi’s blood, but he still insisted on entering seclusion every year to pray for blessings and find people to exorcise her soul. Since he was so reluctant and guilty, why did he have to be so ruthless back then?","In order to save Kang Qingzhi, he had to sacrifice Xi Xi? What right did he have to decide the life and value of others?","The only thing that puzzled Gu Zheng now was that with Xi Xi’s character, even if she trusted Kang Jichuan very much, she would not have taken the initiative to reveal her secret. In that case, how did Kang Jichuan know about it? Moreover, someone happened to be in need of Qiao Xi’s blood to save their life, so Kang Jichuan discovered this secret and took Xi Xi’s blood.","This might not be a coincidence but a carefully planned scheme.","When they left the villa, Gu Zheng carefully observed that Kang Ru and Kang Jichuan were excited to see Xi Xi, especially Kang Ru. He was so excited that tears were about to fall. He probably wasn’t pretending to be sincere.","In that case, Kang Ru might not know about that matter. As for Kang Jichuan...","Gu Zheng’s eyes suddenly turned cold. He would take revenge for how Kang Jichuan had hurt Xi Xi back then. A person who could be so vicious to his own sister was not worthy of his sympathy.","If Xi Xi had not been lucky back then, it was very likely that she would have disappeared into the vast sea a long time ago. Kang Jichuan and Kang Qingzhi, who caused all of this, were still alive and well in this world. How were they worthy of the word ‘kind’?!","One could never judge a book by its cover. Some people looked bright and beautiful on the surface, but they were ugly and dirty on the inside. He Weinian was such a person, and so was Kang Jichuan.","Song Shijing asked tentatively, “President, should I send someone to keep an eye on the Kang family?”","“There’s no need.” Gu Zheng suddenly smiled.","With Xi Xi’s character, she would probably have sent someone over a long time ago, so there was no need for him to do anything unnecessary.","At this moment, Qiao Xi’s body had curled up into a ball as she lay on the bed in the posture of a baby. Her brows were tightly furrowed, and a layer of sweat had seeped out of her delicate skin.","In the past, she thought that she did not like the sea because Qiao Rou pushed her into the swimming pool when she was young. The suffocating feeling made her afraid of the water, so she was afraid of the sea. However, she always dreamed of jumping into the sea later on, and the dark blue seawater was dyed red. Only then did she realize that things were not that simple.","At that time, she had lost a portion of her memory. She could not be sure if it was just a dream or if it really existed. It was not until she saw Kang Jichuan that all the mysteries were solved.","After her blood was taken, she received a blood transfusion and was saved from death. However, she was still very weak. The bodyguards probably did not expect her to still have the strength to escape, so they gave her a chance to escape from the ward.","She hurriedly sent a message to her eldest and second brothers. Just as she was waiting for her brothers to pick her up, she was noticed. She knew that Kang Jichuan would not let her off, so she could only keep running forward. Behind her, she heard the roar of a car and messy footsteps. Below the cliff, a patch of blue seawater was surging against the shore, waves splashing up like the bloody mouth of a whale. She suddenly stopped in her tracks and was in a dilemma.","Kang Jichuan walked out of the crowd. He still looked like the elegant young master she had first seen, but his eyes were filled with reluctance and guilt. His gentle voice trembled slightly. “Xi Xi, don’t be rash.”","She kept retreating and looked at the man in front of her in disappointment.","The heartache in Kang Jichuan’s eyes was really too mocking. He said extremely gently, “Xi Xi, I’ve let you down, but I know that you’re the apprentice of the divine physician and are deeply doted on by him. Moreover, you have a few seniors who treat you extremely well. You’re leading a very happy life, but Qingzhi...","“Qingzhi is just your shadow. She’s the daughter my father adopted because he missed you and my mother too much. She exists because of you. If you return to the Kang family, what will she do? She’s already very pitiful. I can’t...”"]},{"number":1384,"title":"Chapter 1384 A Careful Scheme","paragraphs":["1384 A Careful Scheme","Kang Jichuan suddenly choked, and his eyes were filled with sorrow and heartache. He took a deep breath and said, “Xi Xi, I love you too! But I’ve been by her side for more than ten years. She’s the most important person to me. I really can’t abandon her. If you come back, she’ll lose everything.”","In her dream, Qiao Xi lowered her head. At this moment, she seemed to not care about Kang Jichuan’s weak explanation anymore. Her only thought was to survive. She was looking for a chance to escape.","When she ran out of the hospital, she stole a gun. She raised the gun and aimed it at Kang Jichuan’s head, her eyes filled with pain.","Even someone as strong as Qiao Xi was unable to accept being betrayed by someone she trusted. Moreover, Kang Jichuan was her brother, yet he wanted her life.","Kang Jichuan was not afraid of her gun and even slowly walked toward her. “Xi Xi, you have no idea how painful her life has been all these years. On the surface, she’s the glorious daughter of the Kang family, but in reality, my father gives her all material enjoyment except love. He doesn’t allow her to step into your room and always emphasizes that she’s just your substitute. If you go home, Kang Qingzhi will know that her title won’t belong to her anymore. She’ll be abandoned and even chased out of the house immediately.","He smiled bitterly helplessly. “She’s been weak and sick since she was young. Her yearly medical fees aren’t something that ordinary families can afford. If she leaves the Kang family, will she still be able to live? You’re both my younger sisters. You’re so healthy, and so many people love you, but Qingzhi only has me. I only hope that she can live well. Xi Xi, can you understand me?","“Because of you, her life has already been very painful. Take it as though you’re making it up to her now, alright?”","Qiao Xi was like a soul that floated in midair as she watched this scene coldly. She could not help but sneer.","Kang Qingzhi knew that she was her substitute, so her life was very painful?","However, what did this have to do with her? Kang Qingzhi knew that she was the daughter adopted by the Kang family. Even if Kang Qingzhi was really in pain, it was not her fault. It was Kang Ru and the rest of the Kang family’s fault.","To her, the Kang family was just strangers. Even if they were really related by blood, they had no right to threaten her!","Kang Qingzhi knew that Qiao Xi was not the one who caused her suffering, so why did Qiao Xi have to make up for all of it? If she had to do this, who could she blame for what she suffered?","Kang Jichuan’s eyes were filled with heartache. “Xi Xi, I’m sorry. This is all my fault. Don’t blame Qingzhi. She’s already very pitiful. In the future, we’ll all be fine as long as you don’t appear in Y Nation anymore.","“Fortunately, Father doesn’t know that you’re still alive, and you’ll never see him again. I’ll help you erase this memory. Soon, you’ll forget the painful memories. When you wake up again, you’ll completely forget about me and everything that happened in Y Nation. You’ll start a new life.","“Xi Xi, put down the gun and follow me. I’ll find a chance to send you away.”","Suddenly, the scene in front of Qiao Xi’s eyes shattered into countless scenes. Frame by frame, they flashed past her eyes. She saw herself being pressed tightly onto a bed. Her blood was quickly extracted, and her body gradually became cold. Kang Jichuan stood at the side, his eyes bloodshot with a trace of heartache. “Xi Xi, close your eyes and don’t look. It’ll be over soon. Qingzhi has suffered so much for you. It’s time for you to compensate her.","“Xi Xi, why are you so heartless? Qingzhi is about to die. Only you can save her. It’s not like I want your life. I just want your blood!","“I’m sorry, Xi Xi. I can’t let you leave for the time being. Qingzhi is still waiting for your blood. I need to save her life. If you leave, she’ll die!","“I know you’ve contacted the divine physician, but Y Nation is the Kang family’s territory. Even if he comes, he won’t be able to find you. Don’t waste your effort.”","The doctor’s voice sounded in her ears again. “Mr. Kang, you can’t continue. If this goes on, Miss Qiao will bleed to death.”","Kang Jichuan walked to the bed and gently stroked her sweat-drenched hair. He said softly, “Xi Xi, hold on a little longer. Qingzhi is really going to die. She needs your blood.","“Forgetting this memory is the best outcome for all of us. If we don’t meet again in the future, you’ll forget your hatred for good and live a happy life. Qingzhi has also recovered her health. She has become a cheery person now. The Kang family likes her very much. She can finally become the real eldest daughter of the Kang family, so... don’t appear again.","“Xi Xi, I love you, but I was forced to do it. I can’t just watch Qingqing die...”"]},{"number":1385,"title":"Chapter 1385 Fight To The Death","paragraphs":["1385 Fight To The Death","The blood in Qiao Xi’s entire body froze!","At this moment, she finally understood. From the moment Kang Jichuan reunited with her, it had been a conspiracy. At that time, she thought that she had found her family. Now that she heard Kang Jichuan’s words, she understood everything.","In Kang Jichuan’s eyes, her role was to give Kang Qingzhi a blood transfusion. After Kang Qingzhi recovered, there would be no meaning for her to exist anymore. However, this matter could not be spread. Otherwise, Kang Jichuan and Kang Qingzhi would have to pay the price. Hence, Kang Jichuan wanted to kill her.","However, she was his biological younger sister, after all. Kang Jichuan still had a trace of conscience, so he chose another method. If she lost her memory, she would keep this secret and leave Y Nation forever. This way, Kang Qingzhi could continue to be the high and mighty daughter of the Kang family.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched. What bullsh*t kinship was this? It was a scheme from the beginning!","Back then, she was still an inexperienced girl. Naturally, she could not escape Kang Jichuan’s meticulous scam.","In her dream, she returned to the cliff again. Kang Jichuan reached out to her and said as if he was coaxing a child, “Xi Xi, be good. Come back with me and sleep. When you wake up, you won’t remember anything.”","In the dream, her eyes gradually lost consciousness. Her petite body swayed, and her footsteps were weak. However, she maintained her last bit of rationality and refused to approach Kang Jichuan.","Kang Jichuan’s voice trembled slightly. “Xi Xi, I’ve let you down, but I really can’t live without Qingzhi. Just think of all of this as a dream and forget about it.”","Qiao Xi’s body went weak as she fell to the floor. However, at the same time, a gunshot suddenly sounded in her ears. It tore through the sky as if it had exploded in her ears.","Bang!","The intense sound caused Qiao Xi to instantly come back to her senses. She could clearly see that there were no injuries on her body, so where did the gunshot come from?","She struggled to stand up. Although she looked tired, her eyes became more and more determined. She kept retreating. Behind her was the cliff, and below the cliff was the unfathomable sea. Without hesitation, she shot Kang Jichuan and jumped into the sea. The cold seawater instantly swallowed her.","The reason Qiao Xi wanted to jump down was that she knew that falling into Kang Jichuan’s hands would definitely be worse than death. She might as well risk her life. Even if she died, she would not regret it. At the very least, she would be free at the last moment.","The shot hit Kang Jichuan’s shoulder. He frowned, and his eyes were filled with sorrow. He actually shed tears of pain. Finally, he said, “It’s good that she’s dead. She’ll be free.","“Xi Xi, I’ve let you down in this life. I’ll compensate you in my next life.”","In her dream, after she jumped into the sea, she used her last bit of consciousness to swim toward the shore.","Bang!","Another shot was fired, accompanied by the sound of something falling into the sea. She did not feel any pain, but the sound of the bullet passing through her flesh was very clear. Her vision was blurry, and she could only smell blood. Then, blood spread, dyeing the blue seawater red.","At this moment, she was gradually losing consciousness. She was so dizzy that she could not open her eyes, but she could hear voices not far away.","“Who is this?”","“Don’t poke your nose into other people’s business, lest you get into trouble.”","“Is the person above Kang Jichuan? Did she offend Kang Jichuan? In that case, let’s kill him as well to avoid unnecessary trouble...”","After that, she lost consciousness in the seawater. She vaguely remembered that after she woke up, she seemed to have had a very long dream. Third Brother said that when he found her, she was lying on the beach and on her last breath. They hurriedly took her away.","When she woke up, Third Brother realized that someone had saved her, but Qiao Xi did not remember who it was.","Fortunately, she escaped Kang Jichuan’s clutches. If she had continued to stay by Kang Jichuan’s side, what would her future have been like? Perhaps she would forever become Kang Qingzhi’s blood bank!","The dream suddenly ended, and Qiao Xi abruptly woke up with a start. Her temples were throbbing, and the memory fragments in her mind were still slightly chaotic. She realized that there was another person who jumped into the sea in the end, but she was unable to see who that person was no matter what. She did not know if that person was dead or alive.","However, after this dream, Qiao Xi was sure that her loss of memory was caused by Kang Jichuan. Kang Jichuan knew her secret and probably used... hypnosis.","After she was saved, she was hypnotized again and lost that painful memory. Now that she had seen Kang Jichuan, the hatred in her heart surged. The hypnosis completely failed, and she regained her memory."]},{"number":1386,"title":"Chapter 1386 Welcome Home, Eldest Miss","paragraphs":["1386 Welcome Home, Eldest Miss","Qiao Xi sat up, her slender fingers pressed against her temples as she frowned with a cold gaze.","The room was dark and silent for a long time. Qiao Xi suddenly smiled.","Heh... She really did not expect her to have such a tragic past! She was deceived by a man and even forced to jump off the cliff by him!","Qiao Xi’s entire body was filled with a wisp of piercingly cold killing intent.","She would rather Kang Jichuan take her blood and give her a cold and heartless gaze to send her on her way than listen to Kang Jichuan’s hypocritical explanation. He was just finding excuses for his actions.","She heard that Kang Jichuan had been a vegetarian all these years. He went into seclusion every month to pray for blessings and even invited people to perform rituals to exorcise the souls of the dead. It seemed that he was not doing well!","All because Kang Qingzhi was pitiful, he decided to sacrifice her without hesitation. Was this what a kind-hearted person should do?","She suddenly sneered. Kang Jichuan must have thought that she had died a long time ago, so he invited someone to perform a ritual, hoping that she could rest in peace. Now that he suddenly saw her, was he so scared that he could not sleep at night?","Was he worried that she would recover her memory and kill him and Kang Qingzhi to vent her anger?","Kang Jichuan probably did not expect that the hypnosis would suddenly lose its effect. Actually, Qiao Xi felt that even if she did not see Kang Jichuan, she would gradually recover her memory over time.","Since she had already recovered, she would start fighting back now!","...","On the other hand, in the Kang family’s residence in Y Nation.","Kang Ru sat in the study and took out an exquisite sandalwood box from the locked drawer. Inside was a slightly yellow photo and an exquisite jade necklace.","His eyes were filled with tears as he held the necklace. His hands were trembling slightly, and his voice was extremely excited. “It’s her! It must be her! Her temperament is so similar to your mother’s, and her necklace was designed by your mother. At that time, your mother left me one. She said that I’d be reminded of her whenever I saw the necklace. She kept the other necklace with her.","“Jichuan, she must be my daughter, right?”","Kang Jichuan lowered his head, his lips tense as he frowned.","Even now, he was still unable to accept this fact. That woman was actually exactly the same as Xi Xi, but didn’t she fall into the sea and die?","Actually, he did not want to kill her either. After all, she was his younger sister! He had said that as long as Xi Xi went back with him, he would find a chance to let her leave. However, she did not believe him and even jumped off the cliff on impulse. The seawater was so deep and so far from the shore. Her body was weak, and she was hypnotized. It was impossible for her to have survived!","After that day, Kang Jichuan suffered from insomnia. The moment he closed his eyes, he would see Qiao Xi jumping in front of him. How could his heart not ache? He was extremely guilty and even secretly went to the beach to look for her, but there was no trace of her at all. She completely disappeared into the vast sea.","Now that Kang Jichuan had confirmed that she had passed away, she was back!","Kang Ru, who was at the side, was still so excited that he was at a loss. “My poor daughter! Has she been doing well outside all these years? Has she returned to Li City? Jichuan, quickly get ready. We’ll set off for Li City immediately. I want to look for her!”","Kang Jichuan was silent for a few seconds. After calming down, he nodded and replied, “Alright.”","“She’s wearing Yunqiu’s necklace. She must be Yunqiu’s daughter. I’ve sent someone to investigate. She’s the daughter of the Yin family. Since the Yin family has already acknowledged her identity, she must be my daughter. I have to bring her back to make up for all the regrets I’ve had all these years!”","Kang Jichuan’s heart was heavy, and Kang Ru’s words still echoed in his ears. The Yin family had already acknowledged her. Once Qiao Xi recalled what had happened back then and told the Yin family about it, then...","“I didn’t know that Yunqiu was the daughter of the Yin family. If I had known earlier, she wouldn’t have been with us for so many years without a status.”","Kang Ru’s eyes were red, and his voice trembled. “I’ve let Yunqiu down. Now that I’ve found my daughter, I must let her return to the Kang family and become the noblest daughter of the Kang family! Jichuan, immediately instruct the servants to welcome Eldest Miss home!”","Kang Jichuan’s eyes were flustered and guilty. Complicated emotions filled his heart.","He could understand his father’s feelings. Xi Xi was his daughter and the child his mother had left by his side. She should acknowledge her ancestors and become the noblest daughter of the Kang family. If his mother was in heaven, she would be very happy to see their family reunited."]},{"number":1387,"title":"Chapter 1387 The Angel Sent By God To Save Him","paragraphs":["1387 The Angel Sent By God To Save Him","Kang Jichuan frowned, but he was worried that Qiao Xi would suddenly recall what had happened back then. Although it was unlikely, if she recovered her memory, would he and Qingzhi still have a good life?","Moreover, once Qiao Xi returned to the Kang family, what would Qingzhi do?","Back then, his mother was already pregnant when she left. The doctor found out that the child was a healthy baby girl. His father had been looking forward to his daughter’s birth, but unfortunately, he did not see her in the end. He really missed the mother and daughter, so he adopted Kang Qingzhi.","Although everyone doted on Qingzhi very much all these years, she was just an adopted daughter, after all. If Xi Xi returned, how could Qingzhi have a place in this family?","!!","Kang Jichuan’s emotions were complicated, and he found it difficult to make a decision.","At this moment, Kang Ru suddenly thought of something and reminded him, “Jichuan, you have to tell Qingzhi about this. She’s still the daughter of the Kang family, but Xi Xi is my biological daughter. No one’s status can surpass her.”","“Yes.” Kang Jichuan nodded, but the corners of his mouth were filled with bitterness.","Kang Ru’s eyes were glowing. He had not been so happy in a long time. His voice was filled with joy. “There’s no need for a paternity test at all. I can confirm that she’s my daughter. Her temperament is exactly the same as Yunqiu’s, especially when she wears that necklace and cheongsam. It’s as if Yunqiu is standing in front of me! She’s the angel sent by God to save me. I have to keep her by my side. I have to give her the best things in the world to make up for all the regrets I’ve had all these years!”","Kang Jichuan’s throat tightened.","Not only was she not dead, but she could even appear here again. This was probably fate!","Moreover, his father had already given his word. Even if Qiao Xi came back, Qingzhi could continue to stay with the Kang family. As long as it did not affect Qingzhi, he would not stop Xi Xi from coming back. Moreover, he would try his best to make up for his mistake.","Kang Ru walked out of the study excitedly and went to the bedroom to pack her luggage.","Kang Jichuan stood where he was and was stunned for a long time. Then, he looked up at the butler and instructed, “My father and I are going to Li City. Qingzhi’s health isn’t good, so I’ll have to trouble you to take care of her. Y Nation’s climate is cold, and Qingzhi’s body can’t adapt to it. I’ll go to Li City to see if there’s a suitable house. I’ll bring Qingzhi over to stay for a while if I find one.”","Uncle Zhi replied and watched Kang Jichuan leave with a frown.","He had been in this family for decades and knew the family members very well. Kang Ru had always been frank, sincere, and valued relationships. Hence, when he saw that girl, he could confirm that she was the child Madam had left outside. However, Young Master was different. He was gentle, delicate, and thoughtful. He would definitely send someone to investigate the girl’s identity immediately, afraid that she was a spy sent by someone with ulterior motives. No matter what, he had to do a paternity test first.","However, Young Master did not seem to have any doubts this time. It was as if he had already confirmed that the girl was his younger sister, so he found it a little strange.","Even if they really found Eldest Miss, could this family really be reunited?","The servants who had been in the Kang family for decades all knew that Kang Qingzhi was the adopted daughter of the Kang family and the substitute for the eldest miss. However, love would develop over time. After so many years, Kang Ru, Kang Jichuan, and Old Madam Kang had already doted on her as the real daughter of the Kang family.","How could Miss Kang be happy that the real eldest miss was back? If the two ladies were like fire and water, who would the old master and the young Master help?","Not long after, Old Madam Kang suddenly rushed over. There was no joy on her face at all. Instead, she looked a little disdainful. “You haven’t done a paternity test yet, yet you’re so sure that she’s your daughter? Xia Yunqiu has been gone for so many years. Who knows if she had another man outside?!”","Kang Ru widened his eyes and retorted with a red face, “Mom! Yunqiu wouldn’t do that. That girl must be my daughter!”","Old Madam Kang glanced at him as if she expected better from him. “Even if she’s your biological daughter, did you consider Qingzhi’s feelings when you decided to bring her back in such a hurry?”","The surroundings suddenly fell silent. Kang Ru said helplessly, “Qingzhi is still the daughter of the Kang family. This won’t change.”","Old Madam Kang snorted. “Let me tell you, I don’t care if she comes back or not, but nothing can happen to Qingzhi. She won’t give her room to that woman, nor will she lose her pocket money. Her engagement can’t be changed either. Her status in the Kang family can’t change at all. She’s still the eldest daughter of the Kang family. After that woman acknowledges her ancestors, she’ll be the second daughter of the Kang family.”"]},{"number":1388,"title":"Chapter 1388 Give Him A Chance To Make Up For It","paragraphs":["1388 Give Him A Chance To Make Up For It","Kang Ru frowned, but he did not dare to disobey his mother. He only wanted to reunite with his daughter, so he could only nod. “We’ll do as you say. Qingzhi grew up by my side since she was young. I’ve already treated her as my biological daughter. I can’t disown her just because Xi Xi came back.”","Old Madam Kang’s expression softened a little. “It’s fine if you want to look for your daughter, but after she comes back, we’ll have to see if she’s worthy to be the daughter of the Kang family. If she’s not, the Kang family won’t be able to include her in the family register. She can stay at home as a relative for the time being until she has the right to be the daughter of the Kang family. Do you understand?”","Uncle Zhi, who was at the door, sighed helplessly. He had heard what Old Madam Kang said more than 20 years ago. At that time, Old Madam Kang said, “I can let her enter our house, but you two can’t marry yet. If she’s not worthy to be the wife of the Kang family, she can only stay at home as a lover. We’ll talk when she’s qualified to be the wife of the Kang family.”","At that time, Old Master Kang had also agreed. After Young Madam entered the family, she was obedient, kind, and had an extraordinary bearing. She was just like a daughter of a noble family. However, Old Madam Xia still did not agree to their marriage. In the end, Miss Xia Yunqiu really did not marry Master Kang.","!!","Actually, even now, Uncle Zhi was not sure if Miss Xia Yunqiu really liked Master Kang. After all, if she did, why did she leave?","Old Madam Kang glanced at Kang Ru and frowned impatiently. “Bring her back as soon as possible. I want to see what that girl looks like.”","Kang Ru was extremely excited. He had never thought of what kind of situation he would face after bringing his daughter back.","On the other hand, Kang Jichuan knocked on his sister’s door. Kang Qingzhi was lying quietly on the bed. When she saw him enter, she lowered her eyes in disappointment. “Brother, did you... find her?”","Kang Jichuan looked at his obedient sister with a complicated expression. For a moment, he did not know what to say.","Back then, he had used hypnosis on Qiao Xi and Qingzhi at the same time. After all, Qingzhi was kind-hearted. If she found out that he did not hesitate to sacrifice his biological sister for the sake of saving her, Qingzhi would definitely be unable to accept it.","Kang Jichuan was silent for a long time before taking out a photo. “Qingzhi, this is her.”","Kang Qingzhi stared at the photo, and a trace of killing intent flashed past her eyes. It disappeared in an instant. She asked softly, “Are you and Dad going to look for her?”","Kang Jichuan’s voice was a little hoarse. “Yes, I’ll go tomorrow. Qingzhi, have you seen her?”","Kang Qingzhi’s round eyes were filled with confusion. She thought for a moment and shook her head. “I’ve never seen her. I haven’t gone out much all these years. How could I have seen her?”","Fortunately, she did not remember...","Since Qingzhi hadn’t recovered her memory, then Xi Xi shouldn’t have either. Even if she really came back, she wouldn’t remember those painful memories. He would treat his younger sister well. With him mediating the situation, Xi Xi and Qingzhi would definitely become good sisters.","Kang Jichuan’s suspended heart suddenly relaxed. He finally had the courage to face Qiao Xi. His mood suddenly became pleasant. Since the heavens were willing to give him this chance to make up for it, he would definitely not miss it.","All these years, he had always been troubled. From time to time, he would have nightmares about the scene of Xi Xi jumping off the cliff. Fortunately, Xi Xi was still alive. Otherwise, he would have to live in guilt for the rest of his life.","Kang Qingzhi suddenly clutched her chest with a painful expression.","Kang Jichuan immediately came back to his senses and looked at Kang Qingzhi worriedly.","Her palm-sized face was pale, and her slender eyebrows were furrowed tightly. She whimpered in pain a few times, and a trace of blood seeped out of the corner of her mouth. She lay on the bed and said weakly, “Brother...”","Kang Jichuan was stunned when he heard her call him ‘Brother’. He had long forgotten about Qiao Xi. At this moment, he only had the sickly girl in front of him in his heart. “Qingzhi, don’t be afraid. I’ll call the doctor over now!”","“Forget it, Brother. Don’t go. I know my own body... I know that it’s useless even if the doctor comes. Just stay here and accompany me.”","Kang Qingzhi smiled weakly. “If Dad hadn’t adopted me back then, I might have died a long time ago. I’m already very happy to have been by your side for so many years. I’ll cherish every day from now on. Brother, don’t be sad for me. You have to live happily in the future.”","Kang Jichuan’s eyes were filled with tears. “How can I be happy without you by my side? Don’t worry, you’ll be fine. I’ll call the doctor now!”","With that, Kang Jichuan rushed out. Kang Qingzhi looked at his back view, and her gaze gradually turned cold. She smiled proudly. She was like a different person compared to her weak appearance just now."]},{"number":1389,"title":"Chapter 1389 Maybe They’re Liars","paragraphs":["1389 Maybe They’re Liars","Kang Jichuan immediately found a doctor and learned from the doctor that Kang Qingzhi’s condition was not good. She could lose her life at any time.","The doctor asked in confusion, “Young Master Kang, I remember that Miss Kang was in the same situation back then. At that time, all the doctors said that she was hopeless, but she suddenly recovered. How did you do it? Her condition is very serious this time. I’m afraid...”","Kang Jichuan’s body instantly stiffened.","Back then, he knew that Xi Xi’s blood could revive people, so he deliberately approached her and took her blood to save Qingzhi’s life. Now that she had appeared again, Qingzhi’s illness was acting up again. Did that mean that he had to...","“Mr. Kang, I heard that you’re leaving Y Nation for the time being, but Miss Kang’s condition isn’t good. She needs someone to accompany her. Why don’t you stay?” the doctor reminded him, then turned to leave.","Kang Jichuan’s heart was a mess, and he did not know what to do. On one side was Xi Xi, while on the other was Qingzhi. Both of them were his younger sisters.","Now that Qingzhi’s illness was serious, what would happen if he and his father left and Qingzhi was alone at home?","After thinking about it, Kang Jichuan decided to stay. Xi Xi would understand him. After all, Qingzhi had been weak and sick since she was young. It was only right to take care of her.","On the other hand, when Kang Ru found out that Kang Jichuan wanted to stay in Y Nation for Kang Qingzhi’s sake, he did not object. Anyway, when Xi Xi returned to Y Nation, the siblings would meet. It did not matter if it was a day earlier or later. Moreover, Jichuan was staying because Qingzhi was seriously ill. Xi Xi would definitely understand.","Kang Ru did not care about such a small matter and made preparations excitedly. However, the butler, Uncle Zhi, looked troubled. “Master, you’ve already decided to bring Eldest Miss back. If Young Master doesn’t go, it’ll seem that he doesn’t take Miss seriously. If she finds out that Young Master stayed for Miss Qingzhi, she’ll think that you’re biased toward her. It’ll be inevitable that she’ll think too much.”","Kang Ru smiled and waved his hand. “No! My daughter is tolerant and magnanimous. Why would she care about such a small matter? Qingzhi is gentle and kind. The two of them are about the same age. When she comes home, the two of them will definitely become good friends who can tell each other everything.”","Uncle Zhi: “...”","He, an outsider, could understand. If Young Master did not go, even if Eldest Miss did not say anything, she would still have a grudge in her heart. After all, there was already a favored adopted daughter in this family. Who would care about her?","Master Kang was still the same as before. He did not care about the feelings of others. He always felt that anything could be discussed and one did not need to think too much. However, this would often hurt the people around him.","In Li City in C Nation.","“In that case, Kang Jichuan won’t be coming and Kang Ru is coming over himself?” Qiao Xi leaned leisurely on the sofa.","Song Shijing said, “Yes, Young Madam. This is news from Y Nation. I don’t know why the Kang family is so sure that you’re related to them by blood. They didn’t send anyone to investigate, but Kang Ru is already coming over personally. But if they’re really sure of your identity, it’s really strange that Kang Jichuan didn’t come.”","Gu Yao was dumbfounded. “Qiao Xi, what exactly is going on? Who’s Kang Ru?”","Qiao Xi briefly explained the details of the matter and deliberately avoided some details. Gu Yao asked in surprise, “Then are you really going back to Y Nation with them?”","Xu Zhi had already said that Qiao Xi was not his and Xia Lan’s daughter, and Xi Xi was related to Old Madam Yin by blood. This meant that one of her parents was definitely related to the Yin family. In that case, she should be Xia Yunqiu’s daughter.","As for Kang Ru, he might be Xia Yunqiu’s husband. However, was Madam Xia really married to him? If she had already married someone before she came to Li City, why did she still marry Qiao Zhenguo?","Gu Yao could not help but fall into deep thought. After a while, he said hesitantly, “Qiao Xi, you have to be careful about this. The Kang family is a noble family in Y Nation. Kang Ru’s wife’s name should be written in the family tree, but Song Shijing didn’t manage to find out who Kang Ru’s wife is. I keep feeling that something is wrong. Maybe they’re liars!”","“That makes sense,” Qiao Xi supported her chin and replied with a smile.","Gu Yao frowned. “I heard that Kang Ru is coming to Li City soon. If you don’t want to see him, I’ll chase him out and not let him disturb you!”","Song Shijing looked helpless. Second Young Master had been in charge of the company for so long. Why did he still like to solve problems by force? With Young Madam’s IQ, she was definitely more than enough to deal with Kang Ru!"]},{"number":1390,"title":"Chapter 1390 Breaking The Original Plan","paragraphs":["1390 Breaking The Original Plan","Before Song Shijing could speak, Qiao Xi said with a smile, “Ah Yao, don’t always think of fighting and killing. He’s here to look for his daughter, not to take revenge. What are you saying? If news of this gets out, they’ll think that we don’t know etiquette and don’t respect our guests!”","Gu Yao suddenly felt that Qiao Xi’s words made sense. They were cultured people. They could not always fight and kill.","Just as Gu Yao was looking at her with admiration, Qiao Xi said casually, “Moreover, why would I make a move on Kang Ru? He’s my father! The person I want to make a move on is Kang Jichuan. If he comes to Li City this time, I’ll kill him!”","Song Shijing: “...”","Gu Yao: “...”","Her tone was so gentle and soft, but she said that she wanted to kill someone. Moreover, she was the one who just said that one could not always fight and kill. However, in the next second, she said she wanted to beat Kang Jichuan to death!","This woman was really too scary!","After Gu Yao and Song Shijing left, Qiao Xi received a call from Cheng Ju’an.","Qiao Xi picked up the phone and smiled lightly. “Oh! Mr. Cheng, you’re so busy. Why do you have time to call me?”","Cheng Ju’an’s cold voice sounded. “Stop talking nonsense. I have something important to tell you.”","“Tell me.” Qiao Xi was able to discern that he was not in a good mood and was even slightly depressed.","“Qiao Xi...” Cheng Ju’an’s voice was low. “During the time I was by He Weinian’s side, I discovered a secret. A large part of the reason he returned to the country this time is because of you.”","“Me?” Qiao Xi was stunned.","Cheng Ju’an frowned. “He Wenyin has probably already reminded you, and I’ve found some information. He Weinian seemed to have investigated you five years ago.”","Qiao Xi was filled with doubts. She had never seen He Weinian before. Even before He Weinian returned to the country, she had never heard of the He family. Why was He Weinian investigating her?","“It’s probably because you have the divine physician and a few brothers protecting you, so He Weinian didn’t dare to expose himself. He was originally prepared to return to the country two years ago, but for some reason, he had to postpone it.","“He planned to approach you when he returned to the country, but he didn’t expect you to suddenly get married.”","Qiao Xi thought for a moment and asked softly, “You mean He Weinian has already investigated everything about me, but he didn’t expect me to marry Gu Zheng?”","“Yes.” Cheng Ju’an felt inexplicably flustered. “According to the information, He Weinian wanted you to marry He Tingchen.”","Qiao Xi: “???”","Cheng Ju’an said, “You should be very surprised, but it’s indeed true. He Weinian didn’t spread this news. Even He Tingchen doesn’t know about it. He Weinian wanted you to marry his son not because he thinks highly of you but because he thinks you’re useful to him. He probably thinks that keeping you by his side can restrain someone.","“One more thing. He Weinian was supposed to come back two years ago. At that time, you had just returned to the Qiao family. That was also when Qiao Rou ruined your engagement and stole your fiance, Gu Moling. He Weinian originally wanted to bring He Tingchen back to Li City to save you.","“Qiao Xi, think about it carefully. Back then, your fiance cheated on you with Qiao Rou, the person you hated the most. Everyone in the Qiao family was suppressing you. If you were at rock bottom and He Tingchen suddenly appeared to save you and everyone in the He family treated you as their biological daughter, would you have married He Tingchen instead?”","Qiao Xi suddenly fell silent and thought seriously for a moment before replying, “Maybe.”","“This is all the information I can find. Two years ago, He Weinian had already thought of a plan, but he was delayed by something. After he settled that matter and was about to return to Li City to carry out his original plan, he realized that you had actually married Gu Zheng. This matter exceeded his expectations and ruined his original plan.”","Qiao Xi suddenly recalled that Gu Zheng had said that the He family had cut off all contact with him a few years ago and agreed not to keep in contact with him anymore. However, He Weinian pretended that nothing had happened and returned to Li City as if he had never said anything.","He Weinian looked gentle and kind on the surface, but he was very arrogant on the inside. There must be a reason why he had to go back on his promise to come back here.","However, Qiao Xi never expected that He Weinian would suddenly return to Li City because of her!","Cheng Ju’an sighed. “I’m just reminding you not to worry too much. At the very least, He Weinian won’t make a move easily now. After all, he’s still afraid of Gu Zheng’s power. Next, He Weinian still wants He Tingchen to get close to you. He probably wants you to divorce Gu Zheng and marry into the He family. However, this won’t be easy. He first has to confirm that you’re a weak and ignorant girl.”"]},{"number":1391,"title":"Chapter 1391 Unknowingly Being Targeted","paragraphs":["1391 Unknowingly Being Targeted","Cheng Ju’an suddenly smiled, his tone filled with mockery. “But He Weinian never expected that not only are you not an ignorant girl, but you’re also the famous hacker, Black Tide.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Qiao Xi suddenly choked and roared angrily at the phone. “What are you talking about?! How am I not weak? Are you deliberately mocking me?!”","Cheng Ju’an laughed heartily. “Think what you want. Goodbye.”","Before Qiao Xi could retort, Cheng Ju’an hung up. Qiao Xi was angered to the point her face flushed red. She sat on the sofa and calmed down for a while before controlling her emotions.","After calming down, she could not help but think of He Weinian. Why did he get close to her? What was his motive?","Could it be... because of her blood?","With He Weinian’s character, the reason he could put down his dignity and return to Li City, even sacrificing his son to get close to her, was definitely because he was sure that he would obtain huge benefits by doing this. The only thing he could get from her was probably her blood.","Qiao Xi’s gaze suddenly turned cold as she suddenly had a guess. Could it be that He Weinian knew that Kang Jichuan had taken her blood back then and saved Kang Qingzhi?","Unexpectedly, she had already been targeted by so many people!","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and looked at Gu Zheng. “Tell me, why did you cut off all contact with He Weinian back then?”","Gu Zheng was wearing white home clothes. As his head was lowered, the hair on his forehead fell slightly. His gold-framed glasses covered his expression, and one could only see him pause for a moment before asking casually, “What are the rumors?”","“Rumor has it that you and He Weinian broke off all ties five years ago, but no one said why. At that time, many people criticized you and said that you must be unwilling to repay your master after obtaining power.”","When she spoke up to this point, a wave of rage surged in Qiao Xi’s heart. “After He Weinian returned to Li City, he took the initiative to give up benefits to Gu Corporation. Everyone is praising him for being tolerant and magnanimous, while you’re heartless and ungrateful. They’re saying you’re holding a grudge against your master because of a small argument five years ago.”","A small argument?","Qiao Xi knew Gu Zheng very well. He had always been clear about gratitude and grudges. He Weinian had helped him back then, so Gu Zheng would naturally remember it in his heart. How could he cut ties with He Weinian just because of a small argument? This was clearly nonsense from someone who did not know!","Gu Zheng smirked. “You’ve heard a lot about me and him?”","Qiao Xi was angry. She was naturally very concerned about Gu Zheng. Moreover, that old fox, He Weinian, was too sneaky. She had to be vigilant at all times and not let He Weinian take advantage of the situation.","Gu Zheng looked up at her, his eyes filled with gentleness. “Don’t be angry anymore. There’s no need.”","Qiao Xi tossed the phone to the side. Out of sight, out of mind.","“Actually, I cut ties with He Weinian mainly because of Gu Weiming. Seeing that Gu Corporation was getting better by the day, Gu Weiming could not help but scheme against me. He Weinian took the opportunity to send Gu Weiming some news, and I happened to realize that my master was not as kind and kind as I thought. Instead, he was the instigator of all the schemes.”","Gu Zheng said quietly, then smiled. “Xi Xi, you know me. You can guess what happened.”","Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng had known each other for ten years. Of course, she understood Gu Zheng. Gu Zheng had never been a kind person. He distinguished gratitude and grudges. He would do his best to repay whoever was good to him. It did not matter even if that person was an evil person.","Moreover, when He Weinian appeared in Gu Zheng’s life, it was during Gu Zheng’s most difficult time. He did not have anyone he could trust. Everyone was trying their best to suppress him, and only He Weinian was helping him. Hence, in Gu Zheng’s heart, He Weinian was probably the most important person to him. It was only when he realized He Weinian’s true colors that He Weinian’s tall image gradually collapsed.","However, even so, Gu Zheng would not completely break off all ties with He Weinian. In the end, Gu Zheng steeled his heart and completely cut off all ties with He Weinian. It must be because of an even crueler truth.","Qiao Xi suddenly raised her eyes and asked, “Did you already know that He Weinian had killed many people?”","“No.” Gu Zheng shook his head and continued, “I just sensed that something was wrong, but I didn’t continue to investigate. I only found out about what He Weinian was secretly doing later.”","That was right! Gu Zheng trusted his master so much. Why would he investigate him behind his back? It was just like how she had never suspected Kang Jichuan back then. They were both betrayed by the people they trusted the most."]},{"number":1392,"title":"Chapter 1392 Love Decided By The Gods!","paragraphs":["1392 Love Decided By The Gods!","After a moment of silence, Gu Zheng stood up and slowly said, “I completely cut ties with him because of one of his plans.”","“What plan?” Qiao Xi was puzzled.","Gu Zheng took off his gold-framed glasses and stared at her with a burning gaze. “Cheng Ju’an must have said it on the phone just now.”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a few seconds before she instantly came to a realization. “You already know that He Weinian is scheming against me?”","“Yes.” Gu Zheng stared at her with his deep eyes.","“But didn’t you say that we’ve never met before? Even if you knew that he wanted to attack me, you wouldn’t have cut off all contact with your master for a stranger!”","Gu Zheng’s gaze was calm, and his voice suddenly darkened. “That’s what’s strange.”","“I know very well that I cut off all ties with He Weinian for someone. I remembered that I had to wait for her at the Civil Affairs Bureau on an important day, but I just didn’t know who that person was.","“When I saw you, I was sure that you were the person I’ve been looking for.”","In his and Qiao Xi’s memories, they had known each other for ten years but had never met. He did not know that Qiao Xi was Black Tide. Since he did not know, why would he cut ties with He Weinian because of Qiao Xi?","Moreover, it was also because of Qiao Xi that his loyalty to He Weinian shifted and he secretly investigated the evidence of He Weinian’s crime. He even threatened He Weinian to leave Li City.","Qiao Xi’s head was heavy as she sat on the sofa, her gaze gradually becoming dazed.","At that time, Gu Zheng did not even know her, but he still protected her through his instincts. He did not even hesitate to go against He Weinian for her.","“In that case...” Qiao Xi’s voice was slightly hoarse.","Gu Zheng continued, “We’ve known each other for a long time, but we’ve both lost our memories of each other. Moreover, I’m guessing that I hadn’t lost my memory before I resisted He Weinian, so my memory loss is probably related to He Weinian.”","His gaze was so deep as he quietly looked at Qiao Xi. “After that, I lost my memory, but I still relied on my instincts to resist He Weinian. It’s even to the extent that it’s possible that I was already prepared to make a move on He Weinian before I lost my memory. It’s just that I can’t remember now.”","Qiao Xi recalled Cheng Juan’s words just now: He Weinian wanted to attack her two years ago, but for some reason, he had no choice but to postpone the plan.","What was the reason? Was it because Gu Zheng, who had yet to lose, had set up a trap in advance? He hoped that He Weinian would back down and give up on that plan.","“But this is just my guess.” Gu Zheng suddenly stood up and walked in front of her. His tall and straight body blocked the light, and Qiao Xi’s eyes suddenly darkened.","She slowly looked up. Gu Zheng was standing against the light, and his expression could not be seen clearly. However, she could see the smile on his lips. He bent down slightly and gently lifted her chin, muttering softly, “Even if I forgot about you back then, we were destined to be together. I was destined to leave He Weinian’s side for you, and I was also destined to go to the Civil Affairs Bureau to wait for you.”","Qiao Xi gasped as their eyes met. At this moment, time seemed to have stopped.","At this moment, Gu Yao’s eyes were filled with adoration. He wished he could take out his phone to record this beautiful scene.","Gu Zheng had already forgotten about Qiao Xi, yet he was still able to go against his master for her. Wasn’t this fate?","It was love decided by the gods! It was too touching! His heart was moved!","However, the next second...","Qiao Xi took a few steps back nervously. “Could it be that you’re thinking too much? Perhaps He Weinian didn’t postpone the plan because of you. Could it be that you set up a trap before you lost your memory?”","After all, the two of them had already lost their memories. Gu Zheng had never appeared in her mind. How could Gu Zheng go against his master’s wishes for someone he had never seen before?","The smile on Gu Yao’s face froze, and the beautiful scene in front of him shattered.","Gu Zheng’s eyes revealed an awkward expression for the first time. Qiao Xi lowered her head and did not dare to look at him as if she had made a mistake.","After a long silence, Gu Zheng cleared his throat and said, “I have something else to tell you. The Yao family and the Kang family are somewhat related. Chairman Yao mentioned it before, but the Kang family is too powerful. We haven’t found any useful clues yet.”","“Yao Mengqing’s Yao family?”","“Yes, I’ve asked Song Shijing to investigate. I’ll tell you when there’s something.”"]},{"number":1393,"title":"Chapter 1393 A Guest Who Came Rashly","paragraphs":["1393 A Guest Who Came Rashly","Qiao Xi suddenly thought of something. “Previously, Yao Junjie agreed to give Yao Mengqing’s shares to me. I kept having the feeling that something wasn’t right. Although Yao Junjie isn’t on good terms with the rest of the Yao family, they’re related by blood, after all. There’s no need for him to exterminate them, right?”","Half a year had passed since the incident with the Yao family, but Qiao Xi still could not figure it out. Now that the Kang family had appeared and the two families were still in contact, Qiao Xi could not help but think too much.","Gu Zheng’s voice was calm. “Don’t think too much. I’ll handle everything.”","Qiao Xi felt slightly more at ease and leaned comfortably in Gu Zheng’s embrace.","Half an hour later, the butler’s hurried footsteps sounded. “Young Madam, a guest wants to see you.”","Qiao Xi slowly opened her eyes. As expected, this guest was Kang Ru. After all, he was a noble of Y Nation. It was not difficult for him to find Gu Zheng’s residence. Kang Ru came faster than she had imagined.","“I’ll go downstairs immediately. Arrange for guests to come in first,” Qiao Xi instructed.","Before her memory recovered, she definitely did not want to have anything to do with the Kang family. However, she had already recovered some of her memories. She knew that Kang Jichuan had taken her blood, so she naturally could not let this go.","Previously, Third Brother had reminded her that using her blood to treat illnesses would cause harm to her body. That was why when she wanted to give Gu Zheng her blood, Third Brother firmly refused. However, in those few months, Kang Jichuan had given Kang Qingzhi almost all her blood.","How could she take this lying down without taking revenge?","Qiao Xi’s eyes turned cold as the corners of her mouth curled into a mocking smile. She stood up and stretched before returning to the bedroom to change.","In the living room on the first floor, Kang Ru was pacing anxiously. He had come straight to Longwan Residential after getting off the plane. At first, the butler did not let him in, but when he heard that he was here to look for Xi Xi, he let him in.","Kang Ru was agitated but uneasy. Song Shiyu saw this and muttered in a low voice, “Mr. Kang is too anxious. He didn’t even call before coming. Don’t you think it’s rude?”","Song Shijing glanced at Kang Ru and said seriously, “Don’t spout nonsense.”","“I’m just worried about Uncle Sheng. If this person angers Young Madam, the president will definitely not let Uncle Sheng off for letting him in. He’s already so old, so he won’t be able to take it!”","Speaking of which, Mr. Kang was already in his 40s or 50s and was even an earl of Y Nation. Why did he look so rash?","At first, Uncle Sheng did not let him in because he hadn’t revealed his identity. He was in a rush to barge in. Uncle Sheng was the butler of Longwan Residential, so he naturally would not let him in. However, Kang Ru looked unhappy and said that he was here to look for his daughter. He ordered Uncle Sheng to move aside immediately.","Song Shiyu could not understand. Who did he think he was? He was an earl in Y Nation, but did everyone have to give in to him in Li City? Even if he had a noble status, he could not barge into private property! What was wrong with Uncle Sheng stopping him?","When he saw that scene, Song Shiyu wondered if this person was really a noble. Why did his words and actions look so childish? He did not look like a noble at all.","Kang Ru was so anxious that his forehead was covered in sweat. Finally, footsteps came from the stairs.","He hurriedly looked up, his eyes filled with joy and excitement. “Xi Xi!”","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes to look at him with a cold gaze.","The moment Kang Ru saw Qiao Xi, his eyes instantly lit up. He was extremely sure that Qiao Xi was his and Yunqiu’s daughter. Her aura was exactly the same as Yunqiu’s, especially her eyes. When she looked at him, they were cold and carried a trace of alienation.","Back then, he fell in love with Yunqiu at first sight because of her charming eyes.","Kang Ru said anxiously, “Xi Xi, I’ve been looking for you for so many years. I’ve finally seen you!”","From the beginning until the end, Qiao Xi had always been cold. She elegantly walked to the living room while Kang Ru followed her and chattered in her ear. “Xi Xi, your mother must have told you that I’m your father!”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up.","Kang Ru was so excited that he could not speak properly. “Xi Xi, I... My surname is Kang. I’m a noble in Y Nation. Prepare yourself immediately. We’ll return to Y Nation as soon as possible. I’ll make sure to make it up to you.”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment. Kang Ru was different from what she had imagined, but she had seen Kang Ru’s information. He had been a high and mighty noble since he was born, so he innately had the arrogance to override others. He felt that others would agree with what he thought. If he wanted to do something, others had to do it according to his wishes. He would never think that others would possibly refuse."]},{"number":1394,"title":"Chapter 1394 The Whole World Collapsed","paragraphs":["1394 The Whole World Collapsed","In Kang Ru’s point of view, once someone rejected him, he would feel that that person did not respect him and might even betray him.","Qiao Xi was originally uncertain if Kang Ru knew about what had happened back then. Now that she had seen him in person, Qiao Xi was sure that he definitely did not know. It was difficult for someone with such a character to hide their inner thoughts. If he knew, he would have definitely said something along the lines of, ‘Xi Xi, your brother already knows his mistake. Let’s forget about the past.’","After a moment of silence, Qiao Xi said softly, “Mr. Kang, this is the first time I’ve seen you. You’re saying that you’re my father the moment we met. Why don’t we do a paternity test first?”","Kang Ru stood on the spot, seemingly a little stunned. Then, his eyes were filled with sorrow. “Xi Xi, I’m sure you’re my daughter. We don’t have to do a paternity test.”","!!","“Since you’re so sure, so be it. But I’ve lived in Li City since I was young. I won’t go to Y Nation.”","“What? Xi Xi, you’re not coming back to Y Nation?” Kang Ru was shocked.","Why did she want to stay in Li City? Couldn’t she just go home with him and enjoy life?","Kang Ru was extremely excited before he came. He never expected that Qiao Xi would refuse him. At this moment, it was as if someone had poured a bucket of cold water on him as he stared blankly at Qiao Xi.","“Mr. Kang, I’m sorry, but I really can’t go with you.”","The corners of Kang Ru’s mouth twitched, and he did not know what to say for a moment. He was Qiao Xi’s biological father. He had come all the way to Li City to bring her home. Why was she refusing?","Just because Qiao Xi had rejected him, Kang Ru felt that the entire world was about to collapse.","Kang Ru seemed to be a little impatient. “Xi Xi, I’m your father. Our home is in Y Nation. I’m here to bring you home. As long as you come back with me, I’ll fulfill your wishes.”","Qiao Xi glanced indifferently at Kang Ru. The information was right. Kang Ru was a decisive person who did not consider the thoughts of others. It was even to the extent that he was a little childish. She did not think that her mother would like such a man.","However, Kang Ru said that she could fulfill her wishes. What if she wanted Kang Jichuan and Kang Qingzhi’s lives?","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart, then replied indifferently, “Mr. Kang, I’ve lived in Li City for 20 years. I don’t want to go to an unfamiliar environment. Moreover, my job is in Li City, and my husband is here too. I won’t leave.”","Kang Ru’s body stiffened, and his expression was extremely ugly. His eyes were filled with sorrow and shock. “Xi Xi, I came all the way here to pick you up. How could you...”","Song Shiyu, who was at the door, was speechless. ‘You’re here to pick Young Madam up, but does she have to go back with you? Dream on.’","Kang Ru lowered his head and thought for a moment. He looked at Qiao Xi anxiously. “Xi Xi, it’s okay. If you like being a teacher, I can arrange a job for you at a university in Y Nation. The treatment you get there will definitely not be worse than at Li City University.","“As for your company in Li City, it’s fine if you don’t want it. If you really don’t want to give it up, you can find a few trustworthy people to manage it for the time being. You’re just a girl, so you should shop and watch movies like Qingzhi. Our family doesn’t lack money, so why tire yourself out?!”","Song Shiyu: “...” He really wanted to chase this guy out!","Qiao Xi smiled. “Mr. Kang, everyone has their own ambitions. I don’t like that kind of life. Work is very important to me.”","Kang Ru frowned and gradually broke down.","He really did not understand why Xi Xi was unwilling to leave with him. What was so good about Li City? She could go home with him and get whatever she wanted. How could she bear to reject him?","Right! She had a husband! It must be because of that man.","Kang Ru thought for a long time and felt that this was the only reason. He calmed down and advised softly, “Xi Xi, you’re unwilling to leave because of your husband, right? It’s okay, you can bring him to Y Nation with you. I’ll arrange his work too. Even if the two of you don’t work, our family can still support you.”","Song Shiyu: “...”","Song Shijing: “...”","Was he kidding? He wanted to arrange jobs for their president? He even wanted to support the president?","Qiao Xi seemed to be slightly speechless as well and chuckled. “Mr. Kang, didn’t you investigate before coming? My husband is Gu Zheng.”","Kang Ru naturally knew that Qiao Xi’s husband was Gu Zheng, the richest man in Li City, but so what?","Just then, Song Shijing could not help but say, “Mr. Kang, our president has created a powerful business empire in Li City. It’s really impossible for him to give up everything in Li City and return to Y Nation with you. Young Madam doesn’t want to leave the president either. I hope you understand.”"]},{"number":1395,"title":"Chapter 1395 Can A Father Decide Everything For His Children?","paragraphs":["1395 Can A Father Decide Everything For His Children?","Kang Ru’s eyes were filled with shock and confusion. “Xi Xi, since you’re married, he should follow you to Y Nation. Moreover, how can Li City compare to Y Nation? Your family is waiting for you to go back. Can you bear to disappoint them?”","Qiao Xi refused without the slightest hesitation. “Mr. Kang, there are many important people and matters in Li City. I won’t go back.”","Kang Ru’s body went weak as he took two steps back uncontrollably. His eyes were filled with disbelief, then he said sadly, “I’m your biological father! Can’t you give up everything in Li City for me?”","Qiao Xi was simply angered to the point of laughing due to Kang Ru’s naive thoughts. If she took revenge on Kang Jichuan in the future, Kang Ru would definitely say with a sad expression, “He’s your biological brother! Can’t you give up your past hatred for him?”","“Mr. Kang, you keep saying that you’re my father. If that’s the case, why didn’t my mother live with you but came to Li City alone?”","As soon as Qiao Xi finished speaking, she looked at Kang Ru with interest. Sure enough, his expression changed, and his eyes were filled with sorrow. He said in an extremely helpless tone, “I had no choice! Yunqiu and my mother have always been like fire and water. I only asked her to tolerate it a little, but she refused to accept it and left in a fit of anger.","“I always thought that she was just a child of an ordinary family, while I was a noble earl. The difference in status between us was too great, so we couldn’t get married. Later on, I found out that she was Old Madam Yin’s daughter. Why didn’t she tell me?! If she had told me, we could’ve been together!”","Kang Ru’s eyes were filled with regret and confusion. If Yunqiu had revealed her identity back then, they would have gotten married a long time ago and given birth to a pair of obedient children. The two of them would have accompanied each other until they grew old.","He loved Yunqiu, but he could not understand her actions. Hence, he said with a serious expression, “I couldn’t give her a marriage, but I wouldn’t like anyone else either. I’d love her forever and treat her well. Isn’t that enough?”","Song Shiyu: “??”","‘F*ck! If you’re unwilling to marry her, what right do you have to ask her to stay by your side?’","After Qiao Xi heard Kang Ru’s story, her expression did not change at all. She already understood why her mother left back then.","Even now, Kang Ru did not understand why Xia Yunqiu left. What he cared more about now was how to bring his daughter home.","“Xi Xi, what’s so important about Li City that it’s more important than reuniting with your family?”","As soon as he finished speaking, the living room fell silent.","“Mr. Kang.” Suddenly, a cold male voice came from upstairs.","“Xi Xi was born and raised in Li City. To her, Li City has many precious memories. Besides, the company my mother-in-law spent a lot of effort to found is here. Of course, she can’t bear to leave.","“You’re just a stranger who’s related to her by blood. She’s already 21 years old, but this is the first time she’s seen you. The moment you appear, you’re asking her to give up everything and return to an unfamiliar city with you. How could she agree?”","The man’s voice was calm, but it carried a hint of sharpness, making Kang Ru inexplicably feel a sense of oppression.","Kang Ru frowned unhappily and looked up at the man in front of her. “You’re Gu Zheng?","“I’m Xi Xi’s biological father. What’s wrong with bringing her home? We’re related by blood, so how can we be strangers? Her biological grandmother and brother are at home. They’ll naturally adapt after spending some time together.","“The company her mother left behind is just an inanimate object. How can it be more important than her family? If she really cares about it, she can come back to visit every year.”","Kang Ru was still unable to understand Qiao Xi’s thoughts. His thoughts were already deeply rooted, and no one could change his thoughts. Just like back then, he thought that it did not matter if he did not get married. It was fine as long as he could live happily with Yunqiu. Moreover, Yunqiu had agreed at that time. They had the best time together and had their son, but later on...","Gu Zheng suddenly sneered and interrupted his thoughts, “Mr. Kang, no matter who you are to Xi Xi, you can’t interfere in her life. She has the right to decide her own life. You have no right to force her.”","Kang Ru immediately retorted, “But I’m her father!”","“Can a father decide everything for his children? Do you think it’s reasonable for him to oppress his children just because they’re related by blood?” Gu Zheng questioned coldly."]},{"number":1396,"title":"Chapter 1396 Honey, Arsenic","paragraphs":["1396 Honey, Arsenic","Gu Zheng’s words echoed in every corner of the living room. Uncle Sheng and Song Shijing lowered their heads, but Song Shiyu was extremely excited. He hoped that the president could deal with this weird old man!","Kang Ru was born as the noble young master of the Kang family. After he became an adult, he inherited a noble title. No one had ever spoken to him in such a tone. Gu Zheng was the only one.","His face was pale, and his eyes were filled with anger. “Gu Zheng!”","Gu Zheng still had an indifferent expression as he looked at Kang Ru with a faint smile. He did not care about Kang Ru’s anger at all.","“I’m doing this for her own good. As long as she goes back with me, she’ll be the daughter of the Kang family. Won’t it be good if she becomes the younger sister of an earl?” Kang Ru was so angry that her face turned red.","Gu Zheng replied casually, “No, she doesn’t like that.”","Kang Ru had received good guidance since he was young and developed a gentle and humble character. He was a famous gentle young master in Y Nation. He would not lose his temper because it would really damage his image. At this moment, he was trying his best to suppress the anger in his heart.","After calming down for a long time, Kang Ru sighed helplessly. “Xi Xi, I really hope you’ll come back with me. You’re still young and have a few friends by your side, so perhaps you don’t think that blood relations are important. But when you really encounter trouble, you’ll know how important family is. As long as you return to Romulan City, I’ll help you arrange everything. I’ll definitely try my best to make it up to you and make you the happiest daughter of a noble family!”","Qiao Xi quietly looked at Kang Ru.","Perhaps Kang Ru really wanted to treat her well, but it was unrealistic for her to give up everything in Li City and live in Y Nation.","Kang Ru’s thoughts were selfish. He only wanted to make up for the regret in his heart, but he had never thought about whether she was willing or not. He thought that what he could give his children was the best, and as a child, she should not refuse her father’s arrangements. She should obediently live according to his wishes.","He was too arbitrary and did not allow others to refuse or object.","Perhaps to most people, becoming the daughter of the Kang family was a blissful thing. With a father who doted on her, she did not have to do anything and could squander money freely. Her father would do his best to satisfy whatever she wanted to do. This seemed to be what many girls dreamed of, but there were always people who did not like it.","To Qiao Xi, Kang Ru was still a stranger. It was their first time meeting, yet Kang Ru was already asking her to let go of everything and live in the unfamiliar Romulan City. With Qiao Xi’s unyielding character, she would absolutely not agree.","Kang Ru continued to persuade her patiently. “Xi Xi, the few companies in Li City are worthless. If you really like opening companies, I’ll open them for you when we go back to Romulan City. Let’s not take anything here. We’ll take a private plane back now...”","“Mr. Kang.” Qiao Xi’s voice was cold as she interrupted him. “My husband has already made himself very clear just now. No one can force me.”","Kang Ru’s glowing eyes instantly darkened. “Xi Xi, how can you be so heartless?”","Qiao Xi was slightly helpless. If she had grown up by Kang Ru’s side since she was young, she might have become what Kang Ru liked and become the noble daughter of the Kang family, a beautiful but useless canary.","Qiao Xi had completely lost her patience now. Before she could speak, Gu Zheng beat her to it and said in a sharp voice, “Mr. Kang, our intentions are very clear. If you’re willing to stay as a guest, we’ll naturally welcome you, but you can’t take Xi Xi away. If you insist on doing this, then even if I have to risk my life today, I won’t let you take Xi Xi away.”","Gu Zheng exuded strong killing intent and did not hide the coldness in his eyes. Kang Ru took a few steps back in fear.","He was respected and admired in Y Nation. No one had ever threatened him like this. His life had been smooth sailing without a trace of trouble, so he was still as naive as a child at his age.","Kang Ru could not help but glance at Qiao Xi. His lips moved, and he still refused to give up. “Xi Xi, can’t you think about it again?”","“Mr. Kang.” Song Shijing knew that Young Madam did not want to say anything else, so he went forward with a smile. “Mr. Kang, you came so suddenly this time. Moreover, it’s your first time meeting Young Madam. It’s normal that Young Madam can’t accept it at the moment. Why don’t you give her more time? Some things have to be adapted to.”","Song Shijing’s words gave Kang Ru a trace of hope and shut him up. He did not know what to say."]},{"number":1397,"title":"Chapter 1397 Two Setbacks In Her Life","paragraphs":["1397 Two Setbacks In Her Life","Song Shijing’s voice gradually turned cold. “Mr. Kang, Young Madam hasn’t been feeling well recently. Even if she really wants to leave, she has to wait until she recovers.”","During this period of time, Qiao Xi had been complaining about her illness to the public. She did not attend any banquets or events in Li City because she wanted to lure people into her trap. It was just that she did not expect that she would suddenly recover her memory and get to know that the person who took her blood back then was Kang Jichuan.","Kang Ru instantly became nervous. “Xi Xi, are you sick? Where are you feeling unwell? Then I... I’d better leave first. Think about it again. If you come back to Romulan City, you can go to the manor with Qingzhi to recuperate. You can also...”","“Mr. Kang,” Song Shijing interrupted him and bent down slightly to ask him to leave.","!!","Kang Ru frowned, his face filled with unhappiness. When he heard that Xi Xi was sick just now, his mood was a little complicated. His worry was mixed with a little impatience. “Alright, I’ll come back after a while.”","Watching Kang Ru leave, a complicated look flashed past Song Shijing’s eyes. Song Shiyu’s face was filled with disgust.","Qiao Xi chuckled. “What an interesting father.”","Song Shijing was puzzled. “Young Madam, he doesn’t look like Kang Jichuan.”","Kang Ru’s life had been smooth sailing since he was young. He had never encountered any difficulties or setbacks. He could easily get anything he wanted, so his character was arbitrary. However, he was also very naive. It was really strange for these two traits to be combined.","Qiao Xi grunted coldly. She was not prepared to go to Y Nation. After all, Y Nation was Kang Jichuan’s territory. Kang Jichuan looked gentle and cultured on the surface, but he was meticulous and shrewd. Perhaps he had secretly nurtured his own power all these years. There was no need for her to take risks in Y Nation.","She wanted to take revenge on Kang Jichuan, but she did not have to go to Y Nation to do it. She could get Kang Jichuan to come to Li City. She would not be so rash as to run to someone else’s territory to take revenge.","“Ah Zheng.” Qiao Xi suddenly raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng.","“What’s wrong?” Gu Zheng’s voice was gentle.","“Can you do me a favor?” Qiao Xi’s voice was slightly nervous.","Song Shijing and Song Shiyu stood where they were and watched the delicate young madam pull the president upstairs.","On the other hand, Kang Ru left Longwan Residential with a depressed heart. He really did not understand why Xi Xi rejected him. It was such a joyful thing to be able to reunite with one’s family. How could she not be willing?","Y Nation was very unfamiliar to her, but her family was there. What was more important than her family?","After thinking about it, Kang Ru suddenly recalled Uncle Zhi’s words. Could it be that Xi Xi minded Qingzhi’s existence? Xi Xi knew that there was a favored adopted daughter in the family, so she was afraid that she would not be valued if she went to Y Nation... Was that the reason she was unwilling to agree?","However, Qingzhi was just an adopted daughter while Xi Xi was his biological daughter. Whether Qingzhi existed or not, he would not treat Xi Xi badly.","Kang Ru’s life was extremely smooth-sailing. He had only suffered two setbacks. The first was Xia Yunqiu, and the other was Qiao Xi.","The car slowly stopped at the entrance of Longwan Residential. Kang Ru was about to get in when another car suddenly stopped not far away. Kang Ru could not help but look over.","He Weinian was also stunned for a moment. Longwan Residential was Gu Zheng’s private residence, and very few people came. It seemed that this person was an important guest of Gu Zheng’s.","He Weinian and He Wenxian got out of the car and looked at the person in front of them while thinking. As Gu Zheng’s master and a famous philanthropist in Li City, He Weinian would definitely go forward to greet Gu Zheng’s guest.","After hesitating for a few seconds, He Weinian walked forward. When he saw the person in front of him, his body suddenly stiffened.","Kang Ru?","He actually came to Li City. In that case, had he and Qiao Xi acknowledged each other? Did Kang Jichuan know about this too?","He Weinian was stunned for a moment, then a gentle smile appeared on his face. He greeted with a smile, “Mr. Kang.”","Kang Ru was filled with frustration. He did not want to pay attention to the person beside him, but since the other party had taken the initiative to greet him, he could only turn around out of courtesy. “You know me?”","He Weinian smiled. Of course, he knew him. He was Kang Jichuan’s father!","“Hello, Mr. Kang. I’m the president of He Corporation, He Weinian. Two years ago, I was attending an event in Y Nation and saw you and Mr. Kang Jichuan from afar.”","“Oh, yes.” Kang Ru was still thinking about how to get Qiao Xi to go home with him and only nodded perfunctorily.","He Weinian sized up Kang Ru, then looked at the door of the villa. He asked meaningfully, “Mr. Kang, do you know Ah Zheng? Why haven’t I heard him mention it?”","At the mention of Gu Zheng, Kang Ru frowned. If it were not for this man, Xi Xi might have gone back with him."]},{"number":1398,"title":"Chapter 1398 Can’t Bear It","paragraphs":["1398 Can’t Bear It","Kang Ru did not speak for a long time, while He Weinian asked tentatively, “Don’t tell me you’re here to look for Xi Xi?”","Kang Ru was instantly interested when he heard Qiao Xi’s name. “Mr. He, do you know Xi Xi?”","He Weinian smiled gently. “Of course, I do. Xi Xi is Ah Zheng’s wife, and Ah Zheng is my student.”","Kang Ru’s eyes were filled with surprise. “I didn’t expect you and Xi Xi to be so close. In that case, can you help me persuade Xi Xi to return to Y Nation with me?”","He Weinian’s expression did not change, but he was sneering in his heart. He still replied gently, “That’s not difficult. I can help you persuade Xi Xi. Why don’t we add each other’s contact details first so that we can contact each other at any time? If there’s any progress, I can also inform you to come to Li City.”","Kang Ru hurriedly nodded. He Weinian was Gu Zheng’s master and would definitely be close to the couple. As long as he could persuade Xi Xi, Xi Xi might agree.","After the two of them added each other’s contact details and exchanged a few pleasantries, Kang Ru left in satisfaction.","Watching the car drive away, He Weinian’s gentle expression suddenly turned cold. His eyes were filled with mockery as he sneered. “Idiot!”","He Wenxian walked to his side and said softly, “Father, is he Kang Ru? Has he found Qiao Xi? Kang Jichuan should know too, right?”","He Weinian smirked. “Kang Ru came all the way to Li City, so he naturally wouldn’t hide it from Kang Jichuan. An idiot like Kang Ru is destined to be useless for the rest of his life. If it weren’t for the fact that he has a noble title, he would have long fallen to the streets. Fortunately, his son is still considered smart and will do anything to achieve his goals. He has my demeanor from when I was young.","“Kang Ru actually wants to bring Qiao Xi back to Y Nation. He probably doesn’t know what Kang Jichuan has done to Qiao Xi!”","He Weinian sneered. “Now that Qiao Xi has already lost her memory, it’s even more impossible for Kang Jichuan to tell Kang Ru about what happened back then. We’ll just pretend not to know.","“Wenxian, besides renewing your relationship with Gu Zheng, you have to build a good relationship with Qiao Xi. It’s best if you can become good friends with her.","“I don’t care what you do, but you can’t reveal any flaws in front of Qiao Xi. You have to learn to treat her sincerely. Wenxian, don’t disappoint me.”","He Wenxian pursed her lips nervously and nodded hurriedly. “Father, I’ll remember your words.”","“You can’t just remember. You have to do it!” He Weinian’s voice suddenly turned cold, and his gentle gaze became sharp. “Before I returned to the country, I told you that you had to build a good relationship with Qiao Xi, but what did you do? Just because you were jealous of her, you offended her time and again and were even played by her. Your actions can’t compare to that silly He Wenyin!”","He Wenxian lowered her head and gritted her teeth.","“Now that Qiao Xi is married to Gu Zheng, we can’t do anything under Gu Zheng’s watch. If we don’t deliberately get close to her, what else can we do? You have to be clear that not only do we have to complete the plan, but we also can’t let others suspect the He family. Only then will we be considered to have truly succeeded.","“Wenxian, I can understand your feelings. You hate Qiao Xi, but if you can’t bear it, it’ll ruin your plan. Bear with her for a while longer. As long as the time is right, she’ll die in pain in front of you. At that time, you’ll understand that all your forbearance is worth it!”","He Wenxian exhaled. “I understand.”","He Weinian nodded, and his sharp expression gradually became gentle and loving. “Alright, let’s go in.”","“By the way, how’s the preparation for the restoration of the ancient book going?” He Weinian asked casually.","He Wenxian smiled confidently. “Of course, there’s no problem. As long as the real Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor doesn’t appear, everything will go smoothly.”","Rumor had it that a young woman who claimed to be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor restored a damaged scroll in just a month and became famous. However, there had been no news of her in recent years.","“Don’t worry, I won’t let her appear.” He Weinian smiled coldly. Once the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor appeared, he would get rid of her.","In the study of Longwan Residential.","Gu Zheng leaned against the chair and looked at his wife with interest. “What do you need my help with?”","If it was about Kang Ru and Kang Jichuan, she did not have to hide it. After all, Song Shijing and Song Shiyu already knew about it.","Moreover, when she said she wanted to help, she was a little nervous and ingratiating. Gu Zheng kept having the feeling that her request was not ordinary."]},{"number":1399,"title":"Chapter 1399 Missing Invitation","paragraphs":["1399 Missing Invitation","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes and smiled sweetly. “Senior, you know my identity, right?”","These words sounded a little inexplicable, but Gu Zheng saw through her thoughts and asked casually, “Oh? What identity?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","She hesitated for a long time, and her cheeks turned red. In the end, she said shyly, “Um... I restored the damaged scroll...”","Seeing her like this, Gu Zheng inexplicably wanted to tease her. His voice was tainted with a trace of joy. “Xi Xi, so you’re talking about this identity! What do you want me to help you with?”","Qiao Xi smiled in embarrassment. “Actually, it’s not a big deal. Li City is holding a cultural relics event in a few days. The main content is the restoration of ancient books. I was invited, but I... I really don’t want to go with that identity!”","Gu Zheng could understand Qiao Xi’s thoughts. Back then, Xi Xi was young and casually chose a name. If she attended an event and heard so many seniors call her ‘Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor’, it would really be too embarrassing.","He curled his lips and suppressed his smile. “Since you don’t want to go, then just refuse.”","Qiao Xi blurted out, “It’s easy to refuse them, but I heard that the theme of this event is to repair the classic ancient book, ‘The Forgotten River’. This ancient book actually has rubbings, but the one in the event is the real one. I really want to take a look.”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. It was really rare for Mrs. Gu to expose her identity for an ancient book!","Qiao Xi’s face was dyed red. “I... I really don’t want to go as the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Moreover, this event is related to the restoration of ancient books, after all. Ordinary people won’t be able to enter, so I can only ask you to help me!”","“What can I do?” Gu Zheng stared at her with his deep eyes.","Qiao Xi lowered her head and said in a voice that was like a mosquito, “Why don’t you say that you’re the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor? Bring me in and I’ll see how the seniors repaired The Forgotten River. We’ll leave after that’s done, alright?”","The study instantly fell silent. A moment later, Gu Zheng chuckled. “You’re pushing the name you don’t like to me, Mrs. Gu?”","Qiao Xi defended herself self-righteously. “You’re Gu Zheng! Even if they know that you’re the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, they won’t offend you. They’ll even respectfully call you Mr. Gu. You don’t have to feel ashamed at all!”","Gu Zheng looked at Qiao Xi’s anxious appearance and nodded in amusement. Actually, he had also received an invitation. Even if he did use the name Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, he could still legitimately enter the venue.","“Alright, since you want to go, I’ll go with you.”","“Really?” Qiao Xi was instantly stunned as if she did not dare believe that Gu Zheng would agree so readily.","Gu Zheng looked up and glanced at her. “When have I ever rejected your request? Give me the invitation. On the day of the event, follow me in without worry.”","Previously, Qiao Xi had promised Gu Zheng that she would share any secrets with him and not hide them from him. She originally thought that after revealing her identity this time, Gu Zheng would tease her. She did not expect things to go so smoothly, and it caused her to be slightly in disbelief.","Qiao Xi danced with joy. Suddenly, her entire body stiffened, and her expression changed. “That’s not right! I don’t have an invitation!”","“Previously, the person in charge of the event called me and asked for my address. He said that he would send the invitation over. The event is just a few days away, but I haven’t received it!”","Gu Zheng’s eyes flashed.","His invitation was personally sent over by the staff of the ancient books repair department. They even double-checked his identity. However, Xi Xi received a call asking for her address. They said that they wanted to send the invitation over?","“Which address did you give?” Gu Zheng asked softly.","Qiao Xi frowned. “It’s a house I rented in the past. When it’s not convenient for me to expose my identity, I’ll name that address. I also go there when I meet Stars. Moreover, the phone number I left behind is also a special number in Ling Pavilion. They won’t be able to find the owner’s name.”","After a moment of silence, Gu Zheng said in a low voice, “Xi Xi, you’ve been tricked. The invitations to this event were personally sent to the guests by the staff. A few ancient book repair masters in Li City also personally received the invitations.","“From the looks of it, the person who asked for your address wasn’t a staff member. They intercepted your invitation.”","Qiao Xi blinked. Who was so wicked?","Not only did the other party intercept her invitation, but they also called her to ask for her address. What did they want?"]},{"number":1400,"title":"Chapter 1400 Uninvited Guests","paragraphs":["1400 Uninvited Guests","Qiao Xi was about to log into her account to check the phone number when Song Shijing’s voice came from outside. “President, Young Madam, Chairman He is here.”","Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng looked at each other, and their eyes were slightly surprised.","Others did not know about Gu Zheng and He Weinian’s current relationship, but He Weinian knew very well that Gu Zheng was definitely unwilling to see him. In that case, why did he come to Longwan Residential?","Song Shijing was also very puzzled. Was He Weinian trying to please the president in front of everyone?","!!","“President, do you want me to stop He Weinian?”","Gu Zheng stood up and straightened his clothes. He sneered. “There’s no need. Chairman He isn’t someone you can fool with just a few words. He clearly knows that I don’t welcome him, but he still shamelessly came. He must have something important to say to me.”","“Xi Xi, do you want to go with me?” Gu Zheng turned around and looked at Qiao Xi.","“Of course. How can I bear to let you face that old fox alone?!” Qiao Xi held his arm, and the two of them went downstairs together.","Actually, when He Weinian came to visit, Uncle Sheng could have found a reason to stop him. However, he was worried that others would gossip if news of this got out, so he could only invite him in and serve him good tea.","As long as the president did not come downstairs, He Weinian would leave after a while. However, he did not expect the president and Young Madam to come down together.","He Weinian smiled gently, his eyes filled with love. “Ah Zheng.”","“Chairman He,” Gu Zheng replied casually.","He Weinian could tell that Gu Zheng was unwilling to see him, so he went straight to the point. “Ah Zheng, please forgive me for disturbing you today. I heard that you have a burned painting, so I rushed over.","“You must have heard that Li City is holding a cultural relics event soon. If you have time, you can take the painting there to take a look. Someone will definitely be able to help you repair it.”","Gu Zheng’s expression did not change as he nodded perfunctorily.","He Weinian smiled fakely. “If you’re not interested, then forget it. After all, you’re usually very busy with work.”","With that, He Weinian took out a business card and placed it on the table. “The standard of this event is very high. People who don’t have an invitation can’t enter. Even if you have a high status in Li City, you can’t enter. If you feel like going, you can take my business card and enter.”","Before Gu Zheng could speak, He Weinian looked at Qiao Xi and smiled kindly. “Ah Zheng, you’re not interested in the restoration of ancient books, but perhaps Mrs. Gu is?”","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes, and her gaze carried a trace of doubt.","What a coincidence. She and Gu Zheng had just discussed attending the ancient book restoration event when He Weinian personally came to invite them. She did not believe that He Weinian would be so kind.","“I am interested in it,” Qiao Xi said indifferently.","He Weinian was extremely satisfied. Qiao Xi was not as difficult to get along with as he had imagined.","When Gu Zheng heard Qiao Xi’s words, he raised his eyes slightly and asked softly, “You’re interested?”","Qiao Xi nodded obediently and blinked at him.","“Since you’re interested, then let’s go.”","He Weinian moved the business card in front of Gu Zheng. “Ah Zheng, keep this business card. You can enter by handing it to the staff at the door. One more thing...”","He looked at Qiao Xi and smiled in embarrassment. “Mrs. Gu, there was a misunderstanding between you and Wenxian previously. She has thought it through and even said that she wants to apologize to you in person! Wenxian said that if you’re interested in the restoration of ancient books, she wants to bring you around the event as an apology. What do you think, Mrs. Gu?”","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly. “Miss He wants to bring me around? But you said that the standard of this event is very high. The surroundings are filled with extremely precious classic books. With her identity, can she bring me around?”","The moment that was said, He Wenxian’s expression instantly changed. She looked at Gu Zheng aggrievedly, but Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent from the beginning until the end. He did not even look at her.","He Weinian ignored Qiao Xi’s hostility and still had the image of a loving elder. “Wenxian received an invitation and has many friends in the cultural relics world. It’s naturally not a problem for her to bring you around.”","Qiao Xi nodded and said with a faint smile, “In that case, Miss He, you’re considered an expert!”","It was already very difficult for ordinary people to enter this event. After all, there were priceless cultural relics around, so regular people wouldn’t even dare to walk around the venue. To be able to enter this event seamlessly, one’s identity was naturally extraordinary."]}]);
